window.AKK_TRANSMIGRATED_AS_THE_MALE_LEADS_VEGETATIVE_SISTER_IN_A_GAME_NOVEL_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_TRANSMIGRATED_AS_THE_MALE_LEADS_VEGETATIVE_SISTER_IN_A_GAME_NOVEL_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":101,"title":"Chapter 101: King Bitter Melon, Little Bitter Melon: Rongxun's Moral Blackmail","paragraphs":["\"Agreed!\"","Chu Fu placed Bitter Melon King into the team.","She proactively introduced her: \"This is Bitter Melon King, a player from Zone 028. She escaped from the gaming addiction reform school with me before. Her talent is an S-rank Agony Prison, and she's incredibly strong.\"","[S-rank Talent Agony Prison:","Trait 1: Grievous Cage – When cast on herself or an ally, forms a shield that reflects 50% of enemy damage and continuously stacks Pain debuffs. When cast on an enemy, creates an immovable cage that continuously stacks Pain debuffs.","Trait 2: Pain Amplification – Any skill can magnify the suffering of the target, causing convulsions, dizziness, uncontrollable crying, and similar status effects.","Trait 3: Mental-type damage is increased by 100%.]","Bitter Melon King quickly greeted the team as well, her voice sounding soft and gentle over the channel.","\"Hello everyone! I'm Bitter Melon King. Thank you, Plant Queen, for bringing me along. I'll definitely work hard!\"","Bitter Melon King gripped her staff tightly, feeling nervous. She had only just reached level 10, and her equipment was a complete mess — mostly basic white-quality pieces. Compared to the heavyweights in the team, it looked pathetically shabby.","Fortunately, she had been through embarrassment so many times that while she still couldn't face it with confidence, she had learned to tiptoe around others with careful, cautious politeness.","She was the girl who had returned to Linjiang City with Chu Fu from the gaming addiction reform school: Jiang Yunuo.","Jiang Yunuo had always felt her life was miserable, so when she created her character in the game, she chose this name.","Bitter Melon King.","She had grown up with divorced parents — more accurately, her mother had been beaten away by her father's domestic violence. At the time, she was already five years old and knew that if her mother hadn't run, she would have been killed. So she wanted her mother to run too.","But after her mother ran away, her clothes were never new or clean again, and she was often hungry.","Her grandparents favored sons over daughters and never cared for her as a granddaughter. Less than three months after her mother divorced and fled that burning house, they found her father a new stepmother.","The stepmother gave birth to a younger sister but was beaten away within three years as well.","Her little sister was left behind in her care. The grandparents went all-in again, spending everything they had, and found her father a third wife.","This wife brought along a son from her previous marriage.","Jiang Yunuo could never understand why her own father treated his biological daughter so terribly, yet spoiled his stepmother's son like a treasure.","Just because he was a boy?","She had no choice. She had to fawn over the stepmother, please the little brother, do housework at a young age, wash clothes, survive under the stepmother's thumb, and even start elementary school two years later than kids her age.","With no lunch money, she collected bottles to sell for change, or squatted by fast food restaurants to eat the leftover scraps people had thrown away.","When her father found out, he didn't blame the stepmother for refusing to give her money. Instead, he beat her himself.","Said she was a disgrace.","After that, she did get food to eat, but she got beaten for eating, beaten for making noise while chewing, and even beaten just for walking.","The stepmother would hold her little brother and watch coldly from the side. If her little sister cried or fussed, the sister got beaten too.","When she was young, there wasn't a single spot on her body that wasn't bruised.","Luckily, a kind neighbor noticed and called the police. Her father was convicted of abuse and locked away for two years.","She was sent to live with her grandparents, who didn't abuse her but did hold a grudge for her putting their son behind bars.","So she stopped getting beaten, only to be starved all over again.","Two more years passed, and when her father got out, her grandparents kicked her right back to his house like a soccer ball.","By then, she had grown a little older and learned to run, but most of the time, she still had to fawn over the stepmother just to get a meal.","At 17, she finally graduated from middle school three years late, with terrible grades — because she was too hungry to think properly.","She couldn't attend high school, and her piece-of-trash father and stepmother certainly wouldn't pay her tuition. So she went out and got a job, shaking milk tea at a bubble tea shop.","The sweetness of the tea seemed to make up for her bitter life.","That was around the time when [Primordial Gate] exploded in popularity. From her monthly salary of three thousand, she scraped together a third to buy a gaming helmet.","Because her talent and class were formidable, she secured the first kill on the Wild Boar King the very first time she fought it.","The guys from Dragon Roam Studio tried to kill her for it, but they were utterly tormented by her pain reflection shield. On top of that, her first skill as a Pain Warlock was a lifesteal ability that made her stronger with every clash, turning her into Dragon Roam Studio's number-one nemesis.","But her streak of freedom lasted barely two days. Her stepmother confiscated her gaming helmet, claiming she was \"wasting money instead of handing it over to the family,\" and goaded her trash father into beating her black and blue before stuffing her into a gaming addiction reform center.","What she didn't know was that Jiang Yunuo had fallen victim to a scheme by Dragon Roam Studio. They had tracked down her real-life identity, used a few tricks to get her declared illegally detained, and prevented her from stealing another world boss.","Jiang Yunuo simply assumed her stepmother couldn't bear the thought of her having one nice thing.","But at least all that suffering was behind her now.","When she returned to Zone 028, in order to be merged into the same server as Chu Fu, she skipped the village defense battle. After it ended, there was a mirror map in Fengdu Town, and she just waited for the server merge so she could follow Chu Fu into the Thorn Guild.","It really was true that all the hardship she endured only made her stronger.","Now, she was the very first person to catch a ride on the Thorn Queen's wagon.","She was so incredibly lucky.","She was going to perform well, no matter what.","As she was thinking this, Bitter Melon King raised her staff to put a shield on everyone — but everyone was flying in the sky, quite far from her.","Shen Chi came over to pick her up and gave her a pair of flight wings.","\"How much for these? I'll trade you!\" Bitter Melon King hastily said, not wanting to accept gifts she hadn't earned. She'd recently made a bit of money too.","\"Standard guild equipment — everyone who joins the guild gets a set!\"","Chu Fu casually added Bitter Melon King to the guild.","Scrolling through the long list of guild benefits, Bitter Melon King nearly cried tears of joy.","This guild was way too generous!","She maneuvered the flight wings into the air, then cast shields on everyone on the team.","By now, the boss had been spawned for about ten seconds.","The unorganized players could no longer hold back and began attacking in droves.","But the Goblin Tribe Chieftain was a terrifying boss in its own right, and its most dangerous skill was the Leap Slash.","It would leap into the air and smash its massive spiked club into the ground, cracking the earth open. Players would be launched five or ten meters into the air, and the fall would deal additional impact damage.","Between the launch and the chaotic aggro, players were dying left and right in droves.","Just as Chu Fu was about to make her move, a player suddenly threw up a server-wide broadcast.","[Server 0308888 - Fengdu Town] [Rongxun Qizhao]: \"To the big shots of the Thorn Guild — I heard you folks have a code of honor in the newbie village, where you don't kill other players out of spite during boss fights. Whoever lands the killing blow on the boss keeps the drops, and nobody retaliates privately. I think that's an excellent set of rules. Why don't we all keep following it and build a harmonious server environment together?\"","Chu Fu frowned when she heard this.","She hadn't expected the head of the Rongxun studio to be slick enough to use such a public, hard-to-refuse gambit.","They tried to morally blackmail Chu Fu and the others, making it so they couldn't openly move against Rongxun Studio during the world boss event.","Chu Fu thought for a moment, and then her brow relaxed.","She, too, pulled out a megaphone!"]},{"number":102,"title":"Chapter 102: Vegetative People Are Black-Hearted, Wanting to Hollow Out the Three Major Studios","paragraphs":["[Server 0308888 - Fengdu Town] [\"Who Wants to Be a Plantman\"]: This is indeed a rule I set, but right now I can't control the range of my skills. If anyone snags the final hit, I, Plantman, promise here that I won't target anyone specifically, but collateral damage is unavoidable. Don't worry—our guild's Suture Saint has a resurrection spell and can bring everyone back. Fair price: 100 silver coins, no cheating customers.","Suture Saint immediately shouted in the team chat: \"Sweet! Plant Girl, you secretly take them all out later, and I'll resurrect them. We split the profits fifty-fifty!\"","Little Sister Wu: \"So jealous! We're both healing classes, but when will I ever get a resurrection spell!\"","Suture Saint said with a chuckle: \"I got my resurrection spell from opening a chest dropped by a map boss, but it was a golden chest! You still have two more chances!\"","The highest-level boss, the Goblin Abyss Overlord, drops golden chests.","Second, the first-kill of a hell-difficulty dungeon also drops a golden chest.","But whether you actually pull the spell from it is all up to your luck.","Honestly, just from watching Suture Saint open the Mysterious Merchant's chests, you could tell who was the lucky one.","At low levels, resurrection spells were incredibly rare.","\"Don't lose heart. One of the bosses in the nightmare-difficulty dungeon might also drop a resurrection spell.\"","As Chu Fu finished speaking, she raised her staff, [Kinda Toxic].","Toxic Spray!","First, stack 5 layers of poison on the boss.","Then, Slow Curse and Plague Spread.","The moment Plague Spread came out, members of the Rongxun guild immediately retreated. Priests raised their wands to dispel the miasma, and some even popped antidote potions.","The strategy guide summarized by Feng Minhui of the Huan Yu Workshop—Huan Yu never got to use it, but Rongxun Studio actually had it ready.","That wave, their losses were relatively small.","But did Chu Fu intend to let them off?","Come out, little darling!","With a summon, Chu Fu released the Charm Mushrooms she had grown in her Spirit Herb Pouch.","Because of mass cultivation, a whole swarm of Charm Mushroom sprites appeared, and every single one of them could cast Charm.","When the Charm Mushroom was placed on the ground, it immediately drew the attention of Rongxun Studio's players.","\"These mushrooms are so pretty!\"","\"They must taste amazing!\"","\"Hehe, I think I see little people dancing.\"","Not just them—the Goblin Tribe Chief, two meters tall with bulging muscles, also hopped over, yanked it out of the ground, and shoved it into his mouth.","That immediately poisoned everybody involved.","But it wasn't over yet.","The moment the Charm Mushroom appeared, all the goblins within 200 meters (fixing again) came charging over with a roar.","Originally, the goblins within 100 meters had already been cleared.","Now, an even larger swarm of goblins from beyond the perimeter were lured in, stampeding toward the spot.","Chaos reigned once more.","Players were even being killed by goblins.","The boss's location had gathered roughly a thousand players, most of them from Rongxun Studio, and the rest were scattered independent players from zones 026-029.","Because the studio was deliberately hogging the boss, independent players didn't dare try to fight for it. Of course, there were still some stubborn ones who came to watch the excitement.","As for players from zone 030, they hadn't shown up at all.","They'd already given up.","With Plantman being such a monster, how could they possibly compete?","Right now, all these people were crowded together, shrouded in Plague Spread.","The most terrifying part came when players and goblins started dying.","The very next moment, the corpses began to swell.","\"Bang!\"","Toxin sprayed outward, splattering everywhere.","Not just that—the Charm Mushroom also activated. A cloud of purple mist spread out, releasing dense spores.","The spores landed on the corpses, and mushrooms began sprouting from their mouths and eyes.","It was a horrifying sight.","In just thirty seconds.","The boss's area was littered with corpses.","Players were dying in large numbers.","Meanwhile, players on the map were still typing messages.","\"Wow, the big shots from zone 030 are this merciful? That means us independents can fight the boss too? I didn't go earlier—coming now!\"","\"Don't come! Don't fall for her nonsense. She's flying up in the sky killing us like we're sitting ducks!\"","\"Come here, and that's 100 silver coins for treatment.\"","\"Damn it! Who picked up my equipment! All my gear!\"","Amid the players' screams, the boss's health dropped to 50%.","Chu Fu raised her staff.","[Malicious Detonation!]","In an instant, all the poison stacked on the boss exploded.","BOOM.","The boss lost a full 9% of its health.","The higher the boss's level, the more it weakens percentage-based skills, but a 9% drop was still terrifyingly potent.","What's more, a 50-meter area of the ground turned into a pool of poison.","Fortunately, Jiaojiao, as a teammate, wasn't affected. She stood right in the poison pool, trading blows head-on with the boss.","\"Heh heh, little boss, hitting this grandma doesn't hurt at all!\"","Jiaojiao had zero pressure.","Chu Fu kept reapplying poison, kept detonating.","At this rate, the boss wouldn't survive more than a few rounds.","The boss's health dropped to 20%.","That was Xie Lin's execution threshold.","[Holy Light Judgement!]","The rest of the party was also unloading their skills.","[Thousand Needles, Ten Thousand Holes]","[Mecha Self-Destruct (Mechanist Lv. 15 skill)]","[Gu Worm Frenzy (Gu Master Lv. 10 skill)]","[Soul Calamity (Torment Warlock Lv. 10 skill)]","[Steel Force Infusion (Martial Artist Lv. 10 skill)]","[Puppet Gigantification (Puppeteer Lv. 10 skill)]","Chu Fu abandoned the Charm Mushroom and pulled out a Watermelon Bomb instead.","Throwing!","Whoosh whoosh whoosh whoosh whoosh!","The watermelons slammed into the boss, each chunk dealing 10,000 damage.","Watermelon Bomb's damage was starting to fall behind.","Of course, it was still great for crowd control, but it clearly wasn't cutting it against the boss.","At this point, within 50 meters of the boss, no one was left except Jiaojiao, Xie Lin, and Granny Wu Yingchun.","The boss was taken down without any doubt, the last hit secured by their team.","[Server Announcement: Players \"Who Wants to Be a Plantman,\" \"Rocket on a Wheelchair,\" \"Are You Calling Me Blind?,\" \"Jiaojiao,\" \"Suture Saint,\" \"Shafu Liangu,\" \"Wu Yingchun,\" \"Little Sister Wu,\" \"Zhimengzhe,\" and \"Bitter Melon King\" have completed the first-kill of the Level 13 Field Boss \"Goblin Tribe Chief\"! Reward: All stats +2, Silver Chest ×2!]","The entire server was shaken.","Outside Fengdu Town.","At the location of the Level 18 Goblin Warlord.","A thousand-player raid was assaulting the boss.","\"Damn, how are they this fast? It's only been three minutes since the server merged! How did they already take down a boss?\" Jiang Yixing was panicking!","\"Hurry up, speed up! There's no way they can get over here!\"","\"Exactly, besides this boss, there's also a Level 15 boss! Based on their route, they wouldn't come here.\"","\"But Xingxing, this boss is way too strong. It's driving a war chariot. We've already lost 3 main tanks, and if this keeps up, we'll run out of tanks.\""]},{"number":103,"title":"Chapter 103: Where Are Our Equipment Did It All Get Picked Up by the Plant People's Team","paragraphs":["After taking down the BOSS, Shen Chi immediately pulled out a 10-person bus and let everyone on. The group practically sprinted into the vehicle.","Shen Chi activated the mechanical overload, and with a roar, the bus sped off.","They had to rush to seize the BOSS.","Not only that, they needed to snatch the dungeon.","Shafu Liangu spoke up, “I’ve got intel from my undercover contacts inside the Universe Studio and the Star Alliance. Right now, Universe Studio’s top team is in the Goblin Nest dungeon, and the Star Alliance is busy taking down the Goblin Commander.”","When building a guild in a game, the biggest threat is always the spies.","Even Chu Fu couldn’t guarantee that the Thorn Alliance didn’t have other undercover agents sent by rival studios—or even people bought off from within.","It was impossible to defend against.","Plus, since everyone was from the same city, there were bound to be real-life friends involved.","This matter was entrusted to Shafu Liangu. She quickly tracked down real-life acquaintances through the game forums and managed to bribe a few people.","Getting intel was surprisingly easy.","Xie Lin sneered, “Universe Studio is pretty clever. Their hatred for us is out in the open. If they venture into the wild, it’ll be straight-up war, so they dare not contest the outdoor BOSS. Instead, they’re heading for the Goblin Nest!”","However, the Goblin Nest was a 10-player dungeon. Even with a detailed strategy in hand, the biggest challenge was the long trek through the cave system, which wasted a lot of time.","At least an hour was needed to clear the dungeon.","Of course, that was for ordinary players.","Chu Fu and her team wouldn’t take nearly that long.","As for the Star Alliance, their guild was just a bunch of brainwashed cannon fodder. Their equipment was too weak, and they lacked top-tier talent. Killing a BOSS would take them at least 20 minutes.","Let them bleed for a while!","Shen Chi led everyone forward with a thunderous roar toward the Goblin Warlord.","The players from Rongxun Studio were getting anxious.","【Server 0308888 - Fengdu Town】【Rongxun Qizhao】: Plants, you wouldn’t dare break your promise and refuse to resurrect us, right?","He didn’t dare talk tough, fearing he might truly offend the Thorn Guild and get no resurrection.","What was worst was that their gear had been looted. Who was so fast? Just moments ago, there was pink mist and purple mist everywhere—they couldn’t see clearly. Even if they got revived now, they were completely naked, not even wielding starter weapons!","The losses were unimaginable, and Rongxun Qizhao didn’t dare dwell on it.","【Server 0308888 - Fengdu Town】【Suture Saint】: What’s the rush? The corpses stay for three days. I’m not giving up the first kill! Wait until I get the first kill!","Suture Saint was showing off her wealth, shouting orders through the megaphone without any politeness.","Having resurrection spells didn’t mean she lacked attitude.","Rongxun Qizhao dared not offend her and could only swallow his pride.","【Server 0308888 - Fengdu Town】【Rongxun Qizhao】: Fine, I trust that the great Suture is a person of her word. I’ll wait by the BOSS for good news.","They had no choice but to lie awkwardly on the ground, pretending to be corpses.","Fortunately, “Primal Gate” wasn’t a pay-per-hour game, or else it would have been a huge rip-off.","But soon, they ran into trouble.","On the 【Map Channel】, Rongxun Studio’s players typed in panic.","“Boss, something’s wrong. The goblins are respawning!”","“Damn it, where are they dragging my corpse off to?”","“Ah!! They’re going to roast me!”","“Boss, if my body gets eaten, can I still resurrect?”","“As far as I remember, that woman’s resurrection skill is more like stitching the corpse back together. If the body’s too damaged, resurrection won’t work. Hurry, call her over!”","Of course, those people couldn’t be summoned.","Rongxun Qizhao even began to realize that the Thorn Guild was doing this on purpose, but there was nothing he could do about it.","Fortunately, when they were fighting the BOSS, they left two hundred people inside the city, who quickly answered the call to clean up the monsters.","As for those players swallowed by the goblins, they were completely dead—only able to reincarnate on a new server or fight for a spot in the newbie village of the old server.","Five more minutes passed.","Another system announcement appeared.","[Server Notice: Players “Who Wants to Be a Vegetative State,” “Rocket on a Wheelchair,” “Who’s Calling Me Blind,” “Jiao Jiao Not Proud,” “Suture Saint,” “Shafu Liangu,” “Wu Yingchun,” “Little Sister Wu,” “Zhimengzhe,” and “Bitter Melon King” have completed the first kill of the level 15 field BOSS “Goblin Warlord”! Rewards: +4 to all attributes, 2 Silver Treasure Chests!]","...","The Star Alliance players were panicking.","How could it be so fast!?","It had only been five minutes!","But looking at the BOSS’s health bar, which had only dropped by 20%, no matter how hard they tried to output damage, they couldn’t kill it.","Jiang Yixing stared at the scene, feeling a deep despair.","His rational mind told him to give up.","His hopeful side told him to struggle a little longer—maybe he could snatch the final blow.","In the midst of hesitation, he heard a mechanical roar, like a plane rushing by.","A massive mech appeared in sight.","Last time, Shen Chi’s mech hadn’t been fully unleashed; now it seemed their speed had been completely underestimated.","Even their BOSS-killing speed had been underestimated!","“Retreat!”","Jiang Yixing gave the order.","His players had no choice but to stop attacking and flee.","The Goblin Warlord was driving a war chariot, pulled by three massive three-headed dire wolves.","At this moment, the three-headed wolves charged viciously at the fleeing players, causing heavy casualties.","They had dragged the BOSS over 50 meters from the original spot; if they could get past 100 meters, the BOSS would return to its spawn point due to the “pull-off” mechanism.","Once beyond 100 meters, they would be safe.","Of course, as monster levels rose and BOSSes grew stronger, this range became more terrifying—some late-game BOSSes had domains that allowed entry but no exit.","Chu Fu stepped off a 10-person bus and immediately planted a mushroom.","The purple mushroom flickered continuously, and glowing spores floated around, instantly pulling the BOSS’s attention back.","Not only that, but the Star Alliance players were also drawn back.","“What a beautiful mushroom!”","“Red umbrella, white stalk, eat it and you’re toast.”","“Let’s kill the BOSS! This BOSS belongs to the Star Alliance!”","The Star Alliance players began babbling nonsense.","Chu Fu unleashed Plague Spread.","Completely unprepared, the Star Alliance was wiped out again.","Within five minutes, a new system announcement echoed throughout the entire server.","...","Meanwhile,","[Server 0018888]","【Level 20 Map: Tianxuan Town】","At midnight sharp, the Goblin army’s assault officially began.","A dark green tide of massive goblins surged in from all directions, laying siege to the town.","The veteran players naturally gathered in greater numbers here. After nearly 40 days of integration, there were a whopping 50,000 players packed onto the city walls.","Yet, facing this relentless beast horde, even they couldn’t help but feel a chill of fear.","Lin Haowan transformed into soul mode, soaring through the air to film the scene.","He was streaming the very first town siege battle live. To prepare, he had only logged in briefly when Wangxi Village was open, then immediately logged off to start the broadcast.","The livestream chat was buzzing with excitement.","“Yesterday, that Lulü was pretty cute. Why isn’t she streaming anymore? Who wants to watch a male streamer anyway?”","“Heh, your Lulü is a law enforcer, got reported. Just search for her videos online!”"]},{"number":104,"title":"Chapter 104: They are laughing and joking, while three families have been destroyed in an instant.","paragraphs":["Some curious people went online to check the news.","The camera angle showed a man in the back seat of a car, holding up his phone to film. Despite the dim lighting, the phone had a decent camera, and in the night shot, a heavily made-up face could be made out.","It was Wang Silu.","She was already dead drunk.","Wang Silu shouted, “Mind your own business! If something happens, have your dad bury it. Now drive!”","The car started up, initially swaying left and right, then—bang—it seemed to hit something.","“Ah! I hit a car!” the driver muttered.","“Then why are you still sitting here? Floor it!” the person in the passenger seat yelled.","Everyone's voices were slurred with alcohol.","The driver stomped on the gas, and the car shot forward.","“Holy shit, going this fast? That insane?”","The person filming wasn't scared—his voice was excited. He pointed the phone at the dashboard, where the luxury dials showed the speedometer already climbing past 200 miles per hour.","They kept that speed for nearly half a minute, until a black car appeared up ahead.","Then came a deafening crash.","That car was completely smashed apart—not thrown aside, but literally shattered. Debris flew through the windshield and pelted the occupants, who immediately started cursing.","“Are you blind? You see my car coming and you don’t get out of the way? Can a bunch of poor trash even afford to pay for this?”","No one thought what they had done was wrong. They kept driving and spotted another sports car ahead.","“Ram it! Ram it!” Wang Silu shouted.","The driver floored it and slammed into the sports car. That car was built solid enough not to shatter, but it spun off and crashed into a bicyclist on the roadside.","Because of the impact, their own car veered off course too, hit the curb, and screeched to a halt.","They treated the whole thing like a joke.","They had no idea that because of them, three families had been torn apart.","Because Wang Silu’s face was the clearest on camera, a public outcry had already erupted online.","“The driver is a murderer, and that female host is the instigator!”","“Relying on family money, thinking you can pay your way out—treating other people’s lives like a game. Drinking and driving, egging it on.”","“She already did jail time, but that doesn’t mean she should be allowed to stay in the public eye. Do we want fans idolizing her? What kind of example is that? Following in her footsteps—drink, drive, and mow people down?”","“Holy crap, she’s the second daughter of Shunmuyuan. No wonder she’s so arrogant. Does Rongxun Studio have a stake in her?”","“Whatever. Boycott!”","“Make their stock hit the limit-down again.”","After this news broke, Shunmuyuan’s board immediately issued a public apology. Wang Rongxun stepped into the spotlight and announced an apology as well.","The core message had three points:","Wang Silu’s actions were purely personal and had nothing to do with Shunmuyuan. Her father was only one shareholder, and the others were innocent.","Wang Silu’s streaming was just a hobby, not a professional public career, and she had already paid the price.","But netizens weren’t buying any of it.","...","In Linjiang City, at the Wang family villa, Wang Silu was throwing a fit, smashing things.","“What’s wrong with me being a streamer? If that incident had never happened, I could have been a big star with no one stopping me. Blame that damn car for getting in our way! And I’m not even the main culprit—why are they blaming me?”","Her shrill, spoiled voice rang out.","She hated Sun Jingya too, of course, but Sun Jingya was still locked up. She didn’t dare hate her—she was afraid of the Sun family’s power. So she hated Chu Fu and the others even more for putting her in this position.","What she couldn’t stand most was the video being leaked.","“Where the hell did that video come from? That idiot Guan Youlong—why hasn’t he deleted this thing yet?”","“Enough!”","Her father roared. His face was flushed red, his body shaking.","“Do you want to see the rest of the video? This is only the first part—the second part hasn’t been released. Do you know what that steward did to you when you were drunk?”","“I remember you never even dated him.”","“If you’re going to play, don’t leave evidence. Now you can’t even find a marriage alliance. What worth do you have to this family anymore?”","“Useless. If you keep making scenes like this, I’ll send you to Boss Jiang and make you his fifth wife!”","Wang Silu went pale.","Boss Jiang was a big shot from the provincial capital, over fifty years old. He had been married four times—his wives either got beaten away or married him and got their assets swallowed. She definitely didn’t want to marry him.","“It must be those people from Thorn Guild messing with me—what’s with the ‘vegetable,’ the ‘wheelchair,’ the ‘blind’ stuff? I refuse to believe I can’t destroy them over one game.”","Wang Silu’s rage was boiling. She still had money, and she would hire a team to wipe out Thorn Guild.","Server 0308888 had already opened, so she decided to throw money at it—organize a team to infiltrate that server and, when the timing was just right, stab them in the back.","Now, looking at the siege battle, a spark of inspiration hit her. A plan took shape.","...","Inside Fengdu Town.","After taking down the third boss, Chu Fu immediately led her people to the Goblin Lair instance.","Steal her first kill?","Dream on.","They were all hers.","As for Wang Silu getting reported?","It honestly wasn’t her doing.","But she had tattled—of course she did! She had a big brother, a powerful backer. Her enemies were his enemies too.","Why should Wang Silu get to be a host, some internet goddess, idolized by thousands?","Not in this life.","Even though in the original plot, Wang Silu was supposed to become a top-tier female mage later on.","But now, Chu Fu was going to knock her off that pedestal first.","No more showing off in front of the public, corrupting kids’ minds.","Little did she know—","Because Chu Fu had tattled, Chu Feng remembered Guan Youlong’s little hobby from his past life.","The guy loved filming videos.","He loved collecting dirt on people—dark, twisted stuff. He had evidence of crimes committed by Sun Jingya, Wang Silu, and Wan Huanyu.","Chu Feng wanted to find that video, so he went to Guan Youlong’s secret residence.","A mid-range apartment in a quiet neighborhood, windows always sealed shut. There were even rumors it held an urn of ashes.","The authorities had never discovered this place before.","Chu Feng found the hidden door, opened it, and started browsing through the videos.","What he found was the very evidence from that night.","Even he was furious when he saw it.","The footage had been filmed from a better angle than any dashcam—crystal clear. Wang Silu, as the instigator, was anything but innocent.","This video was far more direct and damning than any scandal tape. It could pull Wang Silu down for good.","And the scandal tapes themselves? He didn’t leave those behind either. He packaged them up and sent them to every member of the Wang family.","He also found records the authorities had missed. Chu Feng packaged those up and forwarded them to the authorities, helping them solidify the case.","Now, on top of everything else, Guan Youlong had even more charges stacked against him.","Unless he never set foot back in the country again, he was looking at a lifetime behind bars.","Chu Feng wiped away every trace of his presence, slipped out, and disappeared quietly—a hero without a name."]},{"number":105,"title":"Chapter 105: Not One First Kill Missed, While Other Studios Are All Wiped Out","paragraphs":["In-game.","Outside Fengdu Town.","The Goblin Lair dungeon was built along the edge of a large mountain range, with four different cave entrances at various points.","There were quite a few goblin guards roaming around. To run the dungeon, players had to clear out these guards.","When there were too many players, these goblins were no different from the Red-Eyed Rabbits.","A few dozen weapons swung down, and they turned into a flash of white light.","However, aside from the players of Wangxi Village, few players had reached level 12 yet, so naturally, this place was sparsely populated.","The person in charge of Universal Studio on server 0278888 was called Universal Caesar. He was the professional manager that Wan Huanyu's family had arranged for Wan Huanyu, but he was one rank lower than Feng Huimin.","He was a returnee from overseas. After being hired with a high salary, he surprisingly ended up playing games.","Some people like playing games, but some people do not. Universal Caesar was one of the latter.","But no matter what you do, you have to have professional ethics, so he did his job diligently. When the studio told him to abandon the novice village, he abandoned it. When the studio told him not to clash with the Thorn Guild, he came to run the dungeon.","However, when the reward that was almost within reach was about to be stolen away, he finally lost his composure.","\"Manager, the scout we left at the entrance sent word. Plantman and their group are coming!\"","\"What?\" Universal Caesar suddenly had a bad feeling.","\"Didn't they still have two bosses left to kill? Why are they coming to the dungeon?\"","Did he even need to ask?","Of course, they didn't want him to take the first-kill.","Actually, Universal Studio had placed scouts at the entrance to stop any well-equipped teams that came to challenge the dungeon.","Universal Studio hadn't changed their ways.","That's how domineering they were.","To get the first-kill, they wouldn't let anyone else in.","Moreover, the villagers of Wangxi Village had participated in two counterattacks. Those with strong combat power had reached level 12, and quite a few met the dungeon requirements.","So they were also being cautious about that.","But if it was Plantman and their group coming, these people definitely shouldn't be stopped.","Unexpectedly, they really came.","He gritted his teeth, and finally discussed with the nearby player. \"Should we give up on the dungeon right now and go seize the bosses?\"","The player next to him, called Chen Xunhuan, was actually a veteran gamer with an S-rank talent. But the awkward part was that he was a tank.","A tank can only ensure taking hits; he can't guarantee clearing the dungeon. Although he was critical, without coordinated damage dealers in the team, dungeon progress was slow.","Chen Xunhuan said, \"Manager, there's no time. Besides, the remaining bosses are level 20 and level 25 monsters. They exceed our members' stats by too much. I can avoid dying, but the squishy damage dealers can't survive the hits.\"","\"Not only that, at our speed, it would take 20 minutes to reach the bosses.\"","\"Factoring in about 30 minutes of fighting, by then, Plantman and their group will have already come out of the dungeon.\"","\"Unless...\"","Universal Caesar quickly asked, \"Unless what?\"","\"Unless the other two studios join forces with us, and we go all out to fight the level 20 boss.\"","Universal Caesar thought it made sense, so he contacted them.","The result, naturally, was no result.","Rongxun Qizhao was lying at the position of the Goblin Tribe Chieftain.","Jiang Yixing was lying at the position of the Goblin Warlord.","Both sides were waiting for the Thorn Guild's Suture Saint to revive them.","And what's more, they even asked Universal Caesar for help.","\"Caesar, can any of your members who didn't enter the dungeon come help us fight off the monsters? Don't let the mobs eat our corpses!\"","\"Brothers of Universal Studio, if you're free, come give us a hand. These goblins eat people, and a lot of my fans are scared to tears.\"","Universal Caesar was speechless. In the end, he arranged for people to go help.","Now, all he could do was try his best.","...","On the other side.","Chu Fu found the normal difficulty Goblin Lair dungeon and chose to enter.","The 10-person team immediately advanced.","Chu Fu assigned the tactics.","\"Jiaojiao, you go ahead and pull aggro on the train. Every 200 meters, I'll drop a mushroom, so we don't have to clear the mobs!\"","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao immediately nodded.","Pulling the train was also a game term. The tank class would be at the front, drawing aggro from all the mobs, and leading them on a wild sprint.","These mobs also had their own aggro range. Basically, once they ran about 100 meters, they wouldn't chase anymore and would return to their spawn point to wander.","Strong teams would clear out the gathered mobs.","Chu Fu didn't want to waste time, so she had no intention of clearing them.","Instead, she just kept them running.","Jiaojiao ran ahead. Her equipment plus S-rank talent gave her incredible defense. These dungeon mobs couldn't do anything to her.","After running 200 meters.","Chu Fu immediately placed a Charm Mushroom.","Instantly, all the surrounding monsters crowded around the mushroom, and the team naturally wouldn't be attacked.","The group of 10 quickly ran to the first boss location. In less than 30 seconds, the boss was taken down.","Then came the second boss, the third boss.","Cleared!","A series of system notifications appeared.","[You have cleared the dungeon: Goblin Lair (Normal).]","[Dungeon time: 16 minutes 34 seconds.]","[You received the first-clear reward: All stats +2, one Bronze Chest.]","[A server-wide announcement is about to be posted. Hide ID?]","Don't hide.","Then, the system announcement appeared.","[Server Announcement: Under the leadership of player \"Who Wants to Be Plantman\", the full team has cleared the dungeon Goblin Lair (Normal), achieving the first server-wide clear! Rewards have been distributed.] x3.","Inside the same dungeon, Universal Caesar's suspended heart finally died.","And then.","From 0:00 until 4:00 in the early morning, before dawn broke,","Chu Fu had already taken all the first kills.","The two extra map bosses gave +8 and +10 to all stats.","The remaining Hard, Nightmare, and Hell dungeon first clears gave +4, +6, and +8 to all stats.","In total, everyone gained +50 to all stats.","Every single person experienced a qualitative leap.","Not only that.","By now, everyone had 2 Golden Chests and 7 Silver Chests.","It was a chest-opening feast.","Chu Fu quickly opened her chests.","[You obtained Purple Poison Mushroom Dress (Golden)]","[You obtained Purple Poison Mushroom Hat (Golden)]","[You obtained Ultra-High-Yield Rice (Silver)]","Aside from that, Chu Fu also unboxed bracers, pants, shoes, belt, gloves, bracelet, and two rings of Silver grade equipment.","Although Chu Fu's equipment in those slots was also Silver grade, they had been dropped from the Beast God Temple. Level 10 Silver gear had around 10-12 points of stats.","The gear Chu Fu unboxed here was level 15 Silver gear, with stat bonuses ranging from 20-25 points.","They were comparable to level 10 Golden gear.","So Chu Fu put them all on.","\"Now for the main event, everyone. In this guild activity, besides the first kills, we also had 2 pieces of Golden equipment drop. The bidding starts now!\""]},{"number":106,"title":"Chapter 106: The Unease of the New Member, the Appearance of the Plague in Reality","paragraphs":["\"These are: the Overlord Armor dropped by the level 25 BOSS Goblin Abyss Overlord, and the Hell Robe dropped by the nightmare-difficulty instance, Goblin Hell Lord.\"","\"Let's auction the Overlord Armor first!\"","[Overlord Armor (Gold Grade):","Physical Defense: 250","Magic Defense: 200","Constitution +12","Strength +18","Agility +10","Overlord Aura: Reduces enemy defense by 10%, increases own attack power by 10%.]","\"Starting bid is 1 gold coin, distributed according to contribution. Xie Lin bids first!\"","Xie Lin directly gave a price of 10 gold coins!","The value was about right.","Within the team, the only one who could compete with Xie Lin was the warrior-type player, Jiaojiao Bu Jiao (Little Miss Not Spoiled).","At this moment, however, she was wearing a heavy set of golden armor, smiling smugly.","Saved her money.","In the end, this piece of equipment fell into Xie Lin's hands.","Next was the other piece of equipment.","[Hell Robe (Gold Equipment):","Physical Defense: 150","Magic Defense: 300","Constitution +10","Agility +10","Spirit +25","Hellfire: Can summon hellfire to burn enemies within a three-meter radius.]","Chu Fu smiled and said, \"Starting bid is 1 gold coin. This time, the highest contributor among magic classes is me, and I'm giving up the bid. Everyone else can go for it.\"","This time, it triggered a fierce competition.","Suture Saint, Shafu Liangu, Little Sister Wu, Zhimengzhe, and Bitter Melon King — all of them could compete.","There were too many magic-class players, which was bound to inflate the price of magic equipment.","Chu Fu also noticed the situation and planned to recruit more physical-class players in the future.","For example, the team currently lacked classes like assassins and archers.","But if they added those, they would end up competing with Shen Chi and Granny Wu Yingchun for equipment.","There was no way around it — the only solution was to build more teams later on to produce more equipment.","\"10 gold!\" Suture Saint started by throwing in all her coins.","Also, knowing that Li Weizheng would send her more coins later, she decided she could afford to overbid; 20 gold coins was within her acceptable range.","\"11 gold!\" Shafu Liangu followed right after.","\"Mom, I want it too!!!\" Little Sister Wu immediately requested support.","Wu Yingchun immediately raised the bid.","\"12 gold!\"","Zhimengzhe raised her hand weakly, \"13 gold!\"","Although she considered herself a lifestyle player, since Plant had brought her along, she also wanted to contribute to the team. Her damage output was at the bottom, and her utility wasn't even as good as Bitter Melon King's or Little Sister Wu's, so she was anxious.","She didn't like being a burden.","Last was Bitter Melon King, watching everyone jump in one by one, suddenly feeling out of place.","Bitter Melon King: Strayed into the heavens~","Little did she know, Suture Saint used to be the same way.","But after spending more time with the team, she developed her own unique skills and started bringing in plenty of money.","After a heated bidding war, the golden armor reached 23 gold coins and was won by Shafu Liangu.","Because Little Sister Wu and Suture Saint were both healers, the equipment was better suited for a damage dealer.","And in terms of finances, Zhimengzhe wasn't as wealthy as Shafu Liangu, so she ultimately lost.","\"It's fine. There will be plenty of opportunities in the future. But buy early, enjoy early; buy late, get a discount.\"","Chu Fu consoled her, then posted a summary.","\"Alright, today's team activities are over. All equipment auctioned off for a total of 42 gold coins and 290 silver coins (including some silver-grade equipment). Since this was our first time teaming up, and because we were rushing for the first kill, the contribution points from the earlier dungeons are hard to tally. So we'll distribute them evenly!","Also, the Rongxun Studio and Xingxing Alliance had a bunch of equipment that we looted. That was thanks to Wheelchair Brother's special gold equipment.","The kills were mine, and the loot was picked up by Wheelchair Brother. It doesn't count as part of the team distribution.","We'll split that privately.","Now, does anyone have any objections?\"","This was mainly directed at the five new players.","Naturally, no one objected.","Chu Fu paid out wages, giving each person 4 gold coins and 229 silver coins as their share.","Bitter Melon King stared at the coins in her bag, feeling both overwhelmed and thrilled.","At the current exchange rate, that was 4.229 million yuan!","With that money, she could buy a nice apartment complex in Linjiang City, or even a large flat in the suburbs!","She had dreamed of owning a house her whole life.","If she had a house, no one could kick her out — it would be her own home, and she could cook for herself.","Although the canteen food was pretty good too.","Bitter Melon King secretly sent a message to Chu Fu.","\"Plant, I feel like I don't deserve this. It's only the first day, and you already gave me +50 to all attributes and paid me money! But my contribution was the lowest! How about I give the money back to you?\"","Chu Fu quickly persuaded her, \"No way, I don't need the money.","This is something everyone gets, and it's just pocket change.","If you feel guilty, just bring more guild members into dungeons.","Your talent is excellent — who knows, you might even become a team leader one day!","When that happens, you'll lead your own team, and that takes some pressure off me. The Thorn Guild needs you too!","Don't worry about your low contribution right now. Your growth ceiling is extremely high.","When Sister Saint first started with us, she was only an A-rank talent. One Corpse Sewing skill and she turned it all around.","Besides, haven't you noticed? Your skills are actually perfect for PvP. You and Sword Saint Brother might end up on the combat team in the future.","Don't overthink current contribution points or anything like that — we're all one team!\"","Bitter Melon King felt a warmth in her heart after Chu Fu's words.","She had always thought Chu Fu was very queenly, but now she truly saw her as a big sister figure.","\"Okay. I... I will definitely work hard to fit in here.\"","Bitter Melon King said.","Chu Fu understood that Bitter Melon King, raised in a tough environment, had a low sense of self-worth and a people-pleasing personality. Changing that would take time.","The best approach was to let Bitter Melon King integrate into the guild and spend more time playing with everyone.","After the team activities ended, Chu Fu quickly opened her livestream to check on the situation in Fengdu Town.","The moment she entered the stream, she heard Lin Haowan shouting.","\"Lu Xing is here! BOSS obliterated! The last BOSS only took 13 seconds! Oh my god, that's so strong.\"","The town defense battle was over.","Chu Feng was undisputedly number one.","Seeing that, Chu Fu smiled.","But then she frowned slightly.","The end of the defense battle also meant a new crisis was about to merge into reality.","And this crisis was a big one.","It would be best to take precautions ahead of time.","She hesitated for a moment, then made a call to Li Weizheng.","\"Major Li, I saw a post on the forum and wanted to ask if you've made any preparations.\"","\"What post?\"","\"It's about the red-eyed rabbits mutating in reality.\"","When Li Weizheng heard that, he relaxed and said, \"Of course I've seen it. Indeed, over the past month, all rabbits have started growing in size.","Not only can abilities be extracted from the game into reality, but monsters are syncing over as well.\"","We've already dealt with that. All the mutated rabbits have been purchased under the guise of research, and we also discovered that these rabbits are actually quite delicious—after eating them, one's explosive power increases.\"","Chu Fu nodded. The way the red-eyed rabbit situation was handled was indeed solid. But what came next?","\"And what about the mutated rats? If that's not handled well, it could very easily trigger a plague!\""]},{"number":107,"title":"Chapter 107: The Prediction of the Flower-Planter Family Does Not Match the Time Chu Fu Knows","paragraphs":["Li Weizheng's tone also turned serious.","\"We are indeed dealing with it. We've not only suspended the breeding of meat bamboo rats and strengthened the control of pet hamsters.","Moreover, we've also launched a rat - extermination campaign in various regions.","Currently, in the urban area of Linjiang City, we're offering 0.5 yuan for each super - large rat carcass to prevent the spread of the plague, and it's already showing some results.\"","Chu Fu had been extremely busy recently and hadn't paid attention to real - world events. Hearing that China was making preparations, she finally felt relieved.","It seemed that most of the strategies she could provide were for the game.","Li Weizheng sighed. \"Moreover, the Analysis Bureau has sent a not - so - good piece of news. In fact, the time left for us is limited.\"","\"Oh? How much time is left?\" Chu Fu subconsciously asked.","She actually thought the time wasn't that tight. According to the plot, the time when the game invaded the real world was 10 months after the opening of the [Primordial Gate].","That meant there were still 8 months and 20 days from now.","However, Li Weizheng's next words left Chu Fu stunned.","\"Less than five months!\"","Chu Fu almost let out an exclamation. How could it be?","But Li Weizheng continued.","\"The monsters are constantly mutating. At first, it was the rabbits, then the rats. According to this pattern, the third type of mutated creatures will be pigs.","So, the government made preparations in advance, established experimental bases, and started raising pigs. They also monitored wild boars in the wild.","Even guinea pigs were taken into account.","Four days ago, wild boars started to mutate. Their food intake increased, their physical constitution strengthened, and their pigskins began to keratinize.\"","Chu Fu's heart sank.","Li Weizheng was also very talkative when it came to sharing intelligence. Since the strategies provided by Chu Fu were very important, but the government had little to offer her in return.","Of course, except for land.","Fortunately, that matter had already progressed. All that was left was for Chu Fu to sign a document the next day, and she could develop the land around Wangxi Village as she pleased.","\"So, after a large number of experiments, the Analysis Bureau speculated that the mutation time for each type of monster is 18 days. That is to say, the time for all 10 types of monsters to mutate is half a year!\"","\"Moreover, after all the monsters have mutated, it's not the end but a special turning point.\"","This time, Chu Fu didn't need him to say it to know what it was.","\"The beast tide!\" Chu Fu said.","Li Weizheng nodded, looking a bit dejected.","It seemed that Chu Fu also knew this news.","This was also the result of a large amount of data analysis by the Analysis Bureau.","\"This is a disaster for all of humanity. However, if players can bring their in - game strength into the real world, it's not impossible to resist.","Compared to this, what we should focus more on in the next few months is probably how to deal with wild boars!","Wild boars will probably turn into the ones in the game within half a month. Ordinary people can't raise such large pigs, can they?","Each pig in the game is nearly 1000 kilograms, and the wild boar king is even more terrifying.","With the current facilities, a pig can easily break out with just one shove.","If we slaughter them casually, the price of pork will drop significantly in the short term, but then, the price of pork is likely to soar!\"","Economic and livelihood issues are the most terrifying.","They will cause a chain reaction. In this era, if people can't afford pork, it might be the end for China.","Chu Fu also hoped to maintain this pure land, which was the last pure land for humanity.","However, in the early stage of the game's invasion of the real world, chaos was inevitable.","Even 10 months of preparation in the original plot wasn't enough.","How could half a year be enough now?","There was only one question in Chu Fu's mind now.","Why was it different from the plot?","Suddenly, a light bulb went off in her head.","In the plot, Chu Feng lived two lives.","In the first life, Chu Feng lived until the fifth year after the game invaded the real world and died in the fifth game invasion version, [Apocalyptic Calamity].","In the second life, Chu Feng was reborn. That was the beginning of this book. After being reborn, Chu Feng found that the game's invasion of the real world had been advanced by two months.","On November 1st, Blue Star synchronized with the expansion pack [Beast Frenzy], and the game officially invaded the real world on Blue Star.","At that time, he was caught off guard and immediately ran around the city to hunt strange beasts.","After the game invaded the real world, Blue Star expanded a hundred times. Chu Feng ran for a full 30 kilometers before finding the hospital that was originally within 1 kilometer and rescued his sister along with the game pod.","Of course, in the plot, Chu Feng's sister in the original story didn't wake up until the eighth expansion pack, [Invasion of the Insects: God's Insect Servants], and then the book was abandoned.","In the plot, Chu Feng thought it was because he killed too many monsters and his own strength had reached a certain level.","So, the time of the game's invasion of the real world was advanced.","What about now?","Chu Fu had traveled through.","Could this be considered the third life?","She had changed from a vegetative person to a top - level player in Area 030. What she changed wasn't just herself but also brought along Shen Chi, Xie Lin, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao, Suture Saint, and so on.","Moreover, in the game, she had achieved the first perfect village defense and counter - attack.","Before her, the game had opened a total of 300,000 servers, and no novice village in any server had ever launched a counter - attack.","Was this variable of hers flapping too hard, causing the time of the game's invasion of the real world to be greatly advanced?","Wait...","Suddenly, Chu Fu asked, \"Major Li, do you have the specific mutation time of the mutated rats?\"","Li Weizheng was very glad that Chu Fu asked the question and quickly replied, \"When we realized the mutation of the red - eyed rabbits, we immediately conducted experiments on rats. We can confirm that the mutated rats also mutated on the 18th day after the opening of the [Primordial Gate].\"","A series of subsequent experiments were also carried out, including reverse - pushing from the genetic and biological levels.","That's why the data was so accurate.","But these details were too long - winded and not suitable to tell Chu Fu.","On the other hand, Chu Fu had another brainstorm.","On the 18th day after the opening of the [Primordial Gate], Chu Fu hadn't even joined the game.","If this data was fixed and not affected by Chu Fu's appearance, then what was causing the earlier invasion of the game into the real world?","Suddenly, Chu Fu thought of a drama she had watched before.","\"Pot End\"","It told the story of a mother who, after losing her child, had a mental breakdown and wanted to retaliate against society by blowing up a bus with a pot of explosives.","At that time, the female protagonist on the bus was constantly blown to death and then would loop back every time.","Each time in the loop, the time would be advanced.","It was like a series of reincarnations.","Chu Feng's first life, his reborn second life, and Chu Fu's third life after traveling through the book.","They were also in a series of reincarnations.","The only difference was that their time wasn't extended but shortened.","The time of the game's invasion of the real world was getting earlier and earlier.","Most terrifyingly, Chu Fu suddenly realized a problem.","She thought the male protagonist, Chu Feng, would always win.","But in fact?"]},{"number":108,"title":"Chapter 108: I originally wanted to cling to my older brother's coattails, but now I've become a variable.","paragraphs":["Chu Fu didn't even dare to imagine that ending.","And at this moment, Chu Fu felt like her thin shoulders were bearing a weight that someone her age shouldn't have to carry.","She'd originally wanted to ride on her brother's coattails.","But now she suddenly realized she herself was a variable.","She was just a working girl!","How could she be involved in something this big?","But soon, Chu Fu pushed through the pressure, and a fighting spirit rose up inside her instead.","Before, she wouldn't say she was slacking off, but she'd always felt like her brother had her back.","Now, realizing her brother might not be so reliable after all, Chu Fu quickly stood up, determined to shield him from the storm.","She also gave Li Weizheng a heads-up.","\"The analysis bureau's assessment is correct, the timing should be accurate.","However, besides the beast tide appearing on day 10 of the newbie village opening, there's another possibility: 1,000 people reaching level 10.","So doesn't that mean level 10 is also a variable?","So, I suggest that the officials amp up the promotion of the [Primordial Gate] and get everyone into the game, even make it a national game.","Maybe at the moment the game invades reality, everyone will also gain power equivalent to level 10.","Most importantly, if the game invades reality, the distances between villages aren't actually right—the [Primordial Gate] magnifies the distance a hundredfold.","Wangxi Scenic Area, Lotus Pond, Tianhe Fort, and Black Rock Gully—in reality, these places are only about a kilometer apart!\"","As for why she didn't directly say that this world was a book,","It was simple:","Chu Fu still didn't fully trust Li Weizheng yet.","She was also afraid that if she said those things before reaching level 30 or gaining any real influence, the authorities would take her away, lock her in a small dark room, and make her recite an eight-million-word game novel from memory.","Besides, now that she was living in it,","Chu Fu felt that the plot she knew might not really be the plot.","It might be more like a guide.","She lived in this world, and this was a real world—how could it really just be a book?","She was a variable. Her brother Chu Feng was so strong, and even he ended up in the cycle of reincarnation.","Chu Fu felt that she should also stay low-key, keep herself safe.","She'd have an honest, open talk with Li Weizheng once she hit level 30.","On the other end of the phone, Li Weizheng was also mulling over Chu Fu's words.","But before he could fully grasp how much impact her intel would have, Chu Fu was already about to hang up.","\"Major Li, you go ahead and get busy. I'm off to level up, trying to catch up to the front-runners as soon as possible.\"","In Chu Fu's mind right now, there was only leveling, leveling, and more leveling.","Six months.","She had to make the most of the most stable development window.","Because once the game fully invaded reality, the opening hours of the [Primordial Gate] would also be restricted.","Currently, the front-runners among players were people like Chu Feng—there was only one in the entire Linjiang City right now.","But as time went by, their numbers would grow.","After all, the [001] server had a total of 9,999 sub-servers.","Even with just a one-percent probability, that meant 100 players at level 30 already.","That's why Laurent was so arrogant, thinking he was invincible.","But the higher the level, the harder it was to level up, and Chu Fu still had confidence she could catch up to the front-runners.","After hanging up the phone,","Chu Fu returned to the game.","While she'd been on the call,","Jiao Jiao had already gone to the town hall and purchased the guild plot.","Naturally, the plot was also outside the city. Chu Fu had deliberately chosen a spot, one right next to an iron mine.","Of course, there were goblin miners inside the iron mine, level 13. Players who came here could mine ores and fight monsters at the same time—a pretty good deal.","And if the guild kept expanding its level, this iron mine would eventually be enveloped within the guild's territory, essentially turning it into private property that could be brought into the real world.","That would be an even better deal.","Chu Fu checked the latest public guild quests.","[Grab the Food:","Issued by: Town Mayor.","Quest Details: There are many goblins outside the town, occupying the farmlands, causing a food shortage in the town.","Go to the goblin camp now and take back our grain.]","[Hand In Food:","Issued by: Town Mayor.","Quest Details: The town is running low on food. The goblin invasion has caused a drop in crop yields, and food is scarce.","Even the wild beasts outside have been hunted in large numbers by the goblins.","Please hand over a portion of food to the starving townsfolk!","(If you have a large amount of food, you can provide it to the town mayor for lots of experience and guild reputation.)]","[Everyone Farms:","Issued by: Town Mayor.","Quest Details: Learn the farming skill, go to the wilderness to reclaim a piece of land, plant seeds, and harvest food.","(Long-term quest. Seeds will be ready in 24 hours. Harvested food can be exchanged for copper coins or submitted for the quest.)]","[Repel the Goblins:","Issued by: Town Mayor.","Quest Details: Participate in a public quest—repelling the goblin raids.]","[Collect Building Materials:","Issued by: Guildmaster of Thorns Guild, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao.","Quest Details: Collect 100 units of wood, 100 units of iron ore, and 100 units of herbs. Time to build a house!","(Quest can be submitted repeatedly.)]","Chu Fu's eyes lingered on quests 2 and 3, and an idea struck her.","Speaking of which, she had previously unlocked a plant.","Called super-high-yield rice.","The mutation effect just made the rice grow in greater abundance and size.","It wasn't a combat plant.","But now, it could actually come in handy.","Because Chu Feng was a lone wolf, Chu Fu had never known that the guild quests on the level 20 maps would all revolve around food.","The quests in the game were actually projections of reality.","In the first year after the game invaded, once the beast tide was pushed back and beasts were held off, humans could eat meat freely.","But after the goblins invaded, laying siege to towns and villages, beasts had to be hunted in distant lands. Many players couldn't even leave the safe zones, so naturally, food became scarce.","But if she reached level 30 and brought that mutant seed out of the game,","What would there be to fear then?","Chu Fu returned to the guild headquarters first.","The headquarters was being built at a lively pace. Accepting quests even gave more experience than grinding monsters.","Most importantly, there was guild contribution points, and those points could be used to exchange for equipment to improve oneself.","They all knew about the treasures in the Thorns Guild's warehouse.","As long as they had enough contribution points, they could even exchange for a full set of silver-tier equipment—that was top-tier.","As soon as Chu Fu appeared, she immediately drew the attention of a group of guild members.","\"Vice Guildmaster!\"","\"Is the plant expert here to accept quests too?\"","\"Oh, the expert switched gear—is that the new purple mushroom set?\"","\"So pretty, wuwuwu, another day of envying the expert's drip.\"","Chu Fu greeted everyone,","\"Hey everyone, keep grinding! You'll all have gear like this before you know it.\"","Then, she accepted the town mayor's quests from the guild quest board, and received two bags of seeds.","[Rice Seeds (Common Grade)]","[Wheat Seeds (Common Grade)]"]},{"number":109,"title":"Chapter 109: Planting Quest, Isn't This Just a Crop-Stealing Game","paragraphs":["The quest instructed Chu Fu to go outside the city to reclaim wasteland.","She could have used her Spirit Plant Satchel to plant seeds, but unfortunately, quests could be rather rigid sometimes.","With no other choice, Chu Fu followed the instructions and headed outside the city.","There were no goblins prowling around the outskirts just yet, and a few players were already planting crops.","The quest required planting a 25x25 area—roughly an acre of land.","When Chu Fu arrived, other players were already there.","\"Earth Shock!\" A warrior player raised his axe and slammed it into the ground, flipping the soil over in one go.","\"Fireball!\" Thud thud thud thud.","A mage released a spell, burning away all the grass on the surface, the ash serving as fertilizer.","\"Scatter Shot!\" An archer drew arrows and punched holes into the dirt.","None of them were actually farming properly.","Probably, anyone who couldn't use abilities to farm simply didn't pick this quest.","The surrounding players were all from the Thorn Guild—specifically the lifestyle players that Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao had painstakingly trained.","Seeing Chu Fu appear, they greeted her warmly.","Chu Fu received another wave of attention.","Even in just a town-level map, she already felt like a celebrity.","\"Everyone, get back to your own work! I'm just here to finish a quest.\"","Chu Fu glanced at the quest instructions.","[Weed] [Till Soil] [Sow Seeds]","With a slight manipulation of her mental energy, every weed on the ground was ripped out by the roots.","Till the soil?","Chu Fu tossed out two dandelions, which buzzed and whirred as they spun, churning up the land.","Then, with a single toss of her Poison Scatter spell, she sowed all the seeds.","A system notification sounded.","[Your seeds have been planted. Please beware of weeding and pest control.","Vicious mutant rats may gnaw on your plants.","Goblin raids may destroy rice paddies and wheat fields, causing reduced yields.","Maturation time: 24 hours.]","Players couldn't realistically watch over their land for 24 hours, so most people just planted and waited until the next day to harvest.","To many players, this quest was basically like farming in a game—plant at your leisure, harvest at your leisure.","But Chu Fu wasn't interested in waiting.","She simply forced the seeds to mature.","[You have obtained 400 jin of wheat (Common).]","[You have obtained 500 jin of rice (Common).]","[Please proceed to Fengdu Town's granary to submit the quest.]","The quest was done.","After that, she looked at the empty land around her and felt a nagging discomfort—like she had to plant something in it.","\"Sure, I don't have to plant here, but I can have my sprites do it for me!\"","Chu Fu had a brilliant idea.","Soon, she reclaimed all the surrounding land.","Fifty-five dandelions, like harvesters, buzzed as they plowed a huge stretch of long, narrow land.","Chu Fu followed behind the chainsaw-dandelions, and before long, she had carved out a massive rice paddy—at least 300 acres.","Then, she pulled out ultra-high-yield rice seeds.","Using Plant Mutation, she forced the rice seed to mature and mutate.","In an instant, the rice plant grew as tall as a corn stalk, its ears full and heavy, bent over from the weight. Each grain was the size of a thumbnail.","[You have obtained Ultra-High-Yield Rice Seeds (3000 grains).]","Then, Chu Fu released every sprite stored in her Spirit Plant Satchel.","Instantly, a cloud like a purple mushroom—countless sprites—swarmed out.","Because she had been filling her staff [A Little Bit Toxic] with poison, Chu Fu had planted over ten million Charm Mushrooms.","With a 1% chance, the Charm Mushroom sprites numbered over 100,000.","Luckily, the Spirit Plant Satchel could store plants infinitely—even if they were sprites, they were technically wood-type companion lifeforms.","So they really were stored away.","Now, these little sprites had work to do.","\"Plant all of these!\" Chu Fu commanded.","The sprites were obedient, hugging the thumbnail-sized seeds.","But each sprite was only the size of a thumb, so the seeds felt like giant boulders to them. Chu Fu planted them with 25-centimeter spacing, and she quickly realized 3,000 seeds weren't enough.","A moment earlier, Chu Fu had thrown one seed into the Spirit Plant Satchel to mature, since the maturation time there was reduced by 20%, saving time.","Unexpectedly, it triggered the Satchel's 3% chance to improve quality.","[Ultra-High-Yield Nutrient Rice Seeds (Gold Grade): Long-term consumption increases Health. Food made from this rice slowly restores HP, and long-term consumption adds +1 Constitution.]","\"Is this... spirit rice?\"","Chu Fu instantly thought of the spirit rice from xianxia novels.","As soon as she said it, the seed's description changed to [Spirit Rice Seeds (Gold Grade)].","Chu Fu also realized that the plants she mutated could be named by her.","She focused on spawning more Spirit Rice Seeds, then released them for the sprites to plant.","Chu Fu was absorbed in her farming, and half a day passed in the blink of an eye.","Finally, the 300 acres were fully planted.","Luckily, they would be ready to harvest in 24 hours—after that, she'd have plenty of seeds and wouldn't need to force-grow them herself.","Once that was done, Chu Fu gave orders for the sprites to guard the rice paddies.","Anything like goblins or mutant rats—kill on sight.","Anything that tried to destroy the fields—slay them all.","After giving her orders, it was time for Chu Fu to log off and train in the real world.","Work hard in the game, but also recover her health in reality quickly.","And just as Chu Fu logged off...","In Fengdu Town, another guild, the Star Alliance, was also taking on guild quests.","Because they didn't have enough reputation points, the Star Alliance hadn't established their own guild territory.","But they could still accept quests from the quest hall—it was just more troublesome and time-consuming to travel back and forth.","The designated planting areas for quests were all in the same region.","When they saw the perfectly tilled, neatly lined fields, they all gaped in amazement.","Especially since wood-type sprites were fluttering over the land.","\"Whose land is this? Did they whale out?\"","\"Wait, where do you buy those farming sprites?\"","\"You can't buy them? Is this some S-tier farming talent?\"","Everyone started chattering on the map chat.","The Thorn Guild players couldn't help but show off.","\"It's the Plant Master's talent—can't you tell?\"","When Jiang Yixing heard this, his eyes turned red.","He'd contracted red-eye disease.","How could someone be so strong in combat and so outrageously good at life skills too?","He really wanted to wreck it!","Just as he was thinking that, he spotted a group of goblins suddenly appearing, heading straight for Chu Fu's land.","In an instant, Jiang Yixing harbored a vicious thought.","Smash all the land to bits!","He didn't stop them—he watched as the goblin squad charged toward the Plant Master's fields. The only thing that puzzled him was that the other Thorn Guild players didn't seem to care either.","The next moment, he saw countless purple mushroom-skirt sprites shoot out, casting skills at the goblins nearing the rice paddies.","The goblins, charmed into a dazed stupor, collapsed to the ground, their bodies sprouting mushrooms.","Dead.","Jiang Yixing's eyes snapped back into clarity.","Just then, a girl standing next to him let out a sly, gleeful laugh.","\"Xingxing, this game is actually pretty fun—isn't this just a crop-stealing game? I'm a pro at this.\"","\"Casual players won't harvest at the exact second the crops mature. We don't even need to plant anything—once the rice is ready, we just go straight in and steal it.\""]},{"number":110,"title":"Chapter 110: Wang Siyu Wants to Backstab, Wan Huanyu Is Speechless","paragraphs":["\"With all this rice, it's more than enough to complete the mission.\"","You make a good point, but is it really possible?","Jiang Yixing hesitated.","A guild member quickly said, \"Xingxing, don't be scared. If you can't do it, have the non-guild players do the stealing, then trade it to you. The quest doesn't say you have to grow it yourself.\"","Only then did Jiang Yixing feel at ease.","Still, he put on a bit of an act and said, \"Let's just do the quest for now, at least finish the prerequisite tasks.\"","\"Great! Xingxing isn't afraid of hard work, let's do it!\"","Everyone started clearing land, pulling weeds, and tilling the soil. Jiang Yixing soon regretted it, but luckily, once he completed the tutorial quest, all he'd need to do for the daily tasks afterward was turn in grain.","By then, even if nothing got stolen, someone would deliver the supplies just to help him finish his quests.","...","On the other side.","Inside Wangxi Village.","Wang Silu, with a hired crew of 200 players, squeezed her way into Wangxi Village and quickly carved out a spot for herself in the newbie zone.","Wangxi Village was indeed well developed. Equipment was cheap—just throw money at it and a level 1 player could wear a full set of Silver-tier gear and take on level 5-6 monsters.","Not only that, but high-level players could use level-balancing advantages to enter level 3 dungeons ahead of schedule.","You could even push it further: four level 10 players carrying one level 1 player into the Nightmare difficulty of the Beast Sanctuary.","After all, once Silver-tier gear became commonplace, even the Nightmare difficulty of the Beast Sanctuary would be completely steamrolled by the stats, making it far easier to clear.","At the dungeon entrance.","Lin Haowan was recording a video.","This time he wasn't streaming—he was a genuine player now.","\"Hey everyone, I've made it to Wangxi Village. This place is amazing—tons of players, all super friendly. Even though my talent doesn't let me join the Thorn Guild, I can still pay a bit and get someone to carry me.\"","\"If you're a whale who doesn't want to grind and wants to catch up, don't bother with the new servers. Just go straight to Wangxi Village.\"","\"Alright, enough talking. Let's get into the fight!\"","He didn't stop recording, since he wanted to capture everything for later editing and maybe grab some funny moments for his videos.","Just as he was thinking that, a disdainful snort rang out nearby.","\"Sycophant!\"","Wang Silu rolled her eyes so hard they nearly went out of her head.","Lin Haowan immediately glanced over and spotted the mage named Lulu.","His eyes went wide in an instant, and all the old grudges came flooding back.","\"You dare insult me? What, is Shunmuyuan your family's turf? Is Rongxun Studio run by your brother? Second Miss of Shunmuyuan, huh? You're the one I'm hitting!\"","Lin Haowan raised his bow and fired straight at Wang Silu.","Wang Silu, decked out in full Silver gear with high attack and heavy HP, barely felt the damage. But the insult cut deep.","She immediately raised her staff.","Fireball.","She was a fire mage.","A fireball the size of a washbasin hurtled toward Lin Haowan, but he dodged it at the last second.","He strafed left and right, loosing arrows, and somehow managed to chip away more than half of Wang Silu's health.","Wang Silu started to panic.","\"What are you all standing there for? Heal me! You're my teammates, aren't you supposed to protect me?\"","All four players in her party furrowed their brows.","\"We only protect you inside the dungeon. That's a separate fee.\"","\"Fine, you want money? I've got it. Heal me!\"","Wang Silu immediately deposited 100 silver coins into the party treasury.","A hundred thousand! Definitely not chump change.","The healer in the party gave Wang Silu a quick heal.","But that wasn't enough.","Wang Silu quickly shouted, \"Don't just heal—attack him too! Kill him! Make him quit the game! Let's see how smug he is then!\"","\"Every time he shows up, I'll kill him.\"","What she didn't expect was the party refusing.","\"This is between the two of you. I can heal you, but I won't fight for you. That breaks the rules of Wangxi Village.\"","What rules?","No PKing out in the open, especially at the dungeon entrance. That area was sensitive.","Holding people up from entering the dungeon would get you ganged up on.","So only the priest healed Wang Silu, but no one attacked Lin Haowan.","Lin Haowan's eyes gleamed, and he pulled his bow even harder.","Even if he couldn't kill Wang Silu, he was going to make her suffer.","\"Can't hit me! Drives you crazy, huh? I'll just dodge! How are you this bad? If you're this bad, why even bother playing?\"","\"Don't think I don't know—that 'car accident' three thousand years ago, the one that put people in comas? You corporates ran them over and put them in vegetative states, and now you're still bullying some poor young girl.","Shameless.","And you still dare to show your face in Wangxi Village?","Get out! Go far away, go back to your precious Rongxun Studio's new server!\"","Lin Haowan hurled insults left and right.","The worst part? His mouth was foul, but he actually had skill.","He had Wang Silu howling in pain.","Then, suddenly, she heard a notification.","“You have been removed from the party!”","What?","The boosting players had kicked her out.","\"What are you doing?! Heal me! I paid you!\"","\"Pah, I'd rather not earn your money. Your character is trash, and on top of that, you're bullying the big boss in the coma. Without him, we wouldn't even have jobs as boosters. We know who our real benefactor is.\"","\"Besides, I'm not attacking you because I don't want anyone twisting it into me stealing a client's gear. Otherwise, I'd cut you down right now.\"","\"That archer, keep going! If you kill her, her gear is yours!\"","Lin Haowan sped up his firing.","\"Lin Haowan, just you wait—I'll destroy you!\" Wang Silu's eyes flashed with malice, and at that moment, the people she'd called in finally arrived.","A wave of over fifty level 1 players surged to the entrance of the Beast Sanctuary.","These were all people who had come to the game with Wang Silu.","\"Get him!\" Wang Silu commanded.","Lin Haowan knew he was in trouble.","But soon, a flash of healing light landed on him.","The players who had been boosting Wang Silu earlier were now healing Lin Haowan instead.","\"Ha! You think we're just gonna stand by? Bullying our boss? Take them all out!\"","Lin Haowan's boosters finally jumped in. They hadn't acted before because they figured a grudge between clients was none of their business.","But now that a mob was coming for Lin Haowan, they weren't having it.","A bunch of level 10 players took down Wang Silu's reinforcements in a few hits.","\"Damn! My PK value hit 10,000! Anyone who kills the werewolf Turg at the Beast Sanctuary entrance gets a 100-copper red envelope!\" Someone shouted, and no one cared about Wang Silu's corpse at all. All they cared about was the reward for killing the wolf boss.","After dying, Wang Silu had no choice but to crawl out of her gaming pod in fury.","She grabbed her phone and sent a message to Wan Huanyu.","\"You said before you'd take care of that one in a coma. Make her disappear from the real world. Send me the contact info—I've got someone I need to handle too.\"","Wan Huanyu was speechless. Finally, he replied, \"... The people I hired already got taken care of.\""]},{"number":111,"title":"Chapter 111: Turning in Grain Makes a Fortune, Money for Building a House Secured","paragraphs":["Wan Huanyu had been full of confidence, certain he could take down Chu Fu, but little did he expect that someone would actually accept his task, even communicating with him that it would definitely be completed.","The result? Within four hours of the server launch, Plantman led his team and swept up every single first-kill.","This infuriated Wan Huanyu, who went straight to confront them.","But then, the intel on the dark web showed that Laurent was already dead.","Ross had also fallen into the net.","Thank god the dark web was anonymous with masked addresses, or his murder-for-hire scheme would have been exposed.","But after this, Wan Huanyu finally kept his head down for good.","After all, anyone who could take out Laurent evidently had aces up their sleeve too.","If pushed to the brink, they might even retaliate with an assassination attempt on him.","So recently, Wan Huanyu has been holed up at Wantu Real Estate Tower, where the security system is top-notch, and he rarely logs off.","Just lay low for a month.","He was about to hit level 20 now, and finally could head to the city to develop.","Hopefully this time things would go smoother.","At least, he wasn’t the rookie from the 001 District anymore.","He had revival scrolls in hand, and he’d raised a priest capable of resurrection—this time he wouldn’t die so easily.","...","Fengdu Town, the granary.","Chu Fu handed her rice over to the granary manager, a man named Shi Dacang.","When she submitted the task, there weren’t many people around—after all, it was the first day of server merge, the territory had just been purchased, and only two guilds had taken on the task.","On day one, nothing had grown yet.","Chu Fu was the only one playing the role of the Divine Farmer.","Shi Dacang inspected the goods.","“The rice is free of pests and disease, plump in grain, top-quality. Purchase price: 2 copper coins per catty.”","“The wheat is also top-quality. Purchase price: 2 copper coins per catty.”","In one go, she earned 1 silver and 800 copper coins.","Not only that, she also got a wave of experience.","It was even more than an hour of killing monsters outside.","Chu Fu quickly pulled out the ultra-high-yield rice (silver tier) and spirit rice (gold tier) she’d been growing before.","“Master Shi, would you buy these as well?” Chu Fu handed them over.","Shi Dacang took one look, his eyes immediately lighting up, then said: “This rice is excellent—each grain is enormous, with extremely high yield. I can purchase it as seed stock at 10 copper coins per catty.”","As for the spirit rice, Shi Dacang took one look and drew a sharp breath.","“This rice contains a trace of unique energy fluctuation. Extremely satiating, packed with vitality. Eating it strengthens the body. What a treasure, what a treasure. Purchase price: 20 copper coins.”","Don’t let the copper pricing fool you—the volume Chu Fu could sell was simply insane.","One acre could yield roughly 5,000 catties of spirit rice at 20 copper per catty, meaning that single acre’s selling price came to 100 silver.","300 acres would be 30 gold coins.","Converted to real-world currency, that was 30 million!","The ability to earn 30 million in 24 hours—how terrifying was that?","And the craziest part? Chu Fu had only tilled 300 acres so far.","What if she expanded?","Forget killing monsters and bosses.","Chu Fu was going straight into farming.","“Master Shi, I can mass-produce these rice and spirit rice seeds. I just need to know—how much can you take off my hands?”","Though Shi Dacang was an NPC, his expression was vivid and full of excitement: “Esteemed awakened one, you must be an incredibly skilled wood-element awakener.”","“To be frank, our granary is running empty. If you could provide 5 million catties of grain, you’d relieve a full month of food crisis for Fengdu Town.”","“And if Fengdu can’t absorb it all, we can pass it to other towns. If other towns can’t take it, we’ll risk our lives to transport it on to Linjiang City!”","“Linjiang City is under siege by the undead legions. The surrounding land is already polluted—nothing can grow there. If you can really produce enough grain, you might even ease the entire city’s famine.”","[System Prompt: Will you accept the epic quest: Famine Year.","Quest giver: Shi Dacang.","Quest description: All towns around Linjiang City are besieged by goblin and undead legions, with no harvest to be had, and the townspeople are starving.","Phase One: Provide 5 million catties of grain.","Upon accepting the quest, you will receive:","Quest item: Rice Pouch (Gold tier): Automatically collects grain and stacks infinitely.","Quest item: Golden Hoe (Gold tier): Increases crop yield by 10% while equipped.","Quest Completion Reward: Large amounts of experience, large amounts of gold, and the badge: Harvest Badge (Gold tier).","Quest Failure Penalty: Lose 1,000 reputation points, and pay 20 gold in compensation.]","[Accept quest? Yes / No]","Wow!","Chu Fu’s eyes lit up.","She hadn’t expected to stumble upon a hidden quest.","In fact, every player could receive class-specific quests from NPCs depending on their profession.","She just hadn’t thought it would trigger this easily.","Chu Fu immediately accepted.","With a delighted grin, Shi Dacang handed her the rice pouch and the golden hoe.","“I hope the awakened one completes this quest soon. The quest can be done in stages—the townsfolk are waiting for food.”","“No problem!”","Chu Fu decided to skip monster hunting entirely and go farm instead.","Soon, she took the golden hoe out to the wilds and kept clearing and tilling the land.","She expanded outside the town, opening up all available plots.","She worked fast, multiplying her 300 acres by tenfold.","She would have gone even bigger, if not for having too few Charm Mushroom sprites to protect the land from the mutant rats.","3,000 acres would yield 15 million catties of grain, and with the golden hoe boosting yields, that rose to 16.5 million catties.","At 20 copper coins per catty, that whole crop was worth 330 gold.","If only her mana pool allowed it, she’d have accelerated the growth too.","But she could only speed-grow 55 mutant plants at a time at most.","There were just far too many food crops for her to handle, so Chu Fu had no choice but to wait until tomorrow to harvest.","Just as she finished, a massive horde of goblins—easily ten thousand strong—suddenly appeared.","[Map Alert: Goblins have appeared on the south side of Fengdu Town. Scale: Medium. Go and reinforce!]","A public quest had triggered.","Similar to village defense battles or retaliation battles, as long as you were nearby, you could kill monsters to earn contribution points, which could be exchanged at Fengdu Town’s contribution warehouse.","The rewards were just consumables, town-return scrolls, equipment, and the like—nothing rare like aptitude stones or skill stones.","Chu Fu swapped her hoe for her “Slightly Toxic” staff and gave the goblin horde a plague-infested Blight.","Public quest completed.","Because her farm was so massive and she worried the sprites might miss something, Chu Fu stuck around killing goblins nearby. The experience was paltry, but it counted toward kills—maybe she could complete a new achievement.","Time slipped by unnoticed.","Twenty-four hours after planting, the first batch of rice was ripe.","The paddy stretched out enormously now—the rice stalks were as tall as cornstalks, hiding any shadows lurking within.","“Quick, don’t stick to one patch. These ears weigh two or three catties each. Let’s spread out and get enough for Xingxing’s mission.”","“Haha, this is so satisfying. That Plantman killed us before—this is just the interest.”","“Yeah, that’s right!”","These people had no idea that Chu Fu had summoned fifty-five Chainsaw Dandelions at the edge of the rice field.","\"Time to harvest the rice!\"","Chu Fu led the Chainsaw Dandelions as they buzzed and swept across a vast swath of the field."]},{"number":112,"title":"Chapter 112: Vegetative Man Brand Harvester, Finalized for Construction Around Wangxi District","paragraphs":["“Buzzzzzz!”","Each electric saw dandelion was 2 meters in diameter, and together they formed a massive 110-meter-wide saw blade that plowed through the rice fields.","Rice plants fell in waves.","Chu Fu held her gold-grade rice sack and began harvesting—the rice automatically turned into grains inside the sack.","She felt that, ever since the game had invaded reality, she could work as a professional harvester whenever she wasn’t fighting monsters.","Just as she was thinking this, the system pinged again.","[You have slain Star’s Healing. Sin value +100.]","[You have slain Who Says Stalker Fans Aren’t Fans? Sin value +100.]","[You have slain Professional Water Army. Sin value +100.]","??????","Chu Fu was dumbfounded.","She looked down and saw, beneath the fallen rice stalks, several corpses chopped into pieces—one chunk here, another there.","Even the Suture Saint would need a while to stitch those back together!","Seriously, why were these people hiding in the rice field?","Playing hide-and-seek?","Or were they plotting something to rack up more sin value for her? Wait—didn’t she have the Disguiser’s Mask?","What exactly were they after?","But she soon realized: when these people died, they dropped all their equipment—including the rice they had in their backpacks.","They had been stealing her rice.","Unbelievable.","Why not just grow their own? Why steal?","Did they think this was some kind of farm-stealing game?","Chu Fu was genuinely a little angry this time.","She had previously set the logic for the Charm Mushroom Sprite to attack enemies who damaged the rice field.","But she hadn’t commanded it to attack humans.","So the Charm Mushroom Sprite hadn’t lifted a finger.","That’s the loophole these people had exploited.","Meanwhile, the Star Alliance members were also panicking.","“What’s that sound?”","“Ah! How did you die!”","“Run! Run! The plant person’s saw plants are here!”","But by the time they tried to flee, it was too late. The Charm Mushroom Sprite cast its charm and wiped them all out.","Then the saw dandelions spun and rolled over them.","Not a single intact piece remained.","Straight to reincarnation.","Chu Fu had no intention of letting them respawn—that would be mercy to her enemies.","And she wasn’t about to let them linger around and annoy her.","Chu Fu kept harvesting.","Soon she had gathered enough rice. It was a bit less than she’d expected, but still about 16 million jin of rice.","She excitedly went to find Shi Dacang.","“Master Shi, the grain you asked for is ready! It’s all here!”","Chu Fu submitted the quest.","Shi Dacang’s eyes widened. Only a day had passed!","How much land would she have needed to plow and plant to produce this?","He took the sack and looked inside—there was a full 16 million jin of rice.","His jaw dropped.","Just like the village chief of Wangxi Village back then—only even more exaggerated.","“Oh heavens, great Awakened One, you are truly incredible! You harvested so much grain in such a short time.”","[System Notice: You have completed Stage One of the Famine Years: Fengdu Town Food Crisis.]","“Your grain can also be shared with the nearby towns of Fenghe and Guguan.”","[System Notice: You have completed Stage One of the Famine Years: Fenghe Town Food Crisis.]","[System Notice: You have completed Stage One of the Famine Years: Guguan Town Food Crisis.]","“These are your rewards—payment for the grain, plus some small tokens of appreciation from our towns.”","Chu Fu suddenly gained a huge amount of experience, leveling up to 17!","Shi Dacang handed three bags to Chu Fu.","One of them contained money.","[You have obtained Gold-Spangled Hundred-Storage Pouch (Gold) ×3]","[You have obtained 320 gold coins]","[Gold-Spangled Hundred-Storage Pouch (Gold): Equippable in the system bag, increases bag space by 50 slots.]","An unexpected bonus.","Currently, Chu Fu was still using the bronze-grade storage pouch crafted by Zhimengzhe—20 slots per pouch.","That was already far better than the 5-slot pouch she’d bought in the newbie village.","But this Gold-Spangled Hundred-Storage Pouch would give her far more room.","At this point, her quest had reached Stage Three.","It already involved two towns.","Did that mean there were third and fourth towns waiting?","And after delivering to all of them, would there be a Linjiang City quest?","If so, she might be able to enter the city ahead of schedule!","And then, she could meet her brother in the game!","Just as that thought crossed her mind, the game pod’s alert chimed.","“Fufu, Major Li is here to see you about something.”","Chu Fu immediately set aside her in-game business, drained the nutrient solution, and climbed out of the game pod.","She no longer needed a wheelchair now—her recovery had been remarkable.","Coming downstairs, she saw Li Weizheng waiting in the living room.","“Student Chu, you’re here. I’ve come to go through the formalities. All the paperwork is here. From now on, you’re free to develop the surrounding land as you see fit.”","Chu Fu glanced at the documents and nodded with satisfaction.","They’d moved fast—just one day.","Of course, time was tight. Li Weizheng also knew that with only a little over four months left, there was no room for delay.","“Let me introduce you—this is Chen Gang, head of the Huaxia Construction Group’s Linjiang branch. If you have any construction needs, you can contact him directly. Rest assured, with him on board, you’ll get full ‘China Speed’!”","This was a pleasant surprise for Chu Fu.","She reached out and shook his hand.","“Hello.”","“As it happens, I do have a building blueprint here. Since we’re in a rush, I don’t plan to build high-rises. Just three-story townhouses will do!”","“But I want the buildings to be dense—eventually, I’ll turn this place into a true, bustling little town!”","“As for money, don’t worry. I’m currently earning at least 300 gold a day in the Primordial Gate—that’s equivalent to about 300 million in real-world currency. At the very least, I won’t shortchange the workers.”","Li Weizheng rubbed his hands together beside them.","“Student Chu, I still owe you 40 gold from before, plus the money I owe the Suture Saint. How about this: you can sell your gold coins directly to us, and we’ll offset the amount with construction fees.”","That worked fine.","Chu Fu naturally agreed.","After that, the three of them discussed the town’s investment. The full project was estimated to cost around 200 billion yuan in total.","But with the game invasion imminent, paper money would soon be worthless, and materials could be had for free from the ruins.","Everyone understood this without saying it out loud.","By then, construction fees and banks would all turn to dust.","So what Chu Fu really needed to pay was just the workers’ wages—so that no one came out short.","In the end, the amount was set at 20 billion.","All she had to do was farm for two months.","Time to clear another three thousand mu of land.","Chu Fu thought to herself.","She gave Chen Gang one last word of advice: “Start full-scale construction right away. Don’t stop. Get it done within three months, if possible.”","After that, within a month, she would move in the entire Thorn Guild and their families—to take care of any worries behind the scenes.","“Don’t worry, Student Chu. I know the situation well. We will not delay the schedule.”","Chen Gang was reasonably senior—being sent here, he certainly wouldn’t look down on Chu Fu just because she was young and sickly.","In reality, Chu Fu now held a rather high rank and status within the official hierarchy.","The three of them discussed the matter once more before finally going their separate ways.","Only after they had left did Chu Feng step out.","Chu Feng's eyes were dark and profound, carrying a hint of hidden meaning within.","\"Fufu, what made you think of buying up the land and developing the surrounding area?\""]},{"number":113,"title":"Chapter 113: Chu Fu's Utopia: Teammates Move into Wangxi Manor","paragraphs":["“Brother, do you know?” Chu Fu suddenly lowered her voice and said sneakily, “Major Li told us that in just over four months, the game is going to invade reality.”","Chu Feng: ????","“Is this for real? Is there any proof?”","Chu Feng’s eyes flickered, and his voice lowered as well.","Chu Fu then explained Li Weizheng’s experimental theory.","At that moment, a huge wave of shock crashed through Chu Feng’s mind.","Based on what he knew from his previous life—after the first month passed, the mutated rats only then synced into reality. And the wild boar mutations didn’t appear until at least two months after the 【Primordial Gate】 had opened.","So the official research had to be correct.","Then the question was: why so soon?","Back before his rebirth, the game didn’t invade reality until after a full year.","What had changed all of this?","Oh, right. It was me. Never mind, then.","Chu Feng quickly figured it all out.","Because he had been reborn.","In his past life, the game invaded a year later, and he had only been a grunt at a small game studio—grinding copper coins, mining ore, converting any spare earnings into cash, trying to build a safety net.","He never imagined that a year later, monsters would invade reality, and all the money sitting in his bank account would turn into worthless paper—just numbers.","Not a single cent could be brought out.","And at that time, he had only been level 10.","Now, he was level 30!","He was a first-tier player—the first person in the entire world to reach level 30.","Everything was different.","Especially, Chu Feng had changed his younger sister’s fate.","He had given Chu Fu a game pod, and as a result, she awakened—not just her, but Shen Chi and Xie Lin as well, two guys who, in Chu Feng’s view, had never appeared in his previous life.","And all of them had S-rank talents.","The stronger the talents that rose up, the more wary the monsters invading this world became.","Take the newbie village for example—once more than 1,000 players reached level 10, the beast tide naturally triggered.","Because of the Beast God’s surveillance.","After his own rebirth, he awakened an SSS-rank talent, creating an enormous variable.","The timing of the game’s invasion into reality had also moved up.","Even so, being reborn once, Chu Feng had confidence that even if it came half a year earlier, he could handle everything.","What comforted him most was that his butterfly effect had changed his sister’s fate and those of others as well.","It had triggered a cascade of reactions.","In particular, he noticed that his sister was on very close terms with the authorities.","That was a good thing—he would stay behind the scenes, while his sister could join official circles and gain access to their intelligence.","Just like right now—he could obtain information like this.","“Don’t worry, Fu Fu, even if the game invades reality, your big brother will protect you!”","“Li Weizheng may have official backing, but once the game invades reality, the authorities will have their own hands full.”","“When that time comes, we have to rely on ourselves!”","Chu Fu never argued with Chu Feng.","She only felt for her brother!","Because the Chu Feng of now only carried memories from his first lifetime. He instinctively distrusted the authorities—after all, in that first life, he was at the bottom, only level 10, and when the world turned upside down, the old order collapsed, and he was just a single grain of sand in an ocean.","Good thing she had arrived!","“Brother, I’m growing too. When this world falls into the abyss and the authorities can’t manage themselves—won’t we still be here?","Better to be one of those who protect others.","Than to be among the ones who need protecting.","Don’t hand your fate to someone else’s hands—only then can you rule your own destiny.","So I’m going to build a kingdom of my own. Maybe one day, this place of ours will be called the City of Thorns!”","Chu Feng smiled.","“Then, for my little sister’s utopia—your big brother will have to keep pushing forward too!”","Chu Fu naturally nodded.","After all, her brother was the protagonist with main-character plot armor!","All the villains would turn into brainless fools.","Chu Fu secretly giggled to herself.","Chu Feng patted Chu Fu’s head. As long as she was happy, he was willing to do anything.","...","Chu Fu did some more training, then logged into the game.","To supply more food tomorrow, Chu Fu went to clear more land.","She simply reclaimed the land around the guild’s territory, adding another 3,000 mu.","That brought Chu Fu’s daily output to 32 million jin.","After that, Chu Fu hurriedly called for Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao and the others to go leveling.","The team counted ten people—the old regulars, plus a few newly trained members.","After some thought, Chu Fu shared the news she got from Major Li’s side.","“Here’s the situation,” she said. “So from now on, I want all of you to move into Wangxi Manor as soon as possible—your families too. If you have relatives you trust, bring them as well. There’s plenty of room in the villas.”","Among the four new members, everyone was stunned—except Bitter Melon King.","Bitter Melon King had seen Chu Fu use her in-game abilities in the real world.","So she had long accepted all of this.","“Then I’m leaving the Primordial Academy—Vice Guild Leader, arrange it for me!” Bitter Melon King said immediately.","“Wait, I’m not following anymore!” Wu Yingchun said, utterly shocked.","After all, compared to the younger ones, Grandma Wu Yingchun never expected things to escalate like this.","Game invading reality? In-game skills syncing to the real world?","This was too surreal.","Chu Fu said, “Grandma Wu, even if you don’t trust me, you should at least trust the authorities, right?","And if you watch the news, you’ll see—red-eyed rabbits and mutated rats have already invaded the real world. A lot of articles are covering it now.","What the public doesn’t yet know, though, is that players can also extract attributes into reality—it’s just that the requirements are strict, and you need to be level 30.","So we need to rush our levels fast!","Get to 30 as soon as possible.","Everyone needs to keep a high login rate—when we can level together, don’t fall behind.”","Little Sister Wu understood.","This was a direct hint at her!","She immediately yelled, “Got it, Vice Guild Leader—I’m quitting my job tomorrow. I’m going full-time gamer!”","Little Sister Wu was the only one in the team who had a regular job.","Not only that, but her job was the kind that didn’t pay much yet came with great benefits, low pressure, and tons of time off.","But after yesterday’s session—five bosses, four dungeons—she suddenly realized this game was the real boom.","She felt like she hadn’t even done much, and she had earned 4 million!","If she went by her old life—5,000 yuan a month, no food, no spending—she’d have to work 66 years to earn that much.","Why go to work anymore?","Of course, they also spent a lot—in the end, the money earned in-game only went back into boosting their own stats. It wasn’t possible to just earn without spending.","Her old lady—her dear mother—had already invested several million.","So Little Sister Wu had also had her doubts and worries.","But now, hearing that the game would soon invade reality, that money would become useless paper, and their lives were even in danger—Little Sister Wu agreed without hesitation.","Shafu Liangu and Zhimengzhe, although stunned by the news, also agreed and planned to move into the Thorn Guild’s VIP employee dorms.","“From now on, we give it everything we have—level up as fast as possible.”"]},{"number":114,"title":"Chapter 114: What Has the Thorn Guild Actually Turned People Into","paragraphs":["Chu Fu reminded everyone to level up. Given their current level, clearing nightmare-tier dungeons to gain levels was already quite good for them.","However, considering that they still needed to complete the [Green Tide Burial Master] quest, Chu Fu led the group to farm level 20 monsters instead.","It had to be said, ever since they got the Charm Mushroom, farming monsters became much easier.","An endless stream of monsters was attracted over.","They farmed like this for six hours, until it reached the early hours of the morning.","The map bosses and hell-tier dungeons had all respawned.","Chu Fu led the team, starting with the hell-tier dungeon. They only farmed three map bosses — the level 18, level 20, and level 25 ones — because they gave the most experience.","Little did they know.","Because Chu Fu hadn't planned on farming the first boss, this allowed the people from Rongxun Studio, Universal Studio, and Star Alliance to finally have a chance to fight a boss.","“The Plant people didn't come.”","“Damn it, last time just 10 people came to steal the boss, but this time they brought a whole crowd. Are they really thinking they can take us on with just their underlings? Isn't that a bit too disrespectful?”","“But why are there so many solo players?”","“I have a bad feeling about this,” Universal Caesar said, pinching the bridge of his nose.","He had investigated before. Plantman's Wangxi Village had a full nine thousand players who reached level 10, and now, the majority of players in Fengdu Town were these very people.","Some of them even counted as unofficial members of the Thorn Guild.","If a fight broke out...","The three major factions really might not stand a chance.","After all, the players from Wangxi Village had far too good equipment.","Meanwhile, looking at their own allied forces.","Whether it was Rongxun or Star Alliance, they were all dressed in rags now.","And why?","Of course, because they'd been killed, and their equipment had been looted.","The people from Rongxun Studio were now staring at those players with bloodshot eyes.","“How did we not notice yesterday that these players had such good gear? How is it that most of them are packing silver-tier equipment?”","“It's level 10 silver gear, not from the nightmare-tier Goblin Nest drops.”","“Our studio's elite team yesterday didn't even manage to clear the nightmare dungeon!”","“Man, should we sneak attack them later and kill them all?”","The dogs of Rongxun Studio never changed their ways.","When the boss appeared, things got even more chaotic.","30 minutes later, the boss crashed to the ground.","The final blow was actually taken by a solo mage, a player called Yulou.","Not only did he not hide it, he laughed and said, “It's mine! Wow, so much experience from that final hit. I won't be polite, then.”","He immediately picked up the dropped silver equipment.","But just that one pickup was enough to break the patience of the Rongxun Guild players.","In an instant, four or five spells and arrows slammed into Yulou.","Yulou died on the spot.","His body collapsed to the ground, shifting into a strange camera angle, but a line of text appeared on the map.","[Yulou]: Damn, the Rongxun Guild killed me! The IDs that hit me are Rongxun Hujiang, Rongxun Ma Wencai...","The surrounding players naturally saw those red-named Rongxun Guild members, and like hungry wolves pouncing on prey, skills rained down on them.","In an instant, all those Rongxun Studio players were dead.","“Brother Yulou, don't worry! I'll hold onto your gear for you. Once you revive, I'll give it back.”","“Kill the red names! Don't you know the rules of Wangxi Village? Whoever gets the boss is the owner! No malicious PK allowed!”","“This isn't Wangxi Village anymore!”","“Then let this be the new rule of Fengdu Town. Everyone should follow it from now on. If you don't, we'll tell Plantman, and let Suture Saint of the Thorn Guild refuse to revive you.”","“Take down all the red names! Whoever kills them gets their gear!”","“You red names can just go and reincarnate. Suture Saint won't bring you back!”","Rongxun Qizhao was stunned.","Then, suppressing the urge to wipe out everyone on the other side, he gritted his teeth and said, “Fall back, retreat. Don't provoke them.”","They couldn't let the fight escalate.","Otherwise, their squad would never recover.","He had heard that yesterday, people from Star Alliance had tried to steal vegetables that Plantman had planted, and they'd been torn apart piece by piece, making them impossible to revive.","In a server with only one resurrection ability, they couldn't afford to offend these people.","Of course, they couldn't win in a fight either.","Having already been swept clean once, Rongxun Studio had suffered a loss of twenty million yesterday.","They couldn't afford another loss today.","So, the group scattered, and Yulou's body lay there on the ground.","No one looted it.","Not only that, the boss's dropped copper coins gathered together, along with potions, materials, bronze gear, and silver gear, all piling up over Yulou's corpse.","Players around were even putting on a show.","“Brother Yulou, you died a worthy death. This red potion, I toast you with it.”","“I'll drink a blue potion in accompaniment!”","“First bow! Second bow! Third bow! Family members, return the gesture!”","A group of players laughed and joked around.","The atmosphere was harmonious, as if they were all close friends playing together.","Rongxun Qizhao screamed inside.","What method had the Thorn Guild used?","To tame players into something like this?","No greed for profit, no thirst for victory, no covetousness or malice.","It made the people of Rongxun Studio look like vile rats lurking in the gutters.","Many players from Rongxun Studio had changed expressions at that moment, their faces turning ugly.","But some also showed looks of envy and longing.","Who doesn't want to be a good person?","Who wants to be a villain, despised and hunted by everyone?","...","Three hours later.","The final boss hunt was finished.","Suture Saint said, “So many people are calling for me across the map to revive them. A bunch of players died by the Goblin Chief's spot.”","Chu Fu nodded.","“I know I've been asking everyone to stay online as much as possible, but leveling like this is pretty tedious.","From now on, we'll gather together every evening at 6 PM sharp to farm monsters, and start boss hunting at midnight. That's about nine hours — treat it like a shift at work.","Once everyone's equipment has been upgraded to gold-tier, we'll start bringing groups through dungeons and leveling up the guild members in batches!”","“You're all dismissed for now. Free time.”","“Oh, and if you're doing quests in the city, make sure to talk to NPCs related to your talent and class.”","“Wheelchair Bro, try more craftsman or artisan-type NPCs!”","“Weaver Dreamers, go check out the tailor shop.”","“Everyone else, the same!”","“A lot of hidden quests give great boosts, and you might even get special rewards.”","Chu Fu shared her own quest.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao looked at the description, then her eyes suddenly sparkled.","“This quest has something to it. Plant Girl, what if I bought grain from players and turned it all in to the NPC at once? Think I could earn that badge too?","If I can, doesn't that make this quest a guide to getting a gold medal for everyone? A repeatable strategy?”","Chu Fu's eyes went wide.","“Jiaojiao, you're a genius!”","No sooner said than done. Jiaojiao Bu Jiao immediately crushed a return scroll and ran off to find Shi Dacang to work on the quest."]},{"number":115,"title":"Chapter 115: The Great Benefactor Badge, Hunt the Defector Quest","paragraphs":["Shen Chi planned to bring Suture Saint along to sweep the map, and Suture Saint would give him 20% of the income.","After all, if Suture Saint flew on his own, it would waste a lot of time. With Shen Chi's transport mech, things were different.","\"I did take on a mission earlier. The barracks in Fengdu Town posted a bounty mission to kill deserters.","Recently, the method for obtaining the Disguise Mask was completely made public online. Many players have joined in, and the faction confrontation has officially begun.","The barracks mission allows you to accept missions to kill Disguisers.","If not, then it's humanoid elite monsters.","The rewards are quite good, and you can also practice your PK skills.","Complete three missions to get a Black-Iron tier badge: the Guardian Badge.\"","Chu Fu suddenly understood. Indeed, there was such a mission.","Wait, the Disguise Mask was exposed?","\"Where's the post? Let me take a look!\"","\"I sent it to your phone. It's not on the Primal Forum.\"","Xie Lin forwarded the post to Chu Fu.","After seeing the ID, Chu Fu's face darkened.","【ImmobileKing】","【The Easiest Way to Get Gold Equipment, Recruiting Teammates.】","【Image (Disguise Mask).","As shown in the picture, this Gold equipment was obtained in the newbie village. The method of obtaining it is very simple: just kill 100 players, then a hidden NPC will be activated, and you can get this equipment.","The most important thing is, after obtaining this equipment, even if you die, the equipment is soul-bound.","Moreover, after death, the kill count on the mask is not reset, and it can continue to accumulate.","Not only that, there's something even more powerful.","During the newbie village siege battle, as a player of the evil faction, you can receive a blessing from the Evil God, which upgrades your talent level.","Not only that, it also boosts your attributes.","For example, I got a 560% attribute boost.","Because on our server, there were 55 Disguise Masks, but none of them joined the evil faction, which benefited me.","My four main attributes now total over a hundred.","But even with the minimum 10% attribute boost, do you know what that means?","As long as you hold out until the siege battle, you're guaranteed a 10% attribute increase.","This is exponential growth!","It might not be strong at first.","But in the later stages, it's absolutely broken.","Suppose we always play only in the newbie village. The newbie village lasts at most 10 days. For a player with an average attribute of 5, the boost after one year would be 154.56.","That's the first year.","In the second year, the attributes would be 5255!","In the third year, attributes would be 160,000!","Leave the village and you're invincible!","So? Did I find a bug or not? Now, come join the evil faction!","Games should have diverse gameplay. Where there's order, there should be chaos. Real life is already suffocating enough. Do we still have to follow rules when playing games?","Things you don't dare to do in real life, try them in the game.","We want PK, we want robbery, we want violence!","I do what I want!】","This was an extremely provocative post.","Chu Fu didn't hesitate. She immediately sent the post to Li Weizheng.","After Li Weizheng saw the message, he was also shocked.","This was nothing less than a minion of the Evil God.","Someone needed to pay this guy a visit!","...","In the game.","Chu Fu also returned to the city with Xie Lin, ready to accept the mission to clear out the traitors.","Bitter Melon King asked, \"Vice Leader, can this mushroom of yours stay here? I plan to level up here.\"","When Bitter Melon King first joined the team, she was only level 10, lower than everyone else. But after five bosses and four dungeons yesterday, she had reached level 12.","She had also been running nightmare-tier dungeons with other guild members to focus on leveling up, and now she was already level 13.","\"It's fine. As long as the Charm Mushroom isn't destroyed, it will keep summoning!\"","Chu Fu said.","\"Then I'll stay here to level up too,\" Shafu Liangu said, summoning several spiders and snakes to block in front of the Charm Mushroom.","This way, the mushroom wouldn't be attacked.","\"Me too! Me too!\" Zhimengzhe also said, summoning her dolls.","Previously, Chu Fu's plant damage output was so high that the others didn't even need to act when leveling.","Of course, the Thorn Guild didn't keep idlers.","So on the surface, they were being carried, but in reality, they were handling the flood of guild applications and assigning teams appropriately for dungeons. In short, they were busy!","Now that Chu Fu was gone, with their talents, classes, and equipment, they could fight on their own.","It would just be a little slower.","Fortunately, the team composition was decent.","Wu Yingchun, the Martial Artist: front-line DPS.","Shafu Liangu, the Gu Master: summoner DPS.","Zhimengzhe, the Puppeteer: summoner DPS.","Bitter Melon King, the Pain Warlock: ranged control.","Little Sister Wu, the Witch Doctor: healer.","Enough for leveling.","...","Inside Fengdu Town.","Jiaojiao Bujiao walked with an arrogant swagger toward Shi Dacang.","Chu Fu had already told her the entire process of how she triggered the mission.","But Jiaojiao Bujiao naturally couldn't copy it directly.","Besides, the NPC logic in 【Primordial Gate】 was still very sophisticated.","She walked over and then said, \"Master Shi, I heard the town is in desperate need of grain lately. I can help you purchase a batch of grain to ease the town's crisis.\"","Shi Dacang sized up Jiaojiao Bujiao, then revealed a delighted expression.","\"So it's Awakener Jiaojiao Bujiao, the guild leader of the Thorn Guild! You saw the townsfolk starving and came to donate grain?\"","\"Jiaojiao Bujiao, you are truly a great benefactor!\"","The next moment, Jiaojiao Bujiao saw a system prompt.","【System Notice: Do you accept the Epic-tier mission: Great Benefactor.","Mission Issuer: Shi Dacang.","Mission Content: All towns around Linjiang City are being besieged by goblins and the undead legion. Crops have failed everywhere, and the townspeople are starving. As a wealthy person, will you donate a batch of grain to help the town get through this crisis?","Phase One: Donate 5 million jin of grain.","After accepting the mission,","you will receive a mission item: Rice Bag (Gold tier): can automatically collect grain and stacks infinitely.","Mission Completion Reward: Large amount of EXP, reward badge: Great Benefactor Badge (Gold tier).","Mission Failure Penalty: -1000 reputation points, Shi Dacang's disgust.】","Wait, what?","That's not how Plant Girl's mission went!","Also, at the minimum price of 1 copper coin per jin of grain, 5 million jin would still cost 5 gold coins!","Was this asking her to exchange gold coins directly for a Gold-tier badge?","Well... that wasn't entirely out of the question!","Jiaojiao Bujiao immediately accepted it, then posted a guild mission for extra tasks: buy rice.","...","On the other side.","Chu Fu and Xie Lin headed to the barracks to accept missions.","The barracks guard captain looked at the two of them and noticed they were in a party. He suddenly said, \"In Fengdu Town and Wangxi Village, we can no longer detect any deserters.","However, there are quite a few deserters in other towns.","In Guguan Town, there is a notorious deserter who has so far been unstoppable.","Unfortunately, Guguan Town has no direct teleport array to ours. You'll need to travel there on your own. The two towns are over a hundred kilometers apart.","Do you wish to accept this mission?\"","Chu Fu and Xie Lin exchanged a glance. Killing intent seeped from both their eyes.","Guguan Town?","Wasn't that District 017?"]},{"number":116,"title":"Chapter 116: Zone 017, Headquarters of the Universal Studio","paragraphs":["If there's one thing this district is most famous for, it's being the home base of Universal Studios.","If I could actually get over there, wouldn't that be a huge win?","However, the lack of a teleportation array is definitely a problem.","That's over a thousand kilometers.","Flying with mechanical wings would take at least 30 hours.","Chu Fu quickly said, \"This task is indeed difficult. I need to recruit companions to go with me.\"","The guard captain said, \"Alright, but to avoid alerting the enemy, the task can only be shared with one friend at most!\"","\"Deal!\"","That's enough!","As long as they brought the mech, 1000 kilometers would only take 3 hours.","If they could take down Wan Huanyu, those 3 hours would be well worth it.","[You have accepted the quest: Travel to Gugu Town and eliminate the cultists.]","[Quest sharing has been enabled. You may invite one player to join you!]","Chu Fu immediately invited Shen Chi.","Shen Chi accepted the quest and rushed over at once.","\"What's this quest about? We can go to Gugu Village? That means...\"","\"Exactly!\" Xie Lin smirked coldly, recalling the face-to-face showdown he'd had with Wan Huanyu in the mediation room earlier.","Back then, Wan Huanyu had been utterly disrespectful—even though Xie Lin couldn't see him, he could hear the arrogance in his voice.","Now, in the game,","They were finally going to meet.","Finally, they had a chance to get revenge.","Xie Lin had been waiting for this day for a long time.","\"Stop yapping, hurry up and come—let's go together!\" Xie Lin said impatiently.","\"I'm on my way!\"","Shen Chi's mech roared as it flew over.","Pulling out a bus, Chu Fu and Xie Lin immediately climbed aboard. The three of them started plotting loudly.","\"We need to change our IDs. They might not expect us to show up, but just in case someone snitches, let's be careful!\"","Xie Lin took off his eyepatch—it was too obvious.","Then the three of them came up with IDs.","\"I'll be Shrimp. You two pick food names!\" Xie Lin said.","That casual?","Chu Fu immediately picked a name.","\"Green Leaf. I'll go with Green Leaf!\"","She changed the ID on her mask.","Shen Chi caught on right away.","\"Then I'll be Dumpling Skin!\"","It was a play on words—his legs weren't great, so it fit perfectly.","Shrimp, Green Leaf, and Dumpling Skin: charging out together!","Time to serve Wan Huanyu one hell of a feast.","They sped forward through the terrifying roar of the mech.","About 30 kilometers past the town, the monsters changed.","No more goblins—instead, the terrain spawned all sorts of powerful beasts, elemental monsters, undead creatures, and even titans and dragons.","Not only that, they even spotted treasure chests deep in the forest.","But the three of them didn't want to waste time. Even a golden chest wasn't enough to make them stop.","However, when it came to dark-gold and diamond-tier chests, Chu Fu's heart wavered. But seeing the level-50 guardian monsters, she ultimately didn't take the risk.","They were here for revenge.","The chests could wait.","\"Watch out for flying enemies!\" Chu Fu warned.","At this point, even a single pterosaur could kill all three of them. This place was no territory for folk like Needle Saint.","\"Don't worry, I'm a pro driver!\" Shen Chi said.","3 hours later.","They arrived at the outskirts of Gugu Town.","\"Hold on—let me ask some players from Wan Huanyu's fan club where he is,\" Xie Lin said.","Chu Fu couldn't help but laugh internally.","During their loud strategizing, she'd learned that Xie Lin had gone to extreme lengths for revenge.","He kept close tabs on Wan Huanyu's every move, knowing that intel would be essential if he ever wanted to take him down.","So Xie Lin had created a fan group for Wan Huanyu.","Xie Lin also had to thank the Original Gate for connecting to his phone, letting him manage the group chat in-game.","Using social media, he'd faked a cute-girl persona, openly declaring her admiration for Wan Huanyu, then recruited players from District 017 to feed him intel.","All it took was a 50-yuan red packet, and plenty of people were happy to tell him Wan Huanyu's location.","He even crafted a persona for himself: a young girl with a crush on Wan Huanyu—a bit starry-eyed, insecure, and head-over-heels.","Some of Wan Huanyu's friends had even guessed at this girl's identity.","They'd never imagine that underneath the cute-girl persona was a man bent on revenge.","Xie Lin played the part far too well.","[Crab Crawl (Group Owner)]: [Red Packet] Good morning, everyone~ Just woke up. Anybody know what Master Wan is up to right now? (fidgeting fingers)","[Universal's Little Sidekick]: Crab Crab girlie, Master Wan's almost level 20. He's probably farming Goblin Wolf Riders.","Goblin Wolf Riders were the level-20 regular goblins with fast respawns and instant-spawn points. Chu Fu and the others had farmed their monsters there too.","[Crab Crawl (Group Owner)]: Then I can't make it (sad face). No time—I have class.","[Monkey's Rescuer]: Crab Crab, just go to school! Don't let those romance novels brainwash you. Wan Huanyu's really not all that. His family's just got money. He's a playboy.","[Number One Wan Loyalist]: The group owner can like whoever she wants. What's it to you? What if Master Wan's into that type? Group owner, kick this guy—he's just getting in the way of you chasing Master Wan.","Naturally, Xie Lin didn't kick anyone.","He was the only admin in the group.","Everyone in it was a player from District 017.","Some were trying to talk the cute girl out of being so gullible,","while others were members of the Universal Guild, watching her chase after Wan Huanyu like it was entertainment.","But because they all played the game, despite their differing stances, they constantly bickered—keeping the group lively.","And none of them would ever suspect that Crab Crawl was fishing for intel.","The most important part? The people selling out the info were Wan Huanyu's own people!","Xie Lin left the group chat.","\"Found him. He's farming at the Goblin Wolf Rider spot.\"","\"Good thing Wan Huanyu's a total waste. Took him this long to nearly hit 20. Otherwise we wouldn't be able to go after him in the city!\"","Xie Lin didn't hide his contempt for Wan Huanyu.","Chu Fu understood why his level was low, but she joined in the mockery anyway.","Wan Huanyu was on server 0198888. Their village-defense battle wasn't an empty-city gambit—they actually defended, but they still lost.","So Wan Huanyu led his people in a retreat. Defense failed.","Eventually, they were merged into server 0178888.","After the merge, only 12 days had passed.","Wan Huanyu was about to hit level 20. Not the fastest pace, but not slow either.","After all, he had plenty on his plate besides leveling—plus he regularly griefed other players.","After the server merge, players could apply to enter this older district.","Countless Universal Studio players flooded in, old players were pushed out by Wan Huanyu, and this place became a hub for the Universal Studio faction.","So the guards' quest to kill evil-faction players likely meant members of the Universal Guild.","All in a day's work.","Soon, the mech hurtled through the sky toward the Goblin Wolf Rider spawn point."]},{"number":117,"title":"Chapter 117: Assassinating Ten Thousand Worlds, Your Resurrection Scroll Has Been Picked Up by Someone","paragraphs":["\"Found them!\"","The three of them stared fiercely at the figure amid the crowd of monsters.","A total of thirty players surrounded Wan Huanyu and began farming monsters.","Among them, Assassins and Archers were responsible for pulling monsters, while Tank-type classes held the monsters' aggro.","Wan Huanyu himself had five people around him, each releasing skills to kill the monsters.","Worth noting: those Assassins, Archers, Tanks, and Priests weren't in Wan Huanyu's party, so they earned no experience.","They were simply there to serve Wan Huanyu.","Wan Huanyu sat in a chair, leisurely waiting for experience to fall into his pocket. He sipped red wine with one hand while... playing on his phone with the other?","Wan Huanyu had no interest in the grind of leveling up. He only cared about PK.","His talent was genuinely powerful—an S-rank Space Origin.","He had class-changed into the hidden class Space Mage.","However, ever since Chu Feng was reborn, this once unshakable powerhouse had been reduced to nothing more than roadside trash.","After being slain by his brother Chu Feng, Wan Huanyu's talent had dropped to A-rank.","And in the original storyline, every time Wan Huanyu was killed by Chu Feng in the later stages, he'd drop a fresh batch of equipment.","Now that luck belonged to Chu Fu!","She just wondered how much money Wan Huanyu was carrying on him right now.","\"Move!\"","Without a second thought, Chu Fu opened her Spirit Plant Satchel.","Go!","Watermelon Bomb Rain!","Chu Fu showered the bus with countless watermelons.","By then, the roaring sound of the mech had already drawn Wan Huanyu and the others' attention.","It was too loud.","Like the noise of a plane flying overhead.","In the game, they'd never heard such a sound.","They almost instinctively looked up—and saw a giant mech descending from the sky.","Their eyes went wide.","\"What is that? A mech? Is there some special event?\"","Some people hadn't processed it yet.","But Wan Huanyu's face changed drastically.","Feng Huimin had used livestream footage to make conference slides—as an enemy, how could Wan Huanyu not recognize Shen Chi's supposedly paralyzed mech?","He had desperately wanted that mech too, investing a lot of money into having newcomers in his guild pick names like \"Mechanic\" to try to trigger the Mechanical Domain talent.","But it never worked.","He never expected that the first time he'd encounter that mech, it would be a sworn enemy coming to his doorstep.","The next moment, huge round spheres came tumbling down from the sky.","Those were... watermelons?!","\"Run!\"","Wan Huanyu shouted, and in a flash of light, sped away.","Spatial Blink!","He could teleport 20 meters in an instant—a lifesaver in any battle.","But Blink had a cooldown. He couldn't use it again for at least two minutes.","The skill activated, letting him escape the lethal blast radius.","\"BOOM BOOM BOOM BOOM BOOM!\"","The watermelons crashed to the ground, crushing the players that had remained at the spot.","\"Fast on your feet!\"","Shen Chi clenched his lips, raised both arms, and aimed the twin golden guns mounted on them at Wan Huanyu.","\"RAT-TAT-TAT-TAT-TAT!\"","A stream of bullets poured out.","But Wan Huanyu gestured with his staff—a silver vortex appeared before him, swallowing the bullets until they vanished.","Then, in the blink of an eye, another vortex opened in the sky above, raining the bullets down onto Shen Chi's mech.","\"Wan Huanyu has an S-rank Space talent. He can blink, and he can also use spatial rifts to reflect projectile attacks back at the attacker.\"","Of course, that only applied to ballistic skills.","Chu Fu waved her hand, engulfing Wan Huanyu in a sickly red haze of spreading plague.","Wan Huanyu popped potions desperately.","\"Huanyu Guild, come to me!\"","Even while chugging potions, he pulled out a signal flare.","\"FWOOSH!\"","The firework shot into the sky.","This was a Level 2 guild ability that summoned guild members to your location—up to 500 people.","And Wan Huanyu frequently PK'd, preferring to dogpile enemies with numbers. He fired off the flare, and his crew swarmed in.","\"Priests, heal now!\"","Wan Huanyu was screaming.","\"Invite me back to party, give me 10 healers. I don't believe they can kill me!\"","\"Don't worry, Young Master Wan. With me here, they can't touch you.\"","A tall, slender girl spoke up. Her ID read: Twelve-Winged Holy Healing Angel.","The Huanyu Corporation's true star player, known across the entire server as the number one healing goddess.","In the original story, she truly was a top-tier healer.","The Holy Healing Angel raised her staff—an instant shield bloomed in a 20-meter diameter around her.","The spreading plague was repelled, and the area became purified ground.","Plague Spreading had no effect.","\"What are you bragging about? Break!\"","Xie Lin descended from above.","Holy Judgment.","Light against light.","The two forces smashed into each other.","More and more players were flooding in by now.","\"Get down here!\"","One player yelled out.","\"Wind mages—Anti-Flight!\"","In an instant, Chu Fu and Shen Chi plummeted vertically.","Thankfully, they weren't high off the ground to begin with. Chu Fu even rolled once as she came off the bus.","\"Taunt!\"","Shield Warriors started taunting Chu Fu.","They wanted her occupied, attacking their tanky selves instead of Wan Huanyu. Then others would burn her down, and she'd be finished.","But they seriously underestimated her.","The gap in mental power between Chu Fu and them was far too vast.","With such a gap, Taunt was useless. It only grabbed a player's attention for under a second before breaking instantly.","\"Annoying. Think you're the only one who can taunt?\"","Chu Fu pulled more plants out of her Spirit Plant Satchel.","She didn't even need to speed-grow them mid-combat anymore.","She had plenty in stock.","In an instant, 55 Gloom Mushrooms got summoned by Chu Fu.","Their caps emitted flickering lights that immediately seized everyone's attention.","Then—spore burst.","A purple mist rolled outward, poisoning everyone on the field again.","This time it was spore parasitism, not viral infection—Dispel wasn't going to cut it.","The tanks who had intended to hold Chu Fu's attention were instead drawn toward the Gloom Mushrooms and started nibbling the caps.","After being infected by the spores, several players dropped dead on the spot.","\"BOOM!\"","Shen Chi's mech blasted everywhere.","Chu Fu seized the moment, letting Plague Spreading infect the corpses on the ground, then detonating the toxins.","\"Virulent Eruption!\"","BANG!","A puddle of verdant poison spread beneath everyone's feet.","The Holy Healing Angel's protective shield shattered under the Holy Judgment bombardment.","Then the Gloom Mushrooms's lure took hold—even she failed to heal in time, stumbling towards the mushrooms instead.","After that, Chu Fu's poison pool, Shen Chi's cannon fire, and Xie Lin's Royal Sword Qi swept through Wan Huanyu's forces.","Players shrieked as they tumbled over as green-glowing corpses.","Wan Huanyu didn't escape either.","\"YOU HAVE SLAIN: WAN HUANYU.\"","Wan Huanyu's vision went black and white. Lying on the ground, he trembled in fury.","[System Notice: You have a Resurrection Scroll in your inventory. Choose whether to resurrect within 3 seconds. 3, 2...]","[System Notice: Your Resurrection Scroll has been picked up by another player.]"]},{"number":118,"title":"Chapter 118: Is This Avengers Team Tough Enough Tear It Down and Use It as a Soccer Ball.","paragraphs":["\"Damn, who, who took my revival scroll?\"","Even though Wan Huanyu was lying on the ground,","he knew full well that the three people who had attacked him weren't nearby.","There was no way they could have looted his body.","It had to be some itchy-fingered member of his guild who saw his golden gear and couldn't resist swiping it.","That thing was worth two hundred million!","Wan Huanyu felt like killing someone.","But he also knew he couldn't curse out his own people, or no one would charge forward for him. Worse, nobody might save him, letting him die again and forcing him to start from scratch.","With that in mind, he quickly typed in the guild chat and sent a message.","\"Quick, send a priest to revive me! Holy Healing Angel, what are you doing?\"","\"I'm dead too! Master Wan, don't panic! I can resurrect, but someone needs to keep those three busy!\"","Holy Healing Angel was an SS-tier talent, a Holy Light Priest.","The four abilities attached to her talent made her incredibly powerful.","【SS-tier talent Revival Angel:","Passive 1: Resurrection","Passive 2: Light Reconstruction: Can revive self.","Passive 3: Light and healing spells amplified by 200%.","Passive 4: Holy Light Domain: Summons a massive shield to block enemy attacks.】","Not only did she carry resurrection as a natural skill, she could also revive herself.","After reviving, she had 10 minutes of invincibility.","But she could be invincible, while Wan Huanyu couldn't, and the three people in front of them were clearly targeting Wan Huanyu.","Green Leaf, Dumpling Skin, Shrimp Meat.","These weren't three delicious ingredients, they were three shrimp-hearted criminals!","On top of that, their identities weren't that hard to figure out.","But she couldn't understand how they had managed to cross servers.","Five hundred people had been wiped out by Chu Fu and her group in the blink of an eye.","Xie Lin walked over to Wan Huanyu's corpse and stomped one foot right on his face.","\"Wan Huanyu! Look at you sprawled on the ground! Remember how arrogant you were back in the mediation room? You said, 'Let your tactics be a lesson to that cripple,' what tactics exactly? How would I know?\"","\"Ah? You didn't go after my parents, did you? Ha, that's perfect! Those two heartless, beastly bastards, you should have really given them what they deserve!\"","\"How do you like our little Avengers squad now!\"","Xie Lin was as arrogant as arrogant could be.","Satisfying!","Comforting!","His mind felt clear and sharp!","Beside him, a grinding sound rose as Shen Chi piloting his mech stomped over.","\"Boom!\"","Shen Chi planted a foot right on Wan Huanyu's corpse.","Xie Lin had the head.","He had the lower half.","Problem was, the mech was so big that one step from him nearly shoved Xie Lin aside.","Shen Chi's voice was ice cold, but at this moment his eyes were red, full of piercing hatred mixed with a hint of manic madness.","\"Wan Huanyu!","Three years ago, you used your tricks to destroy my family.","Three years from now, I'm going to make your business, your studio, your fortune, all of it crumble to dust.","Let you taste the same despair I felt back then!\"","Shen Chi almost roared.","Wan Huanyu had served three years in prison, so it wasn’t like he had gotten off scot-free, he had paid a price.","But what about the oppression of Shen Chi's family?","There was no evidence, and some of it wasn't even illegal.","No one stepped up for the Shen family. Friends and acquaintances advised them to swallow their pride, to back down.","Friends drifted away, afraid that association with the Shens would bring trouble.","Lost jobs, social death, getting swindled out of money.","Shen Chi himself had become a cripple.","In the end, he was the one who suffered, he had to endure, and he had to live in fear of retaliation.","What kind of justice was that?","And now, he had finally taken his revenge with his own hands.","But it still wasn't enough.","That round had only taken about a billion yuan off Wan Huanyu.","He looked at his golden vacuum excavator.","Wan Huanyu's revival scroll, his full set of golden gear, and the equipment of all five hundred guild members.","Not to mention the four hundred gold coins in Wan Huanyu's backpack.","Consider that the small interest Wan Huanyu paid.","Xie Lin piled on the mockery.","\"Man, Wan Huanyu, how do you like our Avengers squad now?","You're begging for mercy like a little kid.","I told you I was going to grind you down to an F-tier talent, you didn't think I was bluffing, did you?","I'll camp your corpse right here. Let's see if you dare resurrect.","Your corpse's already half gone! I'll wait twenty-four hours for you to respawn and trudge all the way back.\"","Xie Lin didn't get enough from cursing himself, so he jabbed a finger toward Chu Fu, who was watching with amusement.","\"Green Leaf... uh, fine, Green Leaf, you curse at him too!\"","Of the three people there, Chu Fu was actually the one who had suffered the most harm.","Although Chu Fu had recovered from her vegetative state,","she had lost her parents.","Chu Fu blinked at Xie Lin's words, then snapped back to reality.","Right, she should curse at him too.","She couldn't stand by just because she was a transmigrator and this wasn't actually her fight.","The original owner of this body had lost her parents. She'd tried to get the hit-and-run perpetrator sentenced to death, but Wan Huanyu's interference forced her brother, then just 21, to drop out of school and support the family.","At that thought, whether it was the original owner's emotions washing over her or her own, she only felt a sting in her nose and a heavy ache in her chest.","Wan Huanyu truly deserved to die!","Chu Fu summoned a chainsaw dandelion.","\"We, talk? Useless! I heard corpses can still see, so how about we chop off his head and play soccer with it!\"","The chainsaw dandelion buzzed forward.","Wan Huanyu's vision spun end over end.","He was furious.","Damage wasn't high, but the humiliation was off the charts.","The suffocating frustration made Wan Huanyu explode with anger, cursing loudly.","But every word he typed sputtered out as blocked asterisks.","He frantically issued orders in the guild chat.","【Wan Huanyu】【Guild Master】: Are you all braindead? Every single one of you, come NOW, even if we have to stack up bodies to crush these three bastards.","【Wan Huanyu】【Guild Master】: Anyone who doesn't show up is out. Get the hell out of the Huanyu Guild, and you won't earn a single coin from me anymore!","【Wan Huanyu】【Guild Master】: Call every player on the server! Anyone who refuses to come, I'll hunt them down for eternity! All of you get here and kill these three!","【Server 0178888】【Wan Huanyu】: BOUNTY on 【Green Leaf】【Dumpling Skin】【Shrimp Meat】. Location: Goblin Wolf Riders' Camp, Coordinates:... SERVER-WIDE KILL ORDER. Anyone who kills them gets 100 gold or a 10 million yuan cash reward. Anyone who doesn't show up, if I find out, I'll hunt you until you quit the server, now MOVE!","【Server 0178888】【Wan Huanyu】: You three think you're so tough? I refuse to believe an entire server of players can't take you three down.","Chu Fu heard this and laughed.","As long as players had no ability to fly, Chu Fu and her group could leave whenever they wanted, stay whenever they wanted.","She wasn't scared of Wan Huanyu.","But Chu Fu was in for a rude awakening.","The Huanyu Guild had dominated this server for so long for a reason, they did have some hidden depth.","A flood of players poured in.","Soon, one player jumped out and shouted, \"Green Leaf, I challenge you to a duel!\"","Chu Fu froze, then suddenly remembered.","This was the Fighter class's level 20 skill.","【Duel】: Selects a target and forces them into a pocket dimension arena. The duel lasts for 30 seconds, or ends when either side's health drops below 10%, upon which both are ejected from the arena.","This is a rather useful skill for breaking up a group.","Three fighters each designated Chu Fu, Shen Chi, and Xie Lin for duels.","Taking advantage of this opportunity,","the Holy Healing Angel was immediately revived and simultaneously cast Resurrection.","The Holy Healing Angel's Resurrection was a group resurrection.","Instantly, all players who had died within a 20-meter radius of her were brought back to life.","\"Quick, Master Wan, use a town portal scroll to get back to the city!!!\""]},{"number":119,"title":"Chapter 119: Using Three as Bosses, Focusing Fire on the Vegetative Man","paragraphs":["\"Who has a return scroll? Give it to me now! Don't let me find out who looted my corpse.\"","Wan Huanyu roared.","But looking around, everyone was so poor they wore rough hemp clothes.","The Holy Healing Angel let out a shrieking scream.","\"Where's my full set of golden gear?\"","She'd been too busy using her talent to revive herself to notice what she was wearing.","Only now did she realize her golden equipment was gone—completely vanished.","She completely lost it.","They'd only merged servers 11 days ago, and it wasn't until day 6 that they cleared the hell-level dungeon. Only five teams in the entire guild could clear it, and it had only slowly grown from there.","Whether it was mage gear or priest gear, it all belonged to the Holy Healing Angel—who else but the one with the strongest talent?","A single golden item cost 6 to 9 gold coins. A full set was at least 100 gold—that was 100 million!","This gear was also part of her annual salary. As long as she had replacements, she could sell the old pieces and pocket the coin.","Her little nest egg had been stolen right out from under her. How could she not scream?","Wan Huanyu realized the gravity of it too. No more waiting.","He bolted.","\"Hold them off!\"","He ran toward the guild members who'd just arrived—those who still had gear.","A guild member immediately handed him a return scroll.","He tore it open on the spot.","Return countdown: 10... 9... 8...","\"Hold them. Just hold them for 7 more seconds.\"","But he clearly overestimated his teammates.","Chu Fu stepped into the duel arena and swung her staff at the brawler across from her.","A sickly green skill struck the top of the opponent's head.","Poison Bolt!","Single-target attack.","-1726!","A massive damage number appeared above the brawler's head.","\"Holy crap!\"","The brawler nearly had a heart attack seeing that damage and frantically chugged the most potent potion available.","Chu Fu didn't give him time.","[Virulent Burst!]","Poison Bolt lasts 15 seconds, dealing damage every 3 seconds. All 5 remaining ticks were stacked together and triggered at once.","-8630!","The brawler died stone-cold dead.","Chu Fu exited the duel space and saw Wan Huanyu shrouded in a white glow—the unmistakable light of a return scroll.","Not only that, the Holy Healing Angel had raised a Holy Light Domain.","There were dandelions at Chu Fu's feet. She immediately urged them forward.","\"Buzzzzzzz!\"","The dandelions spun and shredded the Holy Light Domain's barrier.","The shield's defense and shield value were tied directly to the Holy Healing Angel's own stats. Without her golden gear, her attributes had plummeted, and this barrier was no match for what it used to be!","Not only that—Shen Chi also emerged.","[Mechanical Overload]","The mech let out a roaring boom as a fist a full meter wide slammed into the Holy Light Domain.","With both attacks stacked, the barrier's defense shattered in an instant.","Then the millstone-sized fist swung toward Wan Huanyu.","Wan Huanyu had no choice but to abandon the teleport, or he'd be flattened into paste.","[Blink]","Wan Huanyu escaped the spot.","\"BOOM!\"","The Holy Healing Angel and the surrounding players in rough hemp clothes—those too slow to flee—all died on the spot.","Chu Fu cast Plague Spread, engulfing Wan Huanyu, and the poison took him down instantly.","Second kill!","Wan Huanyu cursed again in the guild chat.","[Wan Huanyu][Guild Leader]: \"Useless! Can't even buy 10 seconds????\"","[Holy Healing Angel]: Guild leader, what do we do? I'm dead too, and my self-resurrection has a 24-hour cooldown.","So she couldn't immediately get up and revive Wan Huanyu.","Just then, a flood of messages burst through the guild chat.","\"Manager Huimin is online!!\"","\"Manager, what do we do? You give the orders, we'll follow!\"","The group acted as if they'd found their anchor.","Wan Huanyu's vision was spinning again, and he immediately started cursing.","[Wan Huanyu][Guild Leader]: \"Feng Huimin, you'd better hurry the hell up!\"","At that moment, the female player with the ID \"Professional Manager Feng Huimin\" rolled her eyes.","'Five million annual salary, fifty million in dividends! Five million annual salary, fifty million in dividends!'","Feng Huimin pinched the bridge of her nose, then rapidly analyzed the current situation.","Feng Huimin said quickly: \"All MT classes, report to me right now, I'm assigning groups. All assassins, come to me to collect resurrection scrolls.","Assassination squad, get ready!","Mage bombardment squad, get ready.","Prepare dispel potions and antidote potions. Coordinates XXXX, XXXX, regroup! Start setting up traps!\"","All the players moved like pieces of a precision machine, roaring into action.","However, the looks on their faces were extremely strange.","Feng Huimin's talent was very poor—only C-rank. Later on, Feng Huimin herself analyzed that she'd gotten a bad talent because she had zero interest in the game.","However, Feng Huimin's class was very interesting.","[Commander]","Her orders could actually influence players—after she issued a command, obedience increased by 30%.","So, even though Feng Huimin couldn't get any good equipment and her level wasn't high, she was still the Number One Commander of the entire Huanyu Workshop—the so-called Raid Leader.","Now, the command Feng Huimin issued was the order to form a raid party.","Every day, at least five hundred people followed Feng Huimin to hunt down map bosses.","Now, those boss-hunting tactics were being used against three players.","From a kilometer away, Feng Huimin directed the crowd.","\"Three MTs go in first—taunt the three of them. Lu An, you focus on the plant girl; her mental strength is too high, no one else can hold aggro on her.\"","Lu An was the S-rank tank class of the Huanyu Guild, and his taunt skill was enhanced to level 3.","The three of them charged in like lone heroes, entering Chu Fu's plague mist.","They withstood the toxins and cast taunts at Chu Fu.","Chu Fu stared at the big brute in front of her, feeling nothing but contempt.","\"Taunting me again?\"","Chu Fu immediately used a Bewitching Mushroom to taunt them right back.","A kilometer away.","Feng Huimin also saw this happen.","She immediately realized it was a new plant of Chu Fu's.","\"All ranged shooters, attack the purple mushroom.\"","Even without Feng Huimin's command, the players within 200 meters were already casting spells at the Bewitching Mushroom.","The Bewitching Mushroom was destroyed, and the ranged archers immediately fell back.","They even broke out in a cold sweat.","It felt like they'd been taunted by an MT.","But that distraction had already given some assassins the chance to sneak up beside Wan Huanyu.","\"Do you think I'm blind?\"","Xie Lin swept his King's Sword in an arc, instantly killing the lurking assassins.","But the next moment, the MT who had just recovered from the Bewitching Mushroom's effect immediately taunted him.","\"I'll kill you and your turtle shell first!\"","Xie Lin was instantly filled with hatred for the MT, raised his sword, and struck.","Another thief crept closer and finally used a resurrection scroll to bring Wan Huanyu back to life.","100 gold coins spent.","Wan Huanyu was revived.","His head would no longer be kicked around like a football.","“Young Master Wan, don’t stop—put on your gear and run, use teleport to get away, as far as you can!”","That assassin tossed a pair of speed-boosting boots to Wan Huanyu.","Wan Huanyu put them on and bolted.","On the other side, Xie Lin and Shen Chi finished off the A-rank MT in front of them and gave chase.","Feng Huimin barked out the order: “Focus fire on the plant man—er, I mean, focus fire on that leafy green!”"]},{"number":120,"title":"Chapter 120: Corpse-Driving Stream: Dragging the Dead into the Dungeon","paragraphs":["The assassins had already crept into position.","Chu Fu's hatred was fixated on Lu An, and for the moment, she couldn't break free from him.","But the growing hatred inside her would not cause her to panic.","These people were focusing fire on her like she was a raid boss. She absolutely couldn't let any assassin-type class get close to her.","The moment this thought crossed her mind, Chu Fu immediately switched out her plants.","15 Charm Shrooms continued their charm effects, 20 Clinging Vines were arranged around her, and 20 Dandelions were placed on the outer perimeter, spinning and attacking.","55 plants summoned three wood-element sprites to help her fight.","Not only that, Chu Fu hid herself within the thick grass and immediately activated the fourth trait of her Plant Human form.","All damage dealt to her would be absorbed by her plants instead.","On top of that, Chu Fu was also restoring her health and mana.","Just like that, she had truly become as hard to beat as a boss!","Lu An raised his shield, trying to taunt Chu Fu, only to find himself restrained by the Clinging Vines. He could only keep chugging control-removal potions or use his own skills to endure.","He wanted to stay glued to Chu Fu and fight her up close. As a tank class, melee pressure could suppress an opponent.","If he could slam his shield into Chu Fu's face, it would cause her at least some pain.","And if she felt pain, her gameplay would suffer.","Everything sounded good in theory, but in practice he found it incredibly difficult to pull off.","The Clinging Vines were locking him down, and the Charm Shrooms were tempting him.","Even worse, Chu Fu was kiting him, and the terrifying part was, as she moved, her cloak was spreading poison. The longer Lu An chased, the deeper the poison sank in.","And Chu Fu was stacking the poison slowly.","\"Taunting me, are we? Fine, then I'll focus you. Let's see how long you can hold out!\"","Chu Fu snarled.","【Lethal Venom】, 【Slow Curse】, 【Plague Spread】, 【Poison Dust】.","Lu An felt even worse!","He was a top-tier S-rank tank class, but in this moment, he realized that not dying was itself a form of torture.","The poison was racking his internal organs with pain, the slow curse made him move like a tortoise, the plague made his whole body burn with fever and his lymph nodes swell and ache.","The poisonous scales from the Poison Dust made his eyes sting unbearably.","He looked at all the debuffs stacked on him.","【Poisoned】, 【Inflamed】, 【Slowed】, 【Blinded】, 【Burning】...","\"Damn you, you shameless snake, all you do is poison! If you've got guts, fight me without it!\"","Lu An cursed, layering in a taunt as he spoke.","Chu Fu knew in her heart that Lu An was deliberately trying to provoke her, combining it with a taunt skill—a high-level trick.","That meant she couldn't go after Wan Huanyu.","But she still knew exactly how to deal damage.","Once all the poisons were stacked on him,","Chu Fu activated 【Venom Vein Awakening】.","Her attack power skyrocketed.","Then, she detonated every toxin at once!","【Virulent Burst】","\"BOOM!\"","All the accumulated poison exploded into a single massive blast of damage, forming a huge venom pool beneath her.","A number appeared above Lu An's head that made even him tremble in fear.","-120,000!","He owed Chu Fu six more lives than he had.","Lu An collapsed.","Feng Huimin, watching everything through a telescope from a kilometer away, observed it all with ice-cold composure.","\"Off-tank, engage!\"","A second tank taunted Chu Fu.","Chu Fu turned her attack on him.","This tank wasn't as tough, and Chu Fu dispatched him quickly. Then she accelerated the growth of her Dandelions, activating the Hot Air Balloon Dandelions.","Twenty of those Dandelions intertwined and formed a true hot air balloon basket.","The reason for this setup was that her flying wings could easily be shot down, but the Hot Air Balloon Dandelions were plants. With twenty of them surrounding her, she activated her talent, guaranteeing she couldn't be killed.","Then, she leaped into the Dandelion basket and shot straight up.","Above fifty meters, she was safe—most tank classes couldn't attack at that range!","By now, Wan Huanyu had fled two hundred meters away.","Chu Fu chased him at full speed in her hot air balloon.","Wan Huanyu had planned to run a bit farther and use a Recall Scroll.","But Shen Chi, who had managed to break free, had such long attack range that even a single opening was enough for him to fire off a shot and interrupt Wan Huanyu's recall.","All Wan Huanyu could do was run.","Then, from above, Chu Fu hurled down a giant watermelon.","【Blink】","Wan Huanyu dodged.","Chu Fu threw another one.","Wan Huanyu transferred the damage, used his skills, and pulled out every trick he had.","\"BOOM!\"","In the end, he couldn't escape—he was blown to pieces. Of course, his head survived.","That was a rule of the 【Primordial Gate】: heads are forcibly preserved to make resurrection easier for priests.","So Wan Huanyu's head remained intact, even Shen Chi and his mech couldn't stomp it out.","This also proved just how powerful the Holy Healing Angel was. She could resurrect him from just a head. But the Suture Saint's stitching art still needed a skeleton or half a body to use.","The moment Wan Huanyu died, an assassin sprinted in like a goalkeeper, leaped up, and caught Wan Huanyu's head.","Run!","The goalkeeper instantly turned into a running back, and this assassin sprinted off with Wan Huanyu's head.","Not only that, he activated Invisibility.","\"Sword Saint Brother! Come on, stop fighting! Find them!\"","Chu Fu shouted.","Xie Lin's abilities were perfect for combat—the tanks couldn't lock him down. If they tried to counter him, he'd chain a combo that would kill them outright.","After killing one, he used Sword Shadow Phantom to shake off the new shields chasing him, then carved his way into the priest and mage ranks. With one 【Holy Judgment】, he obliterated an entire swath of them.","Truly, the best defense is a good offense.","Xie Lin's micro-control was unrivaled—he never got touched.","On top of that, his Heart's Eye skill could pierce invisibility.","Chu Fu could only send out Charm Shrooms to make that assassin turn back and attack the mushrooms, but before doing so, he'd throw Wan Huanyu's head away.","A second assassin caught it.","Chu Fu had to admit—she was almost impressed by their coordination and planning.","Thanks to this desperate relay, Wan Huanyu managed to drag himself all the way from the Goblin Wolf Rider camp to the Goblin Nest dungeon entrance.","Feng Huimin once again deployed her main force to tie up Chu Fu and her team.","\"Holy Light Domain.\"","The Holy Healing Angel, who had been revived by Feng Huimin after Chu Fu had left, cast her domain once more, blocking incoming attacks while simultaneously resurrecting Wan Huanyu.","As soon as he was revived, their figures flickered and vanished on the spot.","Wan Huanyu had entered the dungeon!","In theory, as long as he didn't want to leave, he could stay inside until the end of time.","The moment Wan Huanyu disappeared, the other players began to retreat as well, but the ground was littered with corpses.","From the Goblin Wolf Rider camp to the dungeon entrance, Chu Fu had slaughtered six thousand players.","Xie Lin had killed three thousand, and Shen Chi had taken down one thousand.","Chu Fu stared at the dungeon in front of her and let out a surprised \"eh?\"","\"The dungeon's cooldown is actually ready. Well, since we're already here, let's run it once!\"","It was a gold-tier equipment drop, after all!","Chu Fu also clicked on the dungeon and entered the Goblin Nest on Hell mode.","Ten minutes after they entered, the dungeon's light flashed, and the Holy Healing Angel came out.","She looked utterly pitiful and tearfully complained to Feng Huimin: \"Manager Feng, all my gear got dropped.\""]},{"number":121,"title":"Chapter 121: Raising the Myriad Universe as Pigs, Chu Fu Undermines the Rival","paragraphs":["Having been killed so many times, Feng Huimin could tell that Shen Chi possessed a special item that absorbed all their equipment.","The losses this time were so terrifying that Feng Huimin felt a pang in her heart, because she was entitled to a cut of that equipment's value!","\"Stop crying, it's fine. Go grab some gear from the guild and put it on. We'll resurrect the players in a bit—everyone's accounts still depend on you!\"","Feng Huimin tried to console her.","The Holy Healing Angel could only sob as she went off to resurrect the players.","In truth, Feng Huimin wanted to cry too.","She didn't even dare calculate how much they had lost this round.","Not only that, with ten thousand players stripped of their equipment, she had to open the guild warehouse to replace gear for the players, or they wouldn't even be able to kill monsters.","The worst part was that their elite forces had suffered heavy losses, which meant they could no longer run the Hell difficulty dungeon.","This effectively meant that, after the server merge, their eleven days of progress had been wiped clean.","Moreover, this battle would trigger a chain reaction.","For example, the town defense battle nineteen days from now would fail!","At that point, their investment would become a mockery.","After being overwhelmed with problems, Feng Huimin was also being yelled at.","Wan Huanyu was throwing a tantrum.","\"Didn't you say you studied their weaknesses? Made all those PPTs? So you're only good at making PPTs, huh?","When it comes to actual combat, you're useless—nothing worked, you didn't even scratch their surface!\"","Feng Huimin hadn't expected things to turn out this way either, so this time she admitted her mistake directly.","\"It's my fault. Because they were several major servers away, I overlooked their threat, and my intelligence gathering was insufficient.\"","Feng Huimin summarized: Plantman had grown stronger, and now had a new Charm Mushroom?","Not only that, but what surprised her most was Xie Lin.","Not only could he pinpoint the positions of hidden assassins with precision,","His control was terrifying as well.","He managed to predict and dodge every projectile-type skill.","In comparison, Shen Chi's mech was just a clumsy hunk of iron.","It was merely harder to crack.","If Xie Lin hadn't been able to break out of the encirclement and kill the healers, then let Chu Fu clean up the battlefield, and Xie Lin had grabbed two players while chasing others—","the death toll wouldn't have been this high.","But when she looked closely, the three seemed to complement one another perfectly, with almost no weaknesses.","Still, even if there were no weaknesses, they needed to find one.","Why were they so strong?","Feng Huimin already understood.","\"Wan, we've seen it all in this battle.","Our guild needs players with strong stats and high talent levels.","Regular players are just cannon fodder when pitted against powerful players like that.\"","\"So you're calling me cannon fodder!\"","Feng Huimin gritted her teeth.","\"No, Wan.\"","She couldn't say more.","Wan Huanyu was in a temper right now; a good employee wouldn't provoke the boss while he was angry.","But Feng Huimin had already drawn her conclusions.","Lu An could actually hold his own against Chu Fu, as long as he had a priest assigned to him.","It was just that during the first battle, Holy Healing Angel had died, which left Lu An unable to withstand Green Leaf's attacks.","If they'd had one more assassin in the squad to pin down Killer Shrimp,","this battle wouldn't have gone so badly.","In plain terms, it was because Wan Huanyu couldn't tolerate other standout players, so back at the starting village, he'd only recruited Holy Healing Angel and Lu An.","Furthermore, after that player Lin Haowan exposed the capital-backed studios,","more talented players chose to stay away from the Wan Studio rather than join it.","Not only that—017 had become the stronghold of the Wan Studio, but because their reputation had soured, players wouldn't even choose that server.","Fewer and fewer people meant no economy.","This downward spiral would only get worse.","So Feng Huimin proposed pushing upward, having all players reach level 20 quickly and head to the city.","But going to the city didn't mean giving up the town.","Now, it was nearly impossible to hold it. Without fresh blood, they couldn't defend the town nineteen days from now.","\"Wan, we need to get all players back to town immediately. No matter how strong Plantman and his crew are, they can't go on a rampage inside the city—the guard NPCs are much stronger.\"","\"Also, at their strength, they'll clear the dungeon soon.\"","\"If they camp outside the dungeon entrance, that'll be a problem!\"","\"You head back to town first!\"","Wan Huanyu knew this logic all too well. He immediately exited the dungeon, nervously tore up his return scroll, waited ten seconds, and found himself back in town.","He finally let out a long sigh of relief.","Being back in town at least meant he could do some quests—much better than being stuck in the dungeon. That was too passive.","Besides, far away from the dungeon, he could finally feel safe.","After all, those three were still inside!","...","Inside the Goblin Nest on Hell mode.","Shen Chi reported their haul.","\"Two resurrection scrolls, thirty-two pieces of gold equipment, 7,625 pieces of silver equipment, 45,279 pieces of bronze equipment, 52,708 pieces of iron gear, and over 3,000 pieces of plain white gear—most of it in special slots like necklaces and rings.\"","Chu Fu furiously pressed the buttons on her calculator.","Resurrection scrolls: 200 gold each.","Gold equipment: using a mid-range value of 6 gold each, that's 192 gold.","Silver equipment was top-tier gear in the starting village, so it priced higher there, but here in town, it was only worth a few dozen silver coins.","At 50 silver each, that came to 381 gold.","Iron and plain gear were just scrap, totaling about 5 gold—she planned to hand those over to Shen Chi as materials for his machinery.","The jewelry pieces would be set aside and given out as perks to guild members who lacked accessories.","Total profit: a solid 773 gold.","But that wasn't the end of it.","\"Let's go, clear the dungeon. After that, we're stopping by their guild headquarters—at the very least, we're taking out their warehouse!\"","That idea didn't come from Chu Fu.","It was something her brother Chu Feng did often in the script.","He treated Wan Huanyu like a pig being fattened up!","Whenever they were short on money, they'd go butcher Wan Huanyu for profit.","\"Then let me check if Wan Huanyu's at the guild headquarters. We can take another cut from him!\"","Xie Lin pulled up his phone screen within the game and opened the group chat.","Sure enough, a bunch of people in the group were already discussing what happened.","[Crab Crawl (group owner)]: Oh my god, what happened? My Wan got killed? Who's the jerk who did this? Boohoo, I feel so bad for my young lord.","[Wan's Little Sidekick]: Aw, Crab, good thing you didn't come—you'd have been killed too. You have no idea how brutal it was.","[Crab Crawl (group owner)]: You guys are making it impossible for me to sit through class. Where is Wan now? I'm going to go comfort him!","[The Rescue Monkey]: He's in town, still scolding Manager Feng. Honestly, what did Feng even do wrong? If it weren't for her, he'd still be getting kicked around like a ball!","Xie Lin chatted a bit more and found out that Wan Huanyu didn't seem to be heading back to the guild headquarters, so he gave up on that idea.","[Crab Crawl (group owner)]: The teacher just called my name, boohoo, gotta stop chatting, crying now!","\"This Wan Huanyu is a real schemer—hiding inside town and not coming out. But that professional manager of his is pretty sharp; that's how she saved him.\"","It's said that manager has a special piece of equipment—a telescope—that lets him see the battlefield from a kilometer away!","Next time, we should take out that manager first.\"","Chu Fu nodded thoughtfully.","Then her eyes lit up.","\"This guy's a real talent! What a waste for him to be working under Wan Huanyu!\""]},{"number":122,"title":"Chapter 122: Warehouse, Medicine Workshop, Workshop, and Canteen—All Destroyed","paragraphs":["Inside Guguan Town.","Feng Huimin was getting scolded, enduring the young master's explosive temper.","But suddenly, her face flickered through a riot of colors before she quickly lowered her head, making sure Wan Huanyu didn't notice anything unusual.","In front of her, a system notification appeared!","【Player \"Who Wants to Be a Vegetable\" has added you as a friend. Accept / Decline.】","Why add her?","Could it be...","Feng Huimin's eyes darkened, and she silently accepted in her heart.","And so, among her five thousand-plus friends, one more person appeared who didn't belong to Huanyu Studio.","Chu Fu immediately greeted Feng Huimin warmly.","\"Manager Feng, hello! I really admire your intelligence and commanding skills. Would you like to join our Thorn Guild?\"","There it was!","Feng Huimin understood immediately.","After all, wasn't it said that the highest level of job-hopping was snatching other companies' projects?","Snatch the project, and your value naturally gets seen.","Although this time, Feng Huimin's actions did cost Huanyu Studio a huge sum of money, they also threw Chu Fu's plan off track.","Otherwise, they were planning to kill Wan Huanyu all the way down to level zero.","Feng Huimin used the \"corpse-dragging\" tactic to rescue him, which really opened everyone's eyes.","The game had only just started, and to come up with such an idea—there was no doubt her understanding of the game was anything but weak.","Chu Fu had high hopes for this commander.","Feng Huimin replied without missing a beat.","\"Thank you for your appreciation, but I also hold a key position at Huanyu Studio, with an annual salary of ten million. (Hinting that she's expensive.)","I honestly can't convince myself to jump ship to a guild that's just been formed. (Your organization is still young, and if I go there, I'd want to be the boss.)","Besides, adding me right now makes me reasonably suspicious that you're trying to sow discord. (Keeping a card for herself, in case the other side truly is trying to sow discord, at least she can explain herself to Huanyu Studio with a paper trail.)\"","Inside the dungeon.","Chu Fu read the exchange and couldn't help but smile with pursed lips.","There's a chance!","She immediately typed out a message.","\"What? A manager as capable as you, Feng, only making ten million a year? That's just one gold coin a month, right?\"","\"But in our team, core members earn more than one gold coin a day.\"","\"Of course, you might say in-game currency isn't worth much—what really matters is the real-world money it moves.\"","\"Then all I can say is, your rank at Huanyu just isn't high enough.\"","\"Do you know how I escaped when Wan Huanyu and Guan Youlong came after me?\"","\"If you don't know, I suggest you look into it.\"","\"If you know everything and still choose to stay at Huanyu Studio, then I have nothing more to say.\"","\"You have talent at Huanyu Studio, but neither your gear nor your talents have improved. But I can guarantee that at Thorn Guild, at the very least, you'll get a seat at the table.\"","\"Once we hit level 20 and enter the city, it won't be first-kill races anymore—it'll be speed-run dungeons. The faster your team clears, the more attribute points you get.\"","\"With Huanyu Studio's current state—relying only on numbers, with poor quality, weak strength, and slow dungeon progress—after level 20, they're bound to hit a dead end!\"","\"Besides, there's one thing you need to remember.\"","\"The enemy of Huanyu—is me!\"","Chu Fu looked at what she'd just typed and laughed to herself with a sinister cackle.","\"Hehe, I feel like I'm the villain, sweet-talking a confused young lady!\"","Shen Chi watched Chu Fu's theatrical antics and gave a knowing smile.","\"If she really does come to Thorn, she'd be a huge boost to the guild.\"","Thorn Guild was, after all, a makeshift operation.","They had money, they had strength, but they didn't have standardized management.","Whenever something came up, whoever had time would pitch in.","It was honestly wasting a lot of their fighting potential.","If there were a professional manager to organize all of that, things would be much more efficient.","After Chu Fu left her message, Feng Huimin was probably still mulling it over, as she didn't reply.","And Chu Fu didn't push.","Because soon enough, Feng Huimin would know exactly what she needed to do.","...","An hour later.","The Holy Healing Angel resurrected all the players.","The players of Huanyu Studio filed back into the guild headquarters one by one to collect their basic supplies.","Besides equipment, there was also food and medicine.","With ten thousand people dead, the losses were a headache for Feng Huimin to sort out.","Right then, she really felt like washing her hands of this entire mess.","Of course, while the cat's away, the mice will play—she pushed aside her reply to Vegetable for now and got busy.","She had no choice.","Too many people were coming to her.","And just as she was in the middle of distributing equipment,","suddenly, she felt a shadow fall over her head.","It wasn't the kind of shadow cast by clouds. She even saw, on the ground, the shadow of a steel humanoid mech.","In an instant, a bad feeling rose in her heart.","Mech—Dumpling Skin—launching rockets from a wheelchair.","She snapped her head up.","And saw watermelons falling from the sky by the dozens.","\"DODGE!!!\"","Feng Huimin screamed.","But it was too late.","Watermelon bombs came crashing down on the guild warehouse.","Not only that, the mech was also firing shells.","This time, Chu Fu and the others never even landed—they fought purely from the air, bombing wildly, and players fell in waves.","The guild warehouse had durability too.","It wasn't affected by poison damage.","But it had weak defense against explosive damage, meaning mechanics hard-counter structures.","Under the relentless bombardment,","the guild warehouse was blown wide open.","Countless pieces of equipment inside were exposed.","Shen Chi used his gold-tier vacuum device to suck everything up—all the gear, all the materials—gone!","\"They've got a guild cafeteria too! Blow it up, take all the food!\"","Shen Chi turned around and flew above the cafeteria.","The cafeteria was a must-have for a tier-2 guild. After all, once players reached town and hunger was unlocked, the game became more realistic by the day. Guild players' amenities had to keep up, so the cafeteria was a necessity.","\"Boom! Boom! Boom!\"","Watermelon bombs rained down from the sky.","The lifestyle-class players inside were blown to bits.","\"Workshop! Look at them, they're really building up—they even have a workshop already! Blow that up too!\"","Xie Lin pointed at another building and shouted.","The workshop was where all the lifestyle professionals liked to gather—blacksmithing, tailoring, and other trades. You could rent a room there, which increased your chances of crafting successfully.","Demolishing it would surely yield the materials stored inside.","\"Wow! The medicine workshop—blow up the pharmacy too!\"","Chu Fu kept pointing things out.","Indeed, the progress of their server, which had been merged for eleven days, was way ahead of theirs, which had only been merged for two.","Their guild was actually shaping up nicely.","Not to mention, they even had guild structures!","\"Take out the guild crystal! Once it's dead, the entire guild base is wiped out, and they'll have to go back to town to buy a new one!\"","Buying that plot of land cost several hundred gold coins, after all!","Wan Huanyu was in for a massive loss."]},{"number":123,"title":"Chapter 123: Feng Huimin is slacking off, I want to resign","paragraphs":["Inside the Universal Guild,","every player received a message.","【System Alert: Your guild crystal is under attack!!!】","【System Alert: Your guild crystal is under attack!!!】","Wan Huanyu had already yelled himself hoarse.","\"Feng Huimin? Where are you? Think of something, quick!\"","Feng Huimin was lying by the broken walls and debris of the warehouse!","Her vision was a grayish white, her gaze fixed on one spot beside her, but she couldn’t see anything at all.","Strangely, there was a kind of satisfaction in just giving up and doing nothing.","\"Master Wan, I’m dead too. Why don’t you send someone over with a resurrection scroll? Oh, and whatever you do, don’t let Holy Healing Angel come—I’m afraid she’ll get killed too.\"","Wan Huanyu had never felt this hopeless.","Back when he was on server 001, getting killed by that assassin had just left him stunned, followed by a burst of impotent rage.","After all, this was a game, not reality. Even if he claimed to be the young master of Wantu Real Estate, so what? If someone wanted to kill you, they killed you.","But now, he was the leader of a major guild.","How was he still this pathetic?","Killed right on his own doorstep.","Completely wiped out.","He knew there was nothing he could do now.","He could have fled earlier.","But the guild couldn’t be moved!","The enemy was dead set on wreaking havoc inside the guild grounds, and Wan Huanyu had no way to stop it.","He gave up!","Let it all burn!","···","Inside the Universal Guild.","The guild crystal was built inside the guild hall.","This was where guild quests were accepted and was the most fortified structure.","Not only that, the hall was necessarily built at the very center.","Because the guild crystal had a special effect.","It wasn’t just about whether the territory could be dismantled or conquered.","The guild crystal was an item only village chiefs or town heads could sell. Once placed, the wild area around it would stop spawning monsters, making it a true “safe zone.”","When the crystal shattered, monsters would spawn there again, so it could no longer be called a safe zone, and the territory would be open to attacks at any time.","Chu Fu had already used up all the watermelon bombs in her pockets. She was chugging mana potions while hurrying to ripen more watermelon bombs.","Fortunately, after ripening so many watermelon bombs, she had plenty of bomb sprites, so she simply sent them out to bombard the rooms.","Not only that—","the entire Universal Guild was littered with corpses. Even if anyone was still alive, they had all run away.","Shen Chi had landed earlier, and the eight-meter-tall mech’s fist smashed into the window, tore down the door, and ripped off the roof.","It was like the ultimate demolition crew.","After tearing down the outer walls, they walked up to the crystal.","Electric saw dandelions spun around the crystal as Shen Chi hammered it with the mech.","\"Let me deliver the killing blow!\" Xie Lin raised the King’s Sword high.","Piercing Rainbow Strike!","Holy Light Judgment!","With the terrifying holy light falling, the crystal shattered with a crash.","【System Alert: You have destroyed the Universal Guild’s territory crystal. You may now plunder the territory’s structures.】","【System Alert: You have obtained structures: Chimney (white), Medicine Furnace (white), Herbal Grinding Stone (green), Blacksmith’s Forge (green).】","They got a reward too?","They sucked everything up with the vacuum extractor!","After the full demolition, the three of them felt no lingering attachment and pulled out their return scrolls!","Yes—coming here took three hours, but going back only required a return scroll to teleport straight to Wangxi Town.","No one came to interrupt them.","In fact, the survivors practically hoped they would leave quickly.","Finally they’re gone.","Ten seconds later, the three figures vanished.","Holy Healing Angel timidly returned from the wild, first reviving Feng Huimin.","Feng Huimin felt exhausted.","She looked at her messages and thought, “You could have at least left me a phone number!”","Just then, Wan Huanyu walked into the guild grounds.","Seeing his life’s work destroyed in an instant, he erupted.","“Useless! Useless! A bunch of useless trash!”","Feng Huimin was long used to being yelled at, but this time she felt a sting of defeat too.","Her dividends! Gone.","She didn’t want to listen to Wan Huanyu rage impotently anymore, so she chose to log off.","Actually, she rarely bothered logging in unless necessary, because Wan Huanyu had been acting strange lately—he was always on the game. Before, he would hit the bars and chase women, but now he devoted himself entirely to the game.","The problem was, even so, his level rose painfully slowly. He relied entirely on others to carry him, and his actual strength barely improved.","And soon, Feng Huimin found out why!","After logging off, Feng Huimin stepped out of the game pod and suddenly remembered the message Plantman had left her in-game.","The message told her to investigate whether Wan Huanyu, or the higher-ups, were hiding anything from her.","How to investigate?","The simplest way was to get her hands on Wan Huanyu’s phone.","And that wasn’t hard for her.","She went to his office and picked it up without issue.","After all, the phone was just sitting there.","She opened his messaging app and saw his latest contact.","It wasn’t some woman—it was Guan Youlong.","The exchange between them stunned Feng Huimin.","Game invasion, reality sync, cash-out cards, Plantman.","And even a video!","In the video, Plantman controlled ivy to build ladders and rescue others.","If not for the fact that everything in the footage looked too modern, Feng Huimin would have thought it was a deepfake.","So, this game wasn’t just a game?","It was humanity’s last ark?","Feng Huimin suddenly let out a mocking laugh.","Then what had she been struggling for all this time?","The money she earned would eventually become worthless paper. And her talent was poor, her game experience lacking.","Not only that—she rarely logged in, so she hardly had any gear.","Wan Huanyu also kept her from having too much power, so she never handled the finances.","Oh, right—Wan Huanyu had gold coins on him. 400 gold, equivalent to a liquidity of 400 million, and now it had all been looted and blown away.","At that moment,","Feng Huimin felt nothing but regret.","Just which fool had she hitched herself to?","At the same time, she admitted to being a fool herself—","one of the duped.","Just then, Wan Huanyu called her again.","“Feng Huimin, what tantrum are you pulling? Get back online right now! Solve the guild crisis immediately! Otherwise, I’ll fire you!”","Fire me?","Good riddance.","Feng Huimin’s face turned cold, and she snapped, “I’m done. I work my ass off for pocket change, and I still get cursed at every single day.","Do you realize how much you’ve humiliated me?","I’m suing you for the severe emotional distress you’ve caused.","Since you’re firing me, you’ll pay me severance N+1, or I’ll take you to court.","Expect my lawyer’s letter!”","Luckily, she had kept evidence of everything. She had recorded every single time Wan Huanyu yelled at her.","She immediately packed her personal belongings and took the elevator straight to the chairman’s office.","She was going to file a report right away.","To tell Wan Huanyu’s father, Wan Runian, chairman of Wantu Real Estate, everything.","Meanwhile, Wan Huanyu was even angrier.","But he didn’t dare log off to yell at Feng Huimin in person, because he was afraid—","afraid that the assassin who took down Laurent would come for him and put him out of commission.","He kept calling Feng Huimin, but she had blocked him.","And soon, Wan Huanyu would learn just how disastrous it could be when a talent like Feng Huimin truly went on the warpath."]},{"number":124,"title":"Chapter 124: Returning to Fengdu Town, Guguang Town Has a Murderous Maniac","paragraphs":["Feng Huimin took the video of herself being insulted to the chairman, Wan Runian.","In fact, Wan Runian had a fiery temper. His name was the exact opposite of his personality, but as he got older, he pretended to be elegant.","However, after hearing Feng Huimin's exaggerated account, Wan Runian smashed his antique teacup on the spot.","\"A loss of 1.4 billion in one morning? Why doesn't he just give everyone in China a one - yuan red envelope?\"","\"What an idiot! He's just an incompetent fool!\"","\"Tell him to come and see me, this useless wretch!\"","When Feng Huimin saw Wan Runian, she seemed to see a carbon copy of Wan Huanyu.","But Wan Runian was truly furious, and he had the iron - fisted means to match.","\"President Wan, I won't go even if you tell me to. I'm resigning! Please approve it right now. I've never suffered such great humiliation this month.","Even if you blacklist me in the industry, I won't stay.","Please approve my resignation letter!","Otherwise, I'll expose what Master Wan said to me.","The company's stock has been falling continuously recently. I'm sure you don't want any more trouble because of these things.","In short, I really can't take it anymore. I need to rest. I don't want to work anymore!\"","There were bloodshot eyes all over Feng Huimin's eyes, which were actually rubbed out by herself.","She looked extremely tired, with a look of utter despair.","\"Huimin, I'll give you a vacation. Don't worry, it'll be paid leave. Calm down.\"","\"No, President Wan. I really want to resign. Actually, I've earned enough, but I've found that the company is now in the process of transformation and wants to develop in the gaming industry.","But I know very little about this area.","Moreover, my talent is only C - grade, which doesn't match my... abilities.","I don't want to develop in this field. I'm going to return to the real - world industry and see if there are any other companies that will take me.","For the sake of my years of working for you, please let me go.\"","Wan Runian thought for a moment and then nodded.","Because he felt that Feng Huimin was really not a suitable talent for this field.","Talent C? The minimum requirement for their recruitment was B.","Trying to persuade Feng Huimin to stay would surely lead to her asking for more benefits. It was better to save the money and recruit game geniuses and experts.","Even Lin Haowan was a talented person.","Feng Huimin was not up to it. Otherwise, the guild wouldn't have been wiped out today.","In fact, Wan Runian was even thinking about tricking Feng Huimin.","After all, it was a loss of 1.4 billion. Someone had to be held responsible.","But when he thought of the news brought by the butler from the overseas laboratory, he felt it was unnecessary.","Because there were only four months left.","\"Okay! I'll approve it. But you know, our company is in the middle of a transformation recently, and the cash flow is very tight. Huanyu has also lost 1.4 billion.","So your resignation compensation may have to wait for a while.","The earliest it can be settled is in half a year.","If you accept it, we'll sign an agreement, and I'll sign it right away.\"","Half a year?","Feng Huimin thought that this might be what Wan Runian knew. Maybe the game would invade the real world in half a year, and then they wouldn't have to pay her.","But how much was her compensation?","If she went to the Thorns Guild, she could earn gold coins every day.","How much would that be?","Feng Huimin showed a hesitant and reluctant look. She was afraid that the old man would notice that she was too happy to leave and then not let her go.","\"Okay, I agree!\"","Feng Huimin signed the contract.","After she left, Wan Huanyu received a call from his father and was scolded head - on.","He never expected that Feng Huimin, a woman who only had money in her eyes and could endure humiliation for the sake of money, would really leave.","\"You useless fool. You're just a target. I've stopped your credit card and temporarily stopped investing in your studio. If you have the ability, earn the money back yourself.\"","Wan Huanyu immediately wailed, \"Dad, don't do this! If you don't invest in me, how can I beat the people from the Thorns Guild in the future.","You know, their Thorns Guild is developing well now. If we meet in the city in the future, I'll be even more no match for them.\"","Wan Runian sneered, \"Actually, you should thank her. Recently, I heard a piece of news. The newbie villages in the game actually correspond to real villages.","Her Wangxi Village corresponds to Wangxi Manor!","We own Wangxi Manor. So what if the land she captured is good? In the end, it will still belong to us!\"","Wan Huanyu's head buzzed.","\"Dad, what did you say?\"","\"What? Is your brain not working, and your ears are deaf too? Wangxi Manor, that desolate piece of land.\"","Wan Huanyu felt as if his throat was stuffed with cotton. After a long time, he stammered, \"I... sold that manor a week ago.\"","This time, it was Wan Runian's turn for his head to buzz.","After a while, there was a sound like coughing on the phone, followed by Wan Runian's voice, \"Call... call an ambulance...\"","On the other side.","Chu Fu and the other two returned to Fengdu Town with full loads.","The three of them had naturally completed their tasks by killing a wave of mission targets.","They didn't even know who the targets were. Anyway, they completed the tasks.","They even completed the tasks while massacring.","Moreover, the masks of Chu Fu and Shen Chi reached 10,000 kills and were even promoted to diamond - grade.","[Disguiser's Mask (Diamond - grade)]","Physical and magical attack power +500.","All attributes +50.","Feature 1: Can change one's own ID and hide the sin value.","Feature 2: Can adjust facial features by 80%.","Feature 3: Can change voice by 80%.","Special item, soul - bound, growth equipment.","Next growth: Number of kills: 100,000.","All attributes were doubled, the attack power was also greatly increased, and there was an additional third feature.","But it was of no use to them.","\"By the way, change our names back before submitting the task. Don't let the guards misunderstand that we're also followers of the evil god!\"","The other two nodded.","They changed their names back and then went to find the guard captain.","When the guard captain saw them appear, he showed a surprised look.","\"You're finally back. I thought something had happened to you.\"","\"Hmm?\" Chu Fu let out a confused sound.","The guard captain said with lingering fear, \"A message came from Guguan Town that there was a killing spree.","They massacred an awakened power, causing a loss of as many as 20,000 people.","The leader of the criminals was called Green Leaf, Dumpling Skin, and Shrimp.","I don't even dare to eat these things anymore.","But it's good that you're back. Did you complete the task successfully?\"","Chu Fu immediately stepped forward and said seriously, \"Captain, don't worry. We've completed the task perfectly. We've also heard about that big event.","The killing spree is extremely good at disguising. With the masks of the evil god, they often pretend to be others and start killing.","So, captain, you must try your best to distinguish who are the minions of the evil god and who are the people fighting against the evil god.\""]},{"number":125,"title":"Chapter 125: Tallying the Harvest, Long Live the Plant Masters","paragraphs":["Shen Chi stood behind Chu Fu, looking down at her back. Though he couldn't see her expression, he suddenly felt how incredibly strong her conviction was!","If she hadn't had that accident, she could absolutely have become an actress.","After all, lying was still quite difficult for Shen Chi, who had always been a model student.","At that moment, Xie Lin also stepped forward.","\"That's right! Captain, we fought our way out of a mountain of corpses and a sea of blood. When Wangxi Village fell into crisis, we stepped up and gunned down the cultists of the evil god.","We cleared the Abyssal Difficulty of the Beast God Temple, and we're still carrying the Beast God's gaze upon us. We stand in irreconcilable opposition to the evil god.","Don't worry, from now on, any missions to hunt down the evil god's minions are ours!\"","The two of them stood tall and proud, chests puffed out.","Shen Chi glanced at both of them, noticing something red seeming to flutter near their chests.","Then Xie Lin nudged Shen Chi with the scabbard of the King's Sword.","Shen Chi immediately snapped to attention, but kept his head down and stammered, \"Th-That's right!\"","The guard captain smiled warmly.","\"I believe you. You two look like good kids. Well then, given how difficult this mission was — even though it's your first time here — I'll reward you with this badge after all!\"","[System Notice: You have completed the quest: Defeat the Believers of the Evil God.]","[System Notice: You have received the reward: Guard Badge (Plain).]","[Guard Badge (Plain): Defense +10.]","What a shabby badge.","But still, every extra badge added a bit more strength, and these badges could be worn indefinitely.","Whoever had more badges had more stats to show for it.","Chu Fu didn't mind either. She could just come back to the guard post for more quests later.","After finishing the quest, Chu Fu suddenly gasped, \"Oh! My rice is all ripe! I'm going to go harvest it first.\"","\"Go ahead. Come on, wheelchair, let's head back and take stock of our loot.\"","Chu Fu quickly added, \"Then I'll hold off on the rice! I want to take stock of the loot first!\"","\"Hahahahaha!\" Xie Lin burst out laughing.","Afterwards, the three of them returned to their base.","It was noon, and there were still plenty of players around. Most of the players who had joined the Thornwreath Guild were basically playing the game full-time now.","Truth be told, the income here was way more than any regular job could offer.","The other guild members still didn't know that Chu Fu and the others had just raided Gugu Pass Town. When they saw the trio coming over, they waved and greeted them.","The three found an open spot, pulled out the vacuum collector, and activated its discharge feature.","\"Pfft pfft pfft pfft pfft pfft!\"","In an instant, the vacuum collector spewed everything out!","Equipment scattered like fireworks, piling up everywhere, with gold coins, silver coins, and copper coins raining down like a sky full of flowers.","The mountain of equipment left every guild member passing by completely dumbfounded.","\"Ahhh! Bosses, where did you go defend another village or town? Why didn't you tell us? We could've helped too!\"","\"Oh my god, that's way too much! How are there even golden equipment pieces in there?!\"","\"This isn't just village defense — the forums have blown up! The Vice Leader, the Mechanic Elder, and the Sword Saint Elder are all trending on the forums.\"","The guild was buzzing with heated discussion.","Just then, Zhimengzhe and the others, who had been leveling up, also returned to the guild base.","They came to help.","\"Zhimeng, come over here! Help us sort the equipment!\" Chu Fu waved eagerly.","Zhimengzhe kept her head down, cheeks flushed red, and hurried over to Chu Fu's side.","\"I... I'm on it!\"","She flicked her wrist, and countless threads spread out, tossing pieces of equipment left and right.","Plain, iron, bronze, silver, and gold equipment were quickly separated into piles.","But there was just too much of it — they couldn't pick it all up. They simply couldn't.","\"Quick, everyone pitch in!\"","At Chu Fu's call, the guild members all rushed over to help.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao, who had been buying rice in town, saw the message and sprinted back as fast as she could.","\"Oh my god, you guys went on a robbery!\"","The three exchanged glances and couldn't help but snicker.","\"Spot on — we really did go on a robbery!\"","\"We cleaned out Wan Huanyu's guild warehouse.\"","\"Come on, your inventory's huge. Help us divide up the gear.\"","The guild members quickly got to work sorting everything.","Because they had raided the warehouse of the Huanyu Guild and also taken down a bunch of players — especially the lifestyle players, who were all loaded to the gills — the total gold coins, including those dropped by Wan Huanyu, came to 564 gold.","That meant 188 gold for each of them.","Xie Lin was very satisfied with the number.","\"188... same as my height!\"","\"Hey, Sword Saint, you're way too young to be putting out this kind of cheesy vibe,\" Suture Saint teased.","Shen Chi said matter-of-factly, \"Good thing I'm 190. I don't have to go around telling everyone I'm 188.\"","\"Who asked you?!\" Jiaojiao Bu Jiao shot him a glare.","Chu Fu clutched her stomach. \"Stop it, you guys! Keep this up and I'm going to laugh myself into getting eight-pack abs!\"","Everyone wore bright smiles.","Next came the division of the spoils.","Among them were two resurrection scrolls of great value, so Shen Chi and Xie Lin each took one.","There were 37 golden equipment pieces. Since the two had already taken the scrolls, they took fewer gear pieces each — six apiece — while Chu Fu took the remaining 25 pieces for herself.","Because Wan Huanyu and Holy Healing Angel were both magic-based classes, most of the equipment was geared toward mages.","Chu Fu immediately swapped out all her silver equipment for a full set of golden gear.","Sure, Wan Huanyu was a stinky guy, but the golden equipment was shiny, and Chu Fu had no complaints.","Apart from her purple mushroom skirt and purple mushroom hat, which she kept, she replaced six other pieces: boots, leg guards, belt, bracers, gloves, and a bracelet.","And even though their game progress had been moved up by 11 days, no golden ring had dropped yet, so Chu Fu kept her own.","There were still 19 pieces of equipment left, enough to nearly put together a full set of golden healer/magic gear.","These could be sold to Suture Saint and the others.","No need to fight over them — there were plenty for everyone.","As for silver equipment, Chu Fu and her team had plenty already.","After some discussion, Chu Fu and the others decided to sell the equipment to the guild at half price.","The reason for doing this was simple: if everyone's gear improved, then more people could clear Nightmare difficulty dungeons.","The more people clearing Nightmare dungeons meant more golden equipment drops overall.","Also, the guild assigned dungeons daily, and players had to hand over 20% of the profits.","The guild provided benefits, and players needed to provide value in return.","Once a steady stream of golden equipment started flowing in, everyone would get stronger, and at the top of the pyramid, Chu Fu and her crew would only make more and more money.","With that in mind, Chu Fu posted a message in the guild channel: \"Even though we went out looting, we didn't forget the guild. From now on, any player who lacks accessory-type equipment can claim one plain-level accessory for free.","Secondly, we're donating 20% of all bronze and silver tier equipment to the guild as a free contribution — players can redeem them directly with their contribution points!","The remaining equipment will be sold at 50% of the original price!!!","Of course, flipping is strictly forbidden! Anything we can't sell will be broken down into raw materials by the Mechanic Elder and disposed of.\"","\"Long live the Plant Master!\"","Thunderous cheers erupted across the guild."]},{"number":126,"title":"Chapter 126: I Can Finally See My Brother, Feng Huimin Has Arrived","paragraphs":["Chu Fu didn't stick around for the rest of the auction—she had crops to harvest!","When Chu Fu arrived at the wild fields, she found her spirit rice growing beautifully.","Some players had even started guarding her farmland voluntarily, keeping a wary eye on the players from the big guilds.","The big guild players wouldn't dare steal Chu Fu's spirit rice.","Not after the Star Alliance lost people yesterday.","From what she saw on the forums today, they were terrified that Chu Fu might get bored and massacre every single one of them.","In fact, the Star Alliance was still afraid to buy a base at this point.","Now, whenever they ran into players from the Thorn Guild, they'd take a detour.","After Chu Fu harvested the spirit rice, she gave each player ten catties—enough to last four or five days in-game.","Between harvesting and replanting twice, the whole process took Chu Fu over two hours.","In the end, she harvested thirty-five million catties of spirit rice.","After packing all the spirit rice into sacks, Chu Fu headed to Shi Dacang's place to deliver the grain.","Each village continued to require five million catties of grain.","And Linjiang City demanded five times that amount—twenty-five million catties.","Luckily, Chu Fu's yield was more than enough.","[System Notice: You have completed Phase 1 of the Famine Year: Huaishui Town Food Crisis.]","[System Notice: You have completed Phase 1 of the Famine Year: Qingmu Food Crisis.]","[System Notice: You have completed the Linjiang City Food Crisis.]","Shi Dacang was overjoyed.","\"With this batch of spirit rice, we can temporarily relieve the food crisis in all the surrounding cities. Whoever wants to be a vegetable farmer—thank you for your contribution to the cities around Linjiang! This Harvest Badge is my reward to you!\"","Soon, a gleaming golden badge adorned with a wheat pattern landed in Chu Fu's hands.","[Harvest Badge (Gold Tier):","HP +200.","All Stats +10.","Trait 1: Crops you plant yield an additional 10%.","Trait 2: Crops you plant increase in size by 50%.]","Chu Fu's eyebrows rose, the corners of her mouth curling upward, her eyes sparkling.","This Harvest Badge was perfect for her!","Trait 1 was nice enough—an extra 10% yield, on par with the Golden Hoe.","But Trait 2? That was utterly ridiculous.","For smaller crops, it wouldn't change much—maybe a small cherry becoming a slightly bigger version of a small cherry, a bit plumper.","But what if she applied it to Explosion Watermelons?","A fifty percent size increase meant an extra thirty to fifty centimeters, and the explosion radius would naturally expand as well.","Takeoff.","Chu Fu happily equipped the badge.","Just then, Shi Dacang continued.","\"These grains are gathered, but we need someone to escort them safely to each town and city.","The routes are extremely long, and there may be many dangers along the way.","We can provide you with a mount to increase your travel speed.","If you complete the task successfully, the mount is yours to keep.","Oh, and have you heard? A murderous maniac has recently appeared near Guguan Town, so be careful. If you think it's too dangerous, you can recruit some teammates to come along!\"","[System Notice: Do you accept the epic quest: Famine Year (Phase 2)?","Quest Giver: Shi Dacang.","Quest Objective: All towns surrounding Linjiang City are under siege by goblins and undead legions. The fields yield nothing, and the citizens are starving. The grain you provided has greatly alleviated the crisis in the towns.","Due to special circumstances, towns too far away cannot use teleportation arrays. You must personally escort the grain to each town.","Upon accepting the quest, you will receive:","Quest Item: Bronzehide Rhino (Bronze Tier): Movement speed of 7 meters per second, possesses basic defensive abilities, can resist attacks from goblins and skeleton creatures.","Quest Completion Rewards: Large amounts of EXP, large amounts of gold coins, Bronzehide Rhino (Bronze Tier).","Quest Failure Penalty: -1000 reputation, deduction of 20 gold coins as compensation.","This quest can be completed up to 9 times.]","[Accept / Decline]","\"Accept!\"","Chu Fu clicked the quest button.","Just then, the sky darkened.","It was already 2 AM.","Her communicator buzzed—her brother was urging her to log off.","Chu Fu shared the quest with Jiaojiao Bu Jiao and told her to prepare—they could run the quest when they got back online.","Most importantly, this meant they could go cross-server again.","Not to mention, clearing a Hell-tier dungeon would bring extra rewards.","And on top of that, the mount was an indispensable mode of transport in no-fly zones.","After giving her instructions, Chu Fu opened the game pod.","Chu Feng was already waiting outside!","Chu Fu's tone was light, the corners of her mouth lifting, her eyes curving upward.","\"Brother, did you see the forums? The three of us dismantled the Huan Yu Guild.\"","Chu Fu couldn't wait to share the good news.","Chu Feng hadn't actually checked the forums, but the person downstairs—apparently someone his sister had poached—had told him everything after he logged on.","\"Fufu, you're amazing!\"","Chu Fu's eyes crinkled with joy as she continued excitedly. \"Brother, you have no idea—I just got a quest that lets me visit you in the city! Did you collect any seeds for me?\"","Chu Fu knew a good opportunity when she saw one.","Who had a thicker leg to cling to than her brother's?","Chu Feng was surprised—he hadn't expected Chu Fu to get a quest that allowed her to come to the city at this level. Naturally, he'd be sure to prepare.","\"Don't worry, I've got all the seeds ready for you. And equipment, too!\"","Chu Fu quickly shook her head. \"I don't need equipment—I just took down Wan Huanyu. He was a mage too, and he dropped a Gold-tier item for me!\"","Chu Feng remained composed but spoke calmly. \"His gear stinks. I'll prepare Dark Gold-tier for you instead.\"","\"Wow~\"","Now that was a thick leg worth clinging to.","But the way Chu Feng casually mentioned Dark Gold-tier gear... was a little show-offy.","Ah, it was the classic male-lead habit from early game novels.","What could Chu Fu do? Indulge him, of course!","\"Brother, you're the best brother in the whole world. Love you~\"","Chu Feng could barely suppress his smile.","\"Alright, let's head downstairs first. Someone's here to see you again—she used to be part of the Huan Yu studio. She's been waiting for two hours.","I told her to leave, but she refused.\"","Chu Fu immediately thought of a name.","Professional manager Feng Huimin.","\"Let's go, let's go, brother. I have a feeling she's a real talent!\"","Chu Fu walked downstairs and saw Feng Huimin standing there in a ladies' suit with matching trousers, wide black-framed glasses, and her hair in a neat bun.","Her style was sharp and capable—she looked reliable at first glance.","\"Manager Feng, hello!\"","\"Hello, Miss Chu!\"","Feng Huimin leaned slightly forward to shake Chu Fu's hand, though her back remained straight.","\"Thank you, Miss Chu, for telling me what you did in-game. Otherwise, I'd still be in the dark. I officially resigned this morning.","Not only that, but I've deleted my old character through a suicide reset. In twenty-four hours—by tomorrow noon—I'll be able to spawn in Wangxi Village.","I voluntarily wish to join the Thorn Guild. I hope Miss Chu will give me a chance.\"","I hope that, through my own strength and work ability, I can prove that I have value and earn the recognition of Miss Chu, as well as the entire guild.","I hope that, when the time comes, I can be given a position as a core member."]},{"number":127,"title":"Chapter 127: Feng Huimin Joins, Hurry Up Online to Grab the First Kill","paragraphs":["Feng Huimin knew she had fallen too far behind.","Previously, she had only been responsible for managing the guild and hadn't thought about entering the game herself to play.","It was a bit like amateurs managing experts.","After all, in Feng Huimin’s hands, even top-tier players were nothing more than figureheads—or useful tools.","But when she put herself in the game's role, she felt suffocated.","The total attribute points Chu Fu had gained from world announcements along the way: 112 points.","With a total of 448 attribute points, that was the free attribute points an ordinary player would need to reach level 90 to obtain.","From here, the gap between players and players became enormous.","Chu Fu, let alone fighting 1 vs 10, had never lost even 1 vs 100, or 1 vs 1000.","The Huan Yu guild's defeat was not without reason.","Or rather, this was karma!","Three years ago, ignoring the law, thinking they could bully others with money and power.","Three years later, they finally got the retribution they deserved.","Feng Huimin was extremely grateful, and felt thankful, that Chu Fu had invited her.","She had also gone all in—if Chu Fu didn't accept her now, she would rack her brains to join the Thorn guild anyway.","Chu Fu, of course, wouldn't mistreat talent.","\"It's great that you can come. Your base salary won't be reduced, it's around 1 gold coin. There's a one-month probation period. After that, based on your actual abilities and management skills, we'll arrange profit sharing for you.","By the way, I do have something that needs your help!","You were a professional manager and secretary at Wan Tu Real Estate. I happen to be planning to develop the land outside Wangxi Manor, and I've been communicating with the construction bureau lately. Can you help me with the coordination?","You should have a lot of experience in this area!\"","\"Of course!\" When it came to her own expertise, Feng Huimin naturally felt more confident.","After understanding the situation a bit, Feng Huimin was amazed by Chu Fu's bold move.","She was actually planning to build a self-sufficient small town.","Even Wan Tu Real Estate had never had such ambition.","Chu Fu said, \"Thorn Town is currently fully led by me, so 100% of the shares belong to me. After the one-month probation period, when you take on the role of professional manager, I can give you 5% of the shares.\"","At this moment, Feng Huimin felt like Chu Fu was raising loyal warriors.","This was the grace of recognition!","She had been underappreciated, guarded against, and schemed against.","Now, she had finally received the respect and attention she deserved from Chu Fu.","Even if these were just promises Chu Fu was making now, she accepted them willingly.","However, if she kept dealing with real-world matters, wouldn't that go against the purpose of her coming here?","With that thought, Feng Huimin quickly asked, \"What about in the game? Is there anything tricky that needs my handling, or...\"","Game matters?","Chu Fu thought for a moment, then said, \"Indeed, I need you to do some PR work now!\"","Chu Fu explained the situation on the forum.","\"Don't think everyone is just watching the fun now.","In reality, after taking down the Huan Yu guild, the people of our Thorn guild will also come under fire.","The audience sympathizes with the underdog.","They might even think that our Thorn Studio has become the dragon-slayer that turns into a dragon itself.","So, I need you to spread Huan Yu Studio's dirt from every angle.","Crush them completely.","Just like the declaration of war before a battle in ancient times.","Fight with a just cause!\"","Feng Huimin nodded.","Indeed, the Thorn Studio's image must not be tarnished. It needed to stay above board, so more talented players would choose Thorn Studio.","The Huan Yu Studio had such a bad reputation that even recruiting top players took enormous effort.","\"I'll get in touch with the best PR team on the market. But, Miss Chu, I need to know how far this kind of PR can go.","Would you, Miss Chu, Mr. Shen, and Mr. Xie, mind being used as part of the narrative?\"","The slight color that had just returned to Chu Fu's face tightened, and then a cold glint flashed in her eyes.","\"Let them pay the price. What does it matter if we're used!\"","The scars that were reopened would also turn into sharp blades.","Pointed at the wicked who had never paid for their sins.","Feng Huimin then asked about the current composition of the studio, the list of personnel, and they gradually drifted into talking about how Chu Fu had managed to cross servers.","Chu Fu explained the quest, and Feng Huimin listened, utterly fascinated.","\"So that's possible!\"","The Huan Yu guild had also received this quest, but they only thought it was an ordinary task. They never realized there were extra trigger conditions.","Then, Feng Huimin's expression suddenly changed. She took out her work notebook and started searching.","\"Miss Chu, I suggest you take your team to Windhearth Town in District 025 immediately.\"","\"They merged servers only 6 days ago, and they're still attacking the nightmare-level dungeon. They haven't gotten the first kill yet!\"","Chu Fu immediately jumped up.","Damn, why didn't she say this earlier!","\"I'm logging in right now!\"","Feng Huimin nodded. \"You go ahead. I'll compile a report with information on all the districts, available resources, and I'll call you with it!\"","\"Alright!\"","Chu Fu turned to look at Chu Feng.","\"Brother, can we skip the workout today?\"","Chu Feng, being a top-tier player himself, naturally knew the importance of a first kill.","\"Go!\"","Chu Fu quickly ran back to her room and entered the game pod.","In the living room, only Chu Feng and Feng Huimin remained.","Chu Feng stared directly at Feng Huimin, causing her to unconsciously touch her glasses frame.","She, who had been through many battles, felt like she was being watched by an apex predator.","\"Work hard, and you won't be treated unfairly,\" Chu Feng said casually, then pulled a key box out from under the dining table.","He picked one at random and handed it to Feng Huimin.","\"My sister seems to value you. You should stay here. This is the key to the villa. If you need anything, just tell the property management, and they'll take care of it.\"","\"This... you're giving this to me?\"","\"Heh, the deed isn't in your name, of course. Don't worry, we won't charge you rent either. But if you perform well in the future, my sister might reward you with it.\"","\"Okay... thank you, Mr. Chu.\"","Strangely, Chu Fu seemed gentle, but this Mr. Chu—he seemed dangerous, even exuding a faint... killing intent.","In the past, Feng Huimin had traveled with Wan Runian, and as a leading real estate tycoon, they had dealt with shady characters.","But Chu Feng felt more terrifying than any of them.","Fortunately, Chu Feng was not her enemy.","But her ally now.","As for living in the villa, Feng Huimin felt no disrespect or neglect whatsoever. Instead, she felt honored to be able to stay here.","When she had come looking for Chu Fu, she had seen the security presence here first-hand.","In the future, this place would probably become a sacred ground that countless people would want to enter but never could.","With that thought, she picked up her computer, ready to get to work and prove her worth to Chu Fu.","...","Inside the game.","It was still night.","Except for dungeons, few players were out fighting monsters with 100% enhanced stats.","Chu Fu quickly rallied her team.","\"Hurry, hurry, hurry! We're going to grab the first kill!\"","If she remembered correctly,","District 025 was the home base of Wang Rongxun, the eldest young master of the Wang family.","...","Inside the dungeon.","\"Ah-choo!\"","Wang Rongxun sneezed, feeling as if someone was muttering about him."]},{"number":128,"title":"Chapter 128: First Blood Secured, Wang Rongxun in Tears","paragraphs":["\"Let's pick up the pace—just the final boss left, everyone stay sharp.\"","Wang Rongxun said with a smile, trying to reassure them.","If Wan Huanyu was the hotheaded one and Guan Youlong the twisted one, then Wang Rongxun was the smiling tiger.","He was a bit older than Wan Huanyu and the others, and more capable, too.","But precisely because of his age, when the game first launched, he hadn't joined immediately. It was only after the rumors started circulating in his circles that Wang Rongxun came in.","The upside: to this day, he had never died once.","The downside: because of his distrust and unfamiliarity with the game, his initial talent was only C-rank.","Luckily, the village defense battle was won. He didn't take first place, but he bought up contribution points and purchased a Talent Enhancement Stone, raising his talent to B-rank.","【B-rank talent: Backstab","Trait 1: Instantly teleport behind a target!","Trait 2: All attacks from behind deal 30% bonus damage.】","This talent eventually set Wang Rongxun on the path of an assassin.","However, Wang Rongxun was extremely envious of talent.","When he first entered the game with only a C-rank talent, he naturally suppressed players with S-rank talents.","Not only that—knowing that S-rank talents would drop ranks upon death, he quietly arranged for quite a few of them to be killed off.","Whether they were allies or enemies.","The upside: he only envied the capable.","He had no interest in regular players.","That's why the ordinary players in his area, 025, died in much smaller numbers—over 8,700 survived, and the village defense barely succeeded.","But just two days after the server merge, Lin Haowan exposed the Shun Muyuan incident, and now almost no players chose the 0258888 server, afraid they'd be oppressed by Rongxun Studio once inside.","This left Wang Rongxun without capable talents to use—the highest rank among his dungeon raiders was a mere A-rank player.","Even worse than Wan Huanyu's Huanyu Studio.","Still, as long as you had one piece of gold equipment, you could get endless more.","Besides, clearing this server-first would also net a gold equipment.","With 10 people, each got one; surely someone would draw gold equipment to improve again.","Dungeons would only get easier from there.","But Wang Rongxun never dreamed—","Although the 【Primordial Door】 was divided into servers,","it was actually a single, complete map.","Other players could cross regions and even snatch his server-first away.","...","Fengdu Town.","After Chu Fu finished explaining, everyone in the team's eyes lit up.","\"What server-first? Where did a server-first come from?\" Jiaojiao bu Jiao asked.","Chu Fu shared the quest.","\"The 025 server's hell-difficulty dungeon hasn't been cleared yet!\"","Hearing this, everyone understood immediately.","Shen Chi said at once, \"Everyone, return to the guild base. Get on the bus.\"","The veteran driver got the engine running.","Everyone moved fast, using the guild's free Recall skill to teleport back to the base.","Shen Chi set down the bus, everyone climbed aboard, and with a roar, Shen Chi floored it.","Target: Fenghe Town!","Fenghe Town sat between Fengdu Town and Guguang Town—a straight-line trip of roughly an hour and a half.","With the roaring ride, they arrived at the entrance of the goblin lair in Fenghe Town.","The giant mech was massive—every squad lined up at the dungeon entrance saw it.","Almost immediately, a player from Rongxun Guild let out a hoarse shriek:","\"The Plant People are here! Run!!!\"","Wan Huanyu's guild had been wiped out in the morning.","Was it Rongxun Guild's turn in the afternoon?","Furious and trembling, they ruled the underworld—when could the big four syndicates ever stand tall again, when capital was getting bodied by a lone casual player?","Was this the power of the people?!","Suddenly, at the bustling dungeon entrance, players pulled out every trick to flee—some went invisible, some jumped away in big leaps, some shot off looking like they had fire wheels strapped to their legs.","\"Ah, our reputation's too notorious, we scared everyone off!\" Chu Fu shrugged helplessly, feeling even more strongly about the importance of public discourse.","She didn't care anymore and selected the hell-difficulty dungeon to enter.","News of Chu Fu and the others arriving at Fenghe Town and entering the dungeon quickly reached Wang Rongxun's ears.","Wang Rongxun's forehead veins bulged.","To secure the hell-difficulty server-first, his team had been grinding for days.","Moreover, the dungeon entrance had been hogged by his guild—keeping other casual teams from entering.","What if a powerful casual player snatched the server-first?!","But against thugs like the Plant People, the Rongxun Guild players didn't dare stop them.","Wang Rongxun forced down his temper and flashed a smile.","\"It's fine—you did the right thing. Now, head back to town—not the guild base—and pull out every piece of silver and bronze equipment from the warehouse, fast!\"","Don't end up like Huanyu Guild—wiped out and slow to react, losing their whole headquarters.","Then, inside the dungeon, they picked up the pace.","But nerves were frayed, mistakes piled up, and the boss killed multiple damage dealers with a few hits.","\"Don't worry about the bodies—keep fighting, keep fighting! We've got an hour—just one hour, and the boss will be down!\"","\"The rest of you must not screw up!\"","\"Anyone who makes another mistake is out of Rongxun!\"","Wang Rongxun shouted.","Everyone's nerves were stretched to the breaking point.","Worried the atmosphere was too oppressive, Wang Rongxun twitched his face muscles and forced himself to speak patiently, \"One more attempt—they just entered the dungeon, we still have a chance!\"","One player couldn't help saying, \"Guild Master, I just checked Jīngjí Guild's [thorn guild] clear record—their server-first clear took only about an hour.\"","\"Shut up!\"","Wang Rongxun hissed through his teeth.","And everything refused to go his way.","With fewer damage dealers, the boss became much harder. The pressure was too much, they couldn't dodge the boss's attacks, and players dropped one by one.","An hour later, Wang Rongxun himself hit the ground, leaving only four people alive in the raid.","Just then, the server-wide announcement appeared.","【Server Announcement: Players \"Who Wants to Be a Plant\", \"Rocket on a Wheelchair\", \"Who You Calling Blind\", \"Jiaojiao bu Jiao\", \"Suture Saint\", \"Shafu Liangu\", \"Wu Yingchun\", \"Little Sister Wu\", \"Zhimengzhe\", and \"Bitter Melon King\" have completed the hell-difficulty Goblin Lair server-first clear! Reward: All stats +8, Gold Treasure Chest ×1!】","Wang Rongxun snapped.","\"Get out of combat—what are you waiting for? Keep the healer alive.\"","The players exited the boss arena, and as usual, the boss didn't chase them out but returned to its lair, rapidly regenerating health.","Seizing the moment, the cleric with Resurrection carefully brought everyone back to life.","\"So... do we still keep fighting?\" the cleric asked."]},{"number":129,"title":"Chapter 129: Feng Huimin's Suggestion, Arrival at Linjiang City","paragraphs":["\"Attack!\" Wang Rongxun gritted his back teeth so hard they nearly cracked.","If they didn't attack, wouldn't all their previous efforts have been for nothing?","Only by attacking could they squeeze out one more piece of gold equipment. Regardless of whose equipment it was, it still counted as an improvement.","Once they'd beaten it once, they could beat it countless times.","They had to take it down.","Besides, did he even dare to leave right now?","If he went out, wouldn't Chu Fu just kill him?","He chickened out.","What Wang Rongxun didn't know was that Chu Fu and her group had no intention of attacking the Rongxun Guild at all.","...","Inside the dungeon instance.","The group erupted in cheers.","Another 8 attribute points secured — of course they were thrilled.","Chu Fu's communicator buzzed.","It was Feng Huimin.","\"Boss, I already saw that you guys took the first kill.\"","Feng Huimin was equally astonished.","The first-kill announcement could also be looked up on the forums.","It was automatically updated by the officials.","And from the moment Chu Fu logged in to taking the first kill, it had taken only a little over 2 hours.","That was way too fast.","Feng Huimin reminded her: \"Boss, Zone 025 has only been merged for 6 days. They don't even farm the Level 25 boss daily because raid wipes are way too severe — Wang Rongxun can't afford the losses.","You guys can take down the Level 25 boss first, then head for Linjiang City next.","There's a large auction house in Linjiang City where global goods circulate. You can buy dark gold-grade equipment and gold-grade equipment there.","You can stock up on a batch, then go sell them in other servers.","Right now, Zone 017 and Zone 025 are definitely desperate for gold equipment. You can sell to them at high prices. Sure, it might be arming the enemy, but it could also be... fattening the pigs!\"","Chu Fu immediately grasped the key point.","Zone 017 is the home base of the Huan Yu studio, but after they got slaughtered, they naturally had no gold equipment left.","Not just no gold equipment — they probably didn't even have more than a few pieces of silver equipment.","Player combat power had tanked.","If they wanted to recover their strength, their only option was to buy gold equipment to replenish.","Otherwise, they couldn't even clear nightmare-grade dungeons.","As for Zone 025, that was even easier to understand — they still hadn't cleared the hell-grade dungeon. They only took down the Level 25 boss through human wave tactics, but after the first kill, they never touched it again.","The losses were too severe.","Perfect timing — Chu Fu would bring her people over to finish that boss off.","\"Alright, I understand!\"","\"Then I wish the boss a triumphant victory!\"","Feng Huimin hung up.","Chu Fu shared Feng Huimin's advice with the group, and everyone unanimously agreed.","\"Open the treasure chest first, let's see if there's any upgrade. If not, we'll head to the Level 25 boss next.\"","Chu Fu brought out the new gold treasure chest, gave it a shake, and opened it.","A moment later, a ring appeared in her hand.","[Spirit Medium Ring (Gold): Magic Attack +50, Spirit +40. Special Effect: 20% of your attack is converted to soul damage, ignoring the target's defense.]","The stats seemed more suited for Bitter Gourd King.","But on second thought, Bitter Gourd King already specialized in soul attacks, so it wouldn't need the conversion.","That 20% defense-ignoring effect was still pretty sweet though.","Chu Fu naturally swapped out one of her silver rings for it.","That counted as a small improvement.","On Shen Chi's side, he also drew something good.","[War-Grade Ducted Turbine Blueprint (Gold Blueprint): Allows the creation of a ducted turbine. Once installed, greatly increases speed.]","\"Perfect — I was just worried our movement speed was too slow. This turbine came at just the right time! Let's find somewhere to craft this.\"","There wasn't enough space here. Shen Chi left the dungeon, then summoned the mech, the bus, the turbines, and all the leftover equipment that the players had sorted through from the vacuum cleaner, piling it all into a small mountain.","Then Shen Chi started hand-crafting the turbines.","One turbine was a full 4 meters long and half a meter in diameter.","The previous mech couldn't have supported it at all.","But this time, Shen Chi crafted two of them.","Next came assembling and reinforcing the mech.","To the shock of the people watching,","the original 8-meter mech, upgraded with countless plain, iron, bronze, and black-tier parts, grew even larger.","It now stood a full 20 meters tall, with turbines installed at the back of both legs.","There was also a control cabin in the chest, roughly 4 by 3 meters in size — enough to hold all 10 people.","Now that was a real behemoth!","\"Get on the mech!\"","Shen Chi jumped aboard first.","The others all had flight wings, so they could easily fly up into the mech.","Looking at the tech-styled interior, everyone let out \"ooh\" and \"aah\" sounds.","\"Thank heavens, thank the earth — I finally don't have to stand in the wind anymore!\"","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao, who had been stuck in the foot seat the whole time, harbored a deep hatred for the wind.","Chu Fu, however, felt the mech overhaul was a bit wasteful.","\"Wheelchair Brother, this mech is way too big now. We won't have any room when we go into cave-type or palace-type dungeons!\"","Shen Chi piloted the mech as it took off, answering Chu Fu gently: \"It doesn't matter. This time we're heading into the city, and there's an auction house. I can buy more materials — and the mech's core energy source should be for sale as well.\"","\"Then I'll build a dark gold mech! Or maybe a small mech.\"","\"Besides, assuming we can keep taking this quest, we waste too much time traveling every day. We need a mode of transportation!\"","Since Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao had triggered the Great Benefactor quest, that meant others could too — it was just a matter of spending money to exchange with the NPC for medals.","But that also meant that from now on, they could farm hell-grade dungeons at other towns every single day.","The grain donated to the NPCs totaled 50 million catties. At the lowest-tier grain price, that was 50 gold for a single gold medal.","But if they could clear 4 extra hell-grade dungeons and snag an extra boss or two on top of that, they'd make it back easily.","And if you counted the experience, it was a straight profit!","\"Man, you're a saint, Wheelchair. In that case, you can't foot the bill alone — the guild will chip in too!\" Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao said.","Chu Fu raised both hands in agreement.","Without Shen Chi, even with Chu Fu's quest, they would waste far too much time on the road — it just wouldn't be worth it.","\"Alright then, my class is a bit of a money pit. I'll be counting on all of you!\"","With that,","they boarded the mech and went to take down the Level 25 field boss, picking up another piece of gold equipment.","Then the mech went full speed ahead.","Its top speed rivaled a fighter jet — 2,000 kilometers per hour.","Even so, it took a full hour and a half to reach Linjiang City.","So if they had to travel on foot, the distance from Fengdu to Linjiang was simply far too long.","Teleportation arrays would only open once players pushed the story forward.","Just like expanding the newbie village, expanding towns and cities required large numbers of players to complete quests or meet certain conditions.","Chu Fu looked down at the city below with curiosity.","From a high altitude, she could see Linjiang City's majestic gate towers and the 50-meter-tall city walls.","These were walls built to withstand titans and dragons.","Linjiang City covered an area of only 10 kilometers by 10 kilometers — 25 times larger than Fengdu Town.","But even that wasn't enough.","In the real world, Linjiang City stretched at least 30 kilometers from the city center to its outskirts.","When the game descended into reality, if Linjiang City wasn't expanded, more than half its population would end up stuck outside safe zones.","It might even happen that, as the land expands, one could get lost out in the wilderness."]},{"number":130,"title":"Chapter 130: Clinging to Big Bro's Leg, Venom Dragon Set","paragraphs":["To prevent the guards on the city walls from attacking them, the mech landed, and Chu Fu and the others walked toward the city gate.","\"Non-residents of Linjiang City are forbidden to enter!\"","The soldiers blocked their path.","The main issue was that Chu Fu and her group were simply too low-level.","Even if they had traveled over mountains and rivers, they wouldn't be able to get into the city.","Fortunately, Chu Fu had Shi Dacang's letter of introduction.","\"I'm an Awakened from Fengdu Town, here to escort grain. This is my letter of introduction.\"","Chu Fu handed the letter to the guard.","The guard examined it carefully, and especially when he saw the words \"25 million jin of grain\" written on it, the irritation on his face instantly turned into sheer delight.","\"So you're the one who wants to become houseplant lady—thank you for coming! I'll arrange a carriage right away and personally escort you to the granary.\"","Nice, they even got a carriage ride out of it.","The ten of them boarded the mutant beast carriage, which maintained a speed of about 50 kilometers per hour even inside the city. In less than ten minutes, they arrived at the granary entrance.","Before they even saw the granary administrator, Chu Fu spotted a tall, upright figure standing at the gate.","The person was wearing a full set of dark-gold tier assassin gear. His black hood was pulled back, revealing a handsome face. The curved blade in his hand was wreathed in emerald-green flames, and above his head floated a row of ID text.","【My Little Sister Is Unbeatably Cute Throughout the Universe】","Game IDs were limited to 10 characters at most.","Chu Fu naturally knew her brother's actual ID wasn't that.","He'd modified it with a Disguiser Mask!","This sis-con!","\"Bro!\" Chu Fu waved.","Chu Feng's distant, listless eyes finally gathered light, focusing on the direction of the voice.","Seeing Chu Fu in her full game outfit, Chu Feng immediately pulled up the game's built-in screenshot function and snapped photo after photo.","A purple mushroom skirt, a mushroom hat!","His little sister was so adorable.","This counted as a commemorative outfit, though the gear he'd crafted for her was naturally much better.","Just thinking about the equipment his sister was about to wear, the look of delight spreading across Chu Feng's face filled him with pure satisfaction.","\"Fufu!\"","Chu Feng quickened his pace, as if about to offer a supporting hand, but when he saw Chu Fu come bouncing toward him, he slowed back down.","His little sister was powerful in this game.","Once she hit level 30 and synchronized her in-game strength, she'd only become more formidable.","Then, his gaze shifted to the others.","\"Big shot!\" Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao was the first to greet him.","\"Chu Feng-ge!\" Shen Chi called out obediently.","Even Xie Lin dropped his usual rebellious air and followed suit with a \"Chu Feng-ge!\"","This was their first time seeing Chu Feng in-game, and the impression was completely different!","Even though he was keeping his power restrained, everyone could feel how strong this man was.","It was a gap perceivable purely through their attributes.","\"Mm. Since this is everyone's first time meeting me in-game, let me give you all something.\"","Chu Feng pulled out some items and handed them out one by one.","What he gave Shen Chi was a dark-gold tier mechanical core—exactly what Shen Chi needed.","\"Th-this... this is too precious!\" A dark-gold material was worth hundreds of coins. Was he just handing out a hundred million like that?","\"Just some materials I got from grinding and had no use for,\" Chu Feng said indifferently.","Then he gave Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao a skill book.","The skill book was none other than 【Absolute Defense】","\"Ah!!! Thank you, big shot! Thank you, Chu Feng-ge!\" Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao accepted it joyfully.","Next, he gave Xie Lin a black eyepatch.","\"Dragon leather craftsmanship, dark-gold tier!\"","And it was for a special equipment slot.","\"Thanks, bro! Bro, are you tired? Bro, do you want some water?\" Xie Lin immediately started acting like an eager lackey.","The eyepatch was clearly custom-made. Even though it was also a facial equipment piece, the Disguiser Mask functioned like a human-skin mask, so it didn't conflict with the eyepatch.","Chu Feng then gave Suture Saint a set of dark-gold tier bone needles.","\"Dragon Bone Needles!\"","\"Thank you, big shot! Thank you, big shot!\" Suture Saint was older than Chu Feng, so she felt awkward calling him \"ge,\" but she truly sensed how formidable he was.","Chu Feng gave a light \"Mm\" and continued handing out gifts.","\"Shafu Liangu, is it? You might find this useful.\"","With that, Chu Feng actually pulled out a large cauldron.","【Gu-Refining Cauldron (Dark-Gold Tier)】","Shafu Liangu was stunned.","She got one too?","\"Uh, big shot, I... this is too valuable, I can't accept it. Why don't I pay for it? It's just that I don't have that much money on me right now. Could I save up and pay plant girl later?\"","The main thing was that the cauldron's stats were perfect—it suited her gu master class incredibly well.","Chu Feng said calmly, \"You all play together with my little sister, so of course I won't treat you poorly. If you really feel guilty, just do more for the Thorn Guild—consider it helping my sister.\"","Chu Fu naturally knew her brother was filthy rich.","\"Sister Liangu, take it!\"","After that, everyone else received gifts too.","Chu Feng gave Zhimengzhe a pair of dragon eyeballs to mount into her dolls' eyes, granting the dolls draconic prestige.","He gave Wu Yingchun a dark-gold tier sword.","Finally, it was Wu Family's youngest junior sister's turn.","\"This book isn't a gift. You'll need to sign a long-term contract with the Thorn Guild. After all, this book will be incredibly valuable for the next two years. Even for learning from an NPC, it costs... 10,000 gold coins!\"","Chu Feng revealed the book's title.","【Soul Return Art】","Without a doubt.","It was a resurrection skill!","The skill was far too precious.","For a moment, Wu Family's youngest junior sister nearly dropped to her knees before Chu Feng.","Thankfully, she wasn't that dramatic. But at that instant, the look in her eyes was so determined she might as well have sworn herself as a Chu family death-sworn loyalist.","\"Big shot, don't worry. From today on, I live as a member of the Thorn Guild, and I'll die as a member of the Thorn Guild.\"","Chu Feng nodded, pulled out a scroll, unfurled it, and handed it to her.","It was the contract Chu Feng had already written out.","Wu Family's youngest junior sister signed it without a moment's hesitation.","All the gifts were handed out.","Chu Fu grabbed Chu Feng's arm, shook it, and let her whole body dangle from it.","\"And me? Me? Me?\" Chu Fu stood on her tiptoes.","\"Of course I wouldn't forget Fufu.\" Chu Feng smiled.","He didn't take the items out one by one. Instead, he sent her a trade request.","The trade window allowed for private transactions—after completion, the items would go straight into her bag, invisible to anyone else.","Then, Chu Fu saw a whole row of equipment radiating dark-gold light, with a strange iridescent black sheen flickering across them.","【You have received:","Poison Dragon Leather Little Top Hat (Dark-Gold Tier)","Poison Dragon Leather Bubble Skirt (Dark-Gold Tier)","Poison Dragon Leather Gloves (Dark-Gold Tier)","Poison Dragon Leather Bracers (Dark-Gold Tier)","Poison Dragon Leather Belt (Dark-Gold Tier)","Poison Dragon Leather Leggings (Dark-Gold Tier)","Poison Dragon Leather Boots (Dark-Gold Tier)","Poison Dragon Demon Wings (Dark-Gold Tier) Poison Dragon Eight-Piece Set 8/8","Poison Dragon Crystal Core Necklace (Dark-Gold Tier)","Dragon Bone Bracelet · Left (Dark-Gold Tier)","Dragon Bone Bracelet · Right (Dark-Gold Tier)","Reverse Scale Ring (Dark-Gold Tier)","Soul-Thief Ring (Plain)】","【Soul-Thief Ring (Plain): Trait: Upon killing a boss, steals the boss's soul power to increase magical attack, spirit attributes, and mana.】","A growth-type equipment!","\"Ah, my dear, dear brother. How can such an amazing brother exist in this world? You're simply magnificent!\"","The corners of Chu Feng's mouth were harder to keep down than an AK-47.","Go ahead, try it on!"]},{"number":131,"title":"Chapter 131: Can a Grown Plant Man Fight Against Execution Star","paragraphs":["Chu Fu immediately chose to equip everything.","A small round bowler hat appeared atop her head, its black leather texture rich and refined, complete with a bow tied at the front.","Below her neck hung a gemstone necklace the size of an egg, radiating dazzling brilliance.","The upper part of the dress featured a high collar and puff sleeves, while the skirt billowed in layers like a beautiful cake, flowing past her knees.","Beneath the skirt were leggings made of dragon scales, greatly increasing her defense.","The waist area was arranged with finely layered dragon scales, significantly boosting the equipment’s defensive power and adding a touch of sharpness.","It was paired with a matching belt, and at the buckle position sat a ferocious dragon head.","The gloves were also dark green, complemented by bone bracelets brimming with oppressive aura and wrist guards inlaid with dragon scales.","On her feet were a pair of dragon-leather martin boots, securely protecting her calves and leaving only her flexible knees exposed.","The most distinctive piece, however, was a pair of dragon-wing attachments.","The wings actually occupied the position of a cloak, and when spread open, they made Chu Fu untouchable, with an overwhelming ferocity radiating from her presence.","In the game, rare equipment represented power and uniqueness.","Of course, Chu Fu also kept some of her own accessories—her forehead ornament and earrings.","But paired with the dragonhide set, they seemed to blend together perfectly.","\"Wow!!!\"","Bitter Melon King immediately let out an exclamation.","\"Oh my god, so beautiful, so cool, she looks like a top-tier player.\"","\"Hahaha, Chu Fu, you’ve become the Evil Dragon Princess!\" Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao added.","\"Gorgeous!\" Shen Chi’s eyes were soft, with no hint of insincerity in his compliment.","Xie Lin quietly removed his eyepatch.","Chu Feng also looked on with admiration, snapping photos with his camera.","\"This is the design I personally provided—I designed this!\"","That master-level tailor had been extremely reluctant to turn a dragonhide into a puffy skirt.","In her eyes, it was a shameless waste.","She thought it should have been made into a mage robe, like a burlap sack, just something to slip on and go.","Chu Feng flatly refused.","His little sister had been beautiful since childhood, with many, many princess dresses that their parents had bought for her. After lying in a coma for three years, Chu Feng was determined to make up for every dress Chu Fu had missed.","\"Cute, though the color is a bit dark. Next time, I’ll look for a poisonous dragon with colorful scales.\"","\"Brother, you actually killed a dragon! What level was that dragon?\"","In fact, Chu Fu knew that Dragonfall was a feature from the late-game version.","Dragons were usually level 60, each one a world boss, and they rarely respawned—fewer and fewer existed with each kill.","Chu Feng said, \"A level 45 juvenile dragon—lucky to run into it!\"","The higher the level, the greater the gap in stats.","Her brother had killed a boss 10 levels above him—that was truly impressive.","Moreover, crafting this entire set was nowhere near as casual as Chu Feng made it sound.","At the very least, getting a master-level tailor to work on it required raising favorability and spending a fortune on materials.","If a common dark-gold equipment piece was worth around 500 gold, this entire set would cost 6,000 gold!","Not to mention the [Soul-Stealing Ring].","Growth-type equipment was legendary, just like her own [Slightly Poisonous Staff].","\"Fu Fu, do you like it?\"","\"Of course!\" Chu Fu said loudly. \"This set can carry me all the way to level 40. And once I outgrow it, I’ll keep it as a collector’s item—I would never sell it!\"","This was something Chu Feng had worked so hard to create.","Naturally, he was delighted.","If Chu Fu was happy, he was happy.","\"I also have some seeds I gathered—take them all. I still have things to do. Once you all reach level 20 and can use the city teleportation arrays, we’ll hunt bosses together and level up!\"","\"Alright, brother, go do your thing! Don’t worry about us—we can level fast on our own, too! By the time we catch up to your level, maybe we’ll even be leveling faster than you!\"","Chu Fu spoke the truth.","After all, Chu Feng was a class based around assassination.","When it came to grinding mobs, he really wasn’t as fast as Chu Fu, who was magical.","But he could teleport to other cities and snatch bosses. His current levels all came from stealing boss kills.","Her brother’s reputation for being ruthless had already spread across the entire game.","If she fought alongside him and their skills were exposed in front of others, there would be risks.","Of course, Chu Fu also had a notorious reputation, and she hadn’t even tried to hide it.","They really were family!","Chu Feng knew that Chu Fu’s little team was quite capable. Reassured, he took his leave.","Once he was out of Chu Fu’s sight, Chu Feng summoned a cloak, draping it over his entire equipment set, while the ID above his head changed to something new.","ID: Lu Xing.","Current world ranking: No. 1.","Linjiang City ranking: No. 1.","Level: 35","...","\"Come on, let’s go finish the quest!\"","Chu Fu waved her hand and led the group to the granary administrator.","The man had been staring at them for a while.","Why were the awakened ones just chatting among themselves without turning in the quest?","It was driving him crazy.","Finally, Chu Fu came over.","After a brief exchange, Chu Fu handed over bags of rice totaling 25 million jin.","\"Thank you to this wood-element awakened one for delivering the grain. The quality is excellent, and the timing couldn’t be more perfect. On behalf of Linjiang City, I thank you all for your aid.\"","Then, a system reward notification sounded in everyone’s ears.","Chu Fu was enveloped in white light.","She reached level 18!","Level 20 was just around the corner.","\"Let’s go hit the auction house and sweep up some deals. In half an hour, we set out—we still have three more cities to visit, and time is tight.\"","Chu Fu summoned the task mount Shi Dacang had given her: a copper-hide rhino.","The iron-hide rhino was stored in a beast pouch; clicking the beast pouch in her inventory automatically summoned it.","Chu Fu and her group of ten climbed onto the iron-hide rhino, rumbling off toward the auction house.","The Hengtong Auction House was connected world-wide, said to utilize spatial technology to link auction houses in every city.","At present, servers [001] through [9999] in district 1 were hitting their level 30 peak. With around 100 level-30 players per server, that meant a million players in total.","Gold-tier equipment options were almost dazzling to the eye.","And as more level-30 players appeared, more people were cashing out their power.","What used to be a secret was now, inevitably, no longer one.","While Chu Fu was flipping goods at the auction house and grinding dungeons—","on the 8888 server forums—","a flood of shocking posts appeared.","The forum had a main section and sections for each server. The 8888 section represented Linjiang City, covering five towns and 43 newbie villages, with over 600,000 real registered players.","Thousands of posts were made daily, with an active-player count that was nothing short of terrifying.","What’s more, server 8888 was home to the world’s number one assassin, Lu Xing, drawing players from other servers to come and argue.","They studied his talent, even hurling accusations that Lu Xing must be cheating.","And on top of that, the very first village-defense war live stream had been broadcast here.","Some people were even fiercely debating whether one of the grown ones, if they became a plant, could actually take on Lu Xing in a fight."]},{"number":132,"title":"Chapter 132: A Blood Feud That Ends Only in Death","paragraphs":["Today's posts were also quite exciting.","[Three members of the Thorn Guild in Zone 030 sweep through the Universal Guild.]","[Boycott the lawbreaker — the young master who became a guild leader finally gets what he deserves.]","[Breaking news!!! The blood feud between Thorn Guild's top brass and Universal Guild!]","Then, an old piece of news hidden for three years was completely dragged into the light.","A legal incident with zero attention three years ago — extremely vicious — finally erupted on the forum, setting the gaming forum ablaze.","\"Oh my god, there's actually a scandal this big! No wonder! Who would've thought that in Lin Haowan's interview, the 'plant person' was just a frail little girl who admitted she was actually a coma patient. Back then I even thought the game was amazing for being able to wake up a coma patient, but I never imagined that the coma patient became a coma patient because of this — and lost both her parents in the process.\"","\"If it were me, I'd take revenge too. Why shouldn't I? The law forcing the culprit to pay compensation is just what that murderer deserves, but the law can't make the victim let go of their hatred!\"","\"A blood feud, to the bitter end!\"","\"Support the coma patient, support the Thorn Guild!\"","\"The Universal Guild is public enemy number one.\"","\"Is that Lulu woman also involved? The video is out — so you're all in the same boat.\"","\"Lin Haowan's credibility in exposing capitalists keeps rising higher and higher.\"","\"What? You're still working for Rong Xun or the Universal Studio? Do you have no conscience at all? I'm cutting ties with anyone who joins either studio — I'm afraid the money you earn will one day become the luxury car that slams into me.\"","As the discussion continued to grow,","For a time, IDs carrying the word \"Universal\" became cyber records of shame.","Inside the Wantu Real Estate building, several floors belonging to the newly developed Universal Studio gleamed with lights.","The entire studio had fallen into chaos.","Guguan Town, as the headquarters of Universal Studio, had been sacked today — Feng Huimin had defected, and Wan Runian was hospitalised.","The person now in charge of Universal Studio's operations was Universal Caesar.","But what was driving Universal Caesar to the brink was the flood of resignation letters.","\"Supervisor Caesar, please approve my resignation too!\" A girl with pale skin and a slightly chubby face handed in her resignation letter.","Universal Caesar was stunned.","\"Angel, you signed a contract with Universal Studio. If you leave, you'll have to pay a breach penalty of hundreds of millions!\"","The twelve-winged Holy Healing Angel in the game, whose real name was Shi Xiyue, thought to herself: Just a hundred gold coins? I can earn that quickly once I leave Universal Studio and join the Thorn Guild.","Besides, the thought of staying at Universal Studio — getting killed by the coma patient, killed by the 'who's blind?' Sacred Light, killed by someone in a wheelchair — terrified her.","She was just a nineteen-year-old girl with good talent who wanted to play games quietly and peacefully.","She wanted to be an angel of peace, healing all wounds — not a willing accomplice to wrongdoing!","\"It's fine. If they want to sue me for damages, let them. Even if they file a lawsuit, it'll take six months!\"","Not daring to linger, Holy Healing Angel added,","\"If you won't approve it, then I'll just leave on my own. Bye-bye!\"","And she fled.","Universal Caesar looked at the mess, thought about how much market value Wantu would lose by tomorrow morning, and remembered that he was still in Zone 030 with the Thorn Guild.","He gritted his teeth.","He ran too.","But just then, one person stepped up.","\"What's all the panic? Master Wan hasn't come back yet — nobody else is leaving.\"","\"You all signed contracts with addresses on them. Anyone who dares to waver right now — I'll have my brothers come and destroy you.\"","\"Those who aren't afraid of death should try me. You think I'm bluffing? One of my brothers just got locked up a few days ago — when he gets out, see if he doesn't come after you.\"","Huanyu Kuangwu roared.","When Huanyu Kuangba had gone to intimidate people in real life, Huanyu Kuangwu had missed out because he was too far away — which saved him from arrest.","Some of the brothers had been jailed.","Huanyu Kuangwu had originally been kicked out of the studio by Feng Huimin, but he shamelessly approached Wan Huanyu, and Wan Huanyu actually kept him on, replacing Huanyu Kuangba's position.","What he never knew was that he was kept solely because Wan Huanyu wanted to counterbalance Feng Huimin and build his own faction.","Huanyu Kuangwu was bad at the game, but in real life, he was a loyal attack dog that would bite.","To Huanyu Kuangwu, Wan Huanyu's favour was a debt of gratitude heavier than a mountain. In just two weeks, he had tasted a kind of life he'd never known in his thirty-plus years.","Now he had to stand up and help Master Wan.","So he called his brothers to come and suppress the Universal Studio.","Everyone left at Universal Studio were just ordinary employees — the higher-ups had already fled. And so, against all odds, Huanyu Kuangwu really did seize control.","A wild gleam appeared in his eyes.","He, too, was going to become one of the elite.","...","In the game,","Chu Fu naturally knew what was happening on the forums.","But she was also busy, and she trusted Feng Huimin to handle things.","The group headed to the auction house and quickly swept up all the golden-tier equipment.","Actually, many people knew that prices differed between cities, towns, and villages.","But the server mechanics of \"Primordial Gate\" made it difficult for players without quests to travel between towns and villages at low levels.","Not to mention the distances were far too great — without teleportation items, players would spend days on the road.","And a few days was enough to change everything.","Prices in the game changed day by day.","Just then, Feng Huimin sent a message:","\"Boss, Wan Huanyu's studio is in chaos now. Hard to squeeze much more from them. Better focus on Zone 025!\"","\"Got it!\"","Her subordinates really were too capable.","In just one night, they had gutted Universal Studio.","Still, Chu Fu and her group followed their original plan.","From Linjiang City, they flew to Muqing Town in Zone 001 to turn in their quest.","After completing it, they entered an hell-difficulty dungeon together.","Inside the dungeon, Chu Fu looked at the plant seeds her brother Chu Feng had given her.","There were over twenty kinds, all of high quality — but only two seeds could mutate and be used in battle.","【Man-Eating Flower (Gold)】: Upon mutation, its mouth enlarges and can swallow enemies, dealing massive damage.","【Golden Corn (Gold)】: Upon mutation, it can shoot corn kernels at enemies as projectiles.","Chu Fu matured both plants.","The mutated man-eating flower appeared, grew, and in the blink of an eye turned into a monstrous, nightmarish creature.","Chu Fu's eyes went wide.","She knew the man-eating flower was big.","But this was too big.","Its diameter was a full five metres.","The entire plant stood ten metres tall.","It nearly blocked the entire passageway.","Chu Fu had matured the flower, only to find that despite its gigantic body, its seeds were tiny — and on a single drop, it burst out tens of thousands of seeds.","Then, Chu Fu released the Charm Mushroom.","With the Charm Mushroom active, all monsters within 200 metres came running — and the giant man-eating flower swallowed them whole, a dozen at a time, one-shotting them all.","The damage was explosive.","Afterwards, Chu Fu tested the Golden Corn in the boss zone as well."]},{"number":133,"title":"Chapter 133: Corn Gatling, New Teammates","paragraphs":["\"Proud and Unyielding\" held the BOSS aggro while the others dealt damage normally, and Chu Fu planted the Golden Corn on the ground.","As a native product, the Golden Corn was an eye-opener for Chu Fu as well.","Because, without any mutation, this corn was already capable of increasing stats.","[Golden Corn (Gold Grade): Superb corn containing extraordinary power. Upon consumption, Constitution +1.]","Chu Fu plucked the kernels from the cob, placed them on the ground, and stimulated mutation.","The next moment, the golden corn kernels sprouted from the earth, becoming stalks of corn.","Each stalk bore a full five corn cobs, and after growing to maturity, every single one was as thick as a grown man's calf.","Whether it was the man-eating flowers or the Golden Corn, both seemed to have been affected by the Harvest Emblem, growing larger in size.","At that moment, the five Golden Corns let out a metallic clicking sound, their tips swiveling to aim at the BOSS before them.","Then, from where the corn silk should have been, bursts of mechanical gunfire erupted.","\"Rat-a-tat-tat-tat-tat!\"","Thunderous explosions rang out.","One by one, the golden corn kernels turned into golden bullets, slamming into the Goblin BOSS.","\"Whoa, Wheelchair, take it easy there! You firing a Gatling gun or what?\"","Proud and Unyielding shouted, startled out of her wits.","Standing beside the mages, Shen Chi spread his arms with an innocent expression, a new golden-grade weapon in hand.","After all, his mech was way too big now, unsuitable for cramped, low-ceiling dungeons like the nest.","So his damage output had dropped drastically, and now he was just cruising along, picking up some free EXP.","\"It ain't me, it's Plant Girl!\"","Shen Chi shot a look at the speed of the Golden Corn's bullets—who was the real mechanist here, anyway?","Chu Fu's eyes sparkled as she made the final call.","\"Wow! Not bad, not bad. This mutant plant—I'm naming it the Corn Gatling!\"","[Corn Gatling (Gold Grade):","Effect 1: Golden Corn produces 5 corn cobs each time.","Effect 2: Each corn cob contains 5,000 golden corn bullets, firing 100 bullets per second.]","The real-world Gatling gun's maximum fire rate was about 100 rounds per second as well.","But Chu Fu had five Gatling guns here.","And this was just one Corn Gatling.","What about 55 of them?","Chu Fu was starting to believe even a dragon would be blown to smithereens!","This solved her recent issue of insufficient firepower.","Of course, when she said \"insufficient firepower,\" no one else actually believed her.","But Chu Fu really did feel that Plague Spread was being countered lately.","First of all, the monsters were no longer as densely packed as during the beast tides, making infection rates lower. Players had also started using purification and antidote potions, and enemies with shields prevented her from penetrating deep.","Last time, when Lu An had entangled her, Plague Spread's effectiveness had been greatly diminished.","If that guy tried it again this time, Chu Fu would make him taste what real suppressive fire was.","27,599 bullets per second—aren't you scared now?","After that, Chu Fu steamrolled through the dungeon with overwhelming damage.","They didn't linger in Muqing Town but headed straight to Huishui Town in Sector 009.","They turned in their quests first, then ran the Hell-tier dungeon again.","At this point, their Hell-tier dungeon clear time had been compressed from one hour down to forty minutes.","It wasn't just because they killed monsters faster.","The Copper-Skin Rhino also helped—using it as a mount in the dungeon meant they could move quicker and save time.","Next up was Sector 017, Gushan Town—Wan Huanyu's home turf and the very last town on the list.","Chu Fu and her party went ahead to turn in their quests.","\"Awakened ones, thank you for escorting our food supplies. With these provisions, Gushan Town is sure to survive the crisis!\"","Chu Fu heard the system prompt:","[System Notice: \"Famine Year\" quest Phase 2 complete. Please return to Fengdu Town and report to Shi Dacang.]","\"Alright, all quests are done. You haven't cleared the dungeon in Gushan Town yet, so I've arranged three new teammates for you. Wheelchair, send them to the dungeon first!\"","The group left town and boarded the mech again, flying toward the entrance of the Goblin Nest.","From here, it was clear that both Gushan Town and the Goblin Nest were looking desolate.","The number of players had plummeted, and the Huan Yu workshop members had no motivation to log in at all anymore.","As Shen Chi's mech touched down, the few remaining players at the dungeon entrance stirred.","Some fled in panic, while others were overjoyed.","By the dungeon entrance, a young man jumped three feet in the air.","\"Queen! Bitter Melon!\"","He waved frantically.","The four-character ID floating above his head read: Dream King.","This was none other than He Huiqi, the psychokineticist who had escaped from the internet addiction school along with Chu Fu and Bitter Melon King.","He Huiqi had originally been a player on Server 016, but after being locked inside the internet addiction school and missing his leveling window, when he finally logged back in, his village was already wiped out.","He managed to escape, and afraid of provoking the Huan Yu workshop, he'd been leveling in remote backwaters ever since.","He'd actually entered the game half a month before Chu Fu, yet here he was at only level 11—truly a tale of woe.","When Chu Fu had previously gone on her killing spree in Gushan Town, she'd avoided revealing her connection with Dream King for fear that the Huan Yu workshop would target him after she left.","Now that the Huan Yu workshop had fallen apart, Chu Fu had invited Dream King to join them in the dungeon.","Not only that—there were two more familiar faces, and old enemies at that.","Lu An and Twelve-Winged Holy Healing Angel.","After Feng Huimin had unleashed her wave of public criticism, the two had quit the Huan Yu workshop and gotten successfully poached under Feng Huimin's wing.","\"Plant Master, thank you for having us. Sorry about before!\"","Lu An, being older and more mature, was candid in offering his apology.","To be honest, the apology wasn't strictly necessary—after all, they were the ones who got killed.","By comparison, Holy Healing Angel was both scared and too embarrassed to speak up.","\"S-Sorry.\" The Holy Healing Angel mumbled softly, before she couldn't help stealing a glance at Chu Fu's equipment.","That sheen, that material.","Hang on, that looked like Dark Gold–grade gear!","At that thought, the Holy Healing Angel wept inside.","Her full set of gold equipment had been taken away, and when she met the Plant girl again half a day later, the girl had upgraded to a fresh little dress.","Waaaah, when was she ever going to get her gold set back?","Chu Fu, for her part, didn't mind the Holy Healing Angel's attitude at all. Instead, she spoke lightly, diffusing the awkwardness.","\"We were on opposite sides, that's all. No need to apologize. I did kill both of you, after all!\"","Who'd dwell on a couple of minor annoyances caused by people they'd already beaten?","Besides, talent like theirs—of course Chu Fu would want to recruit them.","\"Perfect—the three of you make up the classic tank, DPS, healer trinity.","Every so often, we'll come to this server and take you along for Hell-tier dungeons.","In your spare time, you should do Nightmare-tier runs, and try not to clash with the Huan Yu workshop.","Once your gear is up and you've found some players you trust, you can form your own squad.","You three are now the designated managers for the Thorn Guild's branch in Sector 017!","But you need to get your levels up ASAP. Once you hit level 20, I'll save you fixed spots on the main team!\""]},{"number":134,"title":"Chapter 134: The Original Generation's Strongest, Wang Rongxun Bows in Apology (1000 Five-Star Reviews Bonus Update)","paragraphs":["Dungeons level 20 and above can now hold up to 20 players at maximum capacity.","These three naturally wanted to join the strongest team and secure the stat point reward for first place on the dungeon speed-clear leaderboards.","\"For now, go run some dungeons!\"","However, the three of them had very poor equipment, since the Huangyu Guild had already been stripped clean.","Chu Fu provided some silver-tier gear, but golden gear was out of the question—there wasn't that level of trust yet.","Let them earn it themselves.","Chu Fu, Shen Chi, and Xie Lin left the party, allowing Dream King, Holy Healing Angel, and Lu An to join.","\"Wahhh, finally found a group! I never got a chance to run dungeons before!\"","Dream King cried out in complaint.","Holy Healing Angel gripped her newly acquired silver staff, sizing up the two healers in the party—Suture Saint and Little Sister Wu—thinking to herself that her talent was definitely stronger than theirs. She would put on a good show later and make them feel inferior.","Meanwhile, Lu An felt immense pressure upon seeing Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao decked out in full golden gear.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao teased: \"This time, without those three freaks—especially without Plant Girl—you guys better seize the opportunity!\"","The others naturally nodded in agreement.","Before, with those three around, the monsters were dead before anyone else could even deal damage.","So it wasn't that their contribution was too low—it was that they never got the chance!","Now, it was their time to shine.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao mounted her Bronze-Hide Rhino, glancing back at the three newcomers.","\"Try to keep up back there!\"","With that, seven people rode Bronze-Hide Rhinos, charging straight ahead.","\"Green-skinned freaks, I'll smash your skulls in!\" Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao taunted.","She taunted while running.","Lu An's face changed.","\"What is she doing?\"","In his experience, pulling more than five mobs in the Hell difficulty dungeon risked a team wipe, yet Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao was kiting a whole horde of them.","\"So this is what they call 'train pulling.' I heard Bitter Melon King mention it in the group chat.","Come on, we can't fall behind!","Don't resist—I'll carry you all the way!\"","Dream King said, unleashing his psychokinesis with a burst, and instantly, the three of them floated off the ground.","\"My speed exceeds a bullet!\"","After a burst of psychokinetic delusion, the three shot forward like arrows from a bow, catching up to the front-runners.","Lu An and Holy Healing Angel were dumbfounded. Back in Guguan Town, they had never encountered players this powerful.","The other party was likely hiding from the Huangyu Studio all along—clearly, Huangyu had long earned its notorious reputation.","The group dragged a massive train of monsters behind them, not stopping until they reached the entrance to the first BOSS room, where Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao shouted:","\"Absolute Defense!\"","Instantly, the monsters' attacks on her went from being a nuisance to being completely unable to break her defense.","The DPS started their assault.","\"A healer who doesn't want to be DPS isn't a real healer. I'm reclassing into damage—Thousand Needles, Ten Thousand Holes!\"","Suture Saint unleashed her skill, and behind her appeared a dense cluster of hands, casting Thousand Needles, Ten Thousand Holes twelve additional times.","The mobs turned into puppets on strings, pierced through by countless needles.","Everyone else watching just felt how ridiculously overpowered this was.","\"So this is the strength of the founding members? Even a healer's damage is this high?\"","Dream King said, a bit dramatically.","He believed the founding members were Chu Fu, Shen Chi, Xie Lin, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao, and Suture Saint.","The next five would naturally be the second generation.","And himself, Lu An, and Holy Healing Angel would be the third generation.","The first generation was naturally the strongest, with each generation growing weaker.","When the BOSS fight came, everyone seemed to compete with one another, pulling out all the stops.","Bitter Melon King's agony attacks, Shafu Liangu's insect self-detonation, Zhimengzhe's enlarged puppets, and Grandma Wu Yingchun's infinite combo chain.","Even Little Sister Wu, as a witch doctor, brought incredibly powerful buffs with her prayer and weaken spells.","The three newcomers were completely carried.","Holy Healing Angel and Lu An especially—","They had farmed this dungeon before, dying over and over every day. One small mistake could lead to a full wipe. They'd spend about four hours a day grinding through it.","But now, the output of this team was absolutely insane!","It only took one hour to clear the dungeon.","Holy Healing Angel and Lu An felt like it was over too soon.","\"Everyone, step up your game! We've fallen back from our record of 40 minutes to 60 minutes again.\"","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao was still unsatisfied.","Holy Healing Angel and Lu An exchanged glances.","What kind of suffering had they endured under the Huangyu Studio before?","Switching teams really was the right call.","Not to mention, after boss kills, all gear was auctioned publicly, and wages were distributed by contribution—absolutely fair!","Back at Huangyu Studio, they had to hand over all equipment directly. Apart from what they personally needed, they got nothing else, so there was no extra income.","Now, with just one dungeon run, they'd earned over 1 gold coin each.","After the group exited the dungeon, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao and her six companions crushed their town-return scrolls and teleported back to Fengdu Town.","Holy Healing Angel felt a pang of loss.","\"Will they come back tomorrow?\"","Dungeon runs like this were too much fun—she didn't want it to end.","...","Meanwhile,","While Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao led the team into the Nightmare difficulty dungeon, Shen Chi piloted his mech and returned to Fenghe Town.","Chu Fu and the others entered the city and took out a loudspeaker.","[Server 0258888] [Who Wants to Be a Plant Girl]: \"Selling golden gear at high prices! Top-tier MT defensive equipment, best healer gear, super DPS gear! No discounts! One set for 100 gold—message me if interested!\"","Inside the dungeon.","Wang Rongxun, who was still struggling against the final BOSS, was stunned.","Didn't you guys come here just six hours ago?","Why are you back again?","And now selling golden gear?","Wang Rongxun stared at the Hell-difficulty BOSS he couldn't seem to beat, feeling completely played.","The veins on his cheeks twitched, as if he were gritting his molars.","\"Drop combat—I'm going to buy the gear!\"","He had no choice but to buy.","He'd discovered that dying too many times, even with resurrection spells, caused you to lose talent points!","And his talent was already terrible—he couldn't afford to lose more!","He crushed his town-return scroll, teleported back to the city, and found Chu Fu set up at a street stall.","Chu Fu claimed to sell full sets, but it only included six pieces: helmet, chest, pants, gloves, boots, and belt.","That worked out to about 16.6 gold per piece.","These pieces had mediocre stats and average traits, worth about 6 or 7 gold on the actual market.","Actually, Wang Rongxun was wrong.","These pieces were selling for only 3 gold in the city.","Chu Fu was selling at a fivefold markup, and Wang Rongxun had to choke it down.","Wang Rongxun forced a smile, walked up to Chu Fu and her group, and even gave a slight bow.","\"Folks, I know you have no fondness for our Rongxun Studio. That car accident years ago—my sister was at fault. But she is she, and I am me!\"","\"I can't choose my blood relatives, but I can choose who I call friends.\"","\"I'd like to make some friends here. I hope we can get along peacefully from now on.\""]},{"number":135,"title":"Chapter 135: Drain Wang Rongxun, Wang Rongxun Extorts Employees","paragraphs":["Chu Fu’s face was set tight, a faint sneer curling at the corner of her lips, her gaze as cold as if she were watching a clown perform.","“Who in their right mind would be friends with their enemy’s brother? Young Master Wang, don’t make me laugh.”","“The gear is right here—buy it or don’t. The one thing you’ve got over Wan Huanyu is that at least you didn’t try to wipe everyone out. Your external PR isn’t bad.”","And that was exactly it. This server still had other solo players.","If some big spender came out of nowhere and threw money at gear, they could clear the hell-level dungeon in no time too!","Wang Rongxun’s face twitched, a shadow of malice flashing in his eyes.","Chu Fu had hit a nerve.","He was the type to envy the capable while putting on a generous front, treating solo players with relative leniency to build himself a good name. Plenty of people actually thought he wasn’t that bad.","Some even spoke up for him.","Wang Rongxun was used to wearing masks, and even after being called out so bluntly by Chu Fu, he held it together.","“Fine, I’ll take this gear. But I have a concern—I’m worried you’ll sell us the equipment and then use my sister’s mistake as an excuse to massacre my guild’s players.”","Wang Rongxun put on a bitter smile, like a leader burdened by the weight of his people.","“My guild feeds a lot of families. We take in anyone—no high talent requirements. Every single one of them is just a working person.”","“If the guild gets destroyed, they all lose their jobs. I hope you’ll show some mercy.”","His little followers, listening to this speech, actually got teary-eyed.","They felt Wang Rongxun was so good to them.","Chu Fu sighed inwardly.","This was the smiling tiger, Wang Rongxun, through and through.","To be fair, he had a point. This wasn’t ancient times—why punish the brother for the sister’s crime? Wang Silu made her own mistakes; why should her brother bear the consequence?","Too bad he didn’t mean a word of what he said.","He was the kind who acted remorseful on the surface but would stab you in the back the moment he got the chance.","It didn’t matter. Chu Fu didn’t fear schemes. She could fight with open tactics.","“Don’t worry. We’re business people. We don’t do the ‘rob the buyer’ play.”","Wang Rongxun figured Chu Fu would want to protect the Thorns Guild’s reputation and wouldn’t stoop too low.","So he started picking through the gear, trying to haggle.","That was when Xie Lin’s megaphone announcement blared out across the server.","[Server 0258888] [Who’s Calling Who Blind]: “Thorns Guild recruiting! Seeking top talent—A-rank or above talent, base salary 100,000. S-rank talent, base salary 1,000,000. Guild provides room and board—luxury estate villas, family may move in, company allocates nearby housing with permanent usage rights.”","[Server 0258888] [Who’s Calling Who Blind]: “Sign a contract and A-rank talent gets a full set of silver gear as a bonus. S-rank talent gets a gold-tier weapon. Clear hell-level dungeons, and pay is distributed by contribution.”","Wang Rongxun’s eyes bulged like a bull’s.","Chu Fu hadn’t planned to kill him.","But this—this was digging out Wang Rongxun’s roots.","Was she planning to set up shop on Server 025?","The Thorns Guild was already notorious. She might actually poach those talents away.","Chu Fu’s eyes curved with a hint of a smile as she casually asked, “Still buying?”","“Buy!”","This time, Wang Rongxun didn’t play games. He gritted his teeth and purchased six full sets of gear.","That was about all his gold reserves could handle.","Chu Fu wasn’t disappointed.","She’d had only 600 gold in her pocket—the rest had been pulled out and sunk into Thorn Town’s construction.","She’d spent 3 gold on 60 pieces of junk-stat golden gear and 480 gold on 120 pieces of decent golden gear.","She’d sold 36 pieces so far and made a clean 1,200 gold in profit.","The remaining good gear? Chu Fu had no intention of selling it to Wang Rongxun.","Wang Rongxun took his gear and headed back into the dungeon, eager to clear it as fast as possible.","What he didn’t know was that the moment he returned, Xie Lin’s stall opened for business.","They said “recruiting.”","In reality, they were quietly selling gear on the side.","“Your talent’s not bad, but talent has its limits, you know? With some hard work, you might have a shot at joining the Thorns Guild someday. In the meantime, I can sell you a piece of golden gear at half price—just 15 gold. The stats are solid.”","“We sold to Rongxun Workshop at 33 gold a piece, in case you were wondering.”","“Your server hasn’t cleared hell-level yet—maybe won’t for days. Golden gear is pricey, but if you invest in one piece, go grab a dungeon reward, and sell it off, you’ll break even in no time. And even if not—with one golden piece, you’ll kill faster and die less. And if you die far from a priest who refuses to rez you, a resurrection scroll alone costs 100 gold.”","“You don’t want to be stuck under Rongxun Workshop forever, do you?”","The solo players exchanged glances. They were tempted.","A full set at 200 gold? No one jumped on that.","But one piece for 15 gold? They could scrape that together.","And what’s more, because Wang Rongxun had a reputation for being “reasonable,” plenty of corporate bosses played alongside him. But they hadn’t joined his workshop.","Why would they? In real life, they were big shots themselves. Wang Rongxun was just the crown prince of Shun Muyuan, not the emperor.","These men had no real conflicts with him and knew him outside the game, so playing together was fine.","Except they’d never gotten to clear the nightmare-level dungeon.","Now, finally, they had a chance.","“Alright, give me a full set!”","A full set at 90 gold—that was a far better deal for him than what Wang Rongxun had paid.","“I’ll take one piece!”","“I want this weapon.”","The small group was discreet, but the Rongxun Workshop players were everywhere. They caught on fast.","“Boss, something’s wrong. The Plant Lady is selling golden gear to the solo players. At this rate, the solos will be better equipped than we are!”","Wang Rongxun panicked.","There was no way he could let solo players outgear his workshop.","So he rushed out of the dungeon, found Xie Lin, and tried to buy gear too.","Xie Lin just packed up his stall and ignored Wang Rongxun completely.","So Wang Rongxun went back to Chu Fu.","“I only have full sets now—six pieces each, 20 sets left. This batch has better stats. I’m asking 250 gold per set.”","Wang Rongxun felt like Chu Fu was messing with him, calling him a “250” (idiot).","But 20 sets meant 5,000 gold. If he didn’t buy, the gear would flow to the solo players, and just on equipment alone, the Rongxun Workshop would lose its stranglehold.","And 5,000 gold was no joke.","Fifty billion in real-world terms.","Where was he supposed to get that kind of money?","Wang Rongxun couldn’t come up with it himself, but he had a workaround.","He issued a guild-wide decree.","“Every player, hand over all your personal funds. You’ll get a 5% kickback.”","That rule was... something else.","Technically, under the guild contract, any funds players earned while playing belonged to the workshop. It was like an employee who made the company fifty million—he’d get a year-end bonus of maybe 250,000.","But the company’s money belonged to the company. The employee didn’t touch it.","This, though? This was asking employees to dig into their own pockets.","What was this—paying to work?"]},{"number":136,"title":"Chapter 136: Scour Wang Rongxun Completely, the Flower Family Mandates Nationwide Gaming Time","paragraphs":["Inside the Glory Guild, quite a few players were unhappy.","“Guild leader, we usually team up to fight monsters and level up, and every copper coin we get from drops has already been handed over to the workshop.","We also clock in 8 hours a day for our shifts, and the rest of the time belongs to us.","I love playing this game, but I’m not about to work overtime for free in-game!","I can’t pay this money.”","When one person dared to speak up, countless others followed.","With no other choice, Wang Rongxun gritted his teeth and said, “Then we’ll crowdfund it. It’s just that I’m short on funds right now. I’ll give you all a rebate in a few days, also 5%—hand over 100 gold coins, get 5% back. Hurry.”","This time, the crowd wasn’t as opposed.","Soon, 5,000 gold coins were exchanged and traded to Chu Fu for 20 sets of equipment.","After the trade was done, Xie Lin pulled out his loudspeaker again and started recruiting people.","He wasn’t really recruiting—he was just hawking equipment.","Wang Rongxun had no choice but to crowdfund another 2,000 gold coins.","This time, he didn’t go buy the equipment himself. Instead, he sent several trusted non-core players to purchase all the equipment from Shen Chi and Xie Lin in batches.","Xie Lin normally never spent money, but his income was steady. He had 400 gold coins in hand and bought 100 pieces of golden equipment.","Shen Chi, on the other hand, was a big spender—a bottomless pit. Fortunately, he’d gotten money from Wan Huanyu and scraped together 200 gold coins. As for Wan Huanyu’s batch of equipment, they still hadn’t split the profit.","So he exchanged for 50 pieces of golden equipment.","They sold everything at more than triple the markup.","In the end, both batches were fully cleared.","Xie Lin sold 1,500 gold; Shen Chi sold 750 gold.","The three of them didn’t pool their funds together, but having Chu Fu drive up the price to screw Wang Rongxun over was something they’d agreed on beforehand. After all, the quest had been discovered by her, so wasn’t it only fair she earned the most?","Meanwhile, Jiao Jiao and the others who had bought golden equipment planned to bring theirs back and sell them to the players of Fengdu Town.","After all, the players of Fengdu Town had developed well and genuinely had money in hand.","As soon as Jiao Jiao’s group returned to Fengdu Town and let word out that they had golden equipment for sale, players swarmed in like crazy—they were practically rioting to buy.","Jiao Jiao invested 800 gold coins and ended up with 1,500 in her bag.","Suture Saint invested 400 and saw it double to 800.","Shafu Liangu and Zhimengzhe each had 200 gold coins earned recently and poured it all in—now it had doubled.","Wu Yingchun and Little Sister Wu together scraped up 100 gold coins and got 200 back. That money meant at least one more trip to Linjiang City to swap for a full set of golden equipment.","As for Bitter Melon King, he counted the 40 gold coins in his bag and beamed with joy.","Following the big shots meant both raising your strength and making money. This was practically an act of re-creation.","Inside Fenghe Town.","Chu Fu and the others had finished selling the golden equipment and returned to Fengdu Town.","The group gathered at the entrance of the granary and found Shi Dacang.","“I’ve received the carrier pigeon message. You’ve completed the task very quickly. You won’t be short on the rewards you’re owed.”","[System Notice: Famine Year, Phase Two — Complete!]","Soon, everyone received their due rewards.","The original quest item, the Copper-Hide Rhinoceros, transformed into a personal mount, along with a large amount of experience and 800 silver coins.","As for Chu Fu, she triggered a new quest.","Shi Dacang said, “Although the famine has been eased for a month, the goblins are still constantly threatening us, and the townsfolk remain restless.","Who wants to be a plant person? Oh great wood-element awakener, if possible, could you open a shop here in Fengdu Town that exclusively sells spirit rice? That way, the food supply for the whole town is guaranteed.","However, opening a shop requires a 1,000-gold-coin deposit, so, you see...”","Shi Dacang looked quite embarrassed.","He was the one asking for a favor, yet he was also demanding that Chu Fu pay.","But Chu Fu was completely overwhelmed by surprise.","So this was where you got the quest to buy a shop?","Shops in town weren’t something players could just buy whenever they wanted. Not only did they require reputation, they also needed town contribution points and good favor with the residents.","So it wasn’t like whoever rushed to the city or town first could just buy one from an NPC. Even Chu Feng hadn’t managed to get an advantage that way.","This required a large number of exploration quests, and the reward would only show up later in the quest chain. In the early stages, you had no way of knowing what the end result would be.","[System Notice: Do you accept the epic quest: Famine Year (Final Phase)?","Quest Issuer: Shi Dacang.","Quest Content: You have escorted food to the surrounding towns and cities, temporarily easing the famine crisis, but the townsfolk remain anxious.","Open a shop to sell spirit rice and provide security for the townspeople.","However, opening the shop requires a 1,000-gold-coin deposit to purchase the storefront.","Yes / No.","Quest Completion Reward: Large amount of experience, Fengdu Town Shop Purchase Certificate.","Quest Failure Penalty: None.]","“Accept!”","“Master Shi, here are 1,000 gold coins. Consider this shop mine!”","[System Notice: Quest Complete!]","[System Notice: You have obtained the Fengdu Town Shop Purchase Certificate. Click on the certificate to select the shop address you wish to purchase—it will be finalized immediately.]","“Wait, what?! The quest rewards a shop?”","Jiao Jiao was the first to jump up.","She immediately asked the guild members who had been helping her buy rice—how many catties had they collected?","She wanted to turn in her quest and buy a shop too.","This time, Jiao Jiao would never again say the quest was just a money sink.","And Chu Fu happily used her shop purchase certificate.","For the location, without hesitation, she chose one right next to the central plaza.","The town’s teleportation array was broken right now, but once the siege war ended, it would be repaired and reconnected with Linjiang City.","And a shop right next to the teleportation array—that was prime real estate beside a train station.","The price would skyrocket. By then, even 100,000 gold coins wouldn’t be enough to grab it.","And right as Chu Fu was buying the shop and thinking about how to run it, and what to sell...","...","In the real world.","At midnight.","A breaking piece of news was published across all mainstream media in China.","“Regarding the issue that the game ‘Primal Gate’ contains supernatural energy interfering with reality, the official authorities have now effectively taken control of the situation. Please do not panic, all residents.","Starting today, all citizens over the age of 6 must play the game for 8 hours per day.","This rule is mandatory.","Community and grassroots organizations will strictly enforce the minimum playtime requirement.","The government will subsidize 1,000 RMB and distribute gaming helmets free of charge. In-game characters with an S-tier talent automatically qualify for official government benefits.","Players above level 30 are required to register with the relevant authorities.","Violators will be treated as criminals.”","The whole internet exploded.","So now, not gaming was a crime?","Most importantly, the fact that power from the game could be brought into the real world could no longer be hidden."]},{"number":137,"title":"Chapter 137: Gold Prices Soar, Wang Rongxun Owes 140 Billion in Debt","paragraphs":["It could be said that as players grew stronger, starting from the first player to reach level 30, there was a trend of exponential growth thereafter.","At present, the number of level 30 players in one major server region.","There are at least 10 people.","Across servers 1-9999, that amounts to one hundred thousand people.","More and more people came to know that reaching level 30 allowed one to enhance their abilities in the real world.","But they all kept their mouths shut.","Why?","Because of the gold price!","Suppose nobody talked about it, and the gold price remained at the current rate of 1 gold coin: 1 million Huaxia Coins. Then these early adopters would keep pouring real-world money into the game.","Some sold their houses, some even took out loans or borrowed from loan sharks.","Franticly purchasing gold coins in the game.","But when the number of people reaching level 30 grows, secrets are bound to leak. Especially since the rate at which level 30 players were appearing was too fast.","From the first player to reach level 30, Lu Xing, to the current 100,000 level 30 players worldwide, it only took three short days.","The authorities used big data to continuously extrapolate, and eventually came to the conclusion that it could no longer be concealed.","Better to guide than to block!","So they decided to announce it ahead of schedule.","Let all players across the nation dive fully into the game.","Of course, they also had to limit the destructive potential of level 30 players in society and prevent criminal behavior.","So after the declaration from Huaxia Nation was released.","Each region had its own plans as well.","In Linjiang City, starting from the early hours, officials were broadcasting an interview across various websites and push notifications.","The first batch of star-level players had officially appeared.","Apart from Lu Xing, who had yet to be discovered in Linjiang City, the publicly recognized number one was the Lich King of Zone 009: Laoji Fuli.","\"Hello everyone, this is Linjiang City Television. Today, we are interviewing a lieutenant general of Huaxia Nation, Mr. Ji Weimin!","Mr. Ji Weimin was born in the 1930s, now 92 years old. He enlisted at the age of 12, and lived through the founding war and numerous major battles, earning merits time and time again.","Mr. Ji, what ability have you extracted so far? And what kind of impact can it have on the real world?\"","Laoji Fuli looked even more like a zombie than when Suture Saint had last seen him, but he was no longer a frail old man on the verge of death.","Instead, he was like a final boss who could leap up and wipe out an entire clan.","Although his skin was aged and spotted with liver spots, his movements were extremely agile, and his fingers were jet black.","Only his eyes betrayed no malice, but rather, a kind of determination.","His teeth had also fully grown back, and he no longer spoke with a lisp, though his voice was hoarse, like howling gales.","\"I extracted a passive ability called Soul Communication. I can see all souls, converse with them, and learn the cause of their deaths.","So, my power can help fight crime and greatly increase the resolution rate of criminal investigations.\"","These words were a warning to those who were ready to run amok while the nation was in turmoil.","While the real world was shaken, the game also experienced frantic changes.","First of all, the price of copper coins skyrocketed.","The original 1:1 sale of copper coins was met with frenzied buying, and the price shot up steadily.","The price of 1 copper coin surged from 1 Huaxia Coin to 10 Huaxia Coins, and even crept toward 20!","Because all players became aware of the crisis.","\"Real-world money isn't worth as much anymore. Gold coins in the game are what really hold value. These coins can be exchanged for real abilities!\"","\"Buy, buy now!\"","\"Isn't anyone afraid? The monsters in the game will also come to the real world. Are we heading for the apocalypse?\"","\"That's exactly why we need to level up fast. If you don't reach level 30, you'll be sitting there defenseless when they come!\"","\"It's unfair! I just awakened a D-rank talent. Are those with S-rank talents going to become the new elite?\"","\"I used to wonder why all those big corporations and conglomerates were dumping money into the game. Turns out they were all trying to shift their assets!\"","What they didn't know, however, was that the big conglomerates were even more panicked.","They could already envision just how badly the stock market would crash, and how many companies would be delisted or go bankrupt.","The surge in copper coin prices inside the game meant, for ordinary people, that a cake had turned into a cookie.","A twentyfold shrinkage.","Or for those who didn't have a cake to begin with.","But for conglomerates that wanted to invest heavily in the game and offload their real-world businesses, it meant the number of coins they could buy had shrunk, the sunset industries could no longer be sold, and no one was taking over their assets.","The losses weren't just twentyfold. They could be two hundredfold! Two thousandfold!","In that pivotal moment when Huaxia Nation made the announcement, studios and conglomerates alike crumbled like snowflakes.","Fortunately, no riots broke out in the real world.","Why?","Because everyone was inside the [Primordial Gate], playing the game!","On the surface, it seemed like an economic depression — empty streets, shops closing down left and right.","In reality, an entire nation and people were plunging into the vast, boundless world of the [Primordial Gate].","...","Inside the game.","Wang Rongxun, who had just spent over 7,000 gold coins, felt his brain flooding with blood and his eyes turning bloodshot.","How much capital would he need to buy back those coins?","If this had originally been 7 billion in gold coins he'd acquired, he would now need 1,400 billion to replace them.","The problem was, Shun Muyuan's market cap was only 1,400 billion in the first place!","What now?","Should he declare bankruptcy, or keep running the business?","If he continued operating, it would be effectively paying off debts with his own earnings.","Wouldn't that just mean he's working for the entire studio?","And more importantly, would the players in the studio even agree to keep working when everyone now knows the game is invading reality?","Wang Rongxun's heart was bleeding.","He had been utterly screwed by Plantman!","...","Fengdu Town.","Chu Fu hadn't expected Huaxia Nation to announce the game's invasion at this time.","\"In the original storyline, it happens much later than this.\"","Chu Fu vaguely remembered it was about two months after the game launched.","But now, it was only day 45.","Half a month earlier.","Still, Chu Fu quickly seized the opportunity.","Cash out!","The gold price had spiked because of Huaxia Nation's announcement, but soon enough, people would realize that copper coin production in the game was rising daily, and the price would eventually be driven back down.","Moreover, the real world still required Huaxia Coins for transactions.","On this level, it was the full force of the nation that was managing and stabilizing things!","Fortunately, after leaving the newbie village, exchanging game currency for real money was done with the players within the five towns.","Not only that, a new old server had merged in today: server [032] Leigu Town, which combined zones 031-034.","The six towns surrounding Linjiang City now had around 220,000 players in total.","Even if each player bought just 33 silver coins, it would be enough to wipe out Chu Fu's gold reserves.","The moment she listed her gold for sale.","It was instantly cleared.","Chu Fu netted 144.2 billion Huaxia Coins.","The money to build a town was earned in just three days!","Special thanks to Mr. Wang Rongxun for his generous sponsorship."]},{"number":138,"title":"Chapter 138: The Great Benefactor Badge, Slayer of Ten Thousand Realms, is the Dream King.","paragraphs":["The future Thorn Capital, according to the Urban Construction Bureau's plan, would require an investment of around 200 billion yuan.","Previously, Chu Fu had already withdrawn 60 billion, and with the new funds just received, her capital reserves were terrifyingly abundant.","Moreover, Chu Fu handed all this money to Feng Huimin, demanding only that she complete the entire construction of Thorn Capital within four months.","Chu Fu was happy to play the absentee boss.","In the game, gold prices were skyrocketing, and Chu Fu also advised everyone to sell off their unused game currency first and buy it back later.","\"Once people calm down and more players flood in, the game currency price is bound to drop!\"","Money-Scattering Girl said helplessly: \"I'd love to sell, but I can't even get enough for myself!\"","She was the Money-Scattering Girl, after all.","She simply couldn't hold back her spending.","Fortunately, she had a big reputation, and many people loved selling things to her.","This time with the rice, it was the same story.","She quickly bought up 50 million jin in one go.","She rushed to Shi Dacang to accept the quest, then showed off the reward to the guild members.","[Great Philanthropist Badge (Gold):","Defense +100","All Stats +10.","Traits:","1: NPC affinity +50%","2: Light of Salvation — When activated, reduces incoming damage by 20% and emits a rainbow-like radiance that restores health to self and nearby players. While the Light of Salvation is active, it continuously drains money from your backpack. As long as your backpack's funds don't hit zero, the Light will persist. Can be manually deactivated.]","The badge's second skill instantly turned Money-Scattering Girl into both a tough tank and a team healer.","\"I got the grain escort quest! Haha, does this mean my shop is coming too?\"","\"Hurry, hurry, keep delivering grain!\"","Chu Fu and the others had barely set foot back in the city when the second wave of deliveries, hell-mode dungeons on other servers, and killing other servers' world bosses began.","They were also doing buy-low-sell-high trading on the side.","However, Chu Fu's pockets were empty, so she didn't plan on buying anything else. She'd wait until noon when the spirit rice harvest came in.","The group hopped back into Shen Chi's mech and made another lap around the map. When they reached Guguan Town, they split into two teams, taking Dream King, Lu An, and Holy Healing Angel along for dungeon runs.","That was when these newcomers truly felt what it meant to be part of the founding squad.","After Chu Fu and the others left,","Dream King followed Lu An and Holy Healing Angel into another dungeon, sighing: \"Why wasn't I born in Wangxi Village! Following the Queen is the only way to eat well!\"","Holy Healing Angel, meanwhile, was full of anxiety.","\"Urgh, Wan Shao... I mean, Wan Huanyu contacted me. He said if I don't come back, he'll hunt me down at the city gates!\"","Holy Healing Angel was scared.","Dream King glanced at his own at least three pieces of gold gear and snorted coldly.","\"If he dares to come, I'll kill him!\"","Holy Healing Angel still wore a worried expression.","Sure enough, when they were about to leave the dungeon, Wan Huanyu was already waiting outside.","Wan Runian had nearly suffered a heart attack, but luckily he was rescued in time. The massive corporation still needed someone in charge.","Wan Huanyu had no choice but to return and take the helm of Wantu Property.","In truth, he had a hidden thought: now that Wantuan Property was under his control, he could move any funds he wanted and rebuild the guild studio, couldn’t he?","But when he got back, he discovered all his employees had fled.","He immediately called the police, wanting to drag them all back, but the police refused to file a case.","After all, it would have been different if they'd taken important documents or classified data.","But they'd simply stopped showing up to work.","Couldn't he just stop paying their wages?","They weren't even asking for their unpaid salaries!","Wan Huanyu gritted his teeth, rallied his remaining people, and logged into the game to exact revenge.","[Server 0178888 - Guguan Town] [Wan Huanyu]: \"I'm telling you all right now — come back right now, or I'll sue you until you're bankrupt. You think running away is enough? Those contracts you signed have non-compete clauses. Even if you left, you can't keep playing this game. Do you really think I'm made of mud?\"","[Server 0178888 - Guguan Town] [Wan Huanyu]: \"Anyone who doesn't come back — I'll hunt them down to death. Holy Healing Angel, Lu An, you two are in a dungeon, right? Let's see if you dare come out. I'm blocking the dungeon entrance right now.\"","Holy Healing Angel was on the verge of tears.","\"What do we do? He wants to kill us! Should we notify Plant Boss?\"","Dream King shouted: \"Those big shots are busy as hell. This small fry is nothing to fear. Listen to me — we walk out together. When we exit, Lu An uses Taunt, Holy Healing Angel opens the shield, and I'll handle the rest.\"","\"Deal!\" Lu An nodded immediately.","Holy Healing Angel gripped her staff nervously.","\"3, 2, 1, out!\"","The three appeared outside the dungeon.","There weren't as many people outside as expected — maybe around 200.","\"If you've got a problem, take it up with me!\"","Lu An acted first — Taunt!","Instantly, every single enemy turned their furious gaze on him.","\"Traitor, kill him!\" Wan Huanyu roared, ready to attack. He wanted to kill Lu An once, to teach him a lesson.","\"Holy Light Domain!\"","Holy Healing Angel raised her shield, and countless attacks slammed against it, but none could break through the shield's defense value.","And Holy Healing Angel could keep reinforcing the shield's durability. Before long, the barrier was thicker than a turtle shell.","Then, Dream King made his move.","\"Up you go!\"","In an instant, all two hundred people in front of him felt themselves floating, as if riding a roller coaster, shooting straight into the sky.","In the blink of an eye, they were lifted a full 50 meters high.","50 meters — as tall as a 16-story building.","This was their first time encountering such a bizarre attack, and they had zero defense against it.","\"No-Fly Zone!\"","Dream King used his psychokinesis again.","Flight was forbidden, and space teleportation was blocked as well.","Wan Huanyu began to fall from 50 meters up.","Faster and faster, faster and faster!","\"Ah!!! No!!! Space teleport! Where's my space teleport?\"","His space teleport was dead.","\"Thud!\"","\"Thud, thud, thud, thud, thud, thud, thud, thud!\"","More than 200 people — lifted into the sky, then dropped — took exactly 10 seconds.","The fall itself took only 3 seconds.","These players were grounded chickens; they'd never faced such a terrifying skill. They had zero way to defend.","And in the game, there existed a truly horrifying source of damage:","Fall Damage.","Splat!","-100,000!","Wan Huanyu hit the ground and died on the spot.","In an instant, Dream King's name above his head stained deep red.","200 people — instantly wiped out.","Lu An and Holy Healing Angel both gaped in disbelief at Dream King.","They never expected him to be this absurdly strong.","Dream King put his hands on his hips, splurged on a loudspeaker, and declared:","[Server 0178888 - Guguan Town] [Dream King]: \"The one who killed Wan Huanyu — that's me, Dream King! Whoever comes, dies!\""]},{"number":139,"title":"Chapter 139: Dream King Guards the Corpse, Fufu's General Store Opens","paragraphs":["At this moment, Wan Huanyu's mind was completely blank.","He had only one thought: a proud dragon falling into a pond is mocked by crabs.","He had actually been killed by some no-name nobody player.","Not a vegetable, not the cripple, not the lame one either.","Just an ordinary player.","Why?","Why?!","Wan Huanyu roared, ordering his subordinates to send people over to kill all three of them, and to buy a resurrection scroll to revive him at the same time.","But buying a resurrection scroll required 100 gold coins, and now the gold price had skyrocketed—100 gold coins cost 20 million credits.","Not only that, the people he could trust were all lying dead on the ground right now. The most trusted member of his guild, Huanyu Kuangwu, was still waiting for Server 48 to open. Even if he rushed into the newbie village of Server 017 and grinded to level 10 to reach the town, it would already be too late.","Wan Huanyu suddenly realized.","He was done for.","...","On the other side.","Chu Fu and the others had circled through five towns and Linjiang City, run a dungeon, auctioned off the dropped equipment and split the money, netting Chu Fu another 30 gold coins.","The gold price was soaring, but gold-tier equipment in the cities had dropped a bit more in price, because more and more players were crowding into the cities.","Chu Fu bought ten pieces of gold equipment with decent stats and returned to Fengdu Town.","Together with Jiao Jiao, she submitted the quest.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao let out a wail.","\"No way, why did I get a residential property instead of a shop?\"","She showed it to everyone.","[Permanent Residential Deed in Fengdu Town (Gold Tier)]","It was still a good item, but completely different from a shop.","Chu Fu consoled her: \"A residential property isn't bad either. Maybe it's because you didn't have the ability to supply goods, so they didn't give you a shop.","But this property is definitely inside the safe zone.","For now, all we know is that Fengdu Town is located somewhere in the Fengdu New District, but the Fengdu New District is too large—we can't be sure where it's worth investing.","Assuming that when the game invades reality and everything syncs with the real world, this house will be property registered in your own name.","A property has a 'return home' function, just like a city-return scroll or a guild recall.","This way, in the future, returning from a city to the town will only take you ten seconds.","A free fixed teleport point saves you a lot of trouble!\"","With Chu Fu's explanation, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao was comforted and broke into a smile.","Next, the others went to trigger the Great Benefactor badge quest.","Everyone needed to accept this quest, since it was an extra gold-tier badge after all.","But to everyone's surprise, Shi Dacang refused to issue the quest this time.","\"Everyone, although the town is desperately short on grain, please act within your means!\"","\"What does that mean? We can't go to the other towns anymore?\"","The group immediately communicated in the team voice chat, making sure Shi Dacang couldn't hear them.","A flash of insight struck Chu Fu.","\"When Shi Dacang said the town is still short on grain, that means the quest can still be accepted. But when he tells us to act within our means, it suggests this quest has certain trigger conditions we haven't met.\"","Without wasting a second, Chu Fu figured out the reason.","\"You guys don't have any gold coins left in your pockets, do you!\"","Everyone had sold off their gold coins on Chu Fu's advice.","\"The question now is what the required amount of gold coins is for this Great Benefactor quest. Jiao Jiao, do you remember how many gold coins you had when you first came here?\"","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao nodded: \"About five hundred gold coins.\"","\"One jin of rice costs 1 copper coin. The quest requires 50 gold coins' worth of rice—one-tenth of your funds. That seems reasonable too!\" Xie Lin said. \"No worries, we still have over ten hours until tomorrow. We can sell off all the equipment we looted from the Huanyu Guild yesterday, and that should be about enough.\"","Yesterday, they had only split up the equipment that was easy to divide, along with the gold coins Wan Huanyu had been carrying.","Those silver, bronze, and black-iron tier equipment pieces needed to be sold, and that would take some time to process.","Someone in the guild was responsible for that, and after crunching the numbers, they came up with a price of 900 gold coins.","Chu Fu, Xie Lin, and Shen Chi each got 300.","Xie Lin borrowed 300 from Shen Chi and ran over to Shi Dacang to accept the quest. Sure enough, it worked.","\"We should all accept this quest. There's no time limit—we can just complete one person's per day. But I'm worried the quest might have a limited number of times it can be accepted.\"","Everyone nodded.","They pooled their money one by one and ran over to Shi Dacang to accept the quest.","Finally, even Chu Fu went to accept it.","Shi Dacang's eyes lit up.","\"Who wants to be a vegetable? You're also here to donate rice? Awakened ones, you are far too kind!","If you donate spiritual rice, I can give you a larger dwelling as a token of appreciation!\"","So this NPC plays favorites?","But Chu Fu didn't hesitate and accepted the quest.","[System Notification: Do you accept the Epic Quest: The Great Benefactor.","Quest Giver: Shi Dacang.","Quest Content: Donate a batch of spiritual rice to help Linjiang City and the five towns get through this crisis.","Quest Completion Reward: Large amount of experience, badge reward: Great Benefactor Badge (Dark Gold Tier).]","Her Great Benefactor Badge was actually dark gold tier.","Chu Fu quickly told the others to go ask if they could also donate spiritual rice, so everyone could get a dark gold tier item.","Worst case scenario, she would just reclaim another piece of land to farm.","But Shi Dacang refused.","\"Everyone, please act within your means. Spiritual rice is very expensive, and I fear you might not be able to afford it. Even doing good deeds shouldn't bankrupt you.\"","This time, even without Chu Fu's reminder, the others understood.","\"50 million jin of spiritual rice costs 1,000 gold coins. Based on the hidden conditions we tested earlier, we'd probably need 10,000 gold coins to trigger this quest.\"","That condition was way too harsh. Even if ten people tried to pool together 10,000 gold coins, it would take maybe ten days of grinding. And right now, they couldn't buy gold coins anyway—the price was insane.","Chu Fu shrugged.","\"Maybe that's good news too. It means in the future, when we're rich, we can donate and get another dark gold badge.","But the most valuable part of this quest is that we can run the hell-difficulty dungeons in the other four towns.","At our current pace, we'll reach level 20 in just five days!\"","Chu Fu and the others' leveling speed could be described as utterly unmatched.","Since it looked like they'd hit level 20 in five days, they agreed to run the dungeon again early tomorrow morning, with two members submitting the quest at a time to stagger the completes.","Most importantly, because of the rice shortage, the entire server had been forced into farming on Fengdu Town.","Which, ironically, fit the town's name perfectly.","It was now noon.","Chu Fu led her chainsaw dandelion to harvest the spiritual rice again, accumulating a total of 55 million jin. Tomorrow she could submit the quest once more and take everyone to the hell-difficulty dungeons in the other towns.","As for the extra 500 jin, she planned to put it up for sale in her shop.","She'd spent the freshly earned 300 gold coins on renovating the shop, and the signboard had been hung up as well.","Fufu's General Store!","But selling only spiritual rice would be a waste.","In the game, having a player-run shop was an extremely rare privilege, so she had to make the most of it.","Luckily, the system didn't restrict what a shop could sell, which gave Chu Fu plenty of room to work with.","【Server 0308888 - Fengdu Town】【Who Wants to Be a Plant】: \"Fufu's Grocery Store is now officially open! We accept consignment items with only a 2% transaction fee. We also buy and sell materials, equipment, skill books, special items, and more. In addition, we offer a wide selection of delicious food that boosts your fullness meter. All players are welcome to come and pay us a visit.\""]},{"number":140,"title":"Chapter 140: Wan Huanyu's Talent Drops to S-Rank, Server 048 Launches","paragraphs":["Chu Fu's shop opening immediately solved the players' problem of not wanting to set up stalls or hawk their goods after earning profits.","Some materials wouldn't fetch a good price at NPC stores, but players actually needed them, so prices naturally skyrocketed.","Gradually, everyone came to Fufu's Sundry Shop to buy.","Not only that,","Chu Fu also hired several life-class players from the Thorn Guild to help out in the shop, paying them wages plus commission.","Besides sales staff, she also offered cooked spiritual rice products for sale.","After all, aside from NPCs, if spiritual rice was sold directly to players, they'd still have to gather firewood and roast it themselves.","That wasn't friendly to players focused purely on grinding monsters and leveling up—they didn't want to cook.","So, the spiritual rice was made into rice balls, hearty meals, and fried rice.","The aroma wafted everywhere.","It even came with advanced stats—after all, spiritual rice was a gold-tier item, yet one serving only cost 20 copper coins.","Players were more than happy to eat it.","...","In the blink of an eye, four days had passed.","Chu Fu's level had reached 20.","The others had also hit level 19—with a bit more effort, they could reach 20 too.","Meanwhile,","the Primordial Gate server had already opened up to District 48.","Right after midnight,","a wave of players spawned into the newbie village.","There were a bunch of unruly youngsters, along with a group of middle-aged and elderly players.","They all rushed outside, trying to seize the respawn spawn points for Red-Eyed Rabbits.","Among the middle-aged crowd, they chatted in their phone group as they ran.","\"Has anyone awakened flight? Otherwise how do we fight bees and boars?\"","\"Did anyone awaken as a Mechanic? Someone like Xiao Chi who can build a flight wing would also work!\"","\"Those flower-growers—did any of them turn into plant-morphs?\"","Just as the group was discussing endlessly, a crude message slammed into view.","\"Motherfcking bastards, I saw Wan Huanyu! I awakened an S-rank talent, and I'm gonna gut him right now!\"","In the newbie village,","a woman with the ID \"Eighteen Stabs\" stood there, her thick, deep eyes blazing with murderous intent.","Maybe because she was so consumed by revenge, when her nephew mentioned that a name could be a jab at herself—or reflect her real-life experiences—she chose this one.","She was Shen Chi's aunt, Xu Can.","She was the late-born child of her parents, and while the family wasn't wealthy, no one was poor either. But then her nephew got in a car accident, and the culprit not only refused to compensate or apologize, refused to pay with his life, and pulled every dirty trick in the book.","He even swindled 500,000 out of her!","Xu Can was livid.","Basically, \"Scam my feelings, fine. Scam my body, whatever—the guy even hired a top-tier male model for that. But scam my money?\"","That was absolutely not okay.","She wanted to raise hell, but it was a case of an arm twisting a thigh—she was outmatched, and besides, she wasn't the only one affected.","In the end, she swallowed her anger.","Her sister and brother-in-law eventually paid her back, but she knew deep down it was really her nephew's compensation money.","She didn't want it, but her sister cried so heartbreakingly, feeling she'd dragged her into this mess, that Xu Can finally took the money.","So after Shen Chi was paralyzed, she often bought health supplements and sent them to her sister's house.","She had never forgotten who the enemy was.","When she spotted Wan Huanyu in the crowd, she was stunned. Why the hell was he here? Was fate lending a hand?","Little did she know—","Wan Huanyu was even more frustrated than she was.","That reckless idiot called Dream King actually camped his corpse for a full 24 hours.","Not only that, but he even offered over a hundred million in real money, and Holy Healing Angel still refused to revive him.","After 24 hours, his corpse despawned.","That infuriated him to no end.","But there was nothing he could do. His character was dead, so he had to create a new one in a different district.","Previously, every server was packed to capacity, but ever since The Cosmic Guild was raided and Wing Honor Guild went bankrupt, the old districts actually saw a surge of players.","Especially Wangxi Village in District 030—it was absolutely swamped.","The newbie village there had been expanded to accommodate 50,000 new players a day.","Some people who had squeezed into the new districts even switched back to the old district 030 instead.","After all, jumping into a new district meant waiting around.","So, players who had applied for District 048 moved partway to the old district, and District 048 went from \"full\" back to \"open for applications.\"","Huanyu Kuangwu and the rest were all on that server, with at least 200 thugs total. Naturally, Wan Huanyu chose to go there.","When creating his character, he didn't dare use his old ID. He thought it over and picked a new one: Spatial Overlord.","[Name failed! Already taken!]","A simple, domineering ID like that—there was no way someone hadn't taken it already.","In the end, Wan Huanyu settled on the ID \"Cosmic Emperor.\" Maybe the character for \"cosmic\" was obscure enough that no one had claimed it.","After locking in the name, it was time for talent awakening.","What left Wan Huanyu breathless was that his talent had indeed dropped from S-rank to A-rank.","\"No, doesn't matter. There's still the fort assault battle—I can earn contribution points and upgrade my talent back to S-rank.\"","Wan Huanyu told himself.","At least his class, Spatialist, was still available.","He entered the game and soon regrouped with Huanyu Kuangwu.","The other guy had also changed his ID, going with \"Most Handsome Emperor in the Universe.\"","Did this kid not realize long names killed intimidation?","Couldn't be bothered to deal with him, Wan Huanyu led the group toward the Red-Eyed Rabbit spawn points.","Just as they were heading out of the village, a man suddenly shouted.","\"Attention all players! We are the official Linjiang City Game Anomaly Response Bureau for Primordial Gate!","To ensure comprehensive game development and a healthy gaming environment, please avoid PvP as much as possible. Strictly no verbal abuse, no mob-clearing monopolies, and no deliberately farming player kills to obtain the Golden Mask.","We hope all players cherish your game characters and coexist peacefully.\"","Wan Huanyu curled his lip with a dismissive sneer.","Who the hell listens to that?","He certainly didn't.","Because he'd joined the game early, even though he'd PK'd groups of players before, he never killed a hundred in the newbie village, so he never triggered the Werewolf Butcher mission condition, and never got the Golden Mask.","And the Spawn of the Evil God only appeared in the newbie villages.","Killing a hundred in the town didn't spawn the quest NPC.","Wan Huanyu had missed it.","This time, he was definitely going to get it.","Just as he was thinking about that, he suddenly felt a chill run down his spine, like a viper had locked onto him.","The next second, a woman appeared behind him.","\"Revenge Soul!\"","A blaze of fire erupted from Wan Huanyu's head, like a gaping, savage maw ready to swallow him whole.","[Revenge Soul: Marks a hated player as a target. Cannot switch targets for 1 day, but while marked, you deal +300% damage to them.]","Eighteen Stabs whipped out her dagger and started slashing!"]},{"number":141,"title":"Chapter 141: All Realms Achieve B-Rank Talent, Vengeful Aunt","paragraphs":["“Thunk thunk thunk!”","Three stabs in one second.","-54","-57","-49","Wan Huanyu was a mage. His base stats gave him 100 HP, plus an extra 5 points of Constitution, for a total of 150 HP.","And the person across from him dealt 160 damage.","Wan Huanyu's body collapsed. His perspective turned strange. Everything became black and white.","He was dead!","He was dead again!","This was the newbie village!","There was no resurrection ability here. Even if all 10,000 new players spent 24 hours grinding copper coins, they still couldn't accumulate 100 gold to summon the special merchant.","And besides, could the special merchant even be summoned in a newbie village?","Probably not.","Was he... going to have to delete his character again?","Meanwhile, Huanyu Kuangwu watched his big brother die right before his eyes and let out a furious roar.","“Damn it! You got a death wish? I'll take you down!”","Eighteen Stabs cursed back, “Kill one, no loss. Kill two, pure profit. You're Wan Huanyu's lackey, right? Well, you're getting stabbed.”","The Revenge Soul effect was gone, but Eighteen Stabs' other talents and class were nothing to sneeze at.","[S-rank Talent: Revenge Soul","Feature 1: Revenge Soul.","Feature 2: Limit Break: When you perform a normal attack, your attack speed surges to 3 hits per second. Speed increases with Agility.","Feature 3: Physical attack increased by 100%.]","[Hidden Class: Blood Feud Assassin","Class Feature: Your attacks have a 5% lifesteal effect. After killing a target, your HP instantly recovers to full. If your HP is already full, it converts into a “Blood Feud BUFF.” Each stack of Blood Feud increases attack power by 1%. Disappears 5 minutes after leaving combat.","Starting Skills: Blood Mist Vanishing, Bloody Backstab.]","Eighteen Stabs charged forward and stabbed Huanyu Kuangwu three times.","Not dead!","The players from Huanyu Studio started cursing up a storm as they swarmed Eighteen Stabs. But in the next moment, she transformed into a cloud of blood mist and turned invisible.","Then, she appeared behind Huanyu Kuangwu — Bloody Backstab.","Huanyu Kuangwu was dead!","That's two kills already.","After that, the remaining Huanyu Studio players fell one by one, one per second, under Eighteen Stabs' blade!","“Stop fighting! I told you all PKing is off-limits, why are you still going?!”","“What district are you from? What street? Show me your ID!”","“Oh, you're not listening, huh? I've taken screenshots. I'll have the cops come after you!”","The Shen family members rushed over to intervene.","“Comrade, this is a normal gameplay mechanic. My cousin didn't even insult anyone, so what right do you have to stop this? Besides, these two sides have a grudge. Isn't it better to settle it in-game than in real life?","And don't you know that you need 100 player kills to get the Disguise Mask? Without the Disguise Mask, how can you bring out the real experts? It's survival of the fittest here. Mind your own business!”","The moderator wanted to step in, but Eighteen Stabs was like a wolf among sheep — one kill per swing. It was absolutely terrifying.","He didn't dare go in either!","With that thought, the moderator gritted his teeth: “After you're done with this group, you can't kill anyone else, got it? Otherwise, I'll summon other moderators, and we'll risk everything to take this person down.”","“We know what we're doing. Don't just stand around — go grind monsters.”","The Shen Chi family took over the best farming spot and started hunting Red-Eyed Rabbits.","In less than two minutes, 99 of the Huanyu Studio players in front of them had been slain!","There was one left, and Eighteen Stabs held back.","If she killed the 100th person now, Werewolf Tuge would spawn — and she wasn't ready to fight that yet.","As for the Huanyu Studio players, they were terrified out of their minds. Seeing that Eighteen Stabs had stopped chasing, they all breathed sighs of relief.","Meanwhile, the Shen family members had already secured the one-shot kill spot. They formed teams of five, and family groups stuck together, each finding their own mobs to farm.","At the same time, they communicated in the group chat.","“No flying ability, but I do have stealth. Can Can, are you going?”","“Bet on it. If I die, I'll head to Wangxi Village and help my nephew run the guild.”","“No problem.”","Then, one copper coin here, another copper coin there, they pooled enough to buy explosives from the general goods merchant.","Eighteen Stabs bought the bombs and dove into the wilderness.","Relying on her agile movements, she finally located the hornets' nest.","She pulled out the explosive and tossed it up.","“BOOM!”","The blast blew the hornets to pieces, and a flash of white light enveloped her.","She leveled up.","Level 2!","Level 3!","Not only that, she even completed an achievement.","After hitting level 3, she snuck back into the Wild Boar King's territory, secured the first kill, advanced to level 5, and opened a Silver Treasure Chest.","At level 5, she could bring two level 1 players into the normal Mutated Rat Nest dungeon.","Soon, she picked the best A-rank tank and an A-rank healer from the family, entered the Mutated Rat Nest, and secured the first clear.","As they say, one step ahead means every step ahead.","This account was thriving.","As for Wan Huanyu, Huanyu Kuangwu, and the others — all they could feel was that life had gone dark.","Wan Huanyu gritted his teeth: “No. My talent got downgraded, that's bad enough. But at this rate, once I hit level 20, I'll have to enter Linjiang City eventually. I probably won't even make it to level 30. How am I supposed to extract my abilities into the real world?”","He pulled out his phone and saw a name on it.","Guan Youlong.","His good brother had the foresight to head overseas early, and he was even the big shot of Zone 009. But after that incident got exposed, the authorities cracked down hard on him, and led by Old Ji (Old Horse Lying in Wait), they wiped out the Youlong Guild in Zone 009.","Now Guan Youlong has an overseas account that doesn't belong to Server 8888 anymore.","Wan Huanyu gritted his teeth again.","“Prep the yacht. Keep selling off our assets. We're moving our capital overseas.”","Wan Huanyu announced this loudly and openly.","He was way too conspicuous, not hiding it at all, and it didn't take long for someone to catch wind of it.","...","At 2 p.m., during Chu Fu's workout time, Feng Huimin arrived at the villa with documents that needed signing.","She quickly reported all the latest intel, especially regarding their old rival.","“I have good news. President Shen's family has made an excellent start in Zone 048. President Shen's aunt — her ID is Eighteen Stabs — awakened an S-rank talent. Not only did she take down Wan Huanyu and the remnants of Huanyu Studio in the new server, she also secured four first kills. At this pace, her leveling speed is off the charts.","Secondly, Wan Huanyu is planning to transfer his assets overseas. He's selling off everything he owns.","Based on current estimates, if we take over his entire conglomerate, including unsold properties, developments, office buildings, property management stakes, and construction crews, it would cost about 50 billion.","If we factor in his liabilities, we could negotiate down to roughly 35 billion.","I think we should take it.”","Chu Fu nodded when she heard this.","“Then take it.”","Meanwhile, Chu Feng, sitting nearby, had a thought.","“How is Wan Huanyu going overseas?”","“Probably by large cruise ship. His family does own one.” Feng Huimin carefully observed Chu Feng's expression. For some reason, she felt that terrifying aura emanating from him again.","A cruel, bloodthirsty smirk crossed Chu Feng's lips.","“Give me their exact departure time!”"]},{"number":142,"title":"Chapter 142: If I Don't Kill You, There Will Never Be Peace in My Heart, Wan Huanyu Dies","paragraphs":["Feng Huimin didn’t dare speculate about why Chu Feng wanted to know Wan Huanyu’s exact departure time.","But when it came to her boss’s affairs, she never asked too many questions.","“Understood. I’ll inform you as soon as I receive the news,” Feng Huimin said.","Wan Huanyu left in a hurry. At eleven that night, the cruise ship set sail into the darkness.","He had no choice.","A single day in the game could bring tremendous changes. After dying, he had to wait twenty-four hours before he could log back in.","He had to apply for access now, and he needed to be overseas in order to connect to a local server.","The luxury cruise ship was brightly lit. Onboard were all the people from the Huanyu Studio who had followed him, including employees such as Huanyu Kuangwu.","Not long ago, they had been the dregs of society—regulars at the police station who frequently ended up behind bars.","Now, they were following Wan Huanyu and enjoying the lifestyle of the wealthy.","“Master Wan, don’t be discouraged. As long as the green hills remain, there will always be firewood to burn.","“Once we’re overseas, there are plenty of small places with practically no defenses, and the authorities won’t interfere much either.","“In the game, we’ll be the emperors of our own territory. Even if the Heavenly King himself comes, we can drown him in spit!”","Huanyu Kuangwu was already lost in his daydreams.","Wan Huanyu’s brows relaxed as well.","He knew countless strategies. As long as he found a server where he could develop properly, he was certain that his talent would eventually bring him back to the peak.","Thinking of this, he nodded and patted Huanyu Kuangwu on the shoulder.","“Little Wu, don’t worry. Once we get there, if I have a bite to eat, you’ll have some soup to drink. Follow me, and you’ll never lose out.”","Huanyu Kuangwu was thrilled.","“Master Wan, I understand. You’ve always treated me sincerely. A gentleman should die for the one who recognizes his worth. From today onward, I’ll be your loyal retainer!”","Wan Huanyu was very pleased.","In truth, Huanyu Kuangwu was better than Huanyu Kuangba. He really was a sycophant.","Huanyu Kuangba still dreamed of treating himself as Wan Huanyu’s equal and calling him brother!","Just as Wan Huanyu was about to say something more heartfelt, a calm voice filled with icy killing intent came from behind them.","“Is that so? Then it seems you can’t be allowed to live either.”","“Who?” Wan Huanyu spun around and saw a figure dressed in a cloak.","In that instant, he felt a chill run through his entire body.","If they had been in the game, Wan Huanyu wouldn’t have found this strange. After all, that outfit was clearly a fairly advanced assassin’s gear.","But this was reality.","What did that mean?","His opponent was a player who had extracted the game’s power into the real world.","“You! What are you trying to do? Who sent you? Don’t kill me! I’ll give you money. Whatever they’re paying, I’ll give you ten times as much!”","“Oh?”","The figure suddenly seemed interested.","“Thirty-five billion!”","“What?”","“I said someone offered thirty-five billion for your life. Give me three hundred and fifty billion, and I’ll let you go this time.”","The corner of Wan Huanyu’s eye twitched violently.","He had only spent one hundred million to have Chu Fu hunted down.","Why had taking his own life cost thirty-five billion?","Moreover, did this person know that he had just sold Wan Tu Properties for three hundred and fifty billion? Was that why he had demanded exactly that amount?","But Wan Huanyu didn’t want to die.","“I agree! I’ll give you the money!” Wan Huanyu gritted his teeth.","“Then transfer it now. Don’t try anything funny!”","“I need to get my computer before I can transfer the money. All of my funds have been deposited into an overseas account.”","“Fine!”","The figure answered, then suddenly swung the blade in his hand.","Under the moonlight, a head soared into the air.","It was Huanyu Kuangwu’s.","“Ah—ahhhhh!”","Wan Huanyu screamed.","He scrambled backward on all fours, utterly pathetic. Snot and tears streamed down his face, and his pants were damp with urine, filling the air with a pungent smell.","Only after a long while did he realize that he was still alive.","The one who had died was Huanyu Kuangwu.","“I’ll pay! I’ll pay! I’ll give you as much as you want! Just don’t kill me!”","“Then transfer the money. Last time, Master Wan used the dark web to place a bounty. This time, you can place another one—specify me as the assassin.”","The dark-web account was the same account into which Wan Huanyu had received the three hundred and fifty billion. It could indeed be used to place assassination contracts.","More importantly, the dark web was capable of transferring enormous sums of money and could even launder illicit funds.","With trembling hands, Wan Huanyu placed a bounty for three hundred and fifty billion on the dark web.","The target was Huanyu Kuangwu.","But Huanyu Kuangwu had already died moments ago. The assassin had even recorded a video, and both sides confirmed that the contract had been completed.","Three hundred and fifty billion had vanished just like that.","At that moment, Wan Huanyu not only failed to feel safe; he instead felt that he was about to die.","He had been stalling for time, hoping that the people aboard the ship would discover the intruder. After all, they were carrying real weapons.","But only now did he realize that everything had been far too quiet.","It was as if something had isolated all sound.","Was it the intruder’s talent? A skill? Or perhaps an equipment item?","He had no way of knowing.","“You—you’ll let me go, right? I transferred the money!”","“Of course. I keep my word. Well then... until next time!”","The assassin was actually a man of his word. Beneath the cloak, half of his face was visible, and the corner of his mouth curved into a faint smile.","Then he vanished from the spot.","Wan Huanyu let out a long sigh of relief.","He immediately turned and ran toward his room.","He didn’t dare remain outside any longer.","“It must be someone from the Plant-Man’s side. But who is he? There isn’t an assassin among their team. No, that’s not right. What level could the Plant-Man possibly be?”","Wan Huanyu stumbled along in a panic.","At last, he managed to open the door to his room.","The next moment, however, he saw a figure sitting on top of the gaming pod, sipping red wine.","The figure removed his hood.","Revealed beneath it was a handsome face, no less striking than that of any young celebrity.","“Master Wan, I didn’t expect us to meet again so soon.”","The moment Wan Huanyu saw that face, his pupils widened.","“You... you’re... Chu...”","He couldn’t even remember the man’s name.","But he knew that this was the brother of the Plant-Man.","In that instant, everything clicked into place for Wan Huanyu.","He even remembered the assassin’s ID from the order he had just placed.","Lu Xing.","He finally understood what kind of existence he had provoked.","“No! You can’t kill me! I paid you!”","Chu Feng let out a mocking laugh.","“But I said I’d let you go this time. I never said I wouldn’t kill you if I saw you again.","“Look, today is the second time we’ve met.”","Wan Huanyu broke down.","He knew that his death was inevitable.","“Why? If you want revenge, go after Sun Jingya! Why are you coming after me? I don’t deserve to die!”","“No. You all deserve to die! Do you think I care about your money? You all deserve to die. If you don’t die, my parents will never rest in peace. If you don’t die, my heart will never know peace!”","After saying this, Chu Feng strode forward and drove his blade straight through Wan Huanyu’s heart.","Wan Huanyu’s expression froze. Pain appeared across his face, his eyes trembled, and his pupils gradually lost focus.","Chu Feng grabbed him by the collar, dragged him onto the cruise ship’s deck, and hurled him away with all his strength.","The corpse flew into the sky, traced a long arc, and plunged into the sea below, where it became food for the sharks."]},{"number":143,"title":"Chapter 143: Battle for District 09, An Official Request","paragraphs":["The game was underway.","It was close to midnight.","Tonight was destined to be sleepless.","Today was the siege battle for Zone [009].","Through the mission to escort supplies, Chu Fu and the others had remained in Huaishui Town and joined the siege battle.","Nine days had passed since the previous siege battle, and the players had also acquired a collection of strategies.","First of all, participants in the siege battle included not only those currently inside the town, but also players above Level 20 who had joined the city.","Twenty-four hours before the siege battle began, these players would receive a homing-pigeon letter and be given a temporary flying mount.","The flying mounts had a top speed of 200 kilometers per hour. Even so, returning to the town still took fifteen hours.","Shen Chi’s mech, on the other hand, could travel at 2,000 kilometers per hour.","Fengdu Town was only 1,500 kilometers from Huaishui Town, meaning they could make the trip in less than an hour.","They had arrived fairly early and received a preliminary mission to help set up the traps.","More than that, the Old Commander was quite embarrassed, but he had no choice except to come and seek out Chu Fu.","“Comrade Plantman, what I mean is, does anyone among you happen to be willing to give up a spot? I can buy it at a high price. My attributes are considerably worse than yours, and I’d like to earn more attribute points from this siege mission!","“How about 100 gold coins for each attribute point?","“Eighty points in total—that’s 8,000 gold coins!”","The lavish offer startled Chu Fu.","But after thinking it over, she found it perfectly reasonable.","Back in the Novice Village, everyone had still been unaware of the importance of attribute points. Even Jiaojiao Bu Jiao had been able to offer 100,000 yuan for a single point.","Now everyone knew how important attribute points were. Players without top-tier talents could only obtain attributes through means like this.","Naturally, the price had been driven through the roof.","The question was, who would be willing to give up their spot?","This would affect their future in a major way.","Everyone knew that Laoji Fuli was a veteran hero and, more importantly, the stabilizing pillar of Linjiang City.","But when it came to future strength and matters of life and death, would anyone really be willing?","To Chu Fu’s surprise, two people in the team actually volunteered to give up their places.","“Plant Girl, why don’t I leave? I’m not that good against groups of monsters!” Zhimengzhe lowered her head and spoke first.","“Then let me give up my spot instead. I’m only a healer, so I don’t need attribute points as much. Besides, my talent level is low!”","Little Sister Wu was quite self-aware.","If the team had to choose one person not to bring, she was slightly lacking both emotionally and in terms of ability.","Most importantly, she had a contract of indenture!","She had sold herself completely to the Thorny Guild.","If Chu Fu wanted the money, Little Sister Wu was more than willing to accept the sacrifice.","Chu Fu thought for a moment before saying, “Are you two sure? This is entirely voluntary. Attribute points are still extremely important.","“Of course, even if someone gives up their spot, they won’t receive all the money. After all, taking down the bosses is a team effort.","“But since you’re both willing to make this concession and help the authorities, the money will be split fifty-fifty between the team and the person giving up the attribute points. The person leaving will receive 4,000 gold coins, while the nine people remaining will each receive 400. The last 400 will go to the Thorny Guild as public funds.","“Which one of you will do it?”","There were still 4,000 gold coins to be had?","Little Sister Wu looked at Zhimengzhe.","“Shall we play rock-paper-scissors? Whoever wins gets the money!”","Zhimengzhe hurriedly shook her head. “No, no, no. If you want to go, then... you go!”","She actually wanted to stay with the team.","But this was the Old Commander they were talking about—the founding hero and retired lieutenant general who had helped establish the peace Flower Country enjoyed today.","If it weren’t for people like him, perhaps Flower Country would never have reached its current state of peace. As long as he asked, Chu Fu would have given up a spot.","Zhimengzhe didn’t want to make things difficult for Chu Fu.","Little Sister Wu, however, had dollar signs in her eyes.","“Really? It’s 4,000 gold coins! At the current exchange rate of one to fifteen, that’s 60 billion yuan!”","Yesterday, she had heard that Chu Fu had bought the Linjiang City magnate’s businesses for only 35 billion yuan!","Little Sister Wu felt as though she were floating.","She had actually just said “only” 35 billion yuan.","Zhimengzhe said weakly, “I want the attribute points!”","“Then I’ll take the money.”","The temptation was indeed considerable.","What was more, if reaching Level 30 meant withdrawing the abilities from the game, then given her current rate of earning and spending money, she was barely making ends meet.","After all, ninety percent of the money earned from the people she revived with Soul Reincarnation had to be given to Chu Fu. That was part of the contract between Chu Feng and Little Sister Wu.","Meanwhile, her mother, Wu Yingchun, had become completely addicted to the game.","Even an A8 household couldn’t withstand that kind of gaming expenditure.","Little Sister Wu had once relied on her parents, but now she had to earn money herself to support her old mother’s gaming habit. And reaching Level 30 would not benefit just her alone.","In that case, taking the money really wasn’t a bad deal.","Seeing this, Chu Fu nodded in agreement. She had Little Sister Wu leave the team, then invited Laoji Fuli to join.","Next came the distribution of combat power.","Huaishui Town had four sides. Chu Fu alone occupied the eastern wall.","Xie Lin, Jiaojiao Bu Jiao, and Zhimengzhe occupied the west.","Shen Chi, Bitter Melon King, and Shafu Liangu occupied the south.","Laoji Fuli, Suture Saint, and Wu Yingchun occupied the north.","Each team had a fixed position.","As midnight drew closer, an oppressive aura spread throughout the entire town.","Chu Fu was now Level 20 and had learned Corrosive Toxic Barrier.","[Corrosive Toxic Barrier:","Upon activation, deals poison damage equal to 120% of the user’s spell attack power and creates a corrosive zone with a diameter of 50 meters, inflicting poisonous corrosion on all hostile targets within it.","Targets in a flesh-and-blood state can be melted into a pool of blood, taking an additional 200% damage.","While under the corrosive effect, bones, machinery, and buildings suffer additional destructive damage equal to 100%.","Spiritual entities suffer soul corrosion, taking an additional 50% damage.","Note: This skill possesses immense destructive power, but using it will affect the collection of materials.]","What a skill!","The moment Chu Fu saw it, she immediately thought of the third expansion pack she had completed in Linjiang City.","The Undead Legion.","The spread of plague was indeed powerful, but skeletons couldn’t contract diseases.","As a result, the powerful Plague Spread skill had lost its effectiveness.","Now, Corrosive Toxic Barrier could take its place. Its only flaw was that its range was too small.","But then again, with Enchanting Mushrooms, what did it matter whether its range was large or small?","Moreover, now that Chu Fu was Level 20, the number of plants she could control had increased to sixty.","One Enchanting Mushroom, ten Dandelions, nine Lala Vines, ten Carnivorous Flowers, and thirty Gatling Corn.","Watermelons were not suitable for deployment at a time like this.","Everything was arranged.","A green tide appeared on the horizon.","Chu Fu could even smell the stench in the air.","[System Announcement: Huaishui Town is about to be invaded by goblins. All players, please take note.]","[System Announcement: The goblin invasion has begun. The Contribution Rankings are now open. Number of participants: 36,273. Contributions from pre-battle preparation missions will also be included in the rankings.]"]},{"number":144,"title":"Chapter 144: The Gatling Corn That Surprised Chu Fu, Sweeping the Entire Venue","paragraphs":["A terrifying number of goblins surged toward them like a foul, blackened tide.","There were Level 11 Goblins, Goblin Servants, and Goblin Rock Throwers, carrying wooden clubs and short knives, or slinging battered animal-hide sacks over their shoulders as they pulled out stones and launched attacks.","The two sides were still 1,000 meters apart.","In fact, within Chu Fu’s field of vision, the goblins were still no more than tiny dots.","Just then, the Gatling Corn she had set to automatic fire suddenly erupted.","“Rat-a-tat-tat-tat-tat!”","A gap was instantly blasted through the distant goblin army.","This was a full kilometer away.","Was the Gatling Corn actually a sniper rifle?","How could it fire that far?","The town itself was only about 2,000 by 2,000 meters in size. If the Gatling Corn’s attack range truly extended to one kilometer, then its fan-shaped barrage could cover an entire section of the town wall, couldn’t it?","Its only drawback was that after fifty seconds, all of the Gatling Corn’s bullets would be completely spent, leaving behind nothing but a single corn stalk.","Fortunately, Chu Fu did not need to plant another one. She could simply accelerate its mutation instead.","That consumed far fewer resources than replanting it from scratch.","Refilling it once every fifty seconds and sweeping across the entire battlefield—Chu Fu felt that was well worth it.","By then, the goblin tide had advanced to within 500 meters.","Chu Fu flew out and unleashed Plague Spread.","The dragon’s wings howled as they beat through the air. Its terrifying speed, combined with the poisonous dragon’s might, made the goblins tremble in fear.","Wearing this set of equipment, Chu Fu’s mana was astonishingly high. Unlike before, she no longer had to drink mana potions after casting Plague Spread just once.","Chu Fu flew in a clockwise circle and threw out four casts of Plague Spread. Her contribution score skyrocketed.","In the blink of an eye, it reached ten million.","Each wave of the goblin invasion contained ten million monsters, but this time, the contribution score was twice that of the entire village.","Killing a Level 11 Goblin awarded two points.","Chu Fu alone had killed five million goblins.","The monsters’ numbers had increased tenfold, but the players’ combat power had also risen tenfold.","The goblin army continued to pour in without end. Finally, a particularly imposing figure appeared among them.","The Goblin Chieftain.","It had blended into the monster horde.","Chu Fu did not even need to attack it personally.","The BOSS died on its own.","[System Notification: “Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?” killed the Goblin Army BOSS, the Goblin Chieftain, and received a reward of 2 free attribute points for the entire team.]","(The amount written in the previous chapter was incorrect. It has been changed to 8,000 gold coins.)","[System Notification: “Who’s Calling Me Blind?” killed the Goblin Army BOSS, the Goblin Chieftain, and received a reward of 2 free attribute points for the entire team.]","The remaining two BOSSes outside the town walls were also claimed by Chu Fu, who happened to be nearby. Who could blame her? Her Plague Spread was simply too absurdly powerful!","Twenty minutes later.","All the monsters had been cleared out.","They had finished almost twice as quickly as Zone 001.","It could be said that the speed at which the monsters were killed depended on how fast they could run.","The second wave brought Goblin Archers and Goblin Spear Throwers.","However, their attack range was only around eighty meters. Before they could get close, they were all killed by Chu Fu’s Plague Spread.","Thus, they safely passed the third, fourth, and fifth waves.","The sixth wave began!","Chu Fu also became more serious.","She took out a megaphone.","[0098888 Server—Huai Shui Town] [Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?]: “Everyone, pay attention! We’re going for the Perfect Village Defense achievement. All rewards will be doubled. To obtain this achievement, everyone must stay alert. If an NPC is killed later, protect the body immediately and call for Suture Saint and Little Sister Wu to provide assistance!”","“Also, remember to throw torches, flashbangs, Eagle Eye flares, Reveal Invisibility spells, and anything else of the sort!”","“Prevent the Goblin Assassins from launching surprise attacks.”","Among the goblin clans, the most difficult enemies to deal with were the Goblin Assassins.","When they were out in the wilderness, players absolutely would not hunt these Level 16 monsters.","But now, these goblins were invisible, making them nearly impossible to guard against.","Chu Fu had to ensure that 100% of the NPCs survived. Not a single one could die.","The requirement was extremely harsh.","Even so, everyone was fighting with all their might to achieve it.","Every archer stationed on the walls had a tank-class player protecting them nearby.","Conversations flooded across the map at a frantic pace. Players could not even finish reading one message before the next one swept it away.","After all, this was a battle involving a full 36,000 people.","“I’m so bored on the east side of town. Anyone want to come play an idiom chain game? I’ll start: ‘Do whatever one pleases!’”","“Is this the big shot from Zone 030? Truly terrifying. Here’s the question: What title will she receive?”","“Steed Heavenly Emperor’s skeleton army hasn’t even encountered any monsters yet, while Poison Heavenly Emperor has already poisoned the goblins to death.”","“Damn, what does this siege have to do with us tanks? We can’t even hit a single monster.”","“Just lie back and take the attribute points. If we achieve a perfect defense, we’ll get four points to every attribute!”","Amid the lively and harmonious atmosphere, a sudden announcement blared through the megaphone.","[0098888 Server—Huai Shui Town] [Graceful Berlin]: “Catch the murderer! Someone is deliberately killing NPCs! A little NPC family I know was not killed by the monsters, but there’s blood at the scene—and their bodies are gone!”","Graceful Berlin was furious.","He was an immersive-game player—in other words, a story-focused player—and he loved interacting with NPCs.","Although the tasks he performed were all trivial chores such as chopping firewood, fetching water, and collecting manure balls, his reputation was much higher than that of other players. Through constant advancement, he had eventually become an assistant at a sesame-cake stall, and then continued climbing until he became the shopkeeper.","His equipment was average, but he had actually made quite a bit of money doing odd jobs in the game.","He had never expected that after joining the others in defending the town, the proprietress of his shop and her daughter would end up dead.","He had high affection ratings with both of them. Once they died, those affection ratings vanished automatically.","That was why Graceful Berlin noticed immediately.","The players exploded into an uproar.","“What happened? Are you sure they weren’t killed by Goblin Assassins?”","“The bodies are gone too. It definitely wasn’t the goblins!”","[0098888 Server—Huai Shui Town] [Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?]: “Don’t panic. Even without the bodies, they can still be revived, as long as we have the crime scene.”","She immediately called out to her team.","“Old Chief, arrange for some scouts to come over. I’ll give you a few pairs of flying wings. Guard the town from the sky and make absolutely sure those evil-god followers don’t commit any more atrocities!”","Chu Fu was furious as well. Fortunately, her brother had given Little Sister Wu a Soul-Returning spell. Otherwise, this situation would have been truly difficult to handle.","Of course, Soul-Returning did not mean that a corpse was unnecessary. Instead, the soul would return to its own body and revive it. Once the dead NPCs were brought back to life, their souls would naturally track down their bodies—even if those bodies were inside a player’s inventory!"]},{"number":145,"title":"Chapter 145: The overseas Guan Youlong is still causing trouble, counterattacking the evil camp","paragraphs":["Little Sister Wu rushed to the scene and immediately cast a soul-returning spell.","Three spirits were summoned, drifting outward in confusion.","The scouts sent by Laoji Fuli caught up with them. Afraid something might happen, Little Sister Wu followed as well.","Perhaps because Chu Fu had shouted through the loudspeaker, they soon spotted three NPC corpses outside a small alley—but no people.","The spirits merged back into their bodies, reviving the three NPCs, though all of them were on the verge of death.","“I’m not dead yet!”","“Boss, don’t be afraid. We’re here to save you,” Graceful Berlin said.","The proprietress let out a shriek. “Ah! You—you’re the murderer!”","“Stop screaming, or your wounds will split open again. You were already down to one HP, and all your blood had nearly drained away.”","Little Sister Wu hurriedly stopped her and then cast a healing spell, raising the three NPCs’ health. Their wounds gradually began to close.","“It wasn’t me! Someone must have disguised themselves as me—even my ID was faked. This is outrageous! Was this aimed at me?”","Graceful Berlin was furious all over again.","Little Sister Wu comforted him. “Don’t be afraid. We’ll catch the murderer soon.”","After all, this was a town-defense battle. Reporters were monitoring everything from above, while the power of the nation was also mobilizing. Countless eyes were watching. How could anyone possibly escape?","Appearances could be changed.","But equipment, class, and skills could not be disguised by a Mask of Disguise.","“Search! Find the murderer!”","Laoji Fuli’s face was grim. The general’s imposing presence made everyone around him straighten up, realizing that the old commander was truly enraged.","Everyone was fighting to defend the town.","How could anyone sabotage them at a time like this?","This was more than just a game. It concerned the survival of all humanity.","No wonder such people were called traitors to humanity.","The player was found soon enough.","Under the current circumstances, there was no way to log out, and countless eyes were watching. The murderer had nowhere to run.","“How could it be you? What were you thinking? You’re already level 20. You worked so hard to level up alongside everyone else, and once you were exposed, no one would revive you. Your character would be ruined! Why do something so destructive and pointless?”","Reaching level 20 meant spending a great deal of time in the game, and the player had made quite a few friends.","Graceful Berlin even knew him, which was why he had chosen to kill Graceful Berlin’s proprietress and her daughter.","It was easier to strike against people he knew.","He had been jealous of the money Graceful Berlin was making and had committed murder in a fit of greed.","There were other reasons involved as well.","Surrounded by players who questioned and cursed him, he roared angrily, “So what if I killed them? You revived the NPCs anyway! If you hadn’t found out, I could have gotten a hundred million. Just wait and see—there’s more than one person who’s been bought off.","“As long as you fail to achieve a perfect town defense, we’ll get the money. A hundred million! You people couldn’t earn that much in your entire lives!”","Graceful Berlin shouted furiously, “Are you insane, or am I? Prices have collapsed worldwide. One copper coin is worth fifteen Huaxia currency. A hundred million is only six or seven gold coins. If you can clear an Inferno-level dungeon, you could earn that much in seven or eight days. And for that little profit, you’re willing to throw away the efforts of more than twenty thousand people in the entire town?”","“What else could I do? I used to work for Wandering Dragon Studio. If I didn’t follow this plan, Guan Youlong would put a bounty on me and my family through the dark web!”","“Besides, I was already a player in the evil faction. The werewolves gave us a quest. Killing NPCs earns us extra contribution points.”","“And what’s the big deal about killing a few NPCs? By reviving them, you even earn more contribution points!”","“How about we work together? It’s just a game. There’s no need to take it so seriously.”","“Wouldn’t it be better for everyone if we gained the greatest possible benefits?”","The man was still trying to say something when a gigantic watermelon fell from the sky.","Boom!","The watermelon and his body exploded into pieces.","Chu Fu used the loudspeaker again.","[Server 0098888—Huaiwater Town] [Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?]: “I never listen to criminals making excuses. Any player who dares to kill NPCs is an enemy—a traitor to humanity.","“I know there are many Wandering Dragon Studio players on this server. You claim that Guan Youlong threatened you? Then seek official protection instead of helping the villain.","“Put bluntly, weren’t you simply tempted by the profits? Anyone who obtained a Mask of Disguise had killed more than a hundred players and joined the evil faction.","“You can claim that the NPCs deceived you, but didn’t those acts of slaughter bring you benefits at the time? Being targeted today is simply retribution.","“If you don’t want to become traitors to humanity, you can just reveal Werewolf Tuge’s location. One person may not be able to kill an NPC, but could a hundred people? A thousand? Ten thousand? Would killing one NPC really be that difficult?”","Outside the town, more than fifty players stood there, each harboring their own thoughts.","“Everyone, we’re just too weak to fight them. They have tens of thousands of people, while we only have fifty or so. What can we possibly do?” one player said hesitantly, clearly considering surrendering.","But some were furious.","“I only got screwed because I entered the game early! Being deceived wasn’t my fault! Back when Master Guan was around, who didn’t kill people? The more you killed, the more you were rewarded. That Plantman is just acting wise after the fact and blaming us now.”","“Which idiot acted early and exposed us?”","“Ahem... how about we...” Someone gave Werewolf Tuge a meaningful glance.","The clever ones had already sent messages.","Who wanted to remain a villain for the rest of their life?","They might not have understood the consequences back then, but now all they wanted was to cling to Plantman’s protection.","Chu Fu’s friend requests were not enabled, but that was no obstacle for these players.","They usually played together with friends, and many people even knew that they possessed Masks of Disguise. Before long, a group of players began trying to persuade them to surrender.","Werewolf Tuge’s coordinates were exposed soon afterward. No one even knew who had leaked them.","The seventh wave of monsters had been defeated, leaving ten minutes of rest.","Shen Chi piloted the mecha and picked up all ten team members.","The mecha started up and thundered toward the wilderness.","This was Laoji Fuli’s first time riding in a mecha, and he was utterly amazed.","Or rather, the strength of every member of Chu Fu’s team had left him stunned.","According to their official data, the defense battle at Zone 009 should not have been this easy. After all, their town had never produced any particularly outstanding players. How could they possibly compare with the slaughterstars of Zone 001?","Yet after Chu Fu and the others came to help, the results had been terrifyingly effective.","Now they were even going to counterattack Werewolf Tuge.","The Werewolf Tuge on the level-20 map had stats more terrifying than those of the level-25 Goblin Abyssal Overlord.","Would ten people be enough?","While Laoji Fuli was thinking about this, Shen Chi had already guided the mecha down.","With a thunderous crash, the enormous mecha landed before the more-than-three-meter-tall Werewolf Tuge.","The towering machine looked down from above, making Werewolf Tuge seem like nothing more than a stray mutt."]},{"number":146,"title":"Chapter 146: Killing the Werewolf Turg was reported by me, and it was me.","paragraphs":["When Werewolf Tuge saw the enormous mech, he instinctively took two steps back.","Then he let out a long howl.","In an instant, his body swelled to a towering ten meters.","But in front of the twenty-meter-tall mech, he was still like a child standing before an adult.","The mech’s chest opened, and nine people jumped out.","They checked Werewolf Tuge’s stats.","【Werewolf Tuge (Epic Divine Servant)","Level: 20","HP: 10,000,000】","“Why’d you make yourself so big? That makes you harder to hit!” Xie Lin complained. He then swung the King’s Sword and launched a full combo.","The attacks drove Werewolf Tuge back step by step.","With his huge body, his movements were naturally clumsy, making it impossible for him to defend against Xie Lin’s attacks.","“Take this, puppy!”","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao shouted angrily and slammed her massive shield into Werewolf Tuge.","Werewolf Tuge’s eyes turned blood red as he locked onto Jiaojiao Bu Jiao.","“Grrr! Kill him! Kill him now! Everyone, get him!”","Werewolf Tuge pointed at Jiaojiao Bu Jiao. At the same time, all the players who had joined the evil faction seemed to be controlled. Their eyes turned blood red as they charged toward Jiaojiao Bu Jiao.","Chu Fu raised her staff.","A cloud of pink mist erupted and instantly enveloped the fifty players in the spreading plague.","In just over ten seconds, all of them had died. The diseased growths that exploded upon their deaths also covered Werewolf Tuge in a massive amount of poison.","Next, Chu Fu cultivated Gatling Corn.","She grew ten of them in one go.","One even produced a tiny Gatling Corn sprite. It held a chibi-style corn gun in its hands and looked incredibly adorable.","“Immobilize the boss for one minute!” Chu Fu shouted.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao said, “You’re really making things difficult for me, Jiaojiao. Fine, I’m coming!”","She roared, activated Absolute Defense, and then wrapped herself tightly around Werewolf Tuge’s leg.","Xie Lin likewise grabbed onto the other leg.","“Heal me!”","Shen Chi controlled the mech and clung tightly to Werewolf Tuge’s shoulder.","Their terrifying strength allowed them to wrestle with the boss directly.","The Primordial Gate was an extremely realistic game. At the same time, it might not be just a game—the data could very well be synchronized with reality.","The boss was incredibly powerful against ordinary players, but for players with top-tier talents, forcibly restraining him was not impossible!","As the three of them held the boss in place, even Zhimengzhe’s doll rushed over to pin down Werewolf Tuge’s tail. Shafu Liangu’s venomous insect leaped onto the werewolf’s face and bit down hard on his nose.","As a martial artist, Wu Yingchun had learned her level-20 ultimate skill: Acupoint Lock.","It was an extremely powerful control skill.","Bitter Melon King used his Pain skills to lower the boss’s defense.","Everything was completed within three seconds.","Chu Fu’s ten Gatling Corn plants had also matured.","Then a sound like a string of firecrackers rang out.","“Rat-a-tat-tat-tat-tat-tat!”","The Gatling Corn plants spat out streams of fire.","Each one fired one hundred bullets per second. With roughly five Gatling barrels per plant and ten plants in total, that amounted to five thousand bullets per second.","A dense cluster of damage numbers, each around -50, erupted above Werewolf Tuge’s head.","A single bullet didn’t do much damage, but what about a thousand bullets?","In just one second, they dealt 250,000 damage. At that rate, Werewolf Tuge would die in forty seconds.","As his HP rapidly dropped, it finally reached 5%.","Werewolf Tuge suddenly let out a furious roar, and his body turned metallic.","“What is this? Did he turn into Wolverine?” Chu Fu quipped.","But everyone could see that Werewolf Tuge had entered an invincible state. It was clearly a special mechanic designed to prevent him from being killed in a single burst.","Then a terrifying pressure erupted from his body.","A beam of black light descended from the sky and merged into him, causing his HP to recover rapidly. Not only that, but his maximum HP began to soar as well.","“Those useless fools can’t be relied on after all. I’ll have to do this myself!”","After absorbing the Evil God’s power, he became even stronger.","In the blink of an eye, he had transformed into a terrifying boss with 50 million HP.","He simply failed to notice that behind him, Chu Fu had already planted a full sixty Gatling Corn plants.","“Hold him for another minute!”","“Understood!”","Everyone performed their respective roles.","Under Chu Fu’s control, the Gatling Corn plants unleashed a furious barrage.","One minute later, Werewolf Tuge crashed to the ground.","There wasn’t a patch of intact skin left on his body.","He had been completely shredded.","Afterward, more than five hundred pieces of Evil God Divine Power Material dropped to the ground.","However, this particular Evil God Divine Power Material seemed to be larger than usual.","【Evil God Divine Power Material (Dark Gold-tier Item):","Can be used on equipment of level 20 or below, including level 20, to increase its quality.","Bronze to Silver: 1 piece required.","Silver to Gold: 10 pieces required.","Gold to Dark Gold: 100 pieces required.","Dark Gold to Diamond: 1,000 pieces required.】","Promoting an item to Diamond was basically impossible.","But upgrading one item to Dark Gold was still feasible.","Nobody lacked Gold-tier equipment.","But aside from Chu Fu, none of them had a Dark Gold-tier item yet!","Chu Fu simply put the materials up for auction.","“Starting bids are one hundred pieces per lot, with a starting price of one hundred gold coins! Five lots will be auctioned together!”","Chu Fu checked her own equipment and thought about which items most urgently needed an upgrade. She placed bids of 500 gold coins on three of the lots.","She had plenty of money now~","“Do any of you have equipment that absolutely needs upgrading? If not, I’m going to sell these,” Jiaojiao Bu Jiao asked.","Without hesitation, Xie Lin added a bid of 500 gold coins.","“I want to upgrade my King’s Sword.”","Shen Chi also added a bid of 500 gold coins.","“I want to upgrade my Vacuum Cleaner!”","What else was there to say?","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao stopped bidding.","Once they reached the city, they would all be able to farm Dark Gold equipment.","So the only people raising the price were those who were reluctant to replace a particular item or who had an especially urgent need for the upgrade.","The others didn’t compete.","After all, paying 500 gold coins for a Dark Gold-tier item was already a perfectly reasonable price.","Gold was extremely expensive these days.","It could no longer be measured in flower currency, because flower currency was rapidly turning into worthless paper.","They couldn’t compete for the gold coins either.","Soon, all the Evil God Divine Power Materials ended up in Chu Fu’s inventory.","The ten-person party split 2,500 gold coins.","Because Chu Fu had contributed an astonishing 81% of the damage, she received 2,025 gold coins. In the end, she had actually earned 500 gold coins instead of spending any.","Even those who hadn’t spent anything still made a profit.","Everyone was happy.","Laoji Fuli watched the team’s system and fell into deep thought.","Why did it feel as though this team’s distribution method was actually fairer?","Of course, anyone who thought too highly of themselves wouldn’t be able to survive in this team. Chu Fu’s damage output was simply too terrifying, so she was bound to receive the greatest share of every reward.","But without Chu Fu, how long would it take them to deal with a terrifying boss like this?","Sometimes, time was the most valuable thing of all.","Just like now.","They had finished the battle in only a few minutes. After riding the mech back, they still had enough time to take part in a goblin siege.","[Map Channel]: “Wait, Saintly Healer, help me out here! I was the one who sent you the message just now!”","The corpse lying on the ground spoke.","[Map Channel]: “No, it was me. My friend can vouch for me.”","[Map Channel]: “I’m the real double agent! Boss, save me! And could you return my equipment while you’re at it? Maybe give me 200 gold too, and cook a couple of dishes for me. (doge)”"]},{"number":147,"title":"Chapter 147: Siege of the Town Ends, Major Contribution Settlement","paragraphs":["The Suture Saint looked at Chu Fu.","“Plant Girl, should we revive them?”","Chu Fu couldn’t tell which of these people wanted to become traitors, and which were actually undercover agents. Besides, there was no time.","“Revive them.”","The Suture Saint brought them back to life.","“Get up. I’ll do this one for free, but don’t even think about causing trouble. Stay here and behave until the town siege is over.”","The Suture Saint used Corpse Stitching.","The Thousand Hands talent activated, instantly reviving all fifty players.","Fortunately, Shen Chi hadn’t used the Vacuum, or all their equipment would have been sucked away, leaving them to cover themselves with beginner’s loincloths.","“Wait, Plant Master! Is there any way you can help us switch back from the evil faction? I don’t want to live like this anymore!”","Someone shouted.","“Yeah, yeah! We didn’t mean to do it in the first place. Guan Youlong ordered us to!”","“I’m not one of Guan Youlong’s people. I’m a player who triggered a hidden condition by killing Wandering Dragon Studio. I couldn’t beat Werewolf Tuge back then, especially since there wasn’t any guide available yet!”","This person spoke with such righteous indignation that the former Wandering Dragon Studio player immediately moved away from him.","Anyone capable of killing Wandering Dragon Studio players was no ordinary person.","“Plant Master, can you help us? We want to participate in defending the town too, but Werewolf Tuge had a skill that teleported us here. On top of that, failing the quest reduced our attributes. This game is unplayable! We heard that even dying by suicide carries the penalty. Are our accounts completely ruined?”","Chu Fu thought for a moment before replying, “I’ll gather some information and post it on the official Thorn Group account later. You can check it there. For now, the town siege is more important.”","Chu Fu flew into the cockpit in Shen Chi’s mech’s chest.","The cockpit door closed, and the mech roared into the sky.","They had to hurry back. She couldn’t miss out on farming contribution points.","On the way, Chu Fu took out the [Evil God’s Divine Power Material] and used it to enhance three of her pieces of equipment.","As usual, she upgraded the [High-Soul-Power Forehead Ornament] and the [Forest Venom Window Earrings] to Dark Gold grade.","After all, accessories of this caliber were incredibly difficult to come by.","For the last Dark Gold slot, Chu Fu chose a special item.","[Spirit Plant Pouch]","This thing was incredibly useful. It allowed her plants to be grown ahead of time and released during battle.","It absolutely had to be upgraded.","[High-Soul-Power Crystal Forehead Ornament (Dark Gold): Attack +120, Spirit +70, Mana Recovery +30%.]","[Forest Venom Window (Dark Gold): Physical and Magical Attack +140, Spirit +80.","Trait 1: Wood-element Attack +200.","Trait 2: Poison-element Attack +200.]","[Spirit Plant Pouch (Dark Gold):","Special Equipment: Spatial Backpack.","Trait 1: Can store an unlimited number of seeds and plant-type items.","Trait 2: Contains a 100 × 100 × 100 planting space with its own soil. Plants grown inside have their yield increased by 30%, their maturation time reduced by 30%, and a 5% chance to improve in quality.]","The attributes had doubled!","Amazing.","Chu Fu casually replenished the Gatling Corn inside the Spirit Plant Pouch so she would have enough to use when they returned.","When they got back, the players in town erupted into cheers.","[Map]: “I don’t know whether Plant Master managed to defeat Werewolf Tuge, but when they didn’t come back, I was honestly starting to panic!”","[Map]: “There were only five hundred people on the eastern wall. The thought of not being able to hide behind the Gatling guns while fighting the monsters scared me half to death.”","[Map]: “How are our brothers in the werewolf faction? Were they wiped out?”","[Map]: “Wiped out, then revived by Suture Saint. I’m a good person, really.”","[Map]: “So where’s Werewolf Tuge?”","[Map]: “He got shredded. Shredded for two whole minutes. My ears nearly exploded, and Tuge was blasted into a mist of blood.”","[Map]: “Plant Master is just too authoritative.”","Amid the flood of praise in the map chat, the final waves were dispatched with ease.","There were four bosses in each wave, and they secured the final hit on every one of them, earning a total of 80 attribute points.","That wasn’t all. Town-level maps were not restricted by level, and Chu Fu and the others had already reached Level 25.","With the death of the final monster, the siege battle in Zone 009 officially came to an end.","[System Announcement: The goblin army has retreated. Huaiwater Town’s buildings remain 100% intact, and the NPC survival rate is 100%. Town defense successful!]","[System Announcement: Perfect score achieved: 100% protection. All players receive a Guardian Badge. Players who already possess one will have their badge automatically upgraded to the next level. All rewards are doubled.]","[System Announcement: All players in Huaiwater Town receive +4 to all attributes. The original reward was +2.]","[System Announcement: Public event contribution rewards are being calculated!]","[System Announcement: The limited-time shop is now open. Contribution points may be exchanged for reward items. The shop will remain open for 24 hours.]","[System Announcement: Players who have reached Level 20 may spend 10 gold to teleport to a higher-level map: Linjiang City.]","[System Announcement: The restrictions on the Huaiwater Town map have been lifted. Players may now travel to Linjiang City on foot!]","Everyone then turned to the rankings.","As expected, first place belonged to WhoWantsToBeAVegetable.","Even so, people were astonished when they saw the contribution total.","[First Place: WhoWantsToBeAVegetable, Contribution: 430 million]","There had been ten million monsters of each level during the siege, so the total contribution available could be estimated at only 1.1 billion.","Chu Fu alone had killed 40% of the monsters.","Absolutely terrifying.","After that, the rankings dropped sharply.","[Second Place: Rocket on a Wheelchair, Contribution: 120 million]","[Third Place: Suture Saint, Contribution: 100 million]","[Fourth Place: Who Are You Calling Blind?, Contribution: 62.31 million]","[Fifth Place: Laoji Fuli, Contribution: 37.89 million]","Chu Fu examined the rewards granted by the system.","First, her Guardian Badge had become Gold grade, increasing all attributes by 10.","Next came the reward for placing first.","[System Notification: Player “WhoWantsToBeAVegetable,” you ranked first in contribution during this goblin invasion event, with a contribution score of 430 million.","You have received: Talent Enhancement Stones ×3, Skill Enhancement Stones ×10, Dark Gold Chests ×1.","Because Huaiwater Town achieved perfect defense, your rewards have been doubled.","You have received: Talent Enhancement Stones ×6, Skill Enhancement Stones ×20, Dark Gold Chests ×2.]","Unlike the village defense battle at Wangxi Village, this time the second- and third-place players also received two and one Talent Enhancement Stones respectively, and those rewards were doubled as well.","Players ranked second through fifth received Skill Enhancement Stones—eight, six, four, and two respectively—which were then doubled again, granting them even more.","It could truly be called an extraordinary payout.","Beyond that, the contribution shop held some pleasant surprises.","[Town Upgrade Blueprint: Price: 100 million contribution points.]","[Second Talent Awakening Stone: Price: 100 million contribution points. Limit: 1.]","[Growth-Type Divine Weapon Embryo: Adds the “Growth” trait to any piece of equipment. Price: 100 million contribution points. Limit: 1.]"]},{"number":148,"title":"Chapter 148: Second Talent, Stuck in a Bug of My Own Making","paragraphs":["【Guild Token: Price: 100 million Contribution Points.】","【Talent Enhancement Stone: Price: 10 million Contribution Points. Limited to 2.】","【Skill Enhancement Stone: Price: 2 million Contribution Points. Limited to 10.】","【10 points to each of the four attributes: Price: 500,000 Contribution Points per point. Limited to 10 points.】","【Revival Scroll: Price: 10 million Contribution Points. Limited to 1.】","The other items were fairly normal.","But Chu Fu didn’t let any of the first three slip by.","Buy, buy, buy!","【Village-Town Upgrade Blueprint: Upgrades a village into a town, expanding its territory to cover an area of 2,000 × 2,000 meters and allowing up to 100,000 players to enter simultaneously.","The user automatically becomes the town mayor and gains control over the use of all newly added land within the area.","Automatically grants free access to tax collection, return-to-town services, teleportation arrays, and more, regardless of the map’s level restrictions.","Allows the mayor to appoint officials, mine and develop nearby resource nodes, and more.】","This was far too important.","With this blueprint, Chu Fu could completely upgrade Wangxi Village into Wangxi Town.","Moreover, she could shift from a grind-focused game mode to an infrastructure-building mode.","By the time the game invaded reality, Wangxi Village would have already become Wangxi Town.","Her plan to develop the Thornlands could be expanded once again.","Fortunately, when she had fought Li Wei for land, he had approved a large area for her. Now, she could expand her plans.","Chu Fu hurriedly sent the 【Village-Town Upgrade Blueprint】 to Feng Huimin and reminded her to increase the construction area. They were only laying the foundation for now, so it should still be in time to make the changes.","Next came the Second Talent Awakening Stone.","Chu Fu checked its information.","【Second Talent Awakening Stone (Dark Gold Grade): Awakens a second talent. The highest possible awakening rank is A-rank.","The awakened talent will complement the character’s current actions, needs, and other factors.","The awakened talent is random. It will not necessarily be exactly what you wish for. All interpretations are subject to the Origin Gate.】","This thing was truly outrageous.","It allowed a person to possess a second talent.","Chu Fu knew that her brother’s first talent was Plunder, while his second talent was 【Godlike Adaptation】.","In other words, every attack that struck her brother would gradually be converted into a passive ability that adapted to that attack.","Simply put, if he was hit by physical attacks repeatedly, he would gradually become immune to physical attacks.","If he was attacked with frost, he would gradually become immune to ice-based attacks.","It was incredibly overpowered.","Chu Fu wasn’t sure what kind of talent she needed at the moment, but she felt that her damage output was already sufficient.","She wondered whether she could obtain a talent that increased her attribute points.","With that thought, she clasped the Second Talent Awakening Stone in her hand and began to pray. Then, she used it.","In an instant, she saw a green radiance that merged into her body.","A system notification appeared:","【A-Rank Talent—Poisonous Body:","Trait 1: Venomous Mutation: Any plant you activate will undergo a poison-type mutation.","Trait 2: Poison-Devouring Sacred Body: Consuming a poisonous substance increases your Poison Attack by 1 point and your Poison Defense by 1 point.】","Wow!","This was extremely good. For Chu Fu, increasing her Poison Attack by 1 point was no different from increasing her regular attack power.","Based on Chu Fu’s understanding of talents in the game, the closest comparison would be a killing-type talent—for example, gaining 1 point of Attack for every monster killed. Of course, a talent like that would have to be at least SSS-rank.","Although consuming poison was somewhat troublesome, it did provide a steady increase.","Moreover, the effect of Trait 1 meant that many plants that previously couldn’t be considered offensive plants could now attack with the support of poison.","That was another excellent benefit.","As for the Growth-Type Artifact Embryo, Chu Fu installed it in the Spirit Plant Pouch without hesitation.","She should have enhanced the Poison Bottle first. The Spirit Plant Pouch could grow through the use of a Growth-Type Artifact Embryo.","【Spirit Plant Pouch (Dark Gold Rank—Upgradeable):","Additional Trait: Upgradeable","Requirements for the next upgrade: Plant 10 different Dark Gold-rank plants, 300 Spatial Stones, and 30,000 cubic meters of any soil","(Note: Different types of soil provide different conditions for plant growth.)】","The requirements weren’t particularly harsh.","Spatial Stones were precious, but they dropped from Abyss-tier dungeons. She could simply go to the city and farm dungeons.","She could also buy them from players, though everyone wanted to use Spatial Stones to extract equipment, so their price was rather high.","Just as Chu Fu was happily sorting through her equipment, Xie Lin and Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao arrived.","“How much Contribution do you have left? Sell me some so I can buy a Second Talent Stone.”","Chu Fu had already spent 300 million. She still needed to buy Talent Enhancement Stones, Skill Enhancement Stones, and Attribute Points, bringing her total spending to roughly 360 million.","“I still have 71.26 million Contribution Points that I can give you. You two can decide how to split them.”","“Help me put together enough first!” Xie Lin clasped his fists toward Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao.","What could Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao do? She was still far short of the amount required, whereas Xie Lin had a chance of buying the stone outright.","“Fine. I’ll help you gather 100 million first, and the rest is mine. If you still try to spend 20 million on another Talent Stone, I’ll kill you!”","Jiao Jiao raised her shield.","“No, no, I won’t! Just help me gather 100 million!”","Chu Fu traded 37.69 million Contribution Points to Xie Lin.","In return, he traded Chu Fu 37.69 gold coins.","Chu Fu let out a surprised cry. “Why did you give me so much? What’s the exchange rate now?”","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao let out a mournful sigh. “With something like the Second Talent Stone appearing, how could prices not skyrocket? And then there’s the expansion of the villages and towns. In the past, Contribution was bought at a rate of one copper coin to one point. Now, one gold coin buys 10,000 Contribution Points, which is equivalent to a rate of one to one hundred in copper coins. If you calculate it according to the current exchange rate between copper coins and Huaxia currency, one Contribution Point is worth 1,500 yuan!","“I’m going to be completely drained!”","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao’s greatest advantage had always been her ability to spend money.","As prices soared, that advantage gradually weakened.","However, thanks to her early investments, she had become the second-largest shareholder of the Thorn Guild, so her dividends were naturally substantial.","Chu Fu said, “What are you worried about? At worst, you can get an advance from the guild. You’ll just receive fewer dividends at the end of the year.”","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao rubbed her hands together like a fly.","“Then I won’t hold back!”","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao immediately became wealthy and generous again.","Chu Fu sold all her remaining Contribution Points to Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao, leaving her with a full 9,283 gold coins in her bag.","She remembered that once she had 10,000 gold coins in her bag, she could activate another achievement and summon a Mysterious Merchant.","However, the wares offered by the Mysterious Merchant were also tied to his own level. Chu Fu didn’t want to summon him while she was only level 25, since he wouldn’t be able to produce anything good.","She simply cashed out 9,000 gold and exchanged it for 135 billion, setting it aside as startup capital for expanding Thorny Town.","Afterward, Chu Fu took out eight Talent Enhancement Stones.","Of her two talents, Chu Fu planned to upgrade Plant Human first, raising it all the way to SSS rank.","As for Poison Human, the third trait gained when advancing from A rank to S rank was probably a 100% increase to poison damage. The earlier traits would receive some enhancement as well, but the changes wouldn’t be significant.","With that thought, Chu Fu picked up the Talent Enhancement Stones and began strengthening the talent one after another.","When she used the fifth stone, Plant Human suddenly flashed.","Trait 5 appeared.","【Trait 5: Plant Human: You can merge all the plants under your control into yourself, transforming into a colossal plant humanoid. The plants become your limbs and organs, and your combat power increases by 500%.】","Chu Fu blinked.","Then she blinked again.","She felt as though she had somehow stumbled onto a bug."]},{"number":149,"title":"Chapter 149: The jackpot is still stacking, and everyone gets a major boost.","paragraphs":["Before Chu Fu acquired the A-rank Poison Human talent, the only real limitation she faced was the matter of “eating.”","Eating wasn’t unlimited. The game had both hunger and fullness levels.","Once a player’s fullness bar was maxed out, they could no longer eat anything else.","They would vomit, or even lose HP from overeating.","Otherwise, with so many attribute-boosting foods available, players could just keep eating and send their attributes skyrocketing.","On top of that, eating conflicted with leveling up and fighting monsters. Spending extra time eating was essentially a waste of in-game time.","That was why Kill-type talents ranked first, while Devour-type talents ranked second. Chu Fu’s eating-related talent was merely one of the weaker Devour-type talents.","Her brother Chu Feng’s Plunder talent, on the other hand, was at the very top of the Devour category.","But what if Chu Fu transformed into a giant-mouthed man-eating flower?","If she used the man-eating flower to consume poisonous substances, she could bypass the fullness limitation.","After all, the man-eating flower could even eat monsters infected with plague toxins!","It would be a completely self-sufficient cycle.","Chu Fu could hardly wait to try it.","However, she still had three Talent Enhancement Stones.","This time, Chu Fu used them on Poison Human.","After all three Talent Enhancement Stones were consumed, Chu Fu’s Poison Human talent evolved as expected—and gave her an even greater surprise.","[A-rank Talent: Poison Human","Trait 1: Toxic Mutation—You can activate any plant and cause it to undergo a toxic mutation, transforming it into a highly poisonous organism.","Trait 2: Poison-Eating Sacred Body—Consuming one poisonous substance increases your Poison Attack by 1 point and Poison Defense by 1 point.","For every 100 points added to Poison Attack, Mentality increases by 1 point.","For every 100 points added to Poison Defense, Constitution increases by 1 point.","Trait 3: Poison damage increased by 100%.]","Trait 2 had evolved to provide attribute points.","Ordinary players could only obtain attribute points by leveling up or completing achievements.","More powerful players could gain additional attribute points from dungeons, first kills against outdoor bosses, and major version events.","But players with exceptionally powerful talents could obtain attribute points through their talents alone. Such players were born free from the game’s attribute-point limitations.","Talents like these were known as Limit-Breaking talents.","Among all newly awakened players, only one in a hundred million possessed such a talent—meaning there were only a hundred of them in total.","And Chu Fu had obtained one!","“Wahaha! Everyone, what second talents did you awaken?” Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao’s wild laughter rang out over the team channel.","She had collected contribution points very quickly, partly because Laoji Fuli had organized people to help her.","After all, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao’s offers were simply too generous. Laoji Fuli’s group had handed over all the contribution points they didn’t need to her.","In reality, they just wanted to get this walking treasure chest out of the way so they could slowly collect the remaining contribution points at lower prices.","“Looks like you got a pretty good talent?” Chu Fu asked. With Jiao Jiao’s personality, there was no way she could keep it secret.","Sure enough, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao revealed her talent.","“I’m a super-powered area attacker now too! I got the A-rank talent Mother Earth.”","[A-rank Talent: Mother Earth","Trait 1: As long as both your feet are standing on the ground, the earth will help neutralize 90% of all attacks you receive.","Trait 2: Control soil to alter terrain, soil forms, and stone forms. You can summon earthlings and stone men to assist you in battle.]","“What about you? What did you get?”","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao asked impatiently.","“Since you’ve asked so sincerely, I’ll be generous enough to tell you! My talent is Myriad Swords Return to the Source!”","Xie Lin revealed his second talent.","[S-rank Talent: Myriad Swords Return to the Source","Trait 1: Myriad Swords—Use your mind to control an even greater number of sword-type weapons in battle. The upper limit depends on your Mentality attribute.","Trait 2: Sword Inquiry—Communicate with swords to comprehend more swordsmanship techniques and gradually form new skills.","Trait 3: Sword Heart—The more swordsmanship skills you master, the more additional attributes you gain.]","Chu Fu sucked in a breath.","“Wow, Sword Saint Brother, that talent of yours is incredibly powerful! It’s a Breakthrough-type talent!”","“What’s a Breakthrough-type talent? And why is his S-rank while mine is only A-rank?” Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao protested.","“Of course it’s S-rank because I used Talent Enhancement Stones!” Xie Lin said.","He had bought another ten million contribution points and used a single stone to push the talent to S-rank, which was how Myriad Swords Return to the Source had appeared.","Besides, no matter how he looked at it, Myriad Swords Return to the Source was far more powerful than Mind’s Eye.","However, he also had no idea what a Breakthrough-type talent was.","“Plant Girl, what does ‘Breakthrough-type’ mean?”","Chu Fu explained the Kill-type and Devour-type talents before continuing with the Breakthrough type.","“Breakthrough-type talents are enlightenment-based skills. They’re exclusive to combat geniuses and players with exceptional comprehension. The higher your comprehension, the more attribute points you gain. But they’re incredibly, incredibly difficult to master. Sword Saint Brother, though, is a genius, so this talent is perfect for you.”","Chu Fu praised him enthusiastically.","After being praised like that, if Xie Lin had possessed a tail, it would have been wagging wildly.","Plant Girl was right. He was a genius.","A genius player—and now, a genius Sword Saint.","In an instant, countless sword techniques began appearing in his mind.","“I’ve got it. The first technique I comprehend will be called One Sword Opens Heaven’s Gate.”","Holding the King’s Sword, he wandered off muttering to himself as he began studying sword techniques.","“What about Wheelchair Brother and Suture Saint?”","Suture Saint revealed her talent with a mischievous grin.","“I upgraded my new talent too. I think it’s pretty good. It’s the S-rank talent Lawless Avatar.”","This talent allowed Suture Saint to condense avatars that could also copy the skills of her main body.","Aside from consuming a bit more mana, it had no real drawbacks.","With her current strength, she could deploy up to five avatars at once.","That meant a fivefold increase in power.","“Besides, I’ve always felt that constantly rushing around to save people wastes too much time. But if I don’t go save them, their accounts won’t be protected. I do feel a certain sense of responsibility, so why not create a few avatars to rescue people for me?”","“It suits you perfectly!” Chu Fu nodded.","Shen Chi also posted his talent.","[A-rank Metal Manipulation.]","It possessed two traits—Metal Disassembly and Metal Synthesis—both of which served as support abilities for a Mechanist.","The Talent Enhancement Stones he had received from the system, along with the stones he had purchased using contribution points, had all been invested in his Mechanist talent. He had raised it to SSS-rank, and its fifth trait had manifested as Mechanical Ascension.","This ability could use machinery and metal to modify the human body, granting the user a massive increase in attributes.","However, Shen Chi was still hesitating over whether he should undergo the modification.","Somehow, he felt the drawbacks would be too severe.","“Plant Girl, do you think I should do it? If I undergo the modification, I’ll become a robot!”","Chu Fu imagined the scene and still found it rather unsettling.","“No, don’t! If you turn into a robot, what happens if we encounter a mechanical invasion in the future? You could easily be reprogrammed and turned against us!”","Chu Fu wasn’t exaggerating. The level 50–60 expansion was titled Mechanical Descent.","Shen Chi thought of that as well, his gaze falling onto Chu Fu’s face.","The thought of turning into cold metal was something he couldn’t accept either.","“Fine. I won’t use it for now.”"]},{"number":150,"title":"Chapter 150: Wangxi Village Turns into Thorn Town, Becoming the Mayor","paragraphs":["Shen Chi had agreed far too readily, which instead made Chu Fu feel a little embarrassed.","After all, this was an incredibly powerful ability. It felt as though she had interfered with Wheelchair Brother’s life!","Unfortunately, no powerful mechanics had ever appeared in the storyline, and there had never been any introduction to this Talent Trait 5.","But Chu Fu quickly figured everything out.","“Just because you don’t need it for the time being doesn’t mean you’ll never need it. You have a second talent now, too. [Primordial Gate] isn’t the kind of game that deliberately prevents players from becoming invincible. The previous game developers weakened whoever was too strong, but [Primordial Gate] favors whoever is strong.","“Perhaps your Trait also needs Metal Manipulation to support it. Once you upgrade Metal Manipulation to S-rank later, there will definitely be some changes!”","Shen Chi was thoughtful as well, but they had no chance to try it this time.","“We’ve already used up all the Talent Stones!”","“That’s fine. Don’t we still have Server 0178888? We’ll just have to wait eight more days!” Chu Fu said.","Naturally, they couldn’t stay in Fengdu Town for eight days.","Everyone’s level had already reached 25, so they could head to Linjiang City and enter the new dungeon.","Besides...","They couldn’t fight the siege battle for Server 017.","But they could fight the one for Server 030!","“As long as ten thousand players on our server reach Level 20, we’ll be able to unlock the town defense battle! It might even happen faster than on Server 017.”","After all, there were simply too many people on their server.","The more players there were, the more people would run dungeons.","At present, within the Thorn Guild alone, there were seven hundred regular teams running Hell-grade dungeons every day. They produced seven hundred pieces of Gold equipment daily, and with twenty percent of the earnings turned in each day, that amounted to seven or eight hundred gold coins.","At this rate, it would only take three or four days for a large number of players to reach Level 20.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao and the others had also stopped forcibly purchasing Contribution Points. After all, this server was officially managed by Laoji Fuli. They had to leave some Contribution Points for their own development; otherwise, all the resources would be taken by the Thorn Guild.","Chu Fu said, “I purchased a Village-to-Town Upgrade Blueprint. I’ll use it first. You can sort through the loot, and afterward we’ll all head to Linjiang City and run the dungeon!”","She took out the [Village-to-Town Upgrade Blueprint] and clicked Use.","[System Notification: Please select the village you wish to upgrade.]","Aside from Wangxi Village, there was another village under the jurisdiction of Huaishu Town.","Chu Fu naturally chose Wangxi Village.","[System Notification: Please select the area to be expanded.]","Chu Fu marked out the expansion area, placing the Thorn Guild at the center of the town. In the future, this location would become a truly prosperous district.","Furthermore, if the town were attacked, the guild would be the last place to suffer damage!","[System Notification: Once the area is confirmed, it cannot be changed. Do you wish to establish the new town with this area?]","“Yes!”","[System Notification: Please name the town.]","“Thorn Town.”","[System Notification: A system announcement is about to be issued. Do you wish to hide your name?]","“No!”","After a series of notifications appeared and Chu Fu responded to each one, the process of upgrading the village into a town was finally complete.","[System Announcement: Congratulations to player “Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?” for using the “Village-to-Town Upgrade Blueprint” to promote Wangxi Village to Thorn Town.","Player “Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?” has become the town mayor. All attributes +100.]","As the system announcement appeared, Wangxi Village underwent earth-shaking changes.","The ground began to tremble—not violently, but with a slow, continuous sense of expansion.","To the players’ astonishment, the red-eyed rabbits outside the village began fleeing in a frenzy. Before everyone’s eyes, the safe zone surrounding the starter village expanded.","A town measuring 2,000 by 2,000 meters emerged.","The enormous starter village had now become a town.","[System Notification: The town has been upgraded. Construction quests may now be issued.]","Chu Fu discovered that a new section had appeared on her attribute panel.","[ID: Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?","Level: 25, 0% EXP","Class: Poison Master","Talents: Vegetable Person (SSS), Poison Person (S)","Skills: Venomous Spell, Slow Spell, Plague Spread +8, Poison Spray, Poison Vein Awakening, Malicious Burst, Corrosive Poison Barrier","Attribute Points:","Constitution: 226 (+302)","Strength: 226 (+162)","Agility: 226 (+187)","Spirit: 408 (+857)","Equipment: Pretender’s Mask (Diamond), Window of Forest Poison (Dark Gold), High Soul Power Crystal Circlet (Dark Gold), Spirit Plant Pouch (Dark Gold), Eight-Piece Poison Dragon Set (Dark Gold), Poison Dragon Crystal Core Necklace (Dark Gold), Dragonbone Bracelet · Left (Dark Gold), Dragonbone Bracelet · Right (Dark Gold), Reverse-Scale Ring (Dark Gold), Beast Hunter’s Heart Badge (Gold), Guardian’s Badge (Gold), Poison Bottle (Gold), Staff of a Little Too Much Poison (Silver), Soul-Stealing Ring (Common)...","Wealth: 283 gold, 822 silver, 721 copper","Properties: Fengdu Town—Fufu General Store; Fengdu Town—Luxury Manor No. 01","Position: Mayor of Thorn Town (Click here to enter the management page).]","Chu Fu clicked on it and discovered that she could appoint deputy mayors.","There were two available positions.","Chu Fu selected two people from her friends list.","[You have appointed “Jiaojiao Bu Jiao” as deputy mayor of Fengdu Town. Delegated permissions: economic development, shop leasing, tax management.]","[You have appointed “Commander Feng Huimin” as deputy mayor of Fengdu Town. Delegated permissions: construction planning, NPC recruitment, resource-point mining.]","[Awaiting the other party’s approval.]","How could they possibly refuse?","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao was the first to accept. She even sent Chu Fu a private message, shouting excitedly.","“Plant Girl, you’re making me a deputy mayor? But you could handle the development yourself, and you have Feng Huimin to help you!”","Chu Fu said with a smile, “Haven’t you been short on money lately? The new town needs to develop its economy. Do a good job, and I’ll give you a five-percent share of the profits.”","This time, Jiaojiao Bu Jiao was genuinely moved.","After the Flower Kingdom announced the special nature of [Primordial Gate], the financial system had begun to collapse. The impact on her was undoubtedly enormous.","Once she lost her identity as a rich heiress, and with Lu An—a substitute MT with an S-rank talent—joining the team, Jiaojiao Bu Jiao had gradually lost her confidence.","But Chu Fu’s appointment instantly made her stand tall again.","She was a graduate of a world-renowned university and an expert in finance.","If her scumbag father hadn’t kept suppressing her, and if she hadn’t been unwilling to simply hand his company over to someone else, she would have established her own business long ago.","Entering the game and investing her entire fortune in the Thorn Guild had been the most correct decision she had ever made.","Of course, the even better decision had been meeting Chu Fu and becoming her friend.","She would definitely demonstrate her business talents and help Chu Fu manage the town.","Meanwhile, Commander Feng Huimin had also received the notification and clicked Accept.","She had entered Wangxi Village only six days ago.","Yet in that short time, she had already gone from Level 0 to Level 10.","In Wangxi Village, she had experienced a completely different kind of gameplay."]},{"number":151,"title":"Chapter 151: How Important Is It to Follow the Right Leader Feng Huimin Reaches the Pinnacle of Her Career","paragraphs":["Six days ago, Feng Huimin committed suicide on Server 0178888. Twenty-four hours later, she chose to be reborn in Wangxi Village.","Her talent had fallen from C-rank to D-rank.","【D-rank Talent—Keen Observation:","Effect: You can keenly perceive the advantages and disadvantages of a battle and analyze the situation.】","Fortunately, her Commander class remained unchanged.","【Class: Commander","Class Trait: After issuing an order, obedience is increased by 30%.","Skill 1—Charge Horn: After use, all players gain a 5% increase to their base attributes, attack power, defense, and healing power. (This skill has no player limit. All beings recognized as allies are affected by Charge Horn.) Duration: 30 minutes.】","After entering Wangxi Village at midnight, Chu Fu immediately arranged for someone to invite Feng Huimin into the guild.","She was then granted administrator privileges.","Feng Huimin had originally thought that, as a player parachuted into the guild at level 0, she would surely be ostracized. She had even prepared herself for all kinds of difficulties.","But none of that happened.","The moment she appeared, a level-10 player from the Thorn Guild took her into the Nightmare-level Beast God Temple dungeon.","She had not even been qualified to enter this dungeon back when she was with the Huanyu Guild.","The fixed party there consisted of Lu An, Wan Huanyu, Holy Healing Angel, and two of Wan Huanyu’s more capable lackeys who served as damage dealers.","Feng Huimin had merely been an administrator—or, more accurately, an all-purpose babysitter.","But in the Thorn Guild, the players could breeze through such a dangerous dungeon with their eyes closed.","Not only that, they were even praising Feng Huimin, who could not attack at all.","“Wow, Commander Feng, your class skill is amazing! This must be an insanely powerful aura-type skill.”","“It’ll be incredibly useful during a siege. You can buff players across a huge area.”","“You must be some kind of special talent recruited by the Plant Master!”","That was not entirely wrong.","She instinctively reached up to push her black-rimmed glasses higher, but since she had not yet reached level 10 and had not activated her level-10 skill, the glasses had vanished.","Not wearing her glasses made her feel terribly insecure.","“That’s right. The Plant Master hired me at a high salary to help manage the guild.”","“Wow! That’s impressive! Commander Feng must be an incredible person in real life.”","Amid the continuous praise, Feng Huimin soon found herself wearing a relaxed smile.","She discovered that these players were all quite capable. Their praise came from the heart. It was as if they were giving her an immense amount of emotional support—not through flattery, but through genuine appreciation and confidence that she could manage the guild well.","They were especially astonished after she told them about her academic background and work experience.","Feng Huimin knew that their trust in her was built on their trust in Plantman. Because they believed in him, they viewed her in a completely different light.","But that alone already made the Thorn Guild vastly different from the Huanyu Studio.","Those people had constantly talked behind her back, accusing her of being an outsider who knew nothing yet tried to lecture experts. They had also been deeply dissatisfied with her low level in the game.","Whenever they needed her, they would flatter her with a few words. When they did not, they would look at her with contempt.","They would fawn over her while taking what they needed, then curse her the moment they were done.","The Thorn Guild was completely different.","Feng Huimin could even have players take her through dungeons, after which she would assign missions.","No one was required to complete a fixed number of Nightmare-level dungeons every day, nor were they forced to submit 20% of the equipment they obtained to the guild.","After learning every player’s skills, equipment, and class, Feng Huimin began arranging teams.","No one complained. Instead, they praised her team compositions as perfectly balanced.","After clearing a dungeon, the Thorn Guild’s players would automatically go to the warehouse to register their loot and submit the goods. There was no need to supervise them, and no need to worry about them embezzling anything.","The first time she fought the Tiger King alongside everyone, Feng Huimin felt the Thorn Guild’s unprecedented unity and strength even more clearly.","They took down the Tiger King without losing a single soldier or suffering a single injury.","Under her management, the Thorn Guild in Wangxi Village operated like a highly efficient machine, increasing its overall efficiency by 150%.","Moreover, as more and more players joined each day, the Thorn Guild produced large quantities of Silver-grade equipment, which it sold in bulk. Small auctions were even held daily.","The transaction amounts left her speechless—and this was only a beginner village.","What would it be like in a town?","She did not dare imagine how terrifying the flow of money would be in a town where everyone had Gold-grade equipment.","Even more shocking to Feng Huimin was Chu Fu’s ability to make money.","The plan to acquire land from the authorities with hundreds of billions in liquid capital and build Thorn Town far exceeded Feng Huimin’s expectations.","Yet Chu Fu had entrusted the operation of such a massive project to her.","The partners worked seriously and caused no trouble. Even while handling construction in the real world and leveling up in the game, Feng Huimin still found everything surprisingly easy.","Meanwhile, her former employer, Wantu Real Estate, was being sold in its entirety after the Huanyu Studio went bankrupt.","She negotiated the deal and acquired Wantu Real Estate Group for 35 billion, including 1,200 in debt. But after the game invaded reality, no one cared much about that debt anymore.","The real value lay in the group’s properties.","Wantu Real Estate’s office towers stood in the heart of Linjiang City, where every inch of land was worth a fortune.","After the game invaded reality, if this area became a safe zone, its value would be unimaginable.","There were also the properties under development, undeveloped sites, unfinished projects, and completed buildings that had yet to be sold.","She planned to organize everything and see whether they could get lucky.","The thrill of managing such a massive operation was simply intoxicating.","She had originally planned to have someone remove the Wantu Real Estate sign the next morning.","From then on, the building would belong to the Thorn Group.","She might even become the CEO of the Thorn Group.","The ultimate career worker.","But she had never expected the Plant Master to have another surprise waiting for her.","She had become the deputy mayor?","In the game, the deputy mayor of a town was equivalent to the authority in charge of an entire beginner-village server!","It was a position above every guild and player.","“Boss, don’t worry. Leave the expansion project to me. I’ll definitely find more NPCs for you as well. You can count on me!”","Feng Huimin was brimming with energy.","She used to work for Wan Huanyu for only eight hours a day.","Now, she wished every day had thirty-six hours so she could deal with Chu Fu’s affairs.","She was simply being given far too much!","...","After assigning the benefits and responsibilities to others, Chu Fu became a hands-off manager and enjoyed a much easier life.","She could finally relax.","She then looked inside her inventory.","She still had thirty Skill Enhancement Stones and two Dark Gold Chests that she had not used yet!","After thinking it over, Chu Fu used twenty Skill Enhancement Stones to raise her level-20 ultimate, Corrosive Toxic Barrier, to level 10.","She also raised her level-15 skill, Malicious Burst, to level 10.","【Corrosive Toxic Barrier → Corrosive Domain +10】","【Malicious Burst → Blood-Melting Venom Pool +10】","Finally, she kept ten Skill Enhancement Stones to use on her level-25 skill.","As for the Dark Gold Chests, Chu Fu no longer even knew what she was missing, so she simply opened them both.","【You obtained ×1 Skill Enhancement Stone.】","【You obtained ×1 Skill Enhancement Stone.】","Chu Fu froze.","“Could the Primordial Gate be a perfectionist too? Fine, then. Thank you for nature’s generous gift!”","Chu Fu used the two enhancement stones on Plague Spread, turning the skill into a level-10 enhanced skill.","【Plague Spread +8 → Plague Calamity +10】","I really am poisonous!","Chu Fu was frightened just reading the skill descriptions.","While she was looking through the skills, a private message came in.","It was from Holy Healing Angel.","“Plant Master, just now in Zone 009, you said you had a way to solve the problem of players joining the evil faction. Is that for real or not? I... I joined too, QAQ.”"]},{"number":152,"title":"Chapter 152: Methods for Stripping the Evil Faction, Sacred Potion","paragraphs":["Holy Healing Angel had excellent talent and had been one of the main players of the Universal Studio from the very beginning. With such impressive stats, of course she had taken the gold-tier equipment.","Although what she had done back then was rather excessive, fighting and killing had been commonplace in the early days of the game. Nobody had thought there was any right or wrong in a game.","Now that she knew the game might be connected to events in the real world, Holy Healing Angel felt somewhat guilty toward the players who had died at her hands. More than that, she was afraid Chu Fu might be too much of a stickler for right and wrong and would come to dislike her.","She truly knew she had been wrong. She hoped Chu Fu could find a way to help her, because she absolutely did not want to join the Evil God faction.","Especially since, once Werewolf Tuge was summoned eight days from now, wouldn’t she be unable to join them in farming contribution points?","Those contribution points could be exchanged for Talent Enhancement Stones and Skill Enhancement Stones. She needed them too.","Reminded by Holy Healing Angel, Chu Fu finally remembered that this was still an unfinished task.","“Don’t worry. I’ll ask around and find someone who knows!”","Chu Fu had seen methods for changing factions in the storyline.","The first method was for a Level 10 guild to build its own idol.","The idol of Huaxia was the Azure Dragon. After placing one’s faith in the Azure Dragon, its divine power could wash away the mark left by the Evil God.","The second method was to have a soul mage sever the soul bond on the mask through soul-splitting techniques.","However, this kind of mage had to be at least Level 70.","They could also look for an NPC, but NPCs like that were not on the Linjiang City map. They would only appear in later expansions.","The third method was to find a player with an SSS-rank talent who had awakened the ability to sever souls. Perhaps such a player could give it a try, but finding one would be like searching for a needle in a haystack.","The fourth method was to use a holy potion capable of dispelling an Evil God’s contract.","Coincidentally, Chu Fu knew someone who could accomplish the third method: Chu Feng.","With his Plunder skill, Chu Feng could sever the connection between a player and the Masquerader’s Mask.","The fourth method was actually more suitable for Chu Fu. The recipe for the holy potion would be difficult to obtain, and the ingredients would be even harder to find. But as long as she could gather them, Chu Fu could cultivate the ingredients in bulk.","When it was time to cling to a powerful ally, one had to do so.","Chu Fu had already added her brother as a friend.","His Masquerader’s Mask had already reached the Epic tier, so even his friends list could be concealed. His current ID was: My Little Sister Is Universally, Invincibly Adorable.","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: Calling Big Brother. Big Brother, do you know how players who joined the Evil faction can leave it? The few subordinates I’ve recruited have all become minions of the Evil God.","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: A lot of people are scared now and want to leave the Evil faction. Do you have a way to help them, Big Brother?","Seeing Chu Fu’s message, Chu Feng fell into thought.","Actually, he could do it himself.","If it were up to him, he really did not want to get involved. It would waste his time and create unnecessary contact with the authorities.","He did not care whether these people lived or died. All he needed was to survive in this world that was on the verge of destruction.","Because he knew how the future would unfold, he felt all the more strongly that there was no point in saving these people.","They would all die anyway.","Some of the Evil God’s minions might even come to believe that joining the Evil faction was the only way to escape the apocalypse.","But since Chu Fu had asked him to help, he naturally would.","Even if it was only to make Chu Fu a little happier.","[My Little Sister Is Universally, Invincibly Adorable]: I have a friend who can help, but he’s rather antisocial and never adds other people as friends. Give me a time, and after we arrange everything, we’ll take care of this.","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: Wow, Big Brother, you actually know someone so amazing! Then let’s set a time!","The two of them agreed on a time, and Chu Fu went to notify Laoji Fuli, telling the fifty players from Server 009 to wait in Linjiang City.","Of course, if some of them had not reached Level 20, Chu Fu would not bother with them for now. She could only deal with them when she had time later.","After thinking it over, Chu Fu also told Li Weizheng about the news.","Li Weizheng was instantly overjoyed when he heard.","“Student Chu, you’ve solved a huge problem for us. Do you know that? The situation in parts of Northern Europe is extremely bad right now.”","“Oh? What happened?”","While Chu Fu was in this world, she had discovered that news from the outside world arrived slowly.","After all, she was only one person and could not be everywhere at once.","She did not know what was happening around the globe at all.","Just managing the Thorn Guild was enough to keep her busy, and leveling up was even more important.","The authorities always received news the fastest.","“You should know that werewolves originated in Northern European culture. There have been countless movies about them, and some werewolves are even extremely popular.","“After Werewolf Tuge appeared, a great many people over there began worshiping him.","“Not only that, the area was already chaotic to begin with. Looting and rioting were almost part of the culture, and young people were especially fond of taking things without paying.","“On top of that, other rumors have started spreading recently: everything in the game will descend into reality, and only the Evil Gods can protect humanity. Any players who resist will die.","“So a large number of people have joined the Evil faction. Their levels are rising faster than those of normal players, and large-scale robberies have even begun occurring in the real world.","“Even though we’ve been on high alert, quite a few conflicts have broken out along the border recently. We absolutely cannot allow anything like that to happen in China!”","Chu Fu understood.","But Chu Feng was only one person. He could not help remove the Masquerader’s Masks from all the Evil-faction players across China’s 1,700 servers.","With that thought, Chu Fu still shared what she knew.","“The item is soulbound, so as long as you can find a way to remove the soul bond, it should be possible. Any player with a soul-related talent can give it a try.","“The other option is a holy potion specifically designed to dispel Evil contracts. I’ll look into it later. If you manage to find the potion and gather the ingredients, you can give them to me. I can produce the potion in bulk.”","Li Weizheng’s heart finally settled.","“No problem. I’ll report this to the higher-ups right away!”","Neither of them knew that this decision would have an even greater impact on the entire game.","In Northern Europe, the number of Evil-faction players had already reached 0.5% of the total player population.","The crime rate had increased by a thousandfold.","One person out of every two hundred was now a criminal.","Furthermore, just as China was doing everything in its power to stop it, a mysterious force was beginning to descend.","“The East refuses to submit to the rule of the gods. All beings of different faiths must be suppressed and eradicated. Go to the East and spread our doctrine. Let them know that the Beast God Church is humanity’s only hope of survival!”","...","Inside the game.","After hanging up the call, Chu Fu summoned everyone.","“Get ready, everyone. We’re heading to Linjiang City!”","This was not their first time going to Linjiang City, but in the past, they had never intended to stay there to level up and hunt monsters. They had not even entered any dungeons.","They had been unable to do so because their levels had been too low.","Now, they could finally make the journey.","First, they went to the mayor’s residence to report in. After leaving Fengdu Town, they would head to Linjiang City.","Then they would make another trip to Guguan Town to pick up Holy Healing Angel, Lu An, and Dream King.","The three of them had reached Level 20 by now.","Once they arrived in Linjiang City, they would also be able to form a twenty-person party and officially challenge the new dungeon!"]},{"number":153,"title":"Chapter 153: Old and New Main Character Teams","paragraphs":["New Character Update","【Character: Feng Huimin","Age: 33","IDs: Professional Manager Feng Huimin; Commander Feng Huimin","Talent: Quick-Witted (D)","Class: Commander","Skills: Charge, Defensive Formation, Battlefield Surveillance, Position Marking, Tactical Simulation.","Appearance: In reality, she wears black-rimmed glasses and professional attire, looking sharp and capable. In-game, she looks exactly like her equipment.","Role: Team commander, overall coordinator, and the protagonist’s chief secretary.","Personality: She makes the most of whatever position she holds and always keeps her eyes on the money. She can endure what ordinary people cannot and is exceptionally capable.】","...","【Character: Jiang Yunuo","Age: 17","ID: Bitter Melon King","Talent: Cage of Suffering (S)","Class: Pain Warlock","Skills: Pain-Healing Symbiosis, Pain Transference, Abyss of Agony","Role: Team damage dealer, damage amplifier, and team support.","Personality: She has a people-pleasing personality and is sensitive by nature. She works hard to become part of the team and follows in the protagonist’s footsteps.】","...","【ID: Zhimengzhe","Talent: Soul Bestower (A)","Class: Dollmaster","Skills: Coordinated Combat, Combat Enhancement, Puppet Double","Role: Summoner, damage-sharing specialist, battlefield divider, and team damage dealer.","Personality: Socially anxious.】","...","【Character: Shi Xiyue","Age: 19","ID: Twelve-Winged Holy Healing Angel","Talent: Angel of Resurrection (SS)","Class: Holy Priest","Skills: Gentle Healing, Dispel, Divine Healing, Holy Light Prayer, Radiance Upon the World","Role: Team healer, party resurrector, and provider of team-wide shields.","Personality: Innocent and pure, with a romantic nature. She loves high-end equipment and simply wants to enjoy playing the game. It is only after joining the Thorn Guild that she realizes just how good she has had it.】","...","【Character: Ji Weimin","Age: 92","ID: Laoji Fuli","Talent: Summon Loyal Souls (S)","Class: Lich King","Skills: Undead Summoning, Soul Harvest, Undead Domination, Soul Screech, Plague of the Deadlands","Role: An army-building summoner who can function as an entire team by himself.","Personality: A Chinese veteran. Salute!】","...","【ID: Lu An","Talent: Unbreakable Bones","Class: Guardian","Skills: Taunt, Shield Stance, Earthshaking War Cry","Role: Team tank—an indestructible cockroach who can take anything, though it still hurts.","Personality: An honest, straightforward man who does exactly as he is told. Loyal to his lord, he eventually abandons the darkness for the light.】","...","【Character: Xu Can","Age: 32","ID: Eighteen Stabs","Talent: Vengeful Spirit!","Class: Blood Vengeance Assassin (Hidden Class)","Skills: Vanishing Blood Mist, Bloody Backstab","Role: Team damage dealer, team scout, expert monster lurer, and PvP fanatic.","Personality: She used to love handsome men, but after being swindled out of 500,000 yuan, she never trusted love again. She refuses to spend a single cent on men and despises them—all except her nephew. She hates evil and takes justice into her own hands, personally killing her enemies. This ultimately becomes the catalyst for Wan Huanyu’s death and marks the beginning of her rise as a future superstar assassin.】","...","Protagonist Group Update","【ID: Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?","Talents: Vegetable (SSS), Poisonous Body (S)","Class: Poisonmaster","Skills: Deadly Poison, Slow, Plague Spread +8, Poison Spray, Venomous Vein Awakening, Vicious Detonation, Corrosive Poison Barrier","Appearance: Dressed in the Venom Dragon Set, with demonic wings on his back and a purple mushroom staff in hand.】","【ID: Rocket on a Wheelchair","Talents: Mechanical Modification (SSS), Metal Manipulation (A)","Current mech height: 20 meters.】","【ID: What Did You Call This Blind Guy?","Talents: Mind’s Eye (S), Myriad Swords Return as One (S)","Current weapon: Dark Gold-tier King’s Sword.】","【ID: Proud but Never Spoiled","Talents: Fearless Body (S), Mother Earth (A)】","【ID: Suture Saint","Talents: Thousand Hands of Salvation (S), Avatar Outside the Law (S)】"]},{"number":154,"title":"Chapter 154: Slaying Stars Monopolizes the Speedrun Leaderboard, Narrowing the Path for Those Who Follow","paragraphs":["Shen Chi’s mech had transformed yet again.","After gaining Metal Manipulation, the mech’s interior expanded considerably. It could now seat twenty people.","Not only that, but the mech could shrink at any time, down to a minimum height of three meters. This allowed it to participate in battles in caves and palaces.","Its strength had increased tremendously.","The group of thirteen headed for Linjiang City. This time, they had all reached the required level, so they first reported to the guards.","The guard was surprisingly considerate. “Esteemed Plant-Man Awakened One, we have records of your repeated visits to Linjiang City. Would you like a soldier to guide you around the city again?”","[System Notification: Would you like to skip the tutorial quest?]","Chu Fu skipped it immediately.","Lu An, Holy Healing Angel, and Dream King, however, could not skip it.","They still had to go through the tutorial quest.","While Chu Fu and the others went to bind themselves to the city’s teleportation array, they would be able to return directly to Linjiang City whenever they used a Return Scroll in the future.","Returning to Fengdu Town would not be difficult either. After all, every one of them owned property there.","What was more, Chu Fu could even return to Wangxi Village—now known as Thorny Town.","As the town’s mayor, she had also given everyone present a job in Thorny Town:","Thorny Town Guard.","At critical moments, they could teleport directly back to Thorny Town.","After binding herself to the teleportation array, Chu Fu went to the Skill Awakening Hall.","Candles burned throughout the hall, which was decorated in dazzling splendor. There were far more instructors here than in the crude square and tiny building of the novice village. The place was practically luxurious by comparison.","The hall was also enormous. There were so many players that they even had to queue.","Of the people in Chu Fu’s group, only Little Sister Wu had yet to reach Level 25. Everyone else was already Level 25.","Little Sister Wu was beginning to regret her decision.","She had originally thought that giving up her spot in the party would only cost her some attribute points. She had not expected it to cost her experience and contribution points as well.","What a loss!","Especially after learning that Shafu Liangu and Zhimengzhe—both players who had originally possessed A-rank talents—had exchanged for Talent Enhancement Stones and upgraded their talents to S-rank.","She was genuinely starting to panic.","She was the only one in the entire party without an S-rank talent.","Would they kick her out?","When the group had not immediately set out for Linjiang City, Little Sister Wu had even suspected that they were planning to leave her behind.","After all, if she and Suture Saint both left, there would be no player in Fengdu Town capable of using resurrection magic.","The players in their Thorny Guild all possessed A-rank talents, and losing even one of them would be a major blow. From that perspective, staying behind to hold down the fort had indeed been the best choice.","But she wanted to go to Linjiang City with them!","Little Sister Wu was so anxious that she could hardly sit still.","Fortunately, they had not abandoned her.","From now on, she absolutely, definitely would not give up her place in the party again.","Just as she was thinking this, another group entered through the hall’s main doors.","It was Laoji Fuli and his companions.","Although Laoji Fuli did not have a mech, as the Lich King, he could kill certain flying monsters and then summon their undead remains.","That allowed him to ride an undead bird over.","His speed was not particularly fast, so although Chu Fu had spent some time establishing the town and dealing with various matters, she and Laoji Fuli still arrived in Linjiang City at roughly the same time.","Laoji Fuli had clearly come looking for Chu Fu specifically. Otherwise, as a Level 30 player, he would have learned his skills long ago.","“Captain Plant is here too? Have you run the new dungeon yet? Want to go together?”","Little Sister Wu jumped up. “I’m not giving up my spot this time, no matter how much you offer!”","Seeing the look on Little Sister Wu’s face—the look of someone who had suffered a colossal loss—Chu Fu understood that she was regretting her decision so badly that her intestines had turned green.","Laoji Fuli chuckled, then said, “Don’t worry, kid. The city dungeon can hold up to twenty people now. There’s room for everyone.”","Not only was there room for everyone, but Chu Fu’s group had only thirteen people, leaving seven open spots.","However, Chu Fu had no intention of running it with Laoji Fuli.","“There are still plenty of members in the Thorny Guild who haven’t run this dungeon. There are also quite a few Level 20 players coming here now, so we plan to compete for the fastest-clear rankings!”","“For outsiders, since the fastest-clear rankings can be challenged as many times as you like, the price is a little lower. One point to all attributes costs ten gold coins. If you want to join us, you can pay to come along. We have seven spots available.”","There were three dungeons in Linjiang City.","The first could be entered at Level 22 and was called The Lich’s Conspiracy.","It still had four difficulty levels: Normal, Hard, Nightmare, and Hell.","The rewards, however, had changed.","The first-clear rewards had long since been claimed, but a fastest-clear ranking had been added.","The top five on the ranking would all receive rewards.","On Normal difficulty, the rewards were five, four, three, two, and one points to all attributes respectively.","For example, if a party first claimed the reward for fifth place on the fastest-clear ranking and later took first place, the rewards would be made up to the first-place reward. They would not receive a combined reward of one plus five.","That was why Chu Fu intended to take first place only.","The four difficulty levels awarded five, ten, fifteen, and twenty points to all attributes respectively, for a total of fifty points.","In other words, one person would cost 500 gold coins. Seven spots would bring in 3,500 gold coins.","Laoji Fuli froze, then gave the group another careful look.","“Are you certain you can clear the fastest-clear ranking? To be honest, I’ve already taken second place. I’m only one reward away from first, and the difference isn’t that great. You may not understand the situation, but this ranking isn’t easy to break!”","“You can find the clear times on the forums. They’re simply ridiculous!”","“I don’t know whether you’ve heard of Lu Xing. He claimed the fastest times on most of these dungeons. He clearly has no intention of letting anyone else take second place!”","Laoji Fuli shook his head helplessly. He felt that Lu Xing had already walked so far ahead that he had left everyone behind with no path to follow.","Besides, he was already Level 30 and could no longer enter the first dungeon. He had only come to secure spots for some promising players in the Junhun Guild.","If money could solve the problem, he was more than willing to pay. With their nation-level efficiency, making money was far easier for them than it was for ordinary farming studios.","What was more, if Chu Fu and the others truly had the ability, he could join them for the second dungeon, The Lich King’s Scream, which was for Levels 25–30, as well as the final dungeon, Destroy the Undead Calamity, for Levels 30–35.","The Destroy the Undead Calamity dungeon dropped Dark Gold equipment. At present, only the top Level 30 players in all of Linjiang City could barely gather enough people to clear it once.","So far, only three parties had cleared the dungeon, and none of their members had changed.","Well, one of those “parties” was not actually a party at all.","It was a single person.","Lu Xing.","Still him.","Quite a few Level 30 players had already decided to give up on competing for the fastest-clear rankings and head straight to the next map.","Chu Fu had not paid much attention to the dungeon clear times. Before she could check them, it was already her turn in line.","“Wait a moment. I’m going to learn a skill. I’ll be back shortly.”","Chu Fu pointed ahead, then walked over.","The class-change instructor smiled.","“Learning a skill costs five gold coins!”","No wonder he was smiling so happily.","What a rip-off!"]},{"number":155,"title":"Chapter 155: Brother Drops His Disguise, Slaying Angels for Fufu","paragraphs":["These days, five gold coins could fetch fifteen million outside.","But then again, once the money outside became worthless paper, it wouldn’t make sense to calculate things that way.","For a level-20 player, five gold coins really wasn’t much.","It was about enough to bankrupt an ordinary player!","Chu Fu paid five silver coins and placed her hand on the crystal.","She wondered what skill she would learn this time.","What was she lacking now?","It seemed like nothing.","But before entering the dungeon—no, no, first she had to meet up with her brother and remove the Disguiser Mask. That was the plan.","Just as she was thinking this, Chu Fu suddenly felt that she had learned something.","[System Notification: You have learned Soul-Eating Venom. Cast it on a target using mental power to inflict tremendous damage on its soul.","It is effective against possession, soul contracts, soul-bound items, and similar effects.","It can forcibly break contracts, curses, and surveillance imposed on you, devouring their effects.]","Huh?","Wait, this seemed to be...","Chu Fu’s eyes widened slightly.","This looked like another skill capable of removing the Disguiser Mask.","She really had gotten exactly what she wanted.","“Awakened, please move aside after completing your awakening. There are still other awakened players waiting to use the Wisdom Stone.”","Chu Fu stepped aside.","Shen Chi walked up.","“What is it? Did you learn something good?”","Chu Fu displayed the skill and said, “I can now solve the problem of players joining the evil faction. Things really do go exactly as planned.”","“Things go exactly as planned? I’ll give it a try too!” Shen Chi stepped forward.","He paid five gold coins and began thinking about how to use Trait 5 without turning into a robot. Then he wondered if it had something to do with his Metal Manipulation talent.","After thinking it over, he also considered that Chu Fu might not be able to handle everything by herself. There were still quite a few people in China who had been deceived and become the lackeys of the werewolf Tuge.","The moment he thought of that, he instantly felt that he had learned something.","[System Notification: You have learned Violent Disassembly. Control mechanical tools to forcibly remove an opponent’s items. There is a chance of shattering equipment the opponent is wearing. The effect of disassembly is increased by 200% against machines, mechanisms, statues, and buildings.]","What?","He displayed the skill.","“Why did I learn this too?”","Still, it went rather well with Chu Fu’s skill.","Xie Lin stepped forward.","“Wheelchair, you’re being far too careless. Every skill is important. Don’t learn skills that have nothing to do with you, and don’t waste your time trying to serve the masses. Making yourself stronger is what matters most! Watch this!”","Xie Lin paid five gold coins, closed his eyes, and placed his hand on the Wisdom Crystal. Then he shouted loudly:","“Activate!”","Chu Fu struggled not to laugh.","Oh no. A chuunibyou teenager!","However, Xie Lin’s conviction was incredibly strong. With his eyes covered, he slightly raised his exquisite jawline. After shouting “Activate,” the corners of his mouth curled upward, making him look even more confident.","“Hahaha!”","He displayed his skill.","[Swordflight: Enlarge a weapon into a vehicle and perform controlled flight. Unaffected by no-fly zones.]","“Awesome!”","Even Chu Fu couldn’t help applauding.","It might seem that everyone now had wings for flight, while Chu Fu had her Venom Dragon Wings and Xie Lin had his mecha.","But no one should forget that BOSSes could also impose no-fly effects.","Xie Lin’s skill, however, had extremely high authority and was unaffected by no-fly restrictions.","Moreover, during a BOSS battle, when the BOSS was slightly smaller in size, melee fighters couldn’t all rush in at once.","That meant the number of available melee damage dealers was limited. Their team currently had only three: Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao, Xie Lin, and Wu Yingchun.","If Xie Lin became an aerial fighter, a melee position would be freed up, allowing the team to add more melee players.","The others went on to comprehend their skills one after another.","Chu Fu, meanwhile, was called over by Laoji Fuli.","“Captain Plant, I’ve made up my mind. I want to buy a spot in your team. When are you entering the dungeon?”","“At least two hours from now.”","“Fine. We’ll wait for you at the dungeon entrance.”","Chu Fu nodded, then opened her brother’s contact.","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: “Big Brother, look what I awakened. You don’t have to come back anymore, so you won’t have to make the trip for nothing. I can handle it myself. [Skill: Soul-Eating Venom].”","On Chu Feng’s end, he stared at his little sister’s message, feeling that something was off.","[My Little Sister Is Universally Adorable]: “Fu-Fu, you know? Big Brother wasn’t deliberately hiding it from you! I just didn’t want to deal with the officials.”","When Chu Fu saw his reply, she realized that she had accidentally exposed his alternate identity.","She had only casually said, “You don’t have to come over,” but Chu Feng had immediately confessed that he was looking for a friend.","Chu Fu hadn’t meant to expose him. She had simply blurted it out without thinking. She hadn’t expected Chu Feng to admit it right away.","She was caught between laughter and tears, especially since Chu Feng continued messaging her.","[My Little Sister Is Universally Adorable]: “Fu-Fu, don’t be angry. What do you want? Big Brother will buy it for you.”","[My Little Sister Is Universally Adorable]: “Didn’t you want to give those players who joined the evil faction a chance to reform? I got this for you. [Holy Potion Formula].”","[My Little Sister Is Universally Adorable]: “Can you accept it as an apology from your big brother?”","Chu Fu: ...","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: “Th-then I forgive you, Big Brother!”","She hadn’t been angry in the first place, but now she could only force herself to forgive him!","She hadn’t expected Chu Feng to have already obtained the formula she had been thinking about.","But then again, it made perfect sense. The method she knew was also known to Chu Feng. Even without the memories of his second life, he had still lived for a very long time in his first life.","He had just lived it rather miserably.","[My Little Sister Is Universally Adorable]: “I’ll send it to you. And as for solving the Disguiser Mask problem yourselves, I’m a little worried too. This kind of thing can’t be resolved simply by separating the soul from the body.”","Chu Feng still intended to come over.","Naturally, Chu Fu agreed.","However, Chu Feng still reminded her not to expose his identity.","Chu Fu agreed to that as well.","...","Linjiang City, Mirror Future Map, Level 40–50 Area.","A small mountain had collapsed in front of Chu Feng.","From a distance, it could be seen that the “mountain” was actually a baby with smooth, delicate skin.","If not for the fact that the baby was a full twenty meters long, it would have been an incredibly adorable baby angel.","But this was a level-50 BOSS—the Son of the Holy Light God, an elemental creature of the light attribute. The holy light it unleashed could dissolve everything.","If it appeared above Linjiang City, even the city’s protective barrier would shatter. The buildings would melt, and humanity would be completely wiped out.","This was the final BOSS of the level-50 expansion, Elemental Storm.","At present, the others naturally knew nothing about the level-50 expansion. Chu Feng, however, could enter future maps by increasing his combat power and hunt down BOSSes.","That was why he had never had teammates, nor did he need any.","He didn’t know how long he would have to continue walking this solitary path.","Perhaps he would have to fight alone all the way until he cleared the Primordial Gate."]},{"number":156,"title":"Chapter 156: 5 Minutes and 23 Seconds, Is That So Hard","paragraphs":["One hour later, Lu An, Holy Healing Angel, and Dream King completed the guidance quest.","The group gathered once more and left the city.","Less than a hundred meters outside the city, wandering skeleton soldiers were already roaming about. The soldiers on the walls kept drawing their bows and firing arrows, killing the skeletons that came charging toward them.","The skeleton soldiers came endlessly. Their bones shattered across the ground, only to reassemble less than a minute later.","The situation in Linjiang City was far worse than in Fengdu Town.","That wasn’t all. After being polluted by the aura of death for so long, the land around Linjiang City had completely withered. There was no vegetation left, and every plant species had gone extinct.","A kilometer east of the city, several people saw a mysterious figure in a black robe standing there, radiating a terrifying aura.","His entire body was covered by the black robe. Only his shoes and a pair of daggers were visible.","The daggers were red as blood, dripping with black baleful energy. Their special effects shot into the sky.","Epic-grade daggers!","Moreover, two scarlet characters hovered above the figure’s head.","ID: Lu Xing","The number-one player on the level rankings.","Everyone held their breath.","Holy Healing Angel stammered, “P-Plant... Big shot, is this the brother’s friend you mentioned—the one who came to help?”","She had never met Chu Fu’s brother.","She just never expected that Chu Fu’s brother would actually know the number-one player on the rankings.","And the big shot’s presence was far too imposing. He hadn’t shown his face at all, yet just one of his weapons looked powerful enough to cut down everyone present.","Chu Fu gave a brief introduction. “Of course my brother’s friend is amazing. I won’t introduce him properly, though. Don’t waste the number-one player’s time. Let’s get this over with!”","Everyone hurriedly nodded and walked over.","Before they could greet him, Chu Feng stood up. His voice was hoarse, clearly altered by the Disguiser’s Mask.","“You already have skills capable of dealing with the Disguiser’s Mask yourselves. Try using your own abilities first!”","“Sure, I’ll go first!”","Chu Fu looked toward Holy Healing Angel and invited her to leave the party. Otherwise, there was no way to force a PvP attack on her.","Then Chu Fu waved the Slightly Poisonous Staff and cast Soul-Eroding Poison on Holy Healing Angel.","The moment the spell was cast, a blue radiance representing the soul struck Holy Healing Angel.","With her mental perception, Chu Fu saw Holy Healing Angel’s soul.","Her soul was trembling, and there was a mask attached to it. The mask wore a strange smile.","Chu Fu immediately controlled her skill and attacked that smiling face.","In an instant, the poison spread across the other party’s cheeks.","To the people watching from the outside, it looked as if Chu Fu had struck Holy Healing Angel in the face with a single move. Her face immediately turned blue.","“Ah!” Holy Healing Angel felt tremendous pain in her face.","At that moment, Suture Saint raised his hand. Countless needles stabbed into Holy Healing Angel’s body, restoring her health.","Holy Healing Angel had been completely unprepared and had nearly been killed instantly by Chu Fu.","“Heal yourself!” Chu Fu shouted.","Only then did Holy Healing Angel recover and begin treating herself. However, she discovered that the pain continued unabated. Even after healing herself, her face still hurt.","That was because this was a soul attack.","What was more, she felt as if something were corroding her face, like sulfuric acid.","If she hadn’t been certain that this was a game, she really would have burst into tears.","Crack!","The Disguiser’s Mask’s eerie smiling face appeared on Holy Healing Angel’s face, then suddenly shattered.","Chu Fu’s skill had broken the mask.","The entire process had taken only three minutes.","But as the mask shattered, an evil force swelled outward, instantly transforming into a hideous ball of flesh.","In the blink of an eye, the ball expanded to three meters in diameter. Its outer layer rapidly hardened into a layer of keratin, and hair began to grow across it.","It had transformed into a monster.","“Look out!”","Jiao Jiao Isn’t Delicate shouted and charged forward with her shield.","At that moment, Chu Feng made his move.","With a single slash, he cut the ball of flesh in half.","A massive damage number erupted from the monster—so large that no one could even count all the digits at a glance.","The monster was slain instantly. Its swollen body deflated like a punctured balloon, and ten pieces of Evil God divine-power material dropped to the ground.","Chu Feng picked them up.","Given his current disguised identity, it would not have been appropriate to leave the items with Chu Fu and the others.","This was the first time Chu Fu had seen anything like this. The plot hadn’t described it in detail, either.","After all, Chu Feng had never participated in this sort of world-saving endeavor.","“We couldn’t tell whether we’d be able to defeat that monster,” Chu Fu said.","Chu Feng’s hoarse voice rang out.","“Even if you can, don’t fight it yet. You’re all only level 25, and you haven’t even completed the first clear of the dungeon!”","He suddenly thought of something and coughed.","“Though, my record won’t be easy to beat.”","Back then, he had only cared about speed and hadn’t left any room for those who came after him. He had never expected his little sister to form such a powerful team.","Now she couldn’t even obtain the attribute points from beating his record.","“The big shot is incredible. We’ll work hard too!” Chu Fu said.","Then she looked toward Holy Healing Angel again.","“How are you feeling? Are you still a player of the Evil faction?”","Holy Healing Angel laughed and cried at the same time.","“I’m no longer part of the Evil faction, but all my attributes have dropped by ten points.”","That was the price.","Because of that price, many players might not want to switch back.","After all, losing ten points in every attribute was equivalent to losing the attributes gained from eight levels!","Next, it was Lu An’s turn.","This time, Shen Chi took action. Using metal manipulation, he transformed one of the mecha’s arms into an iron clamp.","The clamp seized Lu An’s head from both sides and began forcibly prying it downward.","Lu An felt as if his head were about to be crushed.","This time, Holy Healing Angel and Suture Saint healed him together. Shen Chi took only one minute to remove the mask, making him even faster than Chu Fu.","Chu Feng struck again, destroying the Evil God’s power attached to the mask.","Chu Feng said, “Your two abilities are better suited to the wheelchair method outside of combat. The vegetative-state method takes too long.","“But in combat, the vegetative-state method is stronger. After all, it’s difficult for anyone to dodge a spell-based skill.","“Moreover, it might be faster to kill the target first and then take the mask.","“Of course, I’m referring to enemies.","“By dismantling the Disguiser’s Mask, you’re effectively provoking the Beast God and challenging the spread of its faith. Sooner or later, it will send players from the Evil faction after you.","“It may be somewhat difficult for them to target you in the game.","“In the real world, it will be much easier.","“Don’t use this method again before level 30!”","Chu Feng gave them a warning.","Chu Fu found his reasoning sound.","Even if they wanted to use the method, they should wait until level 30, after everyone had extracted their attributes.","“Understood. Thank you, big shot.”","“Mm. I’m leaving! Go try to break the speed-clear rankings!”","Chu Feng activated stealth and vanished from the spot in an instant.","“The big shot clearly doesn’t think we can beat his record!”","“Five minutes and twenty-three seconds. Is that really so difficult? It’s not like flying is forbidden,” Shen Chi said.","The group exchanged glances and laughed."]},{"number":157,"title":"Chapter 157: Taking the Boss into the New Dungeon, Hope You All Can Learn Some Strategy Tips","paragraphs":["Because the matter concerning the Faceless Mask was resolved so quickly, Chu Fu asked Laoji Fuli whether they could enter the dungeon ahead of schedule.","Laoji Fuli naturally had no objections.","Chu Fu and the others boarded Shen Chi’s mech and headed for the entrance to the dungeon “The Necromancer’s Conspiracy.”","It was a desolate, deathly silent mountain surrounded by a fog of death that prevented players from approaching.","The moment anyone stepped into the fog, a prompt would appear: “Would you like to enter the dungeon ‘The Necromancer’s Conspiracy’? Please select a difficulty.”","Since the town defense battle in Region 001 had ended nine days ago, and experts from Region 009 had also reached Level 20, “The Necromancer’s Conspiracy” could be considered a mainstream dungeon in the top tier.","Of course, the very best players had already reached Level 30, and Laoji Fuli was no exception.","The moment Chu Fu and the others arrived, they caused an uproar among the surrounding players.","After all, this was a super-sized mech. Even Level 20 players couldn’t help exclaiming at the sight of it.","The group didn’t even climb down from the mech. They simply waited there, clearly underestimating how famous they had become.","“Holy crap! That looks like the top team from the Thorny Guild—the Rocket on a Wheelchair super-sized mech!”","“My God, it’s huge! It looks like Optimus Prime.”","“Why didn’t I choose Mechanic? The longer I play, the more hopeless I feel. Those S-rank players are just too strong.”","The conversations constantly reached the group’s ears, and everyone wore a different expression.","Suture Saint said, “We entered the game a month later than everyone else, but we’ve finally caught up with the main force?”","The corners of Xie Lin’s mouth lifted as he analyzed the situation rationally. “The true main force is actually at Level 30, but most players are indeed around Level 25. Let’s try to reach Level 30 within ten days! I’ve studied Lu Xing’s leveling method, and I think we can replicate it!”","Chu Fu pondered this.","Her brother, Chu Feng, had a very simple leveling method: farm high-level bosses!","He rarely entered dungeons. After reaching Linjiang City, he used the teleportation arrays to travel around at breakneck speed, killing world bosses.","World bosses were completely different from map bosses.","Every one of them was an existence capable of destroying the world.","Their combat strength was terrifying, and each one had more than a hundred million HP.","“The only problem is that it might cost an enormous amount of money. We’ll have to use teleportation arrays. We can’t rely on flying for everything, can we?”","Chu Fu shook her head. “But I think our advantage lies in large-scale area attacks and clearing out monsters. My new ability is also better suited for fighting monsters.","“Once we reach the cities, the map will be fully unlocked. We’ll be able to farm higher-level monsters. The experience might not be any slower than constantly running back and forth, and we’ll also gain achievement attribute points.”","Xie Lin thought she had a point.","“That works too. Lu Xing’s method is actually rather likely to offend people. The other cities have their own local guilds, and they want to farm bosses as well! Just look at that enormous red name of his. Still, it’s incredibly cool!”","Xie Lin felt that, in terms of sheer style, he was still no match for Lu Xing.","However, catching up to the truly top-tier players was merely a matter of time.","He didn’t believe he was inferior to anyone.","That was the confidence of an esports player.","Everyone was equal.","As they chatted, quite a few players came over to take photos and ask whether they could join them in fighting monsters.","Chu Fu naturally turned them all down, saying that they were waiting for someone.","Before long, seven players bearing the title “Military Spirit” rode over on brown warhorses.","Warhorses could be rented in Linjiang City. They were not as fast as copper-hide rhinos, and despite being called warhorses, they would panic and throw their riders off the moment combat began.","They were not combat mounts at all.","Once they arrived, they naturally spotted Shen Chi’s mech.","Since they couldn’t see Chu Fu and the others, they could only crane their necks and wave up at Shen Chi.","“Wheelchair Boss, Laoji sent us to run the dungeon with you!”","Shen Chi crouched down. The hatch in the mech’s chest opened, and one of its arms extended downward to serve as a staircase.","“Come on up!”","All seven received a party invitation from Chu Fu.","They then entered Shen Chi’s mech, unable to hide their excitement.","A high-tech special-class player whose abilities surpassed modern technology was simply too cool.","Chu Fu said, “Since this is your first time running a dungeon with us, let me explain the rules first.","“Because you paid to come along, you won’t need to take action at any point during the dungeon, and your contribution won’t be counted.","“You may participate in auctions for all the loot dropped throughout the dungeon, but you won’t have any right to share in the profits.","“Each person pays ten gold coins for one all-attribute point. Payment is settled after every run.","“Understood?”","The seven players were clearly displeased by this, but they were disciplined—and they also wanted to prove themselves.","A player with the ID Vanguard Edge said, “Plant-Lady, the seven of us are among the finest members of the Military Spirit Guild. I currently have the S-rank Vanguard talent, which increases all attributes by 100 percent. My physical fitness and overall combat ability are both extremely powerful.","“I hope to run this dungeon with you so that I can learn more. Afterward, I can lead the other warriors in our guild and help us set even better records.","“If you don’t let us fight, the educational value of this experience will be greatly reduced.","“Besides, what if the damage we deal and our contribution are higher than those of your team members?”","His gaze swept over the most famous members before settling on Shafu Liangu, Zhimengzhe, Bitter Melon King, and Dream King.","His attention lingered especially on Dream King. Although he was also a member of the Thorny Guild, he had not participated in the battle in Region 009.","He was not well known.","Dream King immediately blew his top.","“Why are you looking at me? I have an S-rank talent too! And it’s completely original—I’ve never used an Enhancement Stone!”","“Isn’t that better than all you A-rank players?”","He directly displayed his “Psychokinesis (S)” talent.","Another special-class player.","Chu Fu smiled helplessly.","Fortunately, Dream King had already joined the Esports Academy.","Otherwise, even this little piece of information would certainly have been recorded and specifically studied.","“What you said makes sense. Fine, give it a try.”","“Wheelchair Brother, let’s go!”","Shen Chi sealed the cockpit and headed toward the dense fog of death.","Chu Fu received a system prompt.","“Please select a difficulty: Normal, Hard, Nightmare, Hell.”","Chu Fu selected Normal difficulty.","The next moment, the mech and all twenty people vanished from the spot and entered the dungeon.","Their vision went black. When it returned, they found themselves in another land of death.","The fog had dispersed. Withered grass covered the ground, and bare trees rose all around them. Crows perched on the black branches, staring at the enormous mech that had appeared out of nowhere with blood-red eyes.","In the distance was a wandering horde of skeletons.","There were roughly two hundred of them.","Yet Shen Chi showed no intention of letting the others out to fight the monsters. With a deep mechanical hum, the mech charged toward the distant mountain.","The entire dungeon covered an area ten kilometers across. Even running through the whole place in five minutes and twenty-three seconds would be extremely difficult.","Therefore, while studying the strategy, the strategists, commanders, and recruited guide-team players of the Military Soul Guild all agreed that Lu Xing was incredibly fast, possessed the ability to turn invisible, and knew a secret route leading to the boss.","But none of that needed to be taken into consideration when it came to the Thorn Guild’s team.","Because they could fly.","Shen Chi said calmly, “I hope you can learn a few useful strategies from this!”"]},{"number":158,"title":"Chapter 158: The War King Duan Feng Doubts Life, Feeling Surrounded by Giants","paragraphs":["The mecha’s speed was comparable to that of a fighter jet.","Soldier King Soulbreaker and the others’ expressions changed.","What was there left to learn?","How to fly a fighter jet? Then again, Soulbreaker really could fly one. The problem was, where were they supposed to find a fighter jet for him to fly?","The mecha, traveling at 2,000 kilometers per hour, took only twenty seconds to rush from the foot of the mountain straight to the Necromancer’s courtyard.","According to the game’s settings, the Necromancer was still inside the room studying necromancy. He would only come out to fight after a player entered the courtyard.","Soldier King Soulbreaker wondered if Shen Chi had prevented them from leaving so that he could defeat the boss all by himself.","If that were the case, they really wouldn’t receive any contribution points.","But clearly, he was judging a gentleman by his own petty standards.","Shen Chi set everyone down.","Chu Fu said, “Leave the people behind us a little leeway. We’ll start fighting at the five-minute-ten-second mark.”","“Yeah. Wait a moment—I’ll check the official website for a guide and see whether this boss has any pointless dialogue.”","If the boss suddenly started rambling at twenty percent health and became forcibly invincible or something, it would waste time. Their schedule was already extremely tight, and they would have to run the dungeon all over again.","Soldier King Soulbreaker felt that they were being far too careless.","“There’s nothing like that!” he replied.","He had watched the dungeon guide many times and knew how to deal with this boss. With the current level-25 players from the War Soul Guild leading the party, defeating this boss alone would take three minutes.","The problem was that it took them two minutes just to reach the courtyard.","It was an incredibly narrow margin.","But for Chu Fu and the others, would thirteen seconds really be enough?","That was a tenfold difference.","Chu Fu also confirmed that there was no cutscene and began making preparations.","She wanted to try out her Plantman talent’s Trait 5 after it had reached SSS rank.","Chu Fu began summoning her plants.","She was now level 25. On top of that, upgrading the Plantman talent to SSS rank had increased the number of plants she could control. She could now control a hundred plants.","She decided to spread the wealth evenly: fifteen Dandelions, fifteen Lala Vines, fifteen Watermelon Bombs, fifteen Charm Mushrooms, and fifteen Chompers.","That left twenty-five slots, which she filled entirely with Gatling Corn.","These plants occupied a tremendous amount of space. Once they were all summoned, they took up most of the school plaza.","The skeleton mobs still wandering around in the direction they had come from were instantly wiped out.","“Fusion!”","Chu Fu activated her talent.","In that instant, all the plants fused into her body.","Chu Fu clearly felt a terrifying surge in her attributes.","Her body began to change as well. Her skin radiated a green glow, while living plant fibers crawled over her arms.","Every strand of her hair instantly turned green, taking on the appearance of Lala Vines. Chu Fu even developed the sensation that she could control her hair as easily as she controlled her own fingers.","Her eyes turned purple, and her pupils took on the shape of mushrooms, brimming with an alluring charm as purple spores continuously sprayed from them.","Her arms transformed into green roots. Fifteen Dandelion hot-air balloons sprouted from her shoulders and floated in the air, while her fingers and toes became buzzing, chainsaw-like Dandelions.","The Chompers fused together into a downward-flaring skirt. Several mouths appeared along its hem, writhing ceaselessly, as though they could swallow up every inch of ground she passed over.","Watermelon Bombs and Gatling Corn decorated the skirt, making her look ready to launch into battle at any moment.","Chu Fu’s entire body grew from 168 centimeters tall into a three-meter-tall giant.","Of course, she could become even larger, but she was already maintaining her smallest form inside the dungeon.","The Necromancer wasn’t very large, after all. If she grew too big, attacking him would actually become more difficult.","Soldier King Soulbreaker stared at Chu Fu’s bizarre appearance, his mouth hanging open.","Who could even tell which one was the boss now?","You look even more terrifying than the evil Necromancer!","“Whoa! Plant Girl, you turned green!”","That was true. Chu Fu’s entire skin was now green.","But her combat power was practically invincible.","On the other side, Shen Chi was unwilling to be outdone.","Using metal manipulation, he began compressing his mecha. He also slightly activated Trait 5 of his Mechanic class, shrinking the twenty-meter-tall mecha down to roughly three meters.","When the colossal machine was compressed to three meters, Shen Chi’s current mass became astonishing.","The power unleashed by this mecha was actually several times greater than that of its twenty-meter-tall form.","And he now had a massive cleaver in his hand.","Because of his metal manipulation, the cleaver could extend up to fifty meters.","Xie Lin naturally refused to be outdone either. He spent guild contribution points to take a hundred weapons out of the guild warehouse.","The King’s Sword was now beneath his feet, while countless longswords hovered behind him, flashing with silver and green light.","“You’re all showing off, huh? Then look at mine—the Mother of the Earth!”","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao stomped both feet, and countless clods of soil rose into the air, forming a row of earthen-armored soldiers.","“Whoa! Are you summoning the Terracotta Army? Jiao Jiao, are you secretly Qin Shi Huang?”","Suture Saint laughed as he summoned an identical clone of himself.","During the previous town-defense battle, Shafu Liangu and Zhimengzhe had not only earned a considerable amount of contribution points themselves, but had also spent a huge sum of money to finally upgrade their A-rank talents to S-rank.","Shafu Liangu summoned an army of Gu insects: spiders, moths, centipedes, scorpions, and bees.","Every single one of them was as fat as a thousand-jin pig.","Zhimengzhe still summoned only his doll, but the doll now possessed a pair of dragon pupils. Just meeting its gaze was enough to leave someone intimidated.","The battle had yet to begin, but Soldier King Broken Edge already felt surrounded by colossal beings.","He had participated in the previous town-defense battle as well, but he had been following Laoji Fuli at the time. The only people around him had been Laoji Fuli, Suture Saint, and Wu Yingchun.","Suture Saint had indeed been extremely powerful, with wide-area attacks and explosive skills.","But an area-of-effect skill could hit many targets, so its advantage was not as obvious against a single boss.","Soldier King Broken Edge could not fly either, and the town-defense battle had been so chaotic that he had barely had time to look at the others.","Only now, observing them from such a close distance, did he realize how terrifyingly powerful every member of Chu Fu’s party was.","Of course, there was still one person whose abilities he knew nothing about.","He gritted his teeth and sent them a private message.","“Everyone, we only need to surpass one person’s damage contribution. That level-20 Dream King looks like a utility-type player. As long as we beat him, we’ll be fine!”","Everyone nodded in agreement.","Time passed little by little.","Chu Fu was still experimenting with her Plantman transformation. Combining different plants produced different gigantic Plantman forms.","At the same time, she continued planting Charm Mushrooms, then began feeding them to her Chompers.","What delicious mushrooms. A Little Toxic ate them, then Plantman ate them afterward—one mushroom, two meals. Nothing went to waste.","Soon, the time reached five minutes and ten seconds.","“Everyone, get ready!”","Chu Fu pushed open the gate to the Necromancer’s courtyard.","“Who dares disturb my necromantic research? You’ll all become skeletons and serve as my summoned creatures!”","The Necromancer stepped out from inside.","Three seconds were wasted.","“Attack!”","In the next moment, countless rays of light and skills bombarded the Necromancer."]},{"number":159,"title":"Chapter 159: Taking First Place on the Speedrun Leaderboard, Thinking I Gave It My All, but Actually I Was Just Casually Controlling My Score","paragraphs":["Necromancers themselves were a distinct class. After becoming mages, their physiques deteriorated until they were left with nothing but a skeleton-like frame. Without passive skills such as Bone Enhancement, every necromancer was just a short old man.","This necromancer was only a little over 1.7 meters tall, and the Gate of Origins was a true-to-life game.","Chu Fu and the others swarmed him, instantly filling every inch of the surrounding area.","Chu Fu discovered that the enlarged Plantman had also become a melee fighter. She, Shen Chi, Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao, and Lu An charged forward together, completely surrounding the little old man from every direction.","“Hey! That’s not fair! Leave me some room to deal damage!” Grandma Wu Yingchun took several quick little steps and squeezed in beside Lu An. Her reactions might have been slow, but her attributes were still overwhelming.","Strength had an innate advantage when it came to shoving people around.","Xie Lin had originally been a melee fighter, but he was now controlling a hundred flying swords in midair, sending them crashing down toward the necromancer’s head.","Not to mention Zhimengzhe’s Dragon-Eye Dolls and the pig pets belonging to Shafu Liangu—they couldn’t even squeeze their way into the crowd.","Suture Saint and Bitter Melon King, on the other hand, had it easy. As long as they had line of sight, they could cast their skills through any available opening.","Dream King was in the same situation.","“Psychokinesis—Dismemberment by Five Horses!”","A pair of invisible hands, visible only to him, seized the necromancer and pulled in opposite directions.","Crack!","It took only a single second.","Under everyone’s concentrated assault, the necromancer’s limbs went flying, his body was crushed to pieces, his skull was pulverized, and his tattered necromancer’s robe was instantly shredded into strips by countless swords.","Soldier King Duanfeng did not even get a chance to make a move.","His eyes were blank with confusion.","He really wanted to ask: Who exactly was the boss here?","The boss’s HP had actually been wiped out in an instant!","He hadn’t misread it, either. The boss had a full eight million HP!","Was this some kind of health-bar deletion spell?","But in the very next moment, the system rewards descended.","[You have cleared the dungeon: The Necromancer’s Conspiracy (Normal).]","[Dungeon clear time: 5 minutes 14 seconds.]","[Your party has taken first place on the speed-clear rankings. You have received +5 to all attributes and a Silver Chest.]","It was over just like that.","Killing the boss had taken only one second.","He hadn’t even had time to walk over!","As for contribution, everyone else had contributed zero.","“The dungeon’s cleared. Bosses, you can pay up now. Does anyone want this Silver item?”","Chu Fu began settling the accounts and auctioning off the equipment.","Soldier King Duanfeng was thoroughly convinced. He paid 350 gold coins, all of which had been prepared in advance by the guild.","Silver equipment was beneath everyone else’s notice, but with the bidding starting at 50 silver coins, Soldier King Duanfeng thought it was cheap and placed a bid. In the end, he bought it.","Afterward, Chu Fu’s thirteen-person team submitted 20% of the funds to the guild and distributed the remaining money according to contribution.","What left Soldier King Duanfeng incredulous was that, despite the fight lasting only a single second, all thirteen players except one had managed to claim some contribution points.","The Twelve-Winged Holy Healing Angel, who had not attacked, received the guaranteed 1% reward for healing players: 2.8 gold coins.","She had received 2.8 gold coins without even doing anything. At long last, good fortune had come her way.","But... just how fast were these people’s hands?","She hadn’t even had time to react.","What she did not know was that contribution points were something Chu Fu’s team fought over, so every member was extremely alert.","Lu An, as the tank, had instinctively stepped forward to engage the monster. As for Dream King, he had noticed Soldier King Duanfeng staring at him the entire time and assumed that the man was trying to secretly overtake him and claim more contribution points. As a result, he had remained especially vigilant.","After the wages were paid, Chu Fu and the others left the dungeon and selected Hard difficulty.","At that moment, every player at the dungeon entrance could see that the team in first place on the speed-clear rankings had changed names. A dazzling multicolored effect appeared beside it, signifying the birth of a new record.","The speed-clear rankings did not trigger a system announcement.","However, the record would remain permanently on the rankings.","[First place on the speed-clear rankings: Captain: Who Wants to Be a Plantman? Guild: Thorn Guild. (Click to view party lineup.)]","Because this was a twenty-player dungeon, many players had still been waiting outside just moments earlier. Five minutes was not even enough time for them to assemble their desired team composition.","Now, a brilliant radiance appeared, instantly drawing everyone’s gaze upward.","“Huh? The team that just went in broke the record! They surpassed Lu Xing’s record!”","Everyone erupted in astonishment.","Lu Xing’s record had been extremely difficult to break. The clear time had been pushed to the absolute limit.","This immediately sparked another heated discussion among the players.","“Wasn’t this already discussed on the forums? Plantman can fight Lu Xing one-on-one. Look, they’ve surpassed the record!”","“How can you compare them? Lu Xing did it alone, while Plantman brought a twenty-player team. Of course they’d be faster!”","“It took twenty people giving it everything they had to beat Lu Xing by only nine seconds. Their strength isn’t anything special.”","“Did they really give it everything they had? Or was the top student just controlling his score?”","“If it was score control, I’ll eat shit while standing on my head.”","“Don’t come here trying to scam people into feeding you!”","The players continued arguing heatedly.","But it did not take long for them to discover that the team led by Plantman was finishing every difficulty level dozens of seconds faster than Lu Xing’s previous team.","[The Necromancer’s Conspiracy — Hard Difficulty]","Lu Xing’s clear time: 8 minutes 42 seconds.","Who Wants to Be a Plantman? clear time: 8 minutes 37 seconds.","[Nightmare Difficulty]","Lu Xing’s clear time: 13 minutes 28 seconds.","Who Wants to Be a Plantman? clear time: 13 minutes 10 seconds.","[Hell Difficulty]","Lu Xing’s clear time: 33 minutes 28 seconds.","Who Wants to Be a Plantman? clear time: 33 minutes 3 seconds.","“Done!”","Everyone received +50 to all attributes.","After they exited the dungeon, Laoji Fuli sent Chu Fu another private message.","“Classmate Chu, are you running the next dungeon? I’d like to join this time too.”","He had never expected Chu Fu to take the speed-clear rankings so quickly. Laoji Fuli had already reached Level 30, so perhaps he could ride along for the next dungeon.","Otherwise, he would have no chance at all.","Chu Fu, however, refused.","“We may need to take some guild members through it.”","After running this dungeon, Chu Fu had quickly analyzed its mechanics.","Judging from the current speed-clear rankings, as long as their movement speed was high enough, the boss would pose no problem.","Shen Chi’s speed was more than sufficient.","But Chu Fu and Xie Lin could fly as well.","As long as their speed exceeded 120 miles per hour, they could clear this dungeon.","Furthermore, under Feng Huimin’s arrangements, the Thorn Guild was operating with high efficiency. The first batch of fifty teams had already all reached Level 20.","That amounted to a full two hundred players.","Although they all had A-rank talents, their classes were not bad either, and they were equipped entirely with Gold gear. Once they reached Linjiang City, they would naturally have even greater prospects for development.","Chu Fu made the decision immediately.","They would cultivate their own people.","“Looks like I’ll have to be a chauffeur again!”","Shen Chi spent ten seconds returning to Fengdu Town, then used a little over an hour to bring all two hundred Level 20 players over.","The thirteen members split into three teams.","Each run could carry forty-seven players.","In four hours, they could give all of them +50 to every attribute.","Moreover, after those four hours, more Thorn Guild players would have reached Level 20.","Thus, on this day, the players of Linjiang City discovered that the [Necromancer’s Conspiracy] dungeon had been completely monopolized by members of the Thorn Guild!","Lu Xing’s speedrun record had long since been shattered beyond recognition."]},{"number":160,"title":"Chapter 160: Guard the People, Not Contend with Them for Gain","paragraphs":["Fengdu Town.","The high-level monster zones and dungeon areas were bustling with activity.","Thanks to Chu Fu’s arrangements, the entire Thorn Guild was frantically grinding levels.","“You won’t be able to enter this dungeon once you hit Level 26, and by then, it’ll be extremely difficult to secure a speed-clear ranking. Not only will first place be out of reach—you probably won’t even make fifth! So everyone who can level up, hurry up and do it.”","The entire Thorn Guild immediately threw itself into a desperate leveling spree.","Only players who leveled quickly would be able to enter dungeons with the Plant Boss and the others. That meant gaining 50 points in every attribute!","They had heard that the powerhouse Laoji Fuli from Huaishui Town was a veteran general who had even appeared on Linjiang City’s television station. He had paid 8,000 gold coins for a single spot on a team.","And in the end, he had only obtained 80 points in every attribute.","They, on the other hand, were getting 50 points in every attribute for free—worth 5,000 gold coins!","Of course, the value couldn’t really be calculated that way. Since the dungeon could be farmed endlessly, as long as the number of players remained within the control limit, countless people could obtain those attribute points. But only ten people could receive rewards from the town assault battle.","In any case, every player in the Thorn Guild was grateful each day that they had joined.","And so, during this leveling frenzy, a full two thousand players reached Level 20 within twenty-four hours.","The record for the normal speed-clear rankings of “The Necromancer’s Conspiracy” also became more and more terrifying.","First place on the speed-clear rankings: Wheelchair Captain Racing a Rocket—clear time: 2 minutes and 47 seconds.","At that clear time, only Shen Chi’s mecha could reach the destination within ten seconds.","Chu Fu and Xie Lin were no longer fast enough.","As a result, Shen Chi began specializing in carrying players through Normal difficulty, while Chu Fu and Xie Lin took care of the other difficulties.","The entrance to the dungeon looked like a Thorn Guild team-building event.","The players from the Thorn Guild were fully equipped, all wearing complete sets of gold gear. Their talents were all Grade A, and some of their classes were obviously extraordinary at a glance.","This was the strength of the Thorn Guild.","In just one day, it had already earned the reputation of becoming Linjiang City’s number-one guild in the future.","In a way, it was rather pathetic. At present, there were only a handful of guilds in Linjiang City.","The guilds originally established by the four major conglomerates had nearly all disappeared.","The Dragon Tour Guild had been wanted by the authorities and had vanished completely.","Rongxun Workshop had gone bankrupt, and its guild could not even be sold.","The Huanyu Workshop had been destroyed. Only its guild headquarters in the Novice Village remained, but without players contributing to it, the village chief would gradually revoke it.","As for the last major conglomerate, Longhan Entertainment, its main strategy was to build a guild around celebrities. Unfortunately, only Jiang Yixing had obtained a Guild Token, and he was still struggling helplessly in Fengdu Town.","Still, after so many days, several guilds had risen to prominence.","With Wantu Real Estate gone, there were still Qian Tu Real Estate and Bai Tu Real Estate.","As the saying went, when one whale falls, countless creatures thrive.","With the four major conglomerates no longer monopolizing everything, Linjiang City naturally had more players in the field.","The city’s major taxpayers began pouring money into the game, recruiting celebrity-level players to establish guilds.","The Bull Auto Guild, Yafan Guild, and Changsi Guild were backed by a local automobile group, clothing brand, and textile corporation respectively.","At present, even the leaders of those three guilds were still leveling up. Their representatives in Linjiang City were merely acting guild masters.","These days, any Level 20 player with an A-grade talent could be offered a monthly salary of ten million yuan.","No one would accept less. They could make plenty of money simply by running dungeons.","As for how small businesses could afford to offer such astronomical salaries...","Naturally, it was because they had made money in the game.","“Origin Gate” was simply too profitable.","Of course, there were also guild masters who didn’t make any money.","The master of the Mad Blade Guild, for example.","Its guild master, Yu Kuangdao, had the unique Blade Dancer class.","Regardless of their talent, anyone could join the guild. Its philosophy was that everyone was a friend and should help one another.","The guild offered no benefits, but the bonuses that came automatically with founding a guild—such as a 5% increase to experience gain, a 5% increase to drop rates, and a 20% reduction in equipment repair costs—were still highly attractive to players.","Of course, without any additional benefits, the guild master naturally didn’t have much say in anything. In fact, the members often teased Yu Kuangdao.","Yu Kuangdao had a good temper and got along well with everyone.","At that moment, the members of the Mad Blade Guild were engaged in a heated discussion.","“My god, aren’t the Thorn Guild’s players from District 030? They started so much later than us, so how does every single one of them have gold equipment? Don’t tell me the guild distributed it!”","“Their guild operates like a corporation. Members have to hand over 20% of their earnings from dungeon runs. The wool comes from the sheep, so there’s no point envying them.”","“That’s not entirely fair. You may not agree with the rule, but if you leave the Thorn Guild without paying that 20%, you won’t even have a team to run Hell-level dungeons with.”","“@Yu Kuangdao, Guild Master, take me through a Hell-level dungeon, buy me a set of gold equipment, and cook me two dishes while you’re at it.”","Yu Kuangdao replied, “How about I kick you twice instead?”","As he watched everyone discussing the Thorn Guild, tears of envy trickled from the corners of his mouth.","If he had known that establishing a guild would be so troublesome and exhausting—and provide no benefits at all—why hadn’t he sold the Guild Token back then?","It had been worth a hundred million yuan at the time!","A regular person like him really shouldn’t have established a guild.","...","Elsewhere, the military ace Duanfeng grew anxious as he watched the figures on the speed-clear rankings update again and again.","“General Laoji, if this continues, the Thorn Guild will grow stronger by the day and firmly secure its position as Linjiang City’s number-one guild. It’ll be very difficult for our War Soul Guild to surpass them.","“And this is terrifying. In a single day, more than a thousand people have obtained 50 points in every attribute.","“If things continue like this, we’ll have a hard time obtaining any more attribute points ourselves. There’ll be no way for our combat power to surpass theirs.”","Laoji Fuli looked at Duanfeng and said solemnly, “And what if we do surpass them?”","Duanfeng frowned. “General Laoji, if they surpass us, the consequences will be serious. We’re the armed forces of China. If our strength doesn’t overshadow that of every other organization, then when unrest breaks out in the future, we won’t be able to suppress it!”","How could it make sense for an official organization to be weaker than a civilian organization?","Laoji Fuli looked at the young military talent with disappointment.","Duanfeng was indeed formidable in battle, but his thinking had failed to keep pace.","All he saw was violence, suppression, and strength.","He had completely overlooked everything else.","“Duanfeng,","“The strength people possess in this game is really no different from the money they had in the past.","“You can’t stop someone from making money simply because they’ve earned more than you, can you?","“We’re an armed force, but we’re also a force that protects people. We protect the people. How can we compete with them for their benefits?”","They might not be the strongest people in existence, but they were the ones who would ultimately preserve order.","They could never forget their original purpose.","Besides, who said that those children weren’t one of their own?","At the very least, if China were ever plunged into a crisis, he believed Chu Fu would definitely be willing to help.","He was actually quite optimistic about Chu Fu and was willing to make things as convenient for her as possible.","“Enough. Instead of gossiping here, you should spend your time looking for a quest that can take us to District 030!","“At the rate they’re leveling up, their town defense battle is about to begin!","“They may not need our help, but we can still purchase talent stones to make the ace soldiers in our team stronger!”","When you have nothing better to do, use your brain and play some games. Don’t waste your energy fighting among your own people.”"]},{"number":161,"title":"Chapter 161: Feng Huimin Arrives in Linjiang City and Catches Up with the Main Force","paragraphs":["Inside Linjiang City.","The Thorn Guild already had more than 1,000 players, and within a single day, all of them had gained 50 points to every attribute.","Calculated by level, that was equivalent to being ten levels ahead of everyone else.","Chu Fu had been busy all day.","When she looked at the players in the guild who had obtained the attribute points, she felt deeply satisfied.","They were all elite players now.","Then she thought of something and looked toward Feng Huimin in the guild.","The entire night had been incredibly hectic. Coordinating players into teams, recording everyone’s advancement times to ensure fairness, deciding which teams would enter the dungeons with whom—all of it was troublesome.","And yet everything had proceeded in perfect order.","Feng Huimin deserved all the credit.","If Feng Huimin were in Linjiang City instead of Thorn Town, things would surely be even more convenient and efficient.","Moreover, as large numbers of players from Fengdu Town reached Level 20, the Thorn Guild’s main forces had begun moving from Fengdu Town to Linjiang City. Chu Fu needed Feng Huimin to come here and help as well.","Leaving her in Thorn Town would also affect the improvement of her own strength.","Chu Fu had been busy for twenty-four hours, and her experience bar was already more than halfway full.","But Feng Huimin had reached Level 10 yesterday and was still Level 10 today. Clearly, she had been too busy to find time to go to Fengdu Town and level up.","Thinking of this, Chu Fu sent Feng Huimin a message.","“Manager Feng, accept a quest in a moment, then teleport to Fengdu Town and come to Linjiang City with the main group. I’ll help you level up.”","The busy Feng Huimin froze.","“Me?”","Wasn’t she still supposed to handle the Thorn Guild’s affairs?","“Yes. We can’t let your leveling fall behind. Don’t miss out on these attribute points either. I’ve sent the quest over—go ahead and accept it.”","Feng Huimin quickly spotted the quest.","As the town mayor, Chu Fu could issue quests in the mayor’s name.","[System Notification: Do you accept the quest: Assignment for Study?","Quest Issuer: Thorn Town Mayor Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?","Quest Description: Thorn Town has just been established. Its population is small and its food supplies are insufficient. The mayor, Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?, is sending you to Linjiang City for an inspection and study tour. Accept or Decline?","Quest Rewards: A small amount of experience, 1 gold coin.]","This was allowed?","Upon seeing the quest, Feng Huimin immediately became excited.","At the same time, however, she began thinking about many things.","Her efforts must have been noticed by her boss. Otherwise, the boss could simply have kept her in Thorn Town.","Just like Wan Huanyu, she could have been treated as a manager—someone who did not need to fight, but who would not be given any chance to improve her own strength, either.","As for why Chu Fu had not sent for her sooner, that was obviously a test.","Both of them had their own standards in mind.","Chu Fu felt that Feng Huimin had passed, and thus issued her a reward.","Feng Huimin, meanwhile, had given everything she had to demonstrate her value. She had earned her boss’s appreciation while proving her own abilities.","“Boss, I’ve accepted the quest!”","Feng Huimin accepted the quest and immediately reported back to Chu Fu.","“Good. Teleport to Fengdu Town, then come to Linjiang City with the next batch of players. I’ll arrange a team for you. Once we reach Level 26, continue following the team.”","“Okay, okay! Thank you, Boss!”","Feng Huimin agreed at once.","Without this quest, Feng Huimin could indeed have teleported from the Thorn Guild to Fengdu Town. However, she would not have been able to leave the boundaries of Fengdu Town because her level was too low.","The system’s protection mechanism would prevent her from leaving Fengdu Town.","Of course, if Region 030 successfully passed the goblin invasion, that protective barrier would disappear as well.","In the end, when it came to crossing regions and allowing low-level players to travel to high-level villages, quests were the only method.","Very soon, Feng Huimin also arrived in Linjiang City.","She first joined Shen Chi’s team and helped secure the first clear on Normal difficulty.","After that, she began organizing teams outside the dungeon entrance.","“Elder, at your current speed, you can reach the boss in ten seconds. The boss takes three seconds to leave its spawn point, and the team’s maximum attack power allows it to be killed in one second.”","“In theory, if each speed run improves the record by one second, we can still run this dungeon 154 more times. If your team can consistently carry seventeen people, at least 2,618 players can obtain five points to every attribute.”","“Do you think we should push the time limit and allow more guild members to obtain these five all-attribute points?”","“Of course, the closer we get to the time limit, the higher the team’s damage requirements will be. Later, if the team doesn’t have enough damage to carry seventeen people, carrying seven will still be worthwhile.”","“It will just be a little hard on you!”","Feng Huimin kept her voice as calm and firm as possible, hoping to convince Shen Chi to follow this plan.","She was not sure whether she could persuade him.","After all, she knew that Shen Chi also owned shares in the Thorn Guild. He was its third-largest shareholder.","Feng Huimin’s plan was not merely to work Shen Chi like an ox.","It was to use him like a machine.","What Feng Huimin had not expected was that Shen Chi accepted the plan almost immediately.","“I was actually wondering whether the speed-run rankings count completion times down to the millisecond. It wouldn’t be safe, but we might have a chance to run the dungeon a few more times.”","“Even if we fail, it’s no big deal. A single run only takes a little over two minutes now. If we fail, we can just try again.”","Shen Chi began discussing the plan with Feng Huimin.","Feng Huimin felt a surge of emotion.","Was this what it felt like to work alongside capable colleagues?","She felt completely at ease, an experience entirely different from the past, when she had been so furious that she felt her lungs would burst.","After that, they carried out the plan in earnest.","If the players from Fengdu Town had leveled up faster, and if transporting them had not taken time, then completing 154 dungeon runs would have taken only about four hours.","During the final few runs, Shen Chi indeed no longer had enough damage. Killing the boss by himself took him a full ten seconds.","However, once Chu Fu and Xie Lin joined the team, one second was enough to instantly kill the Necromancer.","At the dungeon entrance, the floating speed-run rankings showed that this dungeon could no longer provide any more speed-run attribute points.","[Speed-Run Ranking—First Place: Completion Time: 14 seconds]","[Speed-Run Ranking—First Place: Completion Time: 15 seconds]","[Speed-Run Ranking—First Place: Completion Time: 15.3 seconds]","[Speed-Run Ranking—First Place: Completion Time: 16 seconds]","[Speed-Run Ranking—First Place: Completion Time: 17 seconds]","Those were truly despair-inducing results.","Still, Chu Fu could honestly say that they had completely farmed this dungeon dry.","At present, at least 4,000 Thorn Guild players had obtained five points to every attribute.","This was what it meant to make full use of every resource.","Even professional farmers could not have harvested wool this efficiently.","Afterward, Chu Fu and the others focused mainly on the Hell-level dungeon. That difficulty was so high that even A-rank talent holders would have trouble monopolizing the speed-run rankings in the short term, so they still needed to be carried.","As for Hard and Nightmare modes, the Thorn Guild players were strong enough to try them on their own.","Another day passed.","Chu Fu and the others finally reached Level 26, completely bidding farewell to this dungeon.","Remembering what Laoji Fuli had brought up earlier, she sent the old man a message.","“I can enter the new dungeon now, but there are only six spots available.”","“And there’s one player at level 16, three at level 21, and one at level 22. We have nine of our own people at level 26, but our average level is still fifteen points short. We’ll need you to help make up the difference.”","“Of course, Classmate Chu. I’ll arrange it right away!”","Seeing the situation, Laoji Fuli thought for a moment and directly replaced everyone in Soldier King Duanfeng’s group.","“If we replace just one, these brats will complain. We might as well replace them all.”"]},{"number":162,"title":"Chapter 162: Li Wei Fights to Join the Team, The Lich King's Scream","paragraphs":["Twenty kilometers outside Linjiang City.","A luxurious black castle stood in the middle of the wilderness.","Large numbers of level 25 and 26 undead creatures roamed the surrounding area, seemingly guarding the region.","Yet in front of the ancient castle gates, crowds of players had gathered, turning this castle steeped in eerie deathly aura into something like a tourist attraction.","“Professional raid leader running Difficult Lich King! Follow commands throughout. Level 25 minimum to enter. Bronze gear politely declined.”","“Wandering guild recruiting a fixed team for Nightmare difficulty! Level 28 required, full Gold gear. Loot distributed by team contribution. Whales are our daddies—fair and impartial, no raid fee, open auction.”","“Qianyue Gold Run—bosses only! You don’t need to lift a finger; we’ll carry you to bid on gear.”","“Spare Ribs DKP group recruiting hardworking teammates! Build up enough attendance points and get gear for free.”","“Don’t trust the Spare Ribs DKP group! They steal gear and only give it to their own people. It’s a cliquey trash group—don’t get scammed!”","“Damn it, come out if you’ve got the guts! Stop yelling while invisible—let’s see if I don’t beat the hell out of you!”","The place was buzzing with the lively atmosphere of a game hub.","Just as everyone was shouting and milling about, the roar of an engine rang out. A massive mech arrived before the Lich King’s fortress.","The gates were not even as grand as the mech, and with so many players crowding the entrance, there was nowhere for it to land.","It hovered ten meters above the players’ heads, then vanished in an instant.","They had entered the dungeon.","“Holy crap, was that the Thorn Guild? They’re here?”","“They cleared the Conspiracy dungeon on Normal in fourteen seconds. Is that even something humans can do? How fast are they going to clear this one?”","“You guys aren’t comparing Lu Xing and Plantman anymore? You’ve just accepted that they’re definitely going to speed-clear this dungeon?”","“What are you talking about? How can a lone wolf compare to guild big shots?”","“Plantman? Isn’t the Wheelchair Mech Boss the strongest one now?”","“Exactly. A friend of mine just got to know someone from the Thorn Guild. He said their dungeon improvements all depend on whether the Mechanical Boss can fly—and you can’t fly in this dungeon!”","“You can’t fly here, sure, but there’s still huge room for improvement!”","They looked toward the speed-clear rankings.","【Speed-Clear Rankings, #1: Clear Time: 38 minutes 21 seconds】","The Thorn Guild had run the previous dungeon at least two hundred times. Wouldn’t they run this one even more?","Thinking of the rankings being dominated by the Thorn Guild in the future, everyone felt a little hopeless.","...","【System Prompt: Enter the Lich King’s Wail dungeon? Difficulty: Difficult, Nightmare, Hell, Abyss】","There were four difficulty settings, and the lowest was Difficult—there was no Normal mode.","Chu Fu immediately chose Difficult. The group felt a sudden pull and was transported into the Lich King’s ancient castle.","Because Shen Chi’s mech was so enormous, his mech form was automatically dismissed, and the mech was stored in his inventory.","The group appeared at the entrance to the fortress.","It was Chu Fu’s first time running this dungeon as well. She had looked up guides beforehand, but she already knew the story.","This dungeon contained a hidden encounter: the Lich King’s phylactery.","Destroying them after finding them grants additional experience, along with a Gold-tier treasure chest.","This was also why Gold equipment was relatively abundant in Linjiang City and sold at fairly low prices.","The dungeon’s drop rates were high.","Of course, “low” did not mean it could be bought with silver coins—it still cost gold. Besides, even on Hard difficulty, a single dungeon run took at least an hour, so a minimum price of three gold for Gold equipment was perfectly reasonable.","When Chu Feng had run this dungeon, he had also wanted that treasure chest, so he had gone to all four sections of the old castle. Naturally, that had dragged out the time considerably.","But Chu Fu had nineteen team members.","Chu Fu organized them into four groups and sent each one in a different direction to destroy the Lich King’s mechanisms.","Chu Fu’s own group consisted of Feng Huimin, Holy Healing Angel, Lu An, and Li Weizheng.","That was right—Major Li Weizheng, ID: World Peacekeeper, class: Justice Envoy, level 26.","“Plant Girl, the players from your Thorn Guild have only just arrived, and most of them are around level 20. But we can provide five level-29 players. That way, on your next dungeon run, you can bring along one level-20 player from the Thorn Guild.”","Chu Fu’s team had nine level-26 players. The four players who had not yet reached the dungeon’s level requirement were Feng Huimin, level 16; Holy Healing Angel, level 21; Lu An, level 21; Dream King, level 21; and Little Sister Wu, level 22.","By Li Weizheng’s calculation, they really could bring along one additional level-20 player.","Li Weizheng was not merely thinking of Chu Fu’s interests. He was taking this opportunity to get his own people onto the ride.","Otherwise, once Chu Fu and the others leveled up, and all of them rose above the average level, there would be no place left for his people.","It would be better to propose a partnership while he still had the chance.","Naturally, the fee for getting on board as carried players would not be waived.","Chu Fu nodded.","“Cooperation is certainly possible. But once the members of our team level up, we may continue bringing our own people, and the number of slots available to yours may decrease. Major Li, do you have any objection to that?”","“Of course not, of course not. It’s just that I hope we can maintain a long-term partnership. Could you reserve a few slots for us?”","He wanted to tie himself to Chu Fu. Otherwise, once Chu Fu and her group became stronger, they could simply cut his people out completely.","Li Weizheng wanted to secure one or two slots.","Chu Fu did not want to deal with such calculations. She pointed at Feng Huimin.","“She’s the project manager responsible for coordinating everything. You can discuss it with her.”","Feng Huimin instinctively adjusted her glasses. Once her level had risen, her exclusive item had returned as well.","She did not care whether Li Weizheng was an official. Back when she had worked for Wantoo Real Estate, the people she dealt with most often had been government officials.","“Major Li, I’ll need you to provide me with a list of the people you intend to include in this partnership. Also, some wealthy players are now offering higher prices. I’m not trying to raise ours—I know you’re short on gold as well—but I would like to exchange for some supplies in the real world.”","Real-world money had become little more than waste paper, while prices had soared at the same time.","Many necessities could no longer be bought at all.","A great many large supermarkets and shopping centers had gone out of business.","Feng Huimin had only just taken control of Wantoo Real Estate and converted its office tower into the headquarters of the Thorn Group.","For their group, it was only natural to stockpile extra supplies in preparation for whatever the future might bring.","There was no need to hoard food, but they needed to prepare some of everything else.","As for why they did not need to stockpile food—","Of course, it was because once Chu Fu reached Level 30, with Plantman’s talent, they would never have to worry about food again.","Li Weizheng and Feng Huimin were also deep in discussion.","Just as the two of them were talking animatedly, Laoji Fuli suddenly sent a message in the team chat.","“Once we finish this dungeon, I need to leave for a while. I’ll arrange for someone else to take my place.”","At the same time, Li Weizheng received a phone call.","His expression immediately turned incomparably grim.","“Have they lost their minds? Send an aircraft carrier and blast every last one of them to pieces—feed them to the fish!”"]},{"number":163,"title":"Chapter 163: The Contempt of the Holy Wolf Club, Chu Fu's Complaint","paragraphs":["After Li Weizheng ended the call, Chu Fu did not ask what had happened. Instead, she said, “Do we need to speed up the dungeon run?”","Li Weizheng hesitated.","The twenty members of the party returned from four directions to the center of the Lich King’s castle. If they continued forward, they would reach the Lich King’s boss arena.","Chu Fu asked Laoji Fuli the same question.","Laoji Fuli replied firmly, “No!”","“The dungeon speedrun leaderboard is the most direct way to improve players’ strength. The more time we leave them, the more opportunities we create for those who come after us to claim the bonuses. We can’t shorten the time just because we’ve run into a little trouble.”","“Old man, quit being cryptic. What exactly happened?” Xie Lin asked.","Laoji Fuli thought for less than half a second before telling them everything.","“Overseas, there’s already a strong werewolf culture. Their local games have long divided players into evil and order factions as well. Once the Mask of the Pretender was made public, the newbie villages over there turned into slaughterhouses. Even massacring newbie villages has become a game mechanic of sorts.","“These people are determined to create chaos. The evil faction’s strength has risen dramatically. After reaching Level 30, they can even manifest their abilities in reality. Some of them have already attempted to assassinate a president.","“Now they’ve received a quest in the game to come to our faithless land and spread their doctrine.","“It’s difficult for them to come here through the game, but in reality, they can get here very quickly.","“They made a threat on the forums. They’re currently in international waters and have already reached the waters near Shanhai City.”","Shanhai City was situated by the sea, while Linjiang City also had an estuary. The two cities were connected.","More importantly, although Laoji Fuli did not say it, the forum post made everything perfectly clear.","The evil faction was actually targeting Lu Xing. They intended to confront him in the real world.","If Lu Xing refused to show himself, they planned to attack Plantman instead, since Plantman’s identity was public knowledge.","“Boss, look at the forums. It was posted five minutes ago! The news has blown up too!”","Chu Fu immediately opened the forums and quickly found the pinned hot thread in the general section.","[0031286] Sea God’s Spear posted:","“[The Saint Wolf Club claims responsibility for this attack on the waters of Flowerland.","“Hello, players of the Primordial Gate. The new age has arrived in full. Only by embracing the Beast God and pledging loyalty to the Wolf God can you survive this apocalyptic disaster.","“Primordial Gate is a game designed to select the fittest. It has already revealed the future to everyone.","“Only the intelligent will be able to find a path to survival.","“That path is to worship the Beast God and obtain the Mask of the Pretender.","“Humanity is destined to be eliminated. This is a cleansing operation carried out by a higher civilization. Kill one hundred people, and you will be allowed to survive.","“Otherwise, you will face monstrous mutations, goblin hordes, the Cataclysm of Death, Titan attacks, and the apocalyptic end of the world brought about by extreme weather.","“So, starting today, the Saint Wolf Club welcomes all survivors who wish to join.","“In the end, only one percent of humanity will remain.","“Do not make pointless resistance.","“I know there is a place where people are slaughtering the Wolf God. That is absolutely unforgivable. I will drown that city.","“As the number one player in the world, will you, resident of that city, step forward?","“Lu Xing!","“I declare war on you.","“If you refuse to appear, that’s fine too. I hear there are other powerful players in your city, such as that little girl known as Plantman.","“How pitiful. She hasn’t even reached Level 30 yet.","“I will take her game pod away and suppress it ten thousand meters beneath the sea. By the time the pod runs out of energy, even if she manifests her abilities, it will likely be crushed under the pressure.","“Now, let us show the entire world the strength of the Saint Wolf Club.]”","The post had been published five minutes earlier.","Chu Fu quickly understood what had happened.","This was actually an incident from the original plot. The only difference was that those people had mentioned her as well.","In the original story, Chu Feng had seized every boss in the world. In order to raise the level of the Mask of the Pretender and upgrade his other equipment, he awakened a skill at Level 35 that allowed him to track evil gods.","From that moment on, everyone who possessed the Mask of the Pretender became a target for Chu Feng to hunt and plunder.","Werewolf culture had spread extensively overseas, but was virtually nonexistent in Flowerland. The Evil God issued a quest ordering players to capture the ultimate culprit: Lu Xing.","There was no need to ask how it would end. The Saint Wolf Club would ultimately deliver weapons and equipment straight into the hands of the male protagonist, Chu Feng.","However, after Chu Fu transmigrated into the novel, the resulting butterfly effect had led her to create a strategy for forming teams and counter-killing the werewolf butcher, Tu Ge.","That strategy had become wildly popular in Wangxi Village, and a tutorial version had even appeared on the forums.","As a result, at least on the 8888 servers after region 035, every player who had reached ten thousand points of killing intent by accidentally killing players—or who had actively purchased player kills—had begun counter-killing Tu Ge the werewolf.","Wasn’t that an open provocation?","That was why Chu Fu had become the Saint Wolf Club’s second target.","And from their wording, Chu Fu could tell that these people did not take her seriously at all.","After all, she was only Level 26.","Players below Level 30 were not worthy of their attention.","These players, having gained access to real power through the game, were trying to stir up a war in order to obtain even greater benefits.","What could Chu Fu do?","There was plenty she could do.","“Elder Laoji, don’t panic. Since they’ve called Lu Xing out by name and challenged him, then given Lu Xing’s personality, these people will either die or be crippled. Once he makes a move, those pathetic weaklings will be dealt with instantly!”","“That’s true, but the authorities have no information on Lu Xing and can’t contact him. He’s arrogant and unruly. If he knows what’s happening, he certainly won’t ignore it—but what if he’s running a dungeon or fighting a boss and doesn’t know about the situation?” Laoji Fuli’s face was drawn with worry. That was why he had insisted on logging out to deal with it.","What he did not know was that while no one else could contact Lu Xing, Chu Fu definitely could.","She immediately sent a message to her older brother, Chu Feng.","She decided to play the victim.","[WhoWantsToBeAVegetable]: “Big brother, big brother, someone else wants to kill me again! Boo-hoo! I’m not going to training this afternoon. I’m going to hide in my game pod.”","[My Sister Is the Cutest in the Universe]: “Fu-fu, don’t be afraid. I’ll go deal with it right now.”","[WhoWantsToBeAVegetable]: “Big brother, be careful!”","[System Notification: Your game friend ‘My Sister Is the Cutest in the Universe’ has logged out. Your message will be delivered when your game friend comes online again.]","That was fast!","Li Weizheng said, “Lu Xing is from Linjiang City. The authorities have issued a statement saying that they’re eager to learn his method of advancement. Given how powerful he is, if he agrees to join the official organization, he’ll be granted the rank of honorary major general immediately, with real authority no lower than mine.","“We’ve contacted other players before, hoping to speak with him, but he refused every time. Now he’s so far ahead of everyone else that he’s practically impossible to track. We have no idea where he is!”"]},{"number":164,"title":"Chapter 164: Clash at Sea: Rocky's Water Art vs. the Trident of the Sea God","paragraphs":["Chu Fu’s teammates all wore strange expressions. After all, they had seen Lu Xing two days ago.","A truly mysterious powerhouse.","He had also been contacted by Chu Fu’s older brother, Chu Feng.","But Chu Fu hadn’t said anything, so they had kept quiet as well. Besides, the powerhouse’s attitude was obvious: he didn’t want anything to do with the authorities.","What was more, Lu Xing was simply too troublesome. He killed without mercy, wiping out entire groups over the slightest disagreement, whether they were officials or ordinary people.","Not to mention his bizarre ability. He could actually strip others of their talents, skills, and attribute points.","As Lu Xing’s talent was revealed, people both feared and came to understand him.","With such an abnormal ability, anyone would be a threat.","They had already been shocked when Lu Xing intervened the last time.","“We don’t understand the world of powerhouses. Forget about that for now. It’s time. Get ready for battle!”","Chu Fu changed the subject and began directing the fight.","“The Lich King will unleash a Banshee’s Shriek right at the start. Its penetrating power is extremely strong, and players with low defense will be killed instantly. However, the Holy Healing Angel’s Holy Light Domain should be able to block it. Protect Feng Huimin later.”","“Prepare to attack!”","Everyone pushed open the door and entered.","“Who are you? Those useless Haleses couldn’t even tell that Awakened ones had broken in. But you... do you know you’ve entered hell?”","“Die, die, die, die, die!”","“Aaargh!”","The Banshee’s Shriek rang out.","The Lich King was a witch who had evolved into a lich.","As the shriek left her mouth, a ring of energy swept toward them.","The Holy Healing Angel raised the Holy Light Domain, blocking the sonic attack and saving Feng Huimin’s life.","The others then swarmed forward.","In a mere twenty seconds, the Lich King boss was killed instantly.","[You have cleared the dungeon: The Lich King’s Shriek (Hard).]","[Dungeon time: 38 minutes 14 seconds.]","[Your team has taken first place on the speed-clear rankings. You have received +5 to all attributes and a Silver Chest.]","They had improved on the previous record by seven seconds.","Not bad.","After the dungeon ended, Laoji Fuli was still uneasy.","“I have to go take command in person. I’ve already arranged for someone to take over my position outside the dungeon. The commander has just reached Level 17, so we can send a Level 29 player in. I’ll take the Level 30 player to the front line.”","After saying this, Laoji Fuli logged off directly.","Chu Fu knew that situations like this would become more and more common in the future.","If they wanted to live peaceful lives, they needed absolute strength.","“Let’s go! We’ll keep clearing dungeons. We need to reach Level 30 as quickly as possible!”","Chu Fu said.","Everyone nodded.","Just as they continued running dungeons, ships were constantly returning to the harbor at the mouth of the sea in Linjiang City.","The coast guard had already used satellite communications to relay the message to every vessel, ordering them to return as quickly as possible.","One naval warship after another was mobilized.","They surrounded a bulk carrier at sea.","The ship was carrying a large amount of imported soybeans and palm kernels.","Because of the famine-year mission, Li Weizheng believed that Linjiang City would run out of food in the future. He had therefore coordinated with various departments to import large quantities of food.","As a result, members of the Sacred Wolf Club had seized the opportunity to hide inside the bulk carrier. They were exposed only when the ship entered the waters and underwent a routine inspection.","By now, every crew member aboard the cargo ship had been killed, and their deaths had been confirmed. The only people left were members of the Sacred Wolf Club, and the two sides had already exchanged fire.","Moreover, as time passed, Level 30 players from Linjiang City and Shanhai City arrived as well.","“Luo Qi, don’t be afraid. Just treat them like monsters! Don’t worry—if you lose, we’ll definitely protect your corpse. Linjiang City’s healers have three resurrection spells!”","Someone beside him added, “Even if there’s no corpse, it doesn’t matter. I heard their healers have a Soul-Reclaiming spell. Your soul will find its own body.”","Luo Qi had already been frightened. Hearing this, he became even more terrified.","A large hand landed on his shoulder.","“Show us the spirit of a champion! You know who in Linjiang City is called ‘Blind’? His real name is Xie Lin. He used to be your junior and a huge fan of yours! You have to be stronger than him.”","Xie Lin was his fan?","What a joke.","Three years ago, Xie Lin had indeed faced him in a game, saying, “Luo Qi is my idol.”","Then he had turned around and taken ten of Luo Qi’s kills.","At the time, the livestream audience had mocked Luo Qi for suffering a humiliating defeat late in his career.","Besides, Luo Qi was famously ugly, while Xie Lin was handsome enough to be a young celebrity. The contrast between them had been brutal.","Still, Xie Lin’s story had truly been dramatic. Three years ago, a car accident had resulted in the removal of one of his eyes, forcing him to leave the esports scene for good. Many esports fans had regretted his departure.","Then, after all those twists and turns, the Primordial Gate had opened, and he had returned.","Who could fight better than him?","Even after losing an eye, he had spent several years learning martial arts.","Luo Qi, on the other hand, was just a shut-in!","No matter how brave and aggressive he was in games, he was utterly timid in real life.","Hadn’t they said he was only responsible for recruiting people? Why did he have to go to the battlefield now?","But under the current circumstances, he was the one best suited for combat at sea.","He had awakened the S-rank water-element talent, Roar of the Sea.","As long as he took action, perhaps a tsunami could send all these members of the Sacred Wolf Group back home.","He forced himself to remain calm. After all, he was already in his thirties.","After working as a coach for so many years, his mentality had matured considerably. The escapism of a shut-in had gradually been washed away by worldly pressures and practical concerns.","He put on a smile that looked even worse than crying, gritted his teeth, and said, “Don’t worry, Major General. I’ll fight with everything I have to protect the waters of the Flowering Kingdom.”","Soon, the fishing boat carrying him approached the scene.","The distant sound of gunfire crackled through the air.","The two sides had already begun fighting.","“What’s the situation?”","They could now use the radio, and a report came back quickly.","“They sent over a group of assassins. They’ve already stormed the aircraft carrier. The two sides are engaged in fierce combat, but we’re suffering heavy losses.”","The major general of the Shanhai Alliance wore a grief-stricken expression. He knew that many of his comrades had surely been killed.","These Level 30 players were all superhuman.","“Have the soldiers withdraw first. I’m going!”","Luo Qi felt his blood rush to his head. His entire face flushed red as he strode toward the deck.","He mobilized the energy within his body. The seawater suddenly surged violently toward him. In the next moment, a wave hovered beside him.","He stepped onto it and rode the wave toward the distant aircraft carrier.","“Luo Qi, attack that transport ship first. There are still people aboard.”","“Got it!”","He manipulated the seawater, raising a massive wave that bore down on the transport ship.","A siege to relieve another siege.","At that moment, a blue protective barrier suddenly rose from the transport ship.","A Water Shield!","“Boom!”","The seawater slammed into the Water Shield. The resulting roar made even their souls tremble.","A tall man dressed in tattered pirate garb raised a spear and aimed it at Luo Qi.","He was the Viking Pirate: Sea God’s Spear.","He was the one who had posted on behalf of the Sacred Wolf Club.","“Dord!” In the Viking tongue: Die."]},{"number":165,"title":"Chapter 165: Lochy the Valiant, Slaughter of the Stars, Extermination of the Sacred Wolf","paragraphs":["The waves beneath Luo Qi’s feet transformed into water spears and instantly pierced through his body. Blood sprayed into the air!","The soldiers watching from a distance were all stunned.","Was he dead just like that?","“Open fire! Luo Qi has created an opportunity for us!”","The major general from Shanhai City roared.","Luo Qi’s tsunami had crushed the water-shield barrier.","Bang!","Bang!","Bang!","Large sniper-rifle bullets, each nearly the length of a finger, came flying from eight hundred meters away.","Fast, precise, and ruthless!","They instantly locked onto the Sea God’s Spear’s forehead, neck, and heart.","But when the bullets struck his body, they only forced him back half a meter. The rounds merely lodged in his skin.","Once a player’s Constitution reached 50 points, their body became as resilient as rubber, possessing an astonishing ability to absorb and withstand pressure. Even terrifying sniper rounds could no longer inflict serious damage.","No wonder the soldiers had been slaughtered so easily before.","How were they supposed to fight this?","Just as everyone was falling into despair, they realized that the tsunami had not stopped.","The bloody holes in Luo Qi’s body were rapidly filling in.","Water mages also knew healing spells.","Luo Qi was healing himself.","“It hurts like hell!”","“You bastard!”","“Go to hell!”","Luo Qi had suddenly forgotten that this was reality. He began fighting with the knowledge he had gained from the game.","He raised another water shield, then once again manipulated a tsunami and sent it crashing toward his opponent.","The other side summoned a stream of water as well, forming a pair of water wings.","Luo Qi raised both hands.","“Water Dragon!”","In an instant, a gigantic whirlpool appeared on the already raging sea. Dark clouds gathered overhead, and a massive tornado carrying seawater surged toward the Sea God’s Spear.","It tore apart his water wings and sent him spinning violently through the air.","The enemy cursed from within the Water Dragon.","Luo Qi could not understand the words, but he knew the man was probably calling for reinforcements.","A sound tore through the air in the distance.","An archer.","Whoosh! Whoosh!","The arrows struck Luo Qi’s water shield and shattered it.","Luo Qi’s entire body melted into the sea like ice dissolving in water.","He could breathe underwater!","Using the seawater to evade his opponent, he also summoned water dragons and bombarded the archer.","Luo Qi displayed astonishing combat talent.","He fought across the skies and beneath the sea, manipulating tsunamis and single-handedly holding back the entire Saint Wolf Club.","But before long, the players attacking the aircraft carrier also turned around and joined the assault on Luo Qi.","Luo Qi fought desperately, drenched in blood. His body was riddled with wounds, and seawater washed over him. His already frightening appearance now made him look like a water demon risen from the depths of hell.","And yet, he looked like a hero.","Every soldier aboard the warship was crying.","As though affected by the battle, Linjiang City also began to suffer a heavy downpour.","They were supposed to be the ones protecting their homeland, but now they were powerless. The enemies who had come to attack were like superheroes—each one a monster that ordinary bullets could not harm.","The Saint Wolf Club had a full thirty players surrounding Luo Qi. Although he possessed an S-rank talent, it was obvious that the members of the Saint Wolf Club had extremely high attributes.","One of the enemies transformed into a werewolf and bit down on Luo Qi’s shoulder.","More accurately, he had aimed for Luo Qi’s neck, but Luo Qi managed to dodge the vital point. His shoulder, however, was torn apart.","One of his arms was ripped clean off and fell into the water.","“Ahhh!”","Luo Qi let out a horrific scream.","“Cut off his head and hang it from the ship!” one of the Saint Wolf players shouted.","A player wielding a massive battle-axe raised it high, preparing to bring it crashing down.","The next moment—","Light flashed, and the dark clouds overhead seemed to grow even blacker. A streak of black radiance enveloped everyone.","The black light swept across the battlefield.","Pfft!","Blood sprayed through the air, and a thick, overpowering stench of blood splashed across Luo Qi’s face and body before being washed away by the rain.","The player who had raised his axe and the werewolf biting him were both suddenly decapitated.","Luo Qi fell into the sea.","But returning to the ocean felt like returning to his mother’s embrace. He used the last bit of mana he had left, merged into the seawater, and hid himself.","Who had arrived?","Whoever it was, that person had saved his life.","Without that strike, he would truly have died.","Still, he had performed pretty well this time, hadn’t he?","Luo Qi gave a helpless, bitter smile before a wave of excruciating pain suddenly swept through his entire body.","The Saint Wolf Club had first encountered the navy from Shanhai City. As someone who had joined the official forces of Shanhai City, Luo Qi possessed an S-rank talent, and his status was already comparable to that of Laoji Fuli. That was why he had stepped forward first.","Shanhai City naturally had other level-thirty players, but none of them had arrived as quickly as he had.","In fact, only ten minutes had passed since the battle began.","The second wave of players should be arriving soon.","Luo Qi absorbed seawater and secretly looked toward the surface. His mental strength locked onto a figure in a black robe.","That was...","Luo Qi had never seen this person in Shanhai City.","But he soon realized who it was.","Lu Xing!","The number-one player in Linjiang City—and the number one player in the world.","He moved so quickly that Luo Qi’s eyes could not follow him. Even with his high mental strength, Luo Qi could only vaguely sense his position.","Every time Lu Xing appeared, another member of the Saint Wolf Club fell.","His dagger slit throats. He reached out and tore at the enemy’s face, ripping away the other player’s disguise mask.","The mask twisted and transformed into a terrifying monster, but one slash from Lu Xing shattered it, leaving behind material infused with the power of an evil god.","His combat power was simply horrifying.","So this was the strength of the world’s number one player?","Before long, the players from the Saint Wolf Club began screaming in panic and trying to flee.","But they continued to die at Lu Xing’s hands.","One.","Two.","Five.","Ten.","The Sea God’s Spear’s counterattack was like a mayfly trying to shake a tree. Lu Xing slaughtered them with ease.","All thirty members of the Saint Wolf Club were killed. Not one survived.","The sea gradually returned to calm. Without players channeling mana into it, the waves ceased their violent churning. The dark clouds overhead drizzled lightly, and soon the sunlight broke through them, turning the fine rain into golden threads.","Only shattered corpses and severed limbs remained on the surface. Their blood dispersed with the waves and vanished.","Lu Xing was gone.","“...Damn, that was insanely cool.”","Luo Qi clenched his fists.","At that moment, cheers came through the waterproof radio he was carrying.","“Luo Qi! Luo Qi, are you still alive?”","“What happened? Why has the fighting stopped?”","Because of the distance—or perhaps because everything had happened within only a few dozen seconds—the ships in the distance had no idea what had taken place.","Luo Qi spat out a mouthful of salty seawater and said, “Lu Xing! Lu Xing, the number one player in the world, showed up and killed all the enemies!”","Everyone let out a startled cry, then erupted into cheers.","“Move in and begin rescue operations! See if there are any survivors!”","“Recover all the bodies! We have resurrection spells. We can bring our fallen comrades back to life!”","“Don’t let the sharks eat them!”","“Is Lu Xing still there? We need to thank him in person!”","“He’s already gone!”","...","Inside the Nightmare-level dungeon, The Lich King’s Scream—","Li Weizheng’s expression finally relaxed.","“Lu Xing really did step in. Thank goodness. But the soldiers at sea suffered heavy losses this time. We’ll probably have to ask Saint to make another appearance. This time, we’ll provide a Cash-Out Experience Card.”","Chu Fu replied, “Of course. You and Saint can make the arrangements yourselves.”","Just as she was thinking that, she heard someone knock on the game pod.","“Fufu, come out and get some exercise.”"]},{"number":166,"title":"Chapter 166: You Cannot Avoid Working Out — A Top-Tier Dark Gold Item Just Dropped","paragraphs":["(I felt the ending of the previous chapter wasn’t quite right, so I added a short extra passage. If it doesn’t connect properly, babies, go back and take another look. I noticed that over two hundred of you have already clicked “urge for updates.”)","With the matter resolved, Chu Feng returned from the sea.","Chu Fu connected to the outside voice channel. “Brother, I’m running a dungeon. I’ll need a little over an hour!”","Chu Feng understood. Chu Fu wasn’t doing the dungeon alone, but she couldn’t use that as an excuse to avoid rehabilitation.","“Remember to work out once you’re done.”","“Okay...”","Chu Fu felt that exercising was painful now, too.","After all, she was omnipotent in the game, and the contrast upon returning to reality was enormous. On top of that, she had to take medication and eat regular food.","Rehabilitation also required physical exertion.","Her whole body hurt.","She practically wished Suture Saint could extract his ability and give her a couple of needles.","Come to think of it, once Suture Saint extracted his ability this time, she definitely had to go mooch off him—at the very least, she needed to do something about her muscle weakness.","Then Chu Fu continued leading the team through the dungeon.","Nightmare, Hell—even Abyss difficulty could not stop a team led by two SSS-rank players.","The speedrun rankings for [Lich King’s Shriek], however, were the exact opposite of those for [Necromancer’s Conspiracy].","For [Necromancer’s Conspiracy], the time limit in the standard dungeon was extremely tight, preventing many players from improving any further.","But for [Lich King’s Shriek], the time limit was thirty-eight minutes on Hard mode—and it was also thirty-eight minutes on Nightmare, Hell, and even Abyss difficulty.","No matter the mode, the damage-output requirements were simply too extreme for ordinary players.","Given everyone’s current average level and equipment, it was impossible to meet them.","As a result, the speedrun leaderboard could only compete over second through fourth place. First place had always been monopolized by Lu Xing.","But now his little sister had arrived!","Under Chu Fu’s leadership, the party bombarded everything in their path and cleared the dungeon completely.","On Abyss difficulty—","As the terrifyingly powerful Lich King collapsed to the ground, a huge pile of loot burst forth.","[Lich King’s Scepter (Dark Gold Grade)]","[Necromancer Class-Change Certificate (Special Class)]","[Improved Lich Phylactery (Dark Gold Revival Item)]","“Wow!!!”","Cheers immediately erupted throughout the party.","Although the Abyss-level [Lich King’s Shriek] dungeon was extremely difficult, its chance of dropping Dark Gold items was not one hundred percent—it was only ten percent.","High difficulty, poor drop rates, and few teams capable of meeting the requirements meant that Dark Gold equipment was quite rare even in Linjiang City.","Yet three valuable items had dropped at once: two pieces of equipment and a class-change certificate.","They had struck it rich this round.","“Although this is the Lich King’s staff, any magic-based class can use it—except healers. Starting bid: one hundred gold. Bids will be calculated according to contribution. I have priority bidding rights, so I bid one hundred gold. Any player bidding after me must bid double.”","“Two hundred gold!” Laoji Fuli made his move.","“Old sir, don’t say I didn’t give you a chance, but that’s far below market price. I’m a businesswoman—I can make a good profit even by reselling it! Five hundred gold!” Jiaojiao Bu Jiao joined the bidding.","A Dark Gold weapon was currently worth at least eight or nine hundred gold, and popular class equipment could even exceed one thousand gold.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao’s real-world assets had taken a hit, but her in-game business was thriving. At the very least, the deputy mayor position Chu Fu had given her allowed her to open many shops.","Equipment shops were naturally the most profitable.","The Thorn Guild’s warehouse was overflowing as well, especially with gear from novice maps, all of which Jiaojiao Bu Jiao was handling.","Of course, Jiaojiao Bu Jiao knew better than anyone that money was hard to make in the low-end market. If she wanted profits, she had to deal in high-end goods.","So even though Laoji Fuli was an old chief, she would not yield too much.","There was no way she would let him take the weapon for only two hundred gold.","Laoji Fuli understood as well. In fact, he rather liked this atmosphere. It reminded him of when he had first entered the game and played alongside a group of young teammates.","Now, whenever he ran dungeons with official responsibilities attached, everyone was always giving way to him. He got all the good items, and sometimes he even felt as though he were being bribed.","It made him uncomfortable to take them.","Chu Fu’s party system really was excellent.","He continued bidding, and in the end, it was Shafu Liangu competing with Laoji Fuli for the item.","After all, the Lich King’s staff was actually highly compatible with a Gu Master as well.","In the end, Laoji Fuli secured the staff at the normal market price of seven hundred and eighty gold.","“Next is the Necromancer class-change token. It can be used to switch to a rare class and offers a substantial boost in combat power. Players who haven’t obtained a good class will definitely need it. It’s in high demand and short supply—if it went to auction, it could probably sell for over a thousand gold. Starting bid: five hundred gold.”","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao made another move.","She ultimately won it for one thousand gold.","Last came the Lich’s phylactery.","“[Improved Lich Phylactery (Dark Gold Revival Item)]. Its effect is that after death, you can revive from the phylactery within twenty-four hours. Each revival also permanently increases the attributes of Death and Dark skills by ten percent. It can be used indefinitely, saving you the cost of revival scrolls.","“Most importantly, doctors can’t treat themselves. This phylactery is actually especially suitable for healer classes—it’s a form of insurance.","“Holy Healing Angel cannot bid; her attributes are incompatible with it.","“Starting bid: one hundred gold.","“Based on contribution, Suture Saint gets the first bid. Other players must bid double.”","Suture Saint bid one hundred gold.","Little Sister Wu was a rich woman now too, having received Laoji Fuli’s money, so she joined the bidding.","In the end, she won the item for five hundred gold.","The other Gold-grade equipment was worth relatively little, so Jiaojiao Bu Jiao scooped it up at low prices for resale.","Afterward, the party distributed the earnings according to contribution percentages. As a level-thirty player, Laoji Fuli’s share would inevitably have been higher than Dream King’s and Bitter Melon King’s.","Yet he did not say a word about taking any money.","The old man understood better than anyone that, without Chu Fu leading the party, he could have led a team to clear the dungeon—but he would never have claimed first place on the speedrun rankings.","As someone who had paid to be carried, he absolutely could not take money from Chu Fu’s party.","Chu Fu’s contribution share was forty-two percent, and she earned another one thousand gold.","Once you reached higher levels, that was when the real money started coming in!","“Next, have Feng Huimin arrange a reasonable distribution for all of you. I need to log off and do some rehabilitation.”","“Don’t worry, Boss!” Feng Huimin immediately replied.","Chu Fu clicked out of the game. It was already three in the afternoon.","Under the guidance of a professional doctor, Chu Fu began her exercises.","A level-thirty player could extract their attributes. Logically, Chu Fu could have waited until she reached level thirty, extracted all her attributes at once, and spared herself the hardship she was enduring now.","But extracting in-game attributes came with many restrictions.","Previously, even using an extraction card had required deep sleep—let alone truly extracting strength.","Especially when going from nothing to something: if she tried to extract all of her strength at once, she could end up unconscious for three months.","If she spent three hours a day exercising now and restored her body to health, extracting those abilities later would become easier.","As she exercised, Chu Fu glanced through the news."]},{"number":167,"title":"Chapter 167: Grandmaster Player Rocky, Fengdu Town Reaches 10,000 Players at Level 020","paragraphs":["Chu Fu planned to spend a few hours every day catching up on information from the outside world.","Otherwise, she felt as though she had become completely cut off from society.","“Shanhai City’s legendary player, Luo Qi, fought bloodily to repel foreign forces. The government has awarded him a First-Class Merit and promoted him to the rank of lieutenant colonel.”","“Shanhai City and Linjiang City have joined forces to resist foreign enemies.”","“The final battle was ended by the world’s number-one player, Lu Xing. We thank Lu Xing for his righteous intervention!”","“We look forward to more Level 30 players cooperating with the government to protect their homeland!”","“Next is the nationwide resource allocation plan. We urge the public to play responsibly, pay attention to their health, and maintain a balanced diet. Those living in rural areas should minimize trips into the wilderness.”","“Wild boar invasions have broken out in many parts of the country.”","“Giant bears have been spotted in the north.”","“The government is recruiting bounty teams to hunt wild creatures.”","The world had already begun to descend into chaos.","The worrying part was that only some Level 30 players had gained special abilities. After obtaining their powers, these people did not go hunt monsters. Instead, they turned on one another.","Fortunately, Flower Nation had always been stable. After the strategy for killing the evil-faction player Tuge the Werewolf was made public, the number of evil-aligned players across the country decreased. With the government’s support, anyone causing trouble was dealt with swiftly.","Flower Nation was still safe for the time being.","Chu Fu watched the news while exercising, and the few hours passed quickly.","After finishing her workout, she stepped onto the scale.","45 kilograms!","At 168 centimeters tall, her ribs were clearly visible at that weight.","“I’m about to reach Level 30. Gaining twenty pounds looks like it’ll be difficult. I’ll aim for ten pounds instead!”","Chu Fu set herself a goal.","Then she logged in.","With Feng Huimin leading the team, they first helped Old Steed in the Stable complete a cartload of Nightmare-mode runs. After that, they cleared another round of dungeons across three difficulty levels. The Abyss level could only be completed once a day.","Even so, Feng Huimin’s level skyrocketed to 18 within just a few hours.","She was leveling at rocket speed.","Once Chu Fu logged in, everyone once again split into two teams under Feng Huimin’s arrangements to farm attribute points.","Team One:","Front-line tank: Jiao Jiao Isn’t Spoiled.","Damage dealers: Chu Fu, Xie Lin, Shafu Liangu, and Dream King.","Healer: Holy Healing Angel.","Support: Feng Huimin.","Main tank: Lu An.","Damage dealers: Shen Chi, Suture Saint, Zhimengzhe, Wu Yingchun, and Bitter Melon King.","Healer: Little Sister Wu.","Suture Saint had already switched into a damage-dealing position.","The seven permanent party members filled the remaining thirteen slots with six Level 20 players from the Thorn Guild and seven Level 28–30 players who wanted to farm attribute points.","Basically, three dungeons in two and a half hours yielded a total of 30 points to every attribute: 5, 10, and 15.","Obviously, not everyone could obtain the all-attribute reward from this dungeon’s Abyss mode.","Rare things were valuable.","Chu Fu had not even announced whom she planned to take, yet players were already scrambling to inquire about it.","The moment Chu Fu left the dungeon, several players in magnificent gear crowded around her.","“Plant Master, can you take me through a cartload of Abyss-level speed runs tomorrow? I’ll pay 500 gold coins.”","“I’ll pay 1,000 gold coins.”","“Oh, isn’t this Manager Feng? We’ve worked together before. You’re working for the Thorn Guild now? You really are capable. How about giving me a slot in an Abyss-level dungeon? Money is no object.”","“Isn’t that Jiao Jiao? Don’t you remember your Uncle Li? We met at a banquet last time. Uncle will pay 2,000 gold coins for a run!”","Huang Jiaojiao said, “Uncle, my relationship with my father isn’t very good!”","“Uncle noticed that long ago. Your father’s no good. Uncle supports you. Someone as capable as you should inherit the family fortune. The capable deserve to rule! Your father has so many illegitimate children, but they’re all useless. Not one of them can compare to you!”","“Then let’s add each other as friends, Uncle. I’ll discuss it with the party first. Oh, by the way, you’re still a regular-class mage? I happen to have a special-class advancement certificate for a necromancer. This is the meta class of the current version. There are undead everywhere around Linjiang City, so it’s definitely powerful.","“I’ll sell it to you for 5,000 gold coins, just a little above cost. How does that sound?","“As for the Abyss-level dungeon slot, I’ll have to discuss it first. We only get one run a day, after all!”","Huang Jiaojiao sold the necromancer advancement certificate for five times its original price. Then she returned to discuss the price of the Abyss-level dungeon slot with Chu Fu and the others.","This was an excellent opportunity to make money.","After discussing it with Jiao Jiao Isn’t Spoiled and Feng Huimin, Chu Fu settled on a price of 2,000 gold coins.","As for the Military Soul Guild, they could accept the price or not. There was nothing else Chu Fu could do. However, she could take them through the first three difficulty levels for 10 gold coins per attribute point.","Zero o’clock arrived.","The Abyss-level dungeon refreshed.","Chu Fu took a group of wealthy players into the dungeon. Unfortunately, no dark-gold equipment dropped.","Even so, with seven players serving as the main damage dealers, Chu Fu alone accounted for 67% of the entire party’s damage.","All eight players paid 2,000 gold coins each, and Chu Fu’s share came to 10,720 gold coins.","The gold coins in Chu Fu’s bag had finally surpassed the 10,000 mark.","That amount should be enough to trigger the mysterious merchant’s second phase, which meant the goods would be better.","The merchant only ever appeared in cities, however. Since Chu Fu had not returned to the city yet, she was not worried about missing him.","They continued running dungeons. Although they were not as fast as when clearing “The Necromancer’s Conspiracy,” the dungeons were of a higher level, so Chu Fu and the others still leveled quickly.","By eight that evening, Chu Fu had led eight full runs, and the gold coins in her bag had accumulated to the impressive total of 30,000.","This dungeon was ridiculously profitable.","How did it feel like she was making money even faster than her brother now?","Just as Chu Fu and the others were preparing to continue carrying players through the dungeon, she received a message by carrier pigeon.","[Carrier Pigeon Message","The number of Level 20 Awakened in Fengdu Town has reached 10,000, attracting the attention of the Goblin God. The Goblin God has decided to initiate a cleansing operation!","The town-defense battle will officially begin at midnight tomorrow.","This incident occurred without warning, and only four hours remain until midnight.","Linjiang City has opened a special mount—the Dragonship. A ride costs only 10 gold coins, and it will depart in one hour. It can transport Awakened back to Fengdu Town.","All Awakened lords who receive this message are urged to come and provide support.]","Fengdu Town had reached 10,000 Level 20 players.","That was only natural. Their server had more players to begin with, better equipment, and faster dungeon clears and monster farming.","The first batch of 9,000 players who had participated in Wangxi Village’s village-defense battle had almost all steadily advanced into Fengdu Town. Twenty days had passed since the battle at Wangxi Village.","Therefore, triggering the town-defense battle ten days ahead of schedule was perfectly normal.","Once you gained an advantage, every step that followed came faster.","“We’re not running dungeons anymore. Get ready to return to Fengdu Town!”","Because Chu Fu and the others owned residences, they could return directly to the city. The Thorn Guild players, however, could not.","The Thorn Guild had a full 4,000 players.","At 10 gold coins per person, that came to 40,000 gold coins.","It was practically an extortionate way to drain the gold from players’ pockets.","Shen Chi switched into Old Driver mode.","“Back to Fengdu Town for one gold coin! One and a half hours to arrive, with enough time to complete the preliminary quests! Don’t miss out—get on board while there’s still room!”","With metal manipulation at his command, Shen Chi’s mecha was practically a Transformer. Now, it had transformed into a transport shuttle.","“Squish in, everyone—move farther inside! There are still people waiting to get on!”"]},{"number":168,"title":"Chapter 168: Dream King Had a Flash of Inspiration and Leaned into the Town Defense Battle","paragraphs":["Chu Fu naturally had no need to squeeze through the crowd, so she chose to return to her residence in Fengdu Town.","Then she flew out of town and quickly forced the spirit rice to mature.","She came back once every day to plant the spirit rice. There were a full six thousand mu of fields, so she absolutely could not let the goblins ruin them.","While Chu Fu and the others were busy, Lu An, Dream King, and Holy Healing Angel remained in Linjiang City.","“Are we still going to run dungeons?” Holy Healing Angel asked Dream King.","Dream King gave a bitter smile. “They’re all S-rank. The gap is just too big. We missed out on two enhancement opportunities. Wait, didn’t you two get enhancement skills?”","Those two had once been players from the Universal Studio!","Thinking about that, Dream King felt even more miserable.","It was all Wan Huanyu’s fault—and also that internet-addiction school Guan Youlong had opened.","“Forget it. We’re not running dungeons anymore. Dungeons won’t let us achieve a qualitative leap. Let’s see if we can find any hidden quests!”","Dream King returned to the city and wandered around for a while. As luck would have it, he discovered that the food in his backpack had run out.","He headed toward the snack street and soon heard an old woman selling rice balls.","“Delicious rice balls! Made from spirit rice produced by the wood-element mage of Fengdu Town! Only five copper coins each!”","Dream King immediately turned toward the old woman, his eyes shining.","“Granny, this is spirit rice from Fengdu Town, isn’t it? The teleportation array hasn’t been activated yet, right? How did you get the rice? Do you need me to help you buy some?”","The old woman’s eyes lit up at once.","“Sure, young man. If you help me buy one hundred jin of spirit rice, I’ll give you... I’ll give you two copper coins per jin as a purchasing fee. But you’ll have to pay for the rice yourself. This is only a small business, so I can’t advance the money!”","The entire deal was worth two silver coins. After making the trip, he would earn only two hundred copper coins, and he might have to spend two days on it.","Only an idiot would do it!","But this was a way back to Fengdu Town!","Dream King immediately said excitedly, “Yes, yes, Granny! I’ll definitely bring you the spirit rice.”","System Notification: You have accepted the quest “Purchase Spirit Rice.”","Dream King immediately notified Lu An and Holy Healing Angel.","The two of them hurried over and accepted the purchasing quest as well.","By this time, however, Shen Chi had already flown away. Still, he could come back for a second trip. After all, plenty of players were waiting for Shen Chi’s carriage to claim the remaining nine gold coins.","Shen Chi made quite a profit as well.","Of course, Dream King was not the only one to discover this type of quest. The players from Military Soul had found these quests several days earlier.","They had arranged for a group of area-of-effect and ultra-long-range classes to head to Fengdu Town.","Laoji Fuli was naturally among them.","But this time, no matter what price he offered, Little Sister Wu would not give up her spot.","Neither would anyone else.","Still, it was nice to make a little contribution in Fengdu Town.","Laoji Fuli also took Shen Chi’s second carriage.","By the time he arrived in Fengdu Town, only one hour remained before the town defense battle.","His first impression was that there were far too many people.","Looking closer, he was even more dumbfounded.","Almost everyone in Fengdu Town had golden equipment.","Some people were even fully equipped in gold.","Everyone’s enthusiasm was terrifying. Traps had already been set up five kilometers away from the town.","And they were still laying more.","The trenches had already been dug in five concentric rings.","Were they really this hardworking?","Little did he know that the players of Fengdu Town simply understood their fellow players too well.","If they did not build five rings of trenches, would there even be anywhere to stand?","With so many people, how were they supposed to get any kills?","Were they supposed to foolishly wait on the city walls?","They would not even be able to touch a single monster.","Building the trenches out to the fifth ring expanded the battlefield, allowing them to engage the monsters in advance. More importantly, it prevented the big shots from monopolizing all the monsters.","In short, these players had racked their brains to figure out how to snatch monsters and contribution points.","The moment midnight arrived, the system issued an announcement:","Fengdu Town is about to face a goblin invasion. All players, please take note.","System Announcement: The goblin invasion has begun. The contribution ranking is now active. Participants: 98,633. Preparations quests completed before the battle will also count toward the contribution rankings.","Laoji Fuli’s mind went blank.","“Wasn’t Fengdu Town merged from server 030? How does it have three times as many people as us? How long ago did they merge?”","No one answered him.","But everyone had their own measure of things.","This was actually the true value of the Thorny Guild!","They had defeated capitalist monopolies, upheld fairness and impartiality, and gained an excellent reputation with good treatment. People who had heard of them came flocking from all over.","That was what had led to Fengdu Town’s prosperity.","But with prosperity came a shortage of resources.","After all, the number of monsters in the goblin invasion was fixed. So were the available contribution points. But the number of players had tripled.","How could there possibly be enough contribution points to go around?","Just then, a vast goblin army appeared in the distance.","“Charge!”","The players of Fengdu Town actually climbed out of the trenches.","“Hurry! We can’t let Plant Master and the others get to the monsters first!”","“Get moving! I saw Wheelchair Boss dismantling the arrow towers. Their attack range is one kilometer. Don’t let him place them over by the trenches!”","“Sword Saint has already run to the very front! Kill them quickly!”","Ten million goblins were being divided among one hundred thousand players. Each person could only kill one hundred.","There were no weak players in Fengdu Town.","Everyone charged forward with bloodthirsty cries.","Chu Fu could not even bother with the plant formation she had prepared earlier.","These people had no sense of fair play.","They were trying to steal her monsters.","Chu Fu flew forward as well.","Plague Spread had now been enhanced to level 10, making its spread and infection even more terrifying.","Goblins collapsed in great swathes.","But the other players refused to give up. Chu Fu’s poison still needed time to spread, and they took advantage of the chaos to hack down countless goblins.","Back in Huaishui Town, Chu Fu had gained fifty million contribution points in a single wave.","But now, she had obtained only fifteen hundred.","What was more, the level-eleven goblin horde was completely wiped out in just five minutes.","The players were not even willing to wait the ten minutes before the next wave.","They continued running forward.","If you run, I run too.","Chu Fu did not stop either. After sprinting five kilometers, she came into contact with the second goblin army.","Another chaotic battle broke out.","The players held the goblin army twenty kilometers away from the town.","But when they advanced farther, they witnessed a strange sight.","Thirty kilometers away, the sky looked as though someone had slashed open a wound. The inside was pitch-black, while silver light representing spatial elements appeared along the edges.","It was a spatial rift a full kilometer long.","Goblins continued leaping out of it without end.","System Notification: Congratulations, player! You have completed the hidden achievement “First Glimpse of a Spatial Rift.” All attributes +1.","Achievement Description: During an invasion battle, be the first to investigate the source of the invasion and personally witness a spatial rift.","“Whoa!”","Everyone cried out in surprise.","Even Chu Fu was stunned.","This scene had never appeared in the original storyline.","Was this some new rule?","Or was it something even Chu Feng had failed to discover?","“So this is where the goblins come from?”","“They tear open a massive rift and send the goblins through. That makes perfect sense!”","“Hurry! Camp their spawn point and kill them!”","At least twenty thousand players charged forward and frenziedly pushed ahead, turning the level-twelve goblins into minced meat.","Before long, they had advanced to the area directly beneath the rift.","System Notification: Enter the special public dungeon, True Goblin Lair (Origin)?"]},{"number":169,"title":"Chapter 169: Origin-level Dungeon, Players Counterattack Goblin City","paragraphs":["[WARNING!!!","The Origin-tier Instance is the source of everything. All monsters within possess Origin-tier combat power; each one is no weaker than ten Abyss-tier goblins.","However, killing a single Origin-tier monster is equivalent to permanently eliminating ten thousand goblins.","If you die after entering this Instance, you will be unable to create a new account for 100 days.","This Instance may be entered in legion formation!","Countdown to entry: 8 minutes 13 seconds.]","Chu Fu froze for a moment, then recalled the plot of the book.","She remembered that the final Instance entered by the character representing her brother, Chu Feng, seemed to be called [Servants of God (Origin)].","After Chu Feng entered, he immediately fought a demon-like monster. The battle was unimaginably fierce, shaking heaven and earth—and then the book never updated again.","She had never expected an Instance of this kind to appear at level 20.","Although the system had only described the danger, Chu Fu felt that tremendous opportunities lay within as well.","There were only 8 minutes and 13 seconds left to enter.","But Chu Fu realized that this entry window coincided with the players’ rest period.","She immediately called out in the Thorn Guild, “All players, get ready. I’ve discovered a new Instance. Stay sharp and prepare yourselves for the most difficult challenge yet. Holy Healing Angel, Commander Feng, and all other support players—once we enter, immediately activate every buff you have. MTs, get ready!”","Everyone braced themselves.","The Thorn Guild currently had ten thousand members.","Over the past three days, after Chu Fu had fully settled into Linjiang City, guild members who had not been taken into Instances had begun taking on quests in large numbers.","Once they had accumulated enough reputation, Jiaojiao Bu Jiao had used guild funds to purchase a guild territory near Linjiang City.","The guild had been upgraded to Level 3.","It could now accommodate twenty thousand people, and they had recruited another five thousand A-rank talent players in Fengdu Town.","This Instance could actually hold ten thousand people—no less than a town-defense battle.","Yet Chu Fu had the distinct feeling...","That this was the true counteroffensive.","If even her brother had failed to explore this place, then it was likely to hold the greatest secret of [Gate of Origins].","Chu Fu wanted to be the first to taste the crab.","Otherwise, if she only looked at things from the perspective of the plot, she might not even be able to do as well as her brother. She needed to surpass Chu Feng in order to protect him!","With that thought, Chu Fu became even more resolute.","Players throughout the guild began withdrawing from the front lines. Fortunately, there were simply too many players remaining in Fengdu Town. Removing three thousand people from each of the trenches outside the east, south, west, and north gates barely drew any notice.","Chu Fu’s eastern wall had only ever had a thousand people to begin with. Even including the players following Chu Fu, there were only ten thousand in total—the smallest force of all.","The players following Chu Fu were all strong in their own right, confident that they could snatch monsters even under Chu Fu’s attacks.","Now that they saw this Instance, their blood boiled with excitement.","“Plant Master, are we doing this? Looks like everyone can enter!”","“If the boss goes in, I’m going in. If the boss doesn’t fight, neither will I!”","“Just admit you want to trail behind the boss and drink the soup. Don’t act like you’ve got principles.”","“We’re going in!”","Chu Fu shouted, “But you’ve seen the danger. Our guild currently only has three healers with Resurrection, and in an Instance like this, they may not be able to cover everyone. If you die, you won’t be able to log into the game for three months. You need to decide for yourselves whether you’re willing to take that risk!”","The pressure on Chu Fu was immense as well.","But she truly wanted to see what was inside.","Because she had a terrifying suspicion.","What if that book had not simply been discontinued? What if her brother, Chu Feng, had...","She did not dare to think any further.","But that only made her want to explore this Instance even more—to find out what exactly was here.","Everyone got ready!","When the Instance countdown reached one minute, Chu Fu confirmed entry.","The next moment, ten thousand Thorn Guild players entered the Instance.","“Plantman went in! Hurry, get in!”","The ten thousand independent players following Chu Fu also rushed into the Instance.","Chu Fu felt the world spin around her, accompanied by a bizarre sensation.","She had entered this world standing upright, yet in the next instant, it felt as if her feet had landed on the wall of a skyscraper.","Gravity shifted, and the building’s wall became the ground beneath her feet.","She was walking upward sideways.","The disorienting sensation of warped gravity and space faded as her vision returned.","She was inside an enormous space, roughly a kilometer across. Everything around her was gray and dim. Beneath her feet was wet earth streaked with slime, giving off a foul stench like goblin saliva.","She understood at once. This was likely a place the goblin army had passed through.","Above them stretched twisted bands and lights that, upon closer inspection, resembled an abstract starry sky.","This area was somewhat like the dimensional rift described in the story.","A dimensional rift passage connecting two worlds allowed the goblin army to pass through and attack Fengdu Town.","Combined with the system announcement—the Goblin God had launched a cleansing operation—this place was most likely the essential route of the goblin invasion.","Everything now made sense.","Then, beyond the hundred meters ahead of them, would they be facing the place where the true Goblin God resided?","There was no time to hesitate!","They only had one minute.","After that minute, at least 2.5 million goblins would likely pass through the passage.","“Tankers to the front! Healers and support to the rear! Move out!”","At Chu Fu’s command, the army began to advance.","[Charge Horn!]","Feng Huimin immediately sounded the horn, granting buffs to a full twenty thousand people!","[Formation Defense]","A translucent shield effect appeared over everyone’s bodies, greatly increasing their defense. Not only that, the once-scattered formation began to align itself with uncanny precision, as though an invisible hand were correcting each player’s position.","A level 20 player’s physical ability surpassed that of any track sprinter on Earth. Even though they slowed their pace, the group crossed the hundred-meter dimensional-rift passage in only twenty seconds.","As they emerged from the rift, they saw the scene outside.","It was a primeval forest. More than two thousand incomparably powerful goblins, each over two meters tall, stood in formation one hundred meters beyond the rift. Every one of them surrounded an enormous crystal.","The crystal stood five meters high and three meters in diameter. Muscular goblins appeared around it, connected to it by beams of light. Then, vast numbers of scaled-down goblins were copied into existence.","These were precisely the third wave of monsters that would appear thirty li outside Fengdu Town and prepare to attack the town.","Those goblins were actually using copies to launch their assault.","At that moment, Chu Fu had a strange feeling.","It was as if there were also a player on the other side of the screen, operating the crystal as an item and copying the goblin army to attack the human town on their side.","Like playing an RTS game.","The human players and these goblins were all merely pieces on the board."]},{"number":170,"title":"Chapter 170: The Counterattack of the Thorn Guild, the True Stronghold of the Goblins","paragraphs":["But there was no time to worry about that now.","Different races were enemies.","Whenever they met, they fought.","Chu Fu struck first.","“Plague Spread!”","A scarlet mist spread out. The copied goblins died the instant they came into contact with it. Then, after their corpses were infected with the plague, they exploded.","The plague rapidly spread, infecting the powerful goblins as well.","The moment her attack hit them, Chu Fu saw their health bars.","[Sourceborn Goblin: Level 11, HP: 1.1 billion!]","Their health was absurdly high.","Of course, their attacks were just as terrifying.","One of the powerful goblins, wielding a club made from some unknown beast bone, leaped into the air and swung it at Chu Fu. Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao immediately taunted it.","The beast-bone club struck Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao, knocking her back half a meter.","“Damn, that damage is insane!”","Elsewhere, Lu An let out a painful cry.","She hadn’t been killed, but the blow had hurt terribly.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao, however, couldn’t feel pain.","The other tank-class players were sent flying one after another. Some were killed instantly!","Chu Fu didn’t dare let her guard down. She immediately summoned a Bewitching Mushroom.","The enormous mushroom instantly mesmerized the enemies, easing the pressure on everyone.","Bitter Melon King acted in time, constantly replenishing the protective barriers of the frontline tanks. She also cast Pain Prison. She didn’t expect it to nullify the enemies’ attacks, but any pain the goblins inflicted on the tanks would be reflected back at them, forcing the goblins to hold back.","Every goblin reacted with startling realism.","“We have the numbers advantage! I’ve marked one goblin. Everyone, focus fire on that target! The remaining tanks, hold the line! Healers, keep an eye on the tanks in your own teams!”","Feng Huimin shouted as she marked one of the goblins.","In an instant, that goblin became as conspicuous as a torch in the darkness.","Every player’s gaze locked onto it.","Pour on the damage!","Even Chu Fu couldn’t resist. She waved her staff and unleashed several single-target skills with devastating power.","Soul Devouring, Return to the Void +10.","The skill she had comprehended at Level 25, Soul-Devouring Venom, had been enhanced to +10. It had transformed into Soul Devouring, Return to the Void, corroding the target’s soul until it vanished into nothingness.","As she and the players attacked together, the powerful goblin—with a full 110 million HP—collapsed dead in just twenty seconds.","Chu Fu’s experience bar rose by a full segment.","She wasn’t the only one. A glow of level-up light appeared around Feng Huimin as well, raising her to Level 21.","The experience was unbelievably rich.","And there were still 2,499 monsters like this one.","But in the next instant, a group of powerful goblins charged in from the rear.","Goblin Wolf Riders.","They were the strongest of the goblins, all Level 20. After reaching the Sourceborn rank, each one possessed a staggering 200 million HP.","“Awoooo!”","The giant wolves dove into the players’ formation, instantly slaughtering a swath of them.","“Suture Technique!”","The Suture Saint immediately began reviving the fallen. Together with her clones, she stitched up hundreds of corpses in an instant.","“Don’t panic! The Tanglethorn Guild’s Tenth Regiment, move out and draw the wolf riders away! Goblins are vulnerable to control effects, so use your strongest crowd-control skills!”","Feng Huimin issued her orders.","She had previously divided the Tanglethorn Guild into ten regiments. The members of the Tenth Regiment immediately switched targets and began controlling the wolf riders.","Chu Fu also went completely berserk.","“Plant Person!”","In an instant, Chu Fu’s skin turned green, and her body grew to a height of twenty meters.","Her long hair transformed entirely into creeping vines. With a fierce whip of her head, she bound a goblin wolf rider, then swung it violently through the air.","She hurled the wolf rider away.","“Metal Manipulation!”","Shen Chi likewise controlled his mecha, transforming into a giant. He seized another goblin wolf rider, clamped down on its body, and squeezed with all his strength.","The horrifying sound of bones cracking rang out as the goblin screamed.","The thousand players of the Tenth Regiment all focused their attacks on that goblin wolf rider. Skills rained down, and the goblin soon died. The giant wolf beneath it was killed at the same time.","Two kills.","Chu Fu plunged headfirst into the goblin formation. Since the enemies had broken through into the heart of their ranks, she dove into the enemy formation as well, throwing everything into chaos.","She also discovered that the goblin priests and goblin archers were among those trapped in the center of the encirclement.","Although the goblin priests couldn’t dispel her poisonous mist, the damage from Plague Spread wasn’t enough to kill them quickly.","Worse, the goblins’ Haste skill could restore the health of other goblins.","Chu Fu chased after them.","[Corrosive Venom Barrier]","Green poisonous fog erupted outward. The goblin priests immediately screamed as their skin and equipment hissed under the corrosive effect.","The Corrosive Venom Barrier had a range of eighty meters. Once it appeared, the goblins scattered in panic, unwilling to remain inside the poisonous mist.","They weren’t stupid. They knew how to avoid skills and wouldn’t simply stand there and take a beating.","But Chu Fu had a smooth little combo ready.","She dropped a Bewitching Mushroom.","This time, every goblin nearby ran toward the Corrosive Venom Barrier, drool pouring from their mouths.","They had been drawn in by the mushroom’s delicious flavor.","Not only that, but Chu Fu also pulled out an enormous bag of poison.","[Poison Dust]","Scales and spores scattered through the air.","The goblins, who had still been staring wide-eyed through the green fog, were suddenly blinded by a harsh white flash. They squeezed their eyes shut as tears streamed down their faces, mixing with mucus and drool and making them smell even fouler.","Then the spores from the Bewitching Mushroom followed, burrowing through their mouths and nostrils and sprouting clusters of Bewitching Mushrooms inside their bodies.","If the mushroom spores were inhaled into the lungs, the resulting damage would be even greater.","By herself, Chu Fu threw more than a hundred goblins into chaos.","[Judgment of Holy Light!]","Xie Lin descended from the sky, bathing the entire area in white light. The priests whose health had fallen below twenty percent were instantly slain before they could heal themselves.","Thirty goblin priests were killed in one blow.","The enemy’s already-scattered formation was blasted open, while the players maintained their formation. The tanks taunted from the front, the damage dealers attacked from behind them, and the healers restored everyone’s health from the rear.","The balance of victory tilted little by little in their favor.","“Outsiders! Hurry and call for reinforcements! Kill those giants!”","One of the armored goblins was also giving orders. There were ten goblins like him.","Clearly, these ten were bosses of various ranks!","“Focus fire!”","Feng Huimin also spotted the commanding boss and immediately marked it.","In an instant, the skills of tens of thousands of players surged forward like a tidal wave, striking the goblin.","Chu Fu pounced on it as well. Her hair wrapped tightly around the goblin, preventing it from moving, while the two chainsaw dandelions on her arms transformed into whirling blades and tore into its body with a vicious buzz.","Blood sprayed everywhere, making for a horrifying sight.","But in the players’ eyes, all they saw was the boss’s health bar plummeting at terrifying speed.","This was their chance!","“Get the boss!”","Someone shouted.","Countless players attacked even more fiercely."]},{"number":171,"title":"Chapter 171: The Boss Didn't Drop Loot, but You Can Strip Him Bare","paragraphs":["As the players unleashed a furious barrage of attacks, the BOSS finally collapsed.","Chu Fu, Shen Chi, and Xie Lin had all been on the front line, dealing damage to the BOSS.","However, after the BOSS died, it surprisingly dropped nothing.","Aside from experience, there were no attribute points awarded.","Even their contribution scores didn’t seem to increase.","Chu Fu suddenly realized something. With a toss of her hair, her Vine Lash instantly transformed into a master scavenger, stripping the necklace, bracelets, clothes, and pants from the goblin’s body.","【Goblin Fang Necklace (Dark Gold): Defense +130, Constitution +40, Strength +30, Agility +10. Special Effect: Hercules.】","It was actually a Dark Gold necklace.","“Jiaojiao, catch! It’s good stuff!”","Chu Fu immediately tossed the necklace to Jiaojiao Bu Jiao.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao caught it at once. Although she was delighted to see that it was Dark Gold quality, the next moment, she retched.","“Damn, it stinks! Quick, can a water-element healer wash me? It reeks! Blech~”","Fortunately, there really was a water-element healer nearby who cast a skill on Jiaojiao Bu Jiao.","【Water Purification】","A blue radiance representing clean water flowed over Jiaojiao Bu Jiao’s body. The blood and sweat splattered on her during the battle, along with the goblin stench, were all washed away.","Even the foul odor clinging to the fang necklace disappeared.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao immediately replaced her old necklace with it.","“Strip the gear! The equipment on these goblins can all be taken!”","Chu Fu immediately informed the members of the Thorn Guild.","At once, everyone swarmed over and began stripping the equipment from the dead goblins. Sure enough, all of it could be used.","And every piece was Dark Gold grade.","Although the equipment had a primitive, savage style, Dark Gold gear was simply too tempting.","Not to mention that most goblins wore fang necklaces, bone rings, and the like.","This was practically a wholesale market for Dark Gold jewelry.","Chu Fu leaped back into the goblin ranks. The corpses of the thirty-odd goblin priests who had fallen earlier had not yet been searched.","Her long hair whipped about wildly, bringing back thirty full sets of Dark Gold jewelry and clothing.","Goblin equipment was nowhere near as complete as players’ equipment.","Still, they had leather vests, leather skirts, and leather sandals.","The goblin priests also possessed impressive attack power, so their gear could be worn by both spellcasters and healers.","Suture Saint, Shafu Liangu, Zhimengzhe, Little Sister Wu, Bitter Melon King, Dream King, and Holy Healing Angel—seven people in total—could wear the equipment.","Chu Fu tossed pieces to each of them.","“Ugh! It reeks!”","Little Sister Wu’s face twisted in disgust.","Suture Saint, however, put the gear on without a word.","She had smelled corpses before. Her tolerance was simply on another level.","“Ahhhhh! I refuse to wear filthy goblin equipment! This is blasphemy against an angel!”","Holy Healing Angel began shrieking.","“Sacred Purification!”","Although she complained about it, she nevertheless purified all the equipment. The stench finally vanished.","When the others saw that every piece increased their attributes by nearly eighty points, they decided the gear was far too valuable to pass up and put it on as well.","Afterward, Chu Fu opened the guild’s combat statistics. The fourth-ranked healer was a water-element healer named Yu Xiaoyu, while the highest-ranked spellcaster outside their own party was a fire-element mage named Heaven-Burning Demon God.","Using her vice guild leader privileges, Chu Fu selected the rewards.","An announcement was immediately issued throughout the guild.","【Thorn Guild Vice Guild Leader “Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?” has awarded fourth-place healer Yu Xiaoyu: “Goblin Fang Necklace,” “Goblin Fang Bracelet,” and “Goblin Bone Ring.”】","【Thorn Guild Vice Guild Leader “Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?” has awarded seventh-place spell damage dealer Brahma Demon God: “Goblin Leather Vest,” “Goblin Leather Skirt,” and “Goblin Leather Sandals.”】","The rewards continued to be distributed in order.","The jewelry went to the healers, while the clothing went to the spellcasters.","Before long, all thirty sets of equipment had been handed out.","The players who received the gear all shouted excitedly.","“Thank you, Vice Guild Leader! Thank you, Plant Master! Oh my god, this is Dark Gold equipment... Wait, ah! Blech!”","In an instant, waves of retching echoed throughout the entire team.","The noise soon died down, however, as everyone dealt with the unpleasant odor on the equipment. After that, they became even more eager to get their hands on the goblins.","When monsters no longer posed a threat to players and could instead bring them enormous profits, one could say that the moment their health bars appeared, they were killed instantly.","Most of the goblins present were warriors. The mages could instantly kill them, while the tanks at the front could reach the bodies first and loot the equipment.","Taking advantage of the chaos, Xie Lin stayed on the front line and soon found himself dressed like a goblin savage. He had even somehow gotten hold of a chieftain’s hat.","The strong goblins’ clothing was somewhat oversized and extremely crude. Regardless of whether it was the men’s or women’s version, it consisted of nothing more than a vest.","Xie Lin was already tall, and once he put on the vest, its open front revealed glimpses of his chest and abdominal muscles as he fought. His eight-pack abs were sharply defined.","The lower half consisted of a leather skirt that exposed his sturdy thighs, giving him an overwhelming air of wildness.","Lu An also took advantage of the confusion to grab a set and throw it on. When he turned around, he immediately saw Xie Lin standing beside him.","Lu An glanced at Xie Lin’s eight-pack abs, then looked down at his own magnificent belly and instinctively sucked it in.","The Primordial Gate replicated reality 100 percent, but he had invested attribute points into himself. Shouldn’t he have eight-pack abs too? Why was he still exactly the same as in real life?","Hopefully, after reaching level 30, he could cash out his attributes and finally have a good physique.","On the battlefield, no one paid attention to such details. Everyone was focused on killing monsters and looting equipment. The archers in the rear were practically hopping with impatience.","“Friends in front, spare two pieces for us!”","Chu Fu helped snatch several pieces of clothing and distributed them to the archers according to their contribution.","“If you have weapons you don’t need, pass them on to your teammates!”","Besides spiked clubs, the weapons in the goblins’ hands included bows, battle-axes, and more.","They looked crudely made.","In reality, however, they were crafted from extremely high-grade materials.","With 2,500 goblins, there were 2,500 Dark Gold weapons.","They had struck it rich.","Most of these weapons were seized by members of the Thorn Guild. At least one-fifth of the players obtained a Dark Gold weapon.","Their damage output instantly became even more ferocious.","Under this atmosphere, the goblins were gradually devoured, one group at a time, until they were finally wiped out completely.","Corpses littered the ground.","Shafu Liangu’s insects gnawed ravenously on the goblins, one biting through each body with a crisp crunch.","“These goblins contain so much energy. My insects are evolving like crazy.”","They had transformed into gigantic super-insects.","“Clean up the battlefield! Revive all the players who died. Then we’re attacking again. Don’t forget that there’s still a town defense battle going on outside!”","...","Inside Fengdu Town.","The third wave of the town siege had already begun. Goblins were attacking from the south, west, and north, yet not a single goblin had appeared in the east.","Laoji Fuli had dominated Fengdu Town all by himself. Across the three waves, he had already earned a full thirty million contribution points, and he was grinning from ear to ear. He was still wondering why Chu Fu hadn’t come over to compete for the monsters.","“Wait a minute. Something’s wrong. Where are the Thorn Guild members?”"]},{"number":172,"title":"Chapter 172: The Star Alliance Wants a Taste, but the Goblins Have Gone to the East of the City","paragraphs":["They really couldn’t find them.","Even Laoji Fuli had gone to the trouble of accepting a mission, but he had only managed to dispatch fifty people, and he had no connections in Fengdu Town.","Besides, where the Thorn Guild went was their own business.","Yet Laoji Fuli felt as though a cat were scratching at his heart.","He was simply too curious.","And at that moment, it wasn’t just him.","The players were just as puzzled.","[Map]: “What’s going on? Where are Plant Boss and the others? How did some total stranger end up in first place on the contribution rankings?”","[Map]: “Shh, don’t you read the news? Elder Ji is now the official representative of Linjiang City!”","[Map]: “Holy crap, the eastern wall is empty. There’s practically no one defending it.”","[Map]: “The people from the Thorn Guild on the western wall have disappeared too.”","[Map]: “Something’s wrong. A thousand things are wrong. Could the big shots have been erased by some mysterious force?”","[Map]: “You’d rather believe they were erased by a mysterious force than believe they secretly struck it rich without telling us?”","Inside Fengdu Town.","The only other guild, the Star Guild, had also grown considerably by now.","It had a full five thousand members.","Although they had survived in the cracks under the Thorn Guild’s suppression, even a little that slipped through the fingers of the strong was enough for the weak to survive.","Because prices were cheap and everyone could afford golden equipment, the Star Alliance had flourished as well, becoming a terrifying money-making machine.","Jiang Yixing’s development had been excellent.","Thanks to his succubus talent, all five thousand players in the guild willingly allowed him to drain them.","He was the person who least wanted the Thorn Guild to keep growing stronger.","If the Thorn Guild had suddenly been erased by some unknown force, that would have been fine. What he feared was that they had discovered something valuable again.","Whenever something abnormal happened, there was always a reason.","Jiang Yixing immediately sent people to investigate.","“Quick, go see what’s happening east of town.”","The fastest players under his command hurried toward the east, but they kept walking and walking without seeing a single monster—or anyone from the Thorn Guild.","It was extremely strange.","Inside the guild, reports were coming in as well.","“The guy who used to sit in a wheelchair on the western side is gone too.”","“That Arrogant but Not Delicate person and Suture Saint are gone as well. They’re really all gone.”","Finally, after sprinting for twenty minutes, the player saw the spatial rift outside the eastern part of town and immediately reported the news to Jiang Yixing.","Jiang Yixing suddenly understood.","They had actually entered that dungeon called Origin!","And there had to be something good inside.","“Let’s go. We’re going too. With Plantman there, even if we just follow behind and pick up the scraps, we’ll still make a fortune!”","What Jiang Yixing was doing was frankly shameless.","But he was doing it deliberately.","The Thorn Guild had always targeted the Star Alliance, but Jiang Yixing also knew that only by following Plantman could he obtain anything valuable. Even a sip of the broth would mean a huge profit.","Besides, this was a public dungeon. With Plantman and the others leading the way, what did he have to fear?","As for dying and having to wait a hundred days before resurrecting?","The Thorn Guild had three priests capable of reviving people. For the right price, they would revive anyone. At worst, they could simply endure the guild’s exorbitant demands.","With that thought, he immediately rushed over and applied to enter.","All five thousand members of the Star Alliance were instantly transported into the Origin dungeon.","...","Inside the Origin dungeon.","The ground had been cleared completely. Even the 250 enormous crystals had been dismantled and carried away by the members of the Thorn Guild.","[Goblin Divine-Power Replication Crystal (Diamond-grade Special Item): Can replicate goblin clones for the purpose of exploring, invading, and plundering other planes. Can only replicate goblins.","The crystal contains immense energy. Collecting it may have other uses.]","They smashed every one of them apart and carried them away.","After cleaning up the battlefield, Shen Chi returned as well.","Shen Chi’s mech was the fastest. He had flown straight ahead, covering thirty kilometers in only a few dozen seconds. Before long, he discovered a primitive city.","It was roughly two kilometers in diameter as well. Since it was primitive, the space inside had not been used efficiently, so the population seemed relatively small and spread out. There were probably only around twenty thousand goblins.","The entire goblin city was in chaos. The goblins gathered together, shouting “wa-woo, wa-woo” in their strange language as they rushed toward the outskirts.","Some archers even spotted Shen Chi and fired arrows at him.","He hurriedly fled.","It seemed they had some method of reconnaissance. The only question was whether they knew the route his group was taking.","Shen Chi lured the goblins away, but a group of three thousand goblins still headed toward the area where Chu Fu and the others were located.","Clearly, they knew where Chu Fu and the others were.","“Plant Girl, get your people away from there. Around three thousand goblins are heading your way.”","Chu Fu immediately understood.","“Move!”","Chu Fu chose a direction and led the army forward.","With Feng Huimin’s formation skill, everyone’s speed was surprisingly well-balanced. The fast players instinctively slowed down, while the slower players even received an additional boost.","Twenty thousand players moved at high speed as one, obeying orders to the letter.","They also quickly analyzed the situation before them.","“If these goblins use the replication crystals to attack Fengdu Town, there will be 250 goblins for every level. Ten levels would mean 2,500 goblins. That means there are at least four directions they could attack from. We’re heading south.","“If pursuers come after us, we’ll kite them. If they catch up, we retreat.","“Everyone must keep up with the movement speed of the formation.”","“Yes!”","The members of the Thorn Guild answered loudly.","Chu Fu discovered that the map channel was unusable, but Feng Huimin could still relay commands to everyone in the formation through her class abilities.","Once the order was issued, the unaffiliated players were fired up as well, their faces filled with excitement.","They had struck it rich by tagging along.","The experience alone was astonishing. After this battle, the players had generally gained two levels.","One had to understand that even during the town-defense battle, only the very best players had managed to reach Level 25.","Now, there were still three goblin armies to fight, as well as an entire goblin city to conquer.","Could they reach Level 30 after finishing everything?","What was more, the trip would be worthwhile even if they obtained just one piece of dark gold equipment.","And Chu Fu was extremely fair, which meant everyone else was fair as well. If someone reached the end without receiving even a single piece of dark gold equipment, those who had obtained extra items would definitely give one up.","As for how much dark gold equipment was worth, or how much real-world money it could be exchanged for...","In Fengdu Town, they had long since stopped caring about money in the real world.","No matter how valuable dark gold equipment was, with the Thorn Guild around, it would eventually become standard equipment for everyone.","Why fight tooth and nail over one or two pieces of gear? Being generous could earn them a good reputation. Who knew? Perhaps they might even be accepted into the Thorn Guild’s reserve ranks.","After cleaning up the battlefield, all the players moved together, rapidly withdrawing from the area and heading toward the forces on the western side.","Shen Chi said, “That group of goblins is still heading east. They probably have no way to receive real-time information.”"]},{"number":173,"title":"Chapter 173: Shen Chi Instantly Killed, Sand Table Simulation, The Battle Against the Goblins","paragraphs":["Shen Chi shook off the goblins pursuing him and returned to the city once more. As expected, he saw another force of roughly three thousand goblins rushing out of the city and heading south.","“Another group just left. I suspect there’s either an item in the city that can detect the surrounding area, or some kind of special goblin monster.”","As Shen Chi analyzed the situation, he wanted to gather more information. He decided to approach the city and investigate.","The next moment, a beam of white light shot out from the most luxurious beast-hide tent at the very center of the city.","The beam was a full meter in diameter and pierced straight through Shen Chi’s mecha.","Boom!","Smoke billowed from the mecha. A huge hole had been blasted through the center of the cockpit, and it crashed to the ground.","In party mode, everyone could see the icon representing Shen Chi’s ID—a Rocket on a Wheelchair—instantly go dark, signifying his death.","Shen Chi had been killed in a single blow!","Fortunately, his ID lit up again in less than a second.","Shen Chi had used a Resurrection Scroll.","“Metal Manipulation!”","Shen Chi quickly flung out the materials in his backpack and repaired the mecha.","[Mechanical Overload]","With a boom, Shen Chi sprinted away at 200% speed.","Thankfully, the monster did not pursue him.","“What happened to Wheelchair Brother? Why did he die?” Chu Fu asked anxiously.","Shen Chi explained what he had encountered.","“I was killed by a monster called the Goblin Divine Emissary. However, it didn’t come after me, so it should be a spellcaster. Its skill has a range of one kilometer, but I’m not sure whether that was an instant-kill ultimate.”","This was the first time Shen Chi had died since entering the game.","However, he was too far from the main force, and he was worried that even Suture Saint would be killed instantly if she came over. Shen Chi had therefore made the decisive choice to use a Resurrection Scroll.","Besides, Resurrection Scrolls were no longer much of a burden for him.","Safety came first.","A Divine Emissary?","Generally speaking, anything called a Divine Emissary was at least Level 70!","No—Werewolf Tuge was also a Divine Emissary, but he had only been using a clone, which was why he had been so weak. This Divine Emissary, however, commanded an entire goblin city.","Still, the Goblin God should be considered a relatively weak deity. This Goblin Divine Emissary was unlikely to be Level 70; Level 60 seemed more reasonable.","Even so, a Level 60 monster was still far beyond what Chu Fu and the others could handle.","If it were Level 50, however, they might be able to risk fighting it.","Players had to complete a class advancement quest at Level 30, transforming from ordinary professionals into master-class professionals. At Level 60, they had to complete another advancement quest and be certified as grandmasters.","An ordinary professional might still be able to contend with a master through the strength of their talents.","But no matter what, they could never defeat a grandmaster.","“Did it come after you?” Chu Fu pressed.","“No. But it should be the boss. It seems to be able to detect our movements.”","“If I could get within one kilometer of it, I could see its attributes,” Feng Huimin said. “But the Mechanical Elder was also attacked from within one kilometer. Of course, it’s possible he was hit because he was an easy target in the air. On the ground, obstacles might make it harder for the boss to detect us.","“Still, all of that is just speculation. Even if we knew the details, there’s nothing we can do about the boss right now. There are too many monsters. We need to clear out the weaker ones first before we can deal with the boss!”","Chu Fu agreed.","“Fine. Let’s clear out these goblins first and get more dark-gold equipment! Wheelchair Brother, come back and share the experience. You don’t have any Resurrection Scrolls left, so it’s too dangerous for you to be on your own!”","“Understood. I’ll scout while I’m on my way back.”","Shen Chi planned to return. His damage output made up a significant portion of the team’s total, and without him, their killing speed would slow down.","However, as Shen Chi was making his way back to the team, he had no idea that the three thousand goblins heading toward the east of the city—who were originally destined to find nothing—had just happened to run into a feast delivered straight to them.","At the spatial rift east of the city, a human team emerged.","It was the Star Alliance.","The moment they landed, they saw the imposing goblins charging toward them in the distance.","“Roar!”","The three thousand goblins were tall and powerfully built. They charged straight at the five thousand players of the Star Alliance.","In a single clash, they smashed through the Star Alliance formation with overwhelming force.","“Yo! Yo! Yo!”","The goblins waved their weapons excitedly. They believed they had completed the mission assigned by the Divine Emissary and eliminated the invaders. Then they carried the invaders’ heads back with them and devoured the bodies on the spot.","Many Star Alliance players simply could not endure the brutality of the scene and logged off one after another.","But once they logged off, it meant their accounts had died.","Anyone who died inside the Origin Instance had to wait one hundred days before they could create a new account.","Jiang Yixing naturally had no desire to die. He immediately opened the map channel, hoping to call Plantman for help.","He could pay in gold coins—even one hundred gold coins if necessary.","[System Notification: You are in a special map. Other channels cannot be used except for the guild channel.]","“What?”","“Why didn’t anyone tell us this sooner?!”","“No! I don’t want to die! I have an S-rank talent!”","Jiang Yixing was frantic.","“Mia, find a way to contact Plantman! Get them to come save me!”","“I’ll have the fans leave messages on their official page and ask them to come rescue you!” Mia, his agent, was also panicking. She hurriedly replied.","Mia immediately contacted the players who had already logged off. Since they were already dead, they might as well make one final contribution—raising as much of a fuss as possible so that the people from the Thorn Guild would learn what had happened and be forced to come to their rescue.","...","Completely unaware of all this, Chu Fu led her team toward the goblin camp south of the city.","They had only fifteen minutes. Otherwise, reinforcements would arrive.","But Chu Fu and the others had already made a plan.","Chu Fu brought along a Taoist-class player who possessed an area-wide stealth ability.","They released a Charm Mushroom every one hundred meters.","When they finally reached a point one hundred and fifty meters from the enemy, they released another Charm Mushroom.","She attracted roughly two hundred goblins.","The first group of goblins was drawn to the first Charm Mushroom. After destroying it, they were immediately attracted to the next one, located one hundred meters away.","This created a chain reaction. The goblins were continuously lured away by the Charm Mushrooms, gradually separating from the main force.","With twenty thousand players attacking two hundred goblins, the battle could be settled in five minutes.","This method was indeed extremely efficient.","After killing that wave, they did not linger. They immediately fled.","The three thousand goblins chasing them were furious and howled in rage. Among them, the goblin wolf riders possessed tracking abilities and followed Chu Fu’s trail.","Chu Fu did not let them off easily either. She planted Creeping Vines along the route, then used her S-rank talent, Venomous Human, to turn the Creeping Vines poisonous.","When the wolf riders came after them, the poison struck the wolves first.","Chu Fu also discovered that Shen Chi was not the only one capable of taking to the air to scout for information. Feng Huimin was even more formidable.","At Level 15, Feng Huimin could monitor the surrounding area and use a telescope-like function. At Level 20, she gained an even more astonishing ability: battlefield simulation."]},{"number":174,"title":"Chapter 174: Flanking Attack, Challenging the Goblin Oracle","paragraphs":["Enemies were represented by red dots, allies by green dots, and friendly forces by blue dots.","All known intelligence was recorded on the sand table, allowing them to clearly see the enemy’s information up to one kilometer away.","She led the players into action, leaving the goblins far behind.","“Are we turning this into a war game?”","What had begun as a simple monster hunt had transformed into a full-scale battle.","And victory was destined to belong to them. As long as they continued dragging things out this way, the goblin forces would be gradually whittled down by their side.","Soon, they had killed another two hundred goblins in the west of the city before relocating to the north.","The Goblin City kept sending out troops to pursue them, believing that the three-thousand-strong goblin force dispatched from the east had already completed its mission.","Feng Huimin remained perfectly calm as she issued her orders. “These goblins aren’t all the same level, and their speeds differ as well. Now it’s our turn to circle around and hunt them from behind.”","Chu Fu had already handed over command to her opponent. She was only responsible for fighting.","Everyone followed Feng Huimin’s instructions and took a wide detour. Sure enough, they caught up with the tail end of the goblin pursuit force.","They were all Level 11 goblins, goblin servants, and goblin rock throwers.","The goblin rock throwers, burdened with sacks of stones, were far too slow.","Twenty thousand players swarmed them. In just five minutes, they wiped out three hundred goblins.","At this point, if one looked at the map, their forces and the goblin army resembled a giant game of Snake, with the snake’s head beginning to devour its own tail!","After pursuing them for a full two hours, they annihilated all nine thousand goblin pursuers.","The entire team’s levels rose dramatically, reaching Level 25.","Chu Fu and the others reached Level 29.","More importantly, every member had obtained at least two pieces of Dark Gold equipment.","The rewards were distributed according to contribution rankings. The stronger players received more Dark Gold equipment, with some even collecting a full eight pieces.","That was something they would never have dared to imagine outside this dungeon.","After eliminating all the pursuers, the Goblin City stopped sending out more troops.","“What do we do next, boss? Should we go fight the BOSS? Although this is a public dungeon, it’s closely connected to the assault on Fengdu Town!","“So this dungeon can’t last very long. Once the battle for the town ends, the dungeon might disappear as well.","“By now, the battle for the town should be nearing its end. Don’t underestimate the strength of the solo players in Fengdu Town.”","Chu Fu nodded as well.","“The dungeon’s completion condition should be killing the divine emissary. Even if we don’t complete it, we’ve already made a huge profit, but I have a feeling that clearing it will earn us an unimaginable fortune.","“Wheelchair Brother said there were only twenty thousand goblins inside the city. Twelve thousand have already been sent out, leaving fewer than eight thousand!","“Now that our levels have increased and our equipment has grown much stronger, we can fight them head-on.","“It all depends on how strong the BOSS is.","“So let’s test it out.”","Once the decision was made, Feng Huimin formed the team into a battle formation and led them toward the Goblin City. They soon reached the city’s outskirts.","“Captain, let me test the waters!” Shafu Liangu volunteered first.","Over the past two hours, no one had grown more than Shafu Liangu.","The others had merely experienced an increase in their attributes.","But Shafu Liangu had undergone something akin to a complete rebirth.","Previously, she had refrained from raising too many Gu insects because she was afraid she would not be able to sustain them. Now, however, the ground was covered with corpses brimming with energy. She immediately became an expert at raising them, rapidly nurturing all the Gu insects she possessed.","One of the moths had even evolved into a Dreadeye Butterfly.","Its body was a full ten meters long, and its wings stretched twenty meters when spread. It was an absolutely colossal creature.","“Go ahead. If your Gu insects die, the guild will provide whatever materials you need to raise them again.”","This was essentially a suicide mission. There was a high probability that her pets would not return, but they could not send Shen Chi in her place either.","Everyone agreed.","Shafu Liangu immediately controlled the Dreadeye Butterfly and sent it flying toward the Goblin City.","The Dreadeye Butterfly was incredibly brazen. It darted recklessly through the sky, flapping its wings and generating black winds that attacked the goblins below.","Boom!","A beam of white light flashed and struck the Dreadeye Butterfly, piercing straight through its chest.","The Dreadeye Butterfly plummeted to the ground.","Shafu Liangu’s expression did not change. She summoned another Gu insect.","It was a gray moth, also ten meters in size.","The moth flew into the air once more and boldly headed toward the center of the city. The goblin rock throwers inside began attacking one after another, but their projectiles could not reach that altitude.","“It hasn’t released another attack!” Chu Fu exclaimed, her spirits rising.","Shafu Liangu immediately controlled the moth and sent it straight toward the very center, aiming for the lavish tent that stood out from all the others.","The hide covering the tent was instantly blown away.","Everything inside the tent was exposed.","Although the Goblin City was filthy and chaotic, the interior of this tent was surprisingly orderly. It contained all kinds of potion bottles, crystals, magic stones, beast-bone materials, and books—symbols of civilization.","An elderly goblin stood hunched over inside, gripping a staff and glaring furiously at them.","He wore a white robe made of a gauzy, veil-like material. Flecks of starlight shimmered across it like sparks from a flame, making it exceptionally unusual. On him, however, it looked like a complete waste.","The robe’s quality was probably Diamond rank!","Feng Huimin raised her binoculars and saw the Goblin Divine Emissary.","She clenched her fists.","“I see him. He’s a Level 50 Goblin Divine Emissary. It looks like he’s controlling a formation, so he can’t move, but his ranged attacks can kill someone instantly.”","“We can fight him!” Chu Fu shouted immediately.","Level 50 was definitely within the realm of possibility.","“The good news is that the only goblins left inside the city are the old, the weak, and the infirm. Their strength isn’t very high. We can push our way in!”","“Then what are we waiting for?” Chu Fu grinned. “Charge!”","Chu Fu summoned her plants and merged with them, transforming into a plant humanoid as she advanced toward the Goblin City.","The goblins inside the city shrieked in panic. They had never seen anything so enormous before.","Chu Fu flicked her long hair, sending countless Strangle Vines surging out to ensnare the goblins.","Feng Huimin marked the targets, and the players unleashed their attacks. Every goblin marked was killed, one after another, at astonishing speed.","They soon advanced five hundred meters.","At that moment, a beam of white light shot out from the magnificent tent. It looked almost like a rainbow, curving through the air as it came crashing toward them.","Target: Suture Saint!","“Look out!” Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao shouted. With a single leap, she landed in front of Suture Saint and raised her shield.","Absolute Defense!","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao’s body entered an invincible state. The white light struck her, but dealt no damage, leaving only a dazzling glare.","“We blocked it!”","“Nice one, Jiao Jiao!” Chu Fu shouted.","If the Goblin Divine Emissary only had this one ability, then he was nothing more than a sitting duck.","The group advanced another three hundred meters.","They were now only two hundred meters from the BOSS.","Chu Fu released an Enchantment Mushroom.","The BOSS let out a cold laugh and actually spoke in human language.","“A mere Gold-rank plant thinks it can lure me away?”","The Goblin Divine Emissary’s mental strength was so high that he was immune to the enchantment.","But Chu Fu did not panic in the slightest.","“What about this, then?”","Chu Fu aimed her A Little Too Much Poison staff at him.","“Enchantment!”"]},{"number":175,"title":"Chapter 175: The Thorn Guild Under Pressure: Wolves Ahead, Tigers Behind","paragraphs":["The Fascinating Mushroom’s charm effect truly depended on the allure radiated by the golden plants.","That was why, although Dandelion and Cleavers were both decent, they were gradually phased out as their level increased.","If not for Trait 5, Plant Person, and Poison Person, which could mutate plants into toxins, those two plants would hardly ever have had a chance to enter battle.","However, the [A Little Too Much Poison] staff was a growth weapon, so its skill scaling was extremely high. Its power depended on Chu Fu’s own mental strength and spell attack.","By this point, Chu Fu’s base attributes had reached an astonishing 326 points, not to mention her full set of dark-gold equipment and the bonuses stacked from various badges.","As long as her overall attributes were high enough, there was no reason for her skills to miss.","The moment [Charm] was cast, the Goblin Divine Emissary subconsciously took a step forward. One of the magical conduits connected to him instantly went dark.","The four crystal balls dimmed.","In places Chu Fu could not see, the four spatial rifts leading to Fengdu Town began to shrink.","The Goblin Divine Emissary regained consciousness after being controlled for only three seconds, but by then Chu Fu and the others had already entered a range of less than a hundred meters.","“Hey, green-skinned freak! Look this way! Do you understand human speech?”","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao activated taunt mode.","The Goblin Divine Emissary flew into a rage and raised his staff.","“Angering me will be the decision you regret most.”","A burst of green light the size of a basketball exploded forth and slammed toward Jiaojiao Bu Jiao.","She blocked it, but the shields supplied by the other support players shattered one after another across her body.","The green radiance struck Jiaojiao Bu Jiao, then exploded into fist-sized beams of light that shot outward in all directions like scattering flowers.","In gaming terms, this was splash damage.","After hitting one target, the attack spread out and struck other players at random.","When the scattered green orbs hit the assassins, they blew away half their health. Some of the more fragile players were nearly killed outright.","The Goblin Divine Emissary gave another cold snort. “Chain Lightning!”","With a crack, a bolt of lightning appeared and struck Jiaojiao Bu Jiao before leaping from her to the surrounding players.","Fifty people were killed instantly.","The ground was covered in corpses.","Then the corpses in the guild began talking.","“Damn, what kind of damage is that? I’m a warrior!”","“What’s so special about being a warrior? I’m the team’s main tank!”","“This boss hits way too hard. Is this level suppression? How are we supposed to fight it?”","“Don’t be afraid. Plant Boss and the others are still here.”","Feng Huimin, however, remained perfectly calm.","“As long as the tanks aren’t killed instantly, we can keep fighting. Supports, don’t stop refreshing the shields. Melee attackers, spread out. Don’t get hit by the skills. Dodge as much as possible and avoid putting pressure on the healers!”","“The aggro is stable. Damage dealers, attack. Try to control it.”","Chu Fu advanced at the same time.","She transformed her body into a three-meter-tall form, giving the other players more room to attack. Cleavers wrapped tightly around the Goblin Divine Emissary, but he tore himself free.","Chu Fu refused to give up. The green Plant Person form granted by Trait 5 actually increased her health, preventing her from being killed instantly.","She began applying poison.","Plague Spread and Venomous Miasma were not very effective under the circumstances.","Instead, she directly applied Poison Spell, Slow Spell, and Soul Devouring: Return to the Void.","The last skill in particular made the Goblin Divine Emissary let out a scream. He then glared furiously at Chu Fu.","She had pulled aggro!","“Look at me, you green-skinned monster! You ugly freak!”","Lu An was in position!","His taunt was fully powered up, having undergone considerable enhancement.","The Goblin Divine Emissary immediately turned toward him and fired a blast of white light.","“Holy Light Domain!”","The Holy Healing Angel immediately cast a shield. She and Lu An had fought together too many times, so she naturally knew exactly when to act.","The Holy Light Domain exploded a moment later, reducing most of the damage. On top of that, Lu An’s own talent allowed him to—","Shen Chi also transformed into a three-meter-tall mech, pounding the enemy with tremendous force.","Xie Lin, meanwhile, summoned flying swords from above. They stabbed at the Goblin Divine Emissary with a constant clinking sound.","The ranged attackers had become melee fighters, while the melee fighters had become ranged attackers.","Aside from those three, the player whose attack power ranked immediately below theirs was unexpectedly the Bitter Melon King.","The Bitter Melon King’s Agony skill was extremely powerful against single targets and intelligent races. In the past, the bosses had simply been too weak to give him a chance to deal damage.","This time, however, the Goblin Divine Emissary was truly getting a taste of suffering.","The Goblin Divine Emissary suddenly took out a horn and began to blow.","He was summoning goblins.","Feng Huimin immediately issued orders.","“Everyone else, deal with the small monsters. Leave the central area to the top fifty damage dealers. Dodge the boss’s attacks. Anyone who can’t dodge should lie down. After being revived, leave immediately.”","Put simply, anyone who couldn’t dodge was simply bad at the game. Their agility and reaction speed were insufficient, causing them to be hit by the boss’s skills.","Only the skilled players with good technique could stay.","As for fighting from the air, that was even less practical. The flying wings were not as nimble as the players themselves. When the instant-kill white light appeared, Jiaojiao Bu Jiao and Lu An could not intercept it in time.","The only person in the air was Xie Lin, and so far, he had not been hit by a single skill.","This was the Thorn Guild’s first time fighting a battle of attrition like this.","But Feng Huimin had fought plenty of battles like it back when she was with the Universe Guild.","That was why she had not shown the slightest trace of panic.","The moment they reduced the enemy’s health bar by one percent, she already knew that this battle was winnable.","Of course, it was still far too early to say that with certainty.","The Divine Emissary still had abilities he had not revealed.","Sure enough, only a short while later, the Divine Emissary summoned another attack. Dark clouds covered the sky, and thunderbolts rained down, striking every player.","There was no way to dodge it.","The battlefield was cleared in an instant.","Even among the core members of Chu Fu’s team, only Chu Fu, Xie Lin, Shen Chi, Jiaojiao Bu Jiao, and Lu An survived.","A three-hundred-person team was wiped out in the blink of an eye.","All the healers were dead.","They had nearly been completely annihilated!","Fortunately, everyone present had revival scrolls. In addition, the remaining angels possessed a self-revival skill called Light Reassembly.","Before the Holy Healing Angel could revive Suture Saint, Suture Saint and Little Sister Wu immediately used their revival scrolls.","They were healers and had to get back up quickly. Otherwise, Jiaojiao Bu Jiao and Lu An would not be able to hold the line.","“Corpse Stitching!”","Suture Saint crawled back to his feet and released Corpse Stitching. From the beginning of the battle until now, he had barely done any healing, but Corpse Stitching had never stopped.","Feng Huimin also rose and quickly used Horn, Formation, and other buff skills. The Holy Healing Angel rapidly restored everyone’s health.","“We’ve identified another skill. Everyone, stay calm and keep fighting. Our damage output is improving quickly. Forty minutes! As long as we last forty minutes, this boss will definitely die!”","The moment she finished speaking, the Goblin Divine Emissary cast a healing spell on himself and began recovering his health.","Fortunately, Chu Fu and the Bitter Melon King immediately used soul attacks, greatly reducing the effectiveness of his healing.","Feng Huimin swallowed her anxiety and tried to keep her voice steady.","“Fifty-six minutes. We just need to hold on for fifty-six minutes.”","Every player’s nerves were stretched taut. The players who were not participating in the boss fight were also facing goblins numbering three times their own force.","Fortunately, these goblins were low-level. Some of them were even goblin children.","The players increased their damage output and swept through them.","Fifteen minutes later, Feng Huimin’s expression changed again.","“The goblins attacking from outside are coming back!”","This time, they were truly caught between a rock and a hard place.","More importantly, there was no way they could hold off more than ten thousand goblins."]},{"number":176,"title":"Chapter 176: Clearing the Origin Dungeon, the Generous Rewards Stunned the Audience","paragraphs":["“Brothers, give it everything you’ve got! Hold them back and buy the Plant Grandmaster and the others some time!”","The solo players roared as one.","Everyone increased their output. They gulped down potions as if they were free, released their skills with precision, and squeezed every last bit of damage out of themselves.","At the very center, Chu Fu and the others were also doing everything they could to deal damage.","Chu Fu raised a bottle of poison and aimed it at the Goblin Divine Emissary.","“Have a taste of some vintage venom!”","Chu Fu had always carried a secondary weapon: the Poison Bottle. Normally, she used it to increase her attributes. No boss had ever been worth using up the poison she had accumulated inside it.","She had once considered saving the poison, extracting its materials to upgrade her talent, “A Little Too Poisonous.” But she also felt that it was one of her special trump cards, so she had never been willing to waste it.","Now, at last, it had found its purpose.","The poison poured from the bottle. Under the control of Poison Sprinkling, the venomous liquid instantly enveloped the Goblin Divine Emissary.","The moment its skin came into contact with the poison, it began to corrode. Toxic sores erupted across its body, leaving it covered in pus-filled boils.","The deadly poison caused the Goblin Divine Emissary’s health to plummet.","Not only that, it also inflicted a Defense Down effect that reduced its defense by 100% for a full five minutes.","“Fifteen minutes!” Feng Huimin shouted. “Hold on for fifteen minutes!”","Everyone launched into a frenzied assault.","Chu Fu repeatedly used Deadly Poison, then ignited it with Venomous Detonation, unleashing devastating damage.","Now that they knew their enemy’s methods, the Thorn Guild’s elite team suffered fewer and fewer deaths, while the enemy’s health continued to drop.","“Blasphemers! You should all die! You dare defile the gods? Sooner or later, we will exterminate every last one of you!”","When the Goblin Divine Emissary’s health fell to 10%, its escape mechanism was triggered.","But Jiao Jiao Isn’t Delicate and Lu An clung to it relentlessly.","Two minutes later, the Goblin Divine Emissary crashed to the ground.","A solemn female voice, unlike any they had ever heard before, echoed through their minds.","[You have cleared the dungeon: Servant of God (Origin).]","[Dungeon clear time: 5 hours, 12 minutes, 34 seconds.]","[All participating players may revive once for free. All players gain +1 level and +100 to all attributes.]","[The system will grant rewards based on each player’s performance in the dungeon. Rewards will be distributed automatically; no exchange is required.]","[Calculating rewards...]","“Ahhh! We won!”","The surviving players began to cheer.","“Don’t celebrate yet! Hurry—go help them!”","Everyone looked around.","Only three thousand players remained alive across the entire team, while five thousand goblins were still attacking them.","The players fighting alongside Chu Fu had truly been trading their lives for one enemy at a time.","With the system’s rewards, everyone gained 100 points to all attributes and received a free revival.","In an instant, another twenty thousand players joined the assault on the goblins.","Before long, all five thousand goblins had been wiped out.","The system also finished calculating the rewards.","The lavish prizes left everyone staring wide-eyed in disbelief as their strength skyrocketed.","“Ahhh! Oh my god! My talent has advanced to S-rank!”","“Holy crap! My ordinary class evolved into a special class!”","“Hahaha! I actually awakened a second talent! Isn’t this treatment supposed to be reserved for people with at least ten thousand contribution points?”","Everyone was stunned.","Chu Fu was stunned as well.","As the team’s strongest damage dealer, she was certain her rewards would be substantial. But she had never expected them to be this generous, and even she was left speechless.","[You have completed a glorious battle and made an enormous contribution!","[Your S-rank talent, Poisonous Human, has absorbed divine power and become the SS-rank talent, Poisonous Human.]","[Your special class, Poison Master, has absorbed divine power and can evolve into a hidden class. Please choose an evolution path!","1: Plague Spreader","2: Venomous Gu Crafter","3: Source of Voodoo","4: Seed of Calamity]","Each of the four options focused on a different aspect.","The Plague Spreader was extremely powerful and specialized in plagues. Its passive ability automatically inflicted a plague effect within a five-meter radius.","It was practically spreading disease at all times.","In the game, it might be an incredibly powerful class. But in the real world, she would become a walking pathogen.","Reality did not have a function that prevented friendly fire.","Chu Fu knew that the story contained an Ice Queen who radiated an aura of frost that inevitably froze anyone near her.","In the end, the person who fell in love with her could not endure the “cold violence” and broke up with her.","Chu Fu had an older brother and many friends. She had no desire to become a Plague Spreader.","The second class was more or less similar to a Gu crafter who refined insects through the sacrifice of a husband, only it was an advanced version.","But Chu Fu was somewhat afraid of bugs.","The third was even more outrageous.","Voodoo specialized in curses and the refinement of poisonous corpses. It could turn players or NPCs into powerful Poison Corpses for combat. It could even refine the user into a person whose entire body was filled with deadly poison.","Chu Fu had no desire to become a major villain, so she discarded that option immediately.","All of these classes were powerful, but their side effects were just as severe.","Chu Fu could only place her hopes in the final option. If she refused to choose, she had no idea whether the system would allow her to return the offer.","They were all terrible choices.","[Seed of Calamity:","Class Description: One who controls disaster and misfortune.","Class Trait 1: Skills you release have a chance to gain a 1–10-fold area-of-effect increase, transforming a minor skill into a great calamity.","Class Trait 2: All your enemies automatically suffer -10 Luck.]","That was absurdly powerful!","Chu Fu chose option four without the slightest hesitation.","[You have advanced to Seed of Calamity.]","[Your skills are evolving.]","[Deadly Poison → Poisonous Cataclysm.","Sluggishness → Mire Cataclysm.","Plague Spread +10 → Plague Cataclysm +10.","Corrosive Poison Barrier +10 → Black Death Cataclysm +10.","Soul Devouring, Return to the Void +10 → Soul-Erasing Cataclysm +10.","Poison Sprinkling and Poison Vein Eruption remain unchanged.","Additional awakened skills:","Seed of Cataclysm: Plants a seed of calamity in an enemy. Subsequent attacks will suddenly undergo catastrophic changes.","Seed of Misfortune: Plants a seed of misfortune in an enemy, causing bad luck to plague them and reducing their Luck by 20.","Calamity Rebound (Passive): You will never suffer from disasters or misfortune, and you reflect all bad luck and curses.]","What an incredibly powerful class!","Chu Fu loved it.","This time, her class had also gained a new attribute: misfortune!","That gave her three types of power: plants, poison, and misfortune.","What Chu Fu did not expect was that the system had not finished yet.","[The divine power you absorbed can activate a second class: Wood Mage. It can also advance into the hidden class Spirit of the Forest Sea. Do you agree? (Note: After activating a second class, the class will begin at level 1, and the experience required to level up will be doubled.)]","There was nothing to hesitate about.","Chu Fu agreed without a second thought.","The rewards were so generous that every player went wild.","At that moment, a horn sounded, and everyone felt a tremendous surge of power.","They all turned toward the person who had cast the skill.","Feng Huimin, who had always kept her emotions hidden, now had flushed cheeks, and her hands were trembling.","“Boss! Boss, my talent has advanced to S-rank, and my class has become a hidden class too!”"]},{"number":177,"title":"Chapter 177: 300 S-Class Professionals, the Only Divine-Class Professional","paragraphs":["When Feng Huimin first entered the game, she had awakened only a C-rank talent, Quick-Witted. After dying once, as expected, her talent had dropped to D-rank.","When she learned that the game could descend into reality, Feng Huimin regretted it terribly.","She had missed the Village Defense Battle and the Counterattack. Now that the Town Defense Battle had arrived, prices had skyrocketed, and with everything being rationed, she could only obtain two Talent Enhancement Stones.","How many major events and major-version storylines would she have to go through before she could catch up with the players in the top tier?","Wasn’t this just like missing a bull market in stocks and failing to take part in a billion-yuan project, thereby losing out on the commission?","Feng Huimin could only search for other ways to obtain Talent Enhancement Stones.","But she never expected that simply by following Chu Fu into a major-version storyline, she would rise from a D-rank talent all the way to S-rank.","It was practically the same as ascending to heaven in one step.","There was no doubt, however, that Feng Huimin had made the greatest contribution in the battle.","Her calm command and the versatility of her skills had allowed her to shine brilliantly.","Although the players of the Thorn Guild had been very obedient and had never looked down on Feng Huimin, after all, she was meticulous and also the exclusive secretary-general and overall person in charge for the Plant Boss...","The respect they had shown her had been because of Chu Fu’s influence.","Not Feng Huimin’s.","After this battle, they truly came to admire Feng Huimin and acknowledge her abilities.","The system naturally recognized her even more.","Her D-rank Quick-Witted talent had actually evolved into the S-rank Prophet talent.","Her class had also changed into [Battlefield Commander (Hidden Class)].","Feng Huimin was immensely grateful to Chu Fu. If Chu Fu had not trusted her and given her the authority to act, she would never have achieved what she had today.","This showed just how important it was to follow the right leader.","“Wow, that’s amazing! Congratulations on your promotion, Manager Feng!”","“Thank you, Boss. It’s all thanks to your excellent leadership. If I hadn’t followed you, I could never have achieved what I have today. I have no way to repay you. From now on, even if you ask me to die, I’ll do so willingly.”","Chu Fu had treated her so well. What difference was there between this and cultivating a devoted death warrior?","A true warrior would die for the one who recognized his worth.","“Listen to yourself. Would Plant Girl really let you die? Even if you did die, I could revive you!” Suture Saint then displayed his class. “My talent has already reached SSS-rank, and my class has evolved as well. I’m now the Medicine Saint.”","This was what Suture Saint deserved.","In this battle, according to incomplete statistics, Suture Saint had saved at least twenty thousand people.","Every single person present owed Suture Saint a life.","“Just a little Medicine Saint, and you’re already on the same level as me. What a pity that I’m no longer the person I once was! Hahaha!”","Xie Lin stood on his flying sword, hovering a meter above the ground—higher than everyone else—with both hands clasped behind his back, putting on the air of a worldly immortal.","Xie Lin’s class was Sword Saint, so he really was on the same level as the Medicine Saint.","However, there was clearly something different about Xie Lin’s tone.","Chu Fu stared at him in surprise. Could it be that he had...","Sure enough, before Chu Fu could ask, Xie Lin had already posted his class in the guild chat.","In an instant, a dazzling, multicolored radiance flashed out, nearly blinding everyone.","[Unique Class: Sword God!]","A divine-class wielder.","In this battle, Xie Lin’s damage output had ranked second. He could not surpass Chu Fu, but he had decisively outperformed Shen Chi.","What was even more frightening was that Xie Lin had not been attacked even once throughout the entire battle. In other words, he had placed no pressure on the healers at all and had dodged every single boss skill.","He had cleared the dungeon without taking any damage.","That was incredibly rare.","Previously, as a melee fighter, Xie Lin had always been unable to surpass Shen Chi and Suture Saint during the Village and Town Defense Battles. To make matters worse, he had been the poorest of the three at the beginning and had been unwilling to spend money on anything.","Even now, both of his talents were only double-S and were not particularly impressive.","But now, both talents had risen to SS-rank, and he had gained a divine-class profession.","Xie Lin had completely risen to prominence.","This was a divine-class profession. He certainly had the right to be arrogant.","Everyone looked at him with envy.","Shen Chi let out a sigh. “I thought I was already doing pretty well. I never expected Sword Saint to become Sword God. Unlike me—I only awakened a second class.”","Shen Chi had awakened a second class: Metal-element Mage.","“What? This game has second classes too?”","“My god, why is it always you three?”","“Three? Then what reward did Plant Girl receive?”","Everyone’s eyes turned toward Chu Fu.","Chu Fu could only display it.","“It really is just an ordinary hidden second class.”","“You two are unbelievable!” Xie Lin couldn’t stand the way they were humblebragging.","“But you two made a fortune, while I didn’t lose out either. A person should strive to reach the pinnacle in one field. Having my class advance to the divine level is already a huge help to me!”","Xie Lin was not a greedy person. He genuinely felt that the unique Sword God class suited him perfectly. After awakening it, he had even received some exclusive swordsmanship memories.","Through the third trait of Ten Thousand Swords Return to the Origin—Sword Heart—these memories had granted him a large number of attribute points.","This was an absolutely tremendous boost.","As everyone revealed their rewards, Chu Fu discovered that only she and Shen Chi had awakened second classes.","Upon closer inspection, there was actually a pattern.","Chu Fu and Shen Chi were both players whose combat abilities developed broadly. Their talents and class abilities were separate, allowing them to continuously gain more abilities.","Xie Lin and Suture Saint, on the other hand, were the type whose talents existed to serve their classes.","Overall, however, everyone had advanced.","Within the Thorn Guild, some players with A-rank talents had even reached S-rank during this major descent.","Looking closely, most of these people had been the ones who fought the bosses alongside Chu Fu.","They had faced the most intense battles. Many had died and then gotten back up to continue fighting. Some had died three or four times—not because they were weak, but because the bosses had been completely unreasonable. That was why Feng Huimin had not replaced them.","After fighting with everything they had, it was only natural that they received the greatest rewards.","Among the unaffiliated players who had defended the outskirts against the goblin army, there were also some who had made outstanding contributions. Those who happened to possess A-rank talents had likewise reached S-rank.","According to the statistics, the total number of S-rank talent holders had actually reached three hundred.","It was already astonishing for two or three S-rank talents to awaken in a single novice village.","Now, this group had three hundred S-rank talent holders.","How terrifying was that combat power?","What was more, they were all willingly following Chu Fu.","They knew that only by following Chu Fu could they obtain opportunities like these.","The unaffiliated players who had awakened S-rank talents began asking Chu Fu whether they could join the Thorn Guild.","They were desperate to improve!","...","Meanwhile.","Just as Chu Fu and the others cleared the dungeon, the system made a global announcement throughout the game.","[System Announcement! Congratulations to player “Who Wants to Be a Plant Person?” for leading the Thorn Guild and a host of other players to clear a Genesis-level dungeon! Rewards: +100 to all attributes and +1 level.]","Everyone who heard the bell-like announcement was thrown into an uproar.","At that moment, Chu Feng was also in the game. After seeing the announcement, his pupils contracted in disbelief.","“What is a Genesis-level dungeon? Why have I never even heard of it?!”","Could his little sister actually be a gaming prodigy?"]},{"number":178,"title":"Chapter 178: Diamonds Dropped but Useless: The Weaver's Second Talent","paragraphs":["Chu Feng felt that, although as a reincarnator he possessed the advantage of knowing the future and had obtained a limit-breaking SSS-rank talent with stats far beyond everyone else’s, every move Chu Fu made still brought him unexpected surprises.","Chu Fu was already Level 30.","She had even entered an Origin-level dungeon that he had never heard of before.","This filled Chu Feng with a sense of urgency.","He wanted to be the one carrying his little sister through the game, not the one being carried by her.","More importantly, he knew that once certain players grew stronger, they would attract the attention of even more monsters and gods. He was afraid that Chu Fu might be in danger.","But then again, Chu Fu was already incredibly powerful, and she had a group of formidable teammates. It seemed there was no need for him to worry about her.","And yet, why did the thought of not needing to worry about her make him feel even worse?!","No. He had to grow stronger and become his sister’s eternal shield!","Without wasting a second, Chu Feng continued fighting.","...","Within Fengdu Town.","The remaining seventy thousand players were beating their chests and stamping their feet in frustration.","In fact, they had begun searching the moment they realized Chu Fu was missing.","As the star town of Linjiang City, Fengdu Town naturally had many local reporters, as well as reporters from other places, conducting livestreams.","Lin Haowan had originally intended to lead his guild into battle, but after discovering that Chu Fu had disappeared, he immediately located a player’s livestream.","Before long, he learned through the scrolling comments that Chu Fu and the others had actually vanished in front of the rift.","However, the player broadcasting the stream could not see any information about the dungeon, nor could they track anyone who entered the rift.","It was as if they had truly been swallowed up.","Jiang Yixing had also led the members of the Star Alliance into the spatial rift.","The players at the other three walls still had to defend the town against the enormous hordes of monsters, so they naturally had no way to go to the rift and investigate.","Another half hour passed before a player finally reached the edge of the rift and revealed the situation inside.","Everyone learned about the Origin dungeon.","But just then, countless Star Alliance players began flooding the livestream chat with messages.","“Please, Thorny Guild, save our oppa!”","“We’ll pay any price! Our oppa died right at the dungeon entrance. Hurry and save him!”","“Can anyone get in touch with the Thorny Guild? I’m dying of anxiety! Our oppa is lying on the ground, and it must be freezing!”","The viewers in the livestream did not care what happened to their “oppa.” They were far more curious about what the dungeon was like. After learning that every monster inside was comparable to a Goblin Abyss King, they all lost their nerve.","The entrance to the rift had already been occupied by goblins, and there had been no news from Plantman and the others.","Many people even suspected that the Thorny Guild had met with disaster as well.","This caused the remaining players to lose heart.","Moreover, after Jiang Yixing died, goblins began spawning on the eastern side.","The players had no choice but to send a group of people to defend the eastern wall.","At this moment, Laoji Fuli stepped forward and summoned a massive skeleton army to hold back the monsters outside the eastern wall.","They finally managed to survive until the ninth wave and were merely waiting for the monsters of the tenth wave to arrive.","Yet the system seemed to have frozen. No monsters appeared for a long time. As for asking them to enter the dungeon and investigate?","Forget it.","The price of being unable to log into the game for one hundred days was too great. They were not Plantman or the other top experts.","Besides, there had still been no news. If anything, that only made them even more worried.","Could it be that even the top experts had been wiped out inside that Origin-level dungeon?","If so, they definitely could not go in.","And so they waited for more than an hour.","Then, a shocking global announcement was issued.","It was not limited to Server 030. Every server across Global Regions 1–9999 heard it.","However, even after clearing the dungeon, Chu Fu and the others did not return immediately.","They were cleaning up the battlefield!","...","Inside the Origin dungeon.","Within the City of Goblins.","The loot dropped by the Goblin Divine Emissary was picked up. Everyone was thrilled at first, but their excitement soon turned into bitter disappointment.","[The Goblin God’s Blessed Robe (Diamond Rank): Exclusive to Goblin Divine Servants.]","[God-Blessed Diamond Necklace (Diamond Rank): Exclusive to Goblin Divine Servants.]","Chu Fu knew that Diamond-rank equipment was far beyond what a Level 30 player could possess.","Players would have to reach at least Level 40 before they could possibly obtain Diamond-rank equipment in top-tier dungeons.","Yet their very first piece of Diamond-rank equipment had an exclusive-wearer restriction. This was a huge disappointment to Chu Fu.","That was not all. The Goblin Divine Emissary’s other pieces of equipment—the boots, bracelet, ring, and weapon—were also Diamond-rank, but required Level 50 to equip.","It gave them the feeling that they had fought for nothing.","Chu Fu could only place the equipment in the guild warehouse as display pieces.","At that moment, Zhimengzhe timidly raised a hand.","“Captain, I awakened a second talent called Weaver. It can dismantle equipment and turn it into materials, then reweave it. There’s even a chance to improve the equipment’s quality. How about letting me try the equipment?”","Chu Fu immediately brightened.","Equipment that could not be used was no different from trash. If it could be dismantled into materials, there was no reason to feel it was going to waste.","Level 50 was still far too distant. They might as well dismantle it.","“Sure. You can have all of it!”","Chu Fu bundled up the equipment and handed it to Zhimengzhe.","“If you need any materials, use guild contribution points to exchange for them. The guild will reimburse everything. Once the new equipment is made, everyone can exchange for it with guild contribution points!”","Chu Fu then addressed all the members of the Thorny Guild:","“This time, everyone took part in this large-scale guild dungeon, and the battle was intense. So we’ll be using a combination of free looting and contribution-point distribution.","“I know that some people obtained more than others, and some players may feel that they got the short end of the stick.","“But I believe the rewards from this dungeon are enough to make up for the value of the equipment.","“Dark Gold-rank equipment will come sooner or later. Don’t forget that, besides Fengdu Town, there are also Guguan Town, Fenghe Town, Leigu Town, and more and more new towns appearing every day.","“When the time comes, I may ask you to go fight and provide support, and you may not even be willing to go.","“You might think Dark Gold-rank equipment is common and worthless.","“So don’t let temporary gains and losses damage our unity.","“Of course, Dark Gold-rank equipment is currently considered top-tier endgame gear in the game. I hope that excess equipment will first be repurchased through Thorny Guild contribution points. Guild members who lack equipment can also use contribution points to purchase it.","“Since all the equipment from this dungeon has already been distributed, everyone should submit any materials you acquire while exploring to the guild.","“Search in teams and return here to regroup before seven o’clock. Then we’ll leave!”","After Chu Fu finished speaking, everyone scattered and set off to explore the entire city.","However, they all avoided the Divine Servant’s tent.","The best items in this place were certain to be inside. Everyone—even those who were not members of the Thorny Guild—tacitly agreed that anything here belonged to the Plantman team.","Chu Fu and the others entered the residence of the Goblin Divine Emissary. The first items they obtained were the enormous silver-gray gemstones placed in the four directions of the formation protected by the Goblin Divine Emissary."]},{"number":179,"title":"Chapter 179: Chu Fu Returns, the Star Alliance Is Annihilated","paragraphs":["【Divine-Powered Spatial Stone (Diamond-grade Item): Can tear open space at a known coordinate and establish a spatial passage. The larger the tear, the more energy it consumes.","Currently marked coordinates: East, south, west, and north districts of Fengdu Town.","Divine power remaining: 17 hours, 42 minutes, 31 seconds.】","So this thing was used to establish formations.","Chu Fu felt a chill run down her spine as well. Fortunately, the Goblin Divine Emissary hadn’t destroyed the spatial stones back then. Otherwise, they might never have made it back.","Thankfully, even after the divine power expired, the spatial stones would remain valuable.","Not only could they be used to build teleportation arrays, but they could also serve as consumables to send equipment from the game into reality.","These four enormous spatial stones could be broken down into 4,000 units of spatial stone by the system.","Chu Fu’s Plant Spirit Advisor had only needed 300 spatial stones to advance to Dark Gold grade!","They had struck it rich.","The four spatial stones were put away.","Everyone began collecting the other loot.","It was obvious that the goblins went hunting frequently. The entire town was filled with animal hides, animal bones, and energy cores.","Energy cores could only be produced by mutated beasts above level 30.","They could be embedded into equipment, used to craft technological items, and maintain energy output. They were extremely high-grade materials.","Although the entire city reeked.","Under the players’ carpet search, nothing was spared.","The tents were dismantled, the pots, bowls, and pans were taken away—even a single bone needle was left behind.","The entire Goblin City was completely reduced to ruins. Even the earthen walls and bricks were smashed apart and carried away so they could be used to repair the city walls later.","Shen Chi also went to the west, south, and north districts and retrieved the Copy Crystals.","However, when he passed through the east district, Shen Chi inexplicably found a huge pile of gold coins and player equipment. He also saw several human body parts.","One of the heads left a particularly deep impression on him. It seemed to belong to the young celebrity Jiang Yixing.","A lackey of Longhan Entertainment.","Shen Chi pretended not to see anything, started up his mech, and sped away.","The players of the Star Alliance screamed in the guild channel.","“The guy in the wheelchair is here!”","“Ahhhhh! Why is he leaving? Didn’t he see us?”","“We’re scattered into pieces all over the place. Of course he didn’t see us!”","“Waaah, I still want to play this game! Don’t go! Don’t go!”","“I should’ve listened to my mom and stopped chasing celebrities!”","An hour later,","they received the devastating news over the phone.","Plantman had already returned to Fengdu Town.","The dungeon had ended. They were completely unable to return.","Even if they stayed online for twenty-four hours, no one would be able to rescue them.","With all its members dead, the Star Alliance no longer had even one-tenth of the players required for its current guild level. It was immediately disbanded, and its guild base became an undefended empty shell.","...","West District, Fengdu Town.","Led by Chu Fu, every player returned safely.","With their return, the defense of Fengdu Town finally concluded.","【System Announcement: The goblin army has retreated. 100% of Fengdu Town’s buildings have been preserved, and 100% of its NPCs survived. Town defense successful!】","【System Announcement: Perfect score achieved: 100% protection! All players receive a Guardian Badge. Players who already possess one will receive accumulated experience instead. All rewards are doubled.】","【System Announcement: All players in Fengdu Town gain +4 to all attributes. The original reward was +2.】","【System Announcement: Contributions to the public event are now being calculated!】","Chu Fu and the others had only fought during the first and second waves, earning just 42.38 million contribution points.","【System Notification: The contribution points you accumulated in the Origin Instance have been distributed as rewards. They will not be added to your town-defense contribution points.】","【System Notification: Player “Who Wants to Be Plantman?” ranked second in contribution points during this Goblin Invasion event, with 42.38 million contribution points.","Rewards obtained: 2 Talent Enhancement Stones, 5 Skill Enhancement Stones, and 2 Golden Chests.","Because Fengdu Town achieved perfect protection, your rewards have been doubled.","Rewards obtained: 4 Talent Enhancement Stones, 10 Skill Enhancement Stones, and 4 Golden Chests.】","First place naturally went to Laoji Fuli, with a total of 150 million contribution points.","The last time, in Huaishui Town, he had purchased the contribution points of the entire town, eventually raising his talent to SS rank and awakening a second talent.","His skills had also been enhanced, and the enormous number of skeletons he summoned had formed an undead catastrophe.","Even so, it had been surprisingly difficult for him to seize contribution points from the players in Fengdu Town.","Their equipment was simply too good.","Plantman had taken first place in Huaishui Town with a full 430 million contribution points.","Yet after coming to Fengdu Town—where he didn’t even have the Thorn Guild competing with him for kills—he had managed to earn only 150 million.","The gap between him and Classmate Chu was still enormous.","And now, it was probably even wider!","A single dungeon had actually brought Chu Fu and the others to level 30.","Most frightening of all were the other rewards.","【World Chat】“Did you sneak off and get rich without telling your brothers?”","【World Chat】“Blame me, huh? You told me to stay in the east district because there was a Plant Master there and I wouldn’t be able to get a single kill. Didn’t expect us to follow the plants and feast, did you?”","【World Chat】“The rewards weren’t that impressive. They only changed my Common class into a Rare class.”","【World Chat】“I jumped straight to an S-rank talent! If I’d stayed here, I would’ve needed at least 30 million contribution points. How could I compete with you beasts?”","【World Chat】“I heard the Plant Master and the Mechanical Boss awakened second classes!”","【World Chat】“The most incredible one is the Sword Saint Boss, all right? From now on, we have to call him the Sword God! The only god-tier class in Linjiang City was probably Lu Xing, and now there’s a second one!”","Laoji Fuli watched with envy.","He suddenly found himself wondering:","He was already ninety-two, so why was he still exhausting himself with all this hard work? He had been retired for more than thirty years. Why couldn’t he join the Thorn Guild and tag along with Classmate Chu?","Most importantly, he wanted to properly enjoy playing the game too!","With that thought, Laoji Fuli finally set aside his dignity and sent Chu Fu a private message.","Laoji Fuli: “Classmate Chu, make sure you take me along for the next defense battle at Guguan Town. I’ll pay to join the party!”","Chu Fu quickly replied.","“Elder Ji, there’s no need to be so polite. We’re just running a dungeon together. Anyone can participate. The main issue is whether we can enter Guguan Town.”","Chu Fu didn’t continue the conversation for long, because she had just received an even more explosive piece of news.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao’s voice was nearly hoarse from shouting.","“Ahhhhhhh! Plant Girl, I just received a message! The Origin-level dungeon we cleared foiled the Goblin God’s plan, and the【Primeval Gate】stole part of the Goblin God’s divine power and can convert it into a regular dungeon!","Ownership of this dungeon belongs to our Thorn Guild!!!”"]},{"number":180,"title":"Chapter 180: Jiao Jiao Abdicates the Presidency, Chu Fu Takes Control of Thorns, Making Thorns Great Again","paragraphs":["“What?”","This was yet another piece of news Chu Fu had never heard before. In the original plot, there had never been any guild capable of controlling dungeons and charging admission. At most, guilds controlled resource sites such as mines and farmland.","“I’m telling the truth. This is a huge matter. Plant Girl, I’ll give you the guild leader position, and you can decide for yourself!”","Jiao Jiao Wasn’t Spoiled manipulated her interface and transferred the guild leader position directly to Chu Fu.","A system notification sounded on Chu Fu’s end.","[System Notification: You have become the leader of the Thorn Guild!]","Chu Fu froze and hurriedly looked at Jiao Jiao Wasn’t Spoiled.","“Sister Jiaojiao, you didn’t have to go that far. You could have just copied the system notification and sent it to me!” Chu Fu had a vague suspicion.","Sure enough, Jiao Jiao Wasn’t Spoiled gave a silly grin.","“Actually, I’d already been thinking about this for a long time. When we founded the Thorn Guild, I provided the most financial support. But times have changed.","“My financial backing isn’t as strong as it used to be, and every decision and major event in the guild basically depends on you now.","“You were originally the largest shareholder anyway.","“I think it’s better for you to hold the guild leader position than me. Besides, you trust me enough to give me the position of finance minister in Thorn Town.","“I think I’m better suited to that position. I’ll continue managing those affairs, but the guild leader should be someone with greater prestige—namely, you.","“There are a lot of people in Riverside City who know Plant Girl, but not many who know me, Jiao Jiao Wasn’t Spoiled.","“Moreover, if I keep the guild leader position, people might think we’re a guild controlled by capital. Some independent players are proud and aloof; they don’t really like that kind of guild structure and might refuse to join us.","“All of that could become a problem.","“So I’m taking this opportunity to hand the position over to you!”","In truth, Jiao Jiao Wasn’t Spoiled could have clung to the guild leader position. After all, she was one of its founding members and had a contract to prove it.","However, as the Thorn Guild grew larger, while Chu Fu established Thorn Town and acquired Wantu Real Estate, their positions had undergone a complete reversal.","Rather than risk internal conflict in the future, Jiao Jiao Wasn’t Spoiled would be better off stepping aside while retaining her shares.","She also trusted that Chu Fu wasn’t the kind of person who would betray a friend.","Giving up the position of Thorn Guild leader wouldn’t cost Jiao Jiao Wasn’t Spoiled anything. Instead, it would bring her even greater benefits.","Chu Fu remembered Jiao Jiao Wasn’t Spoiled’s appearance in the original plot.","Although the plot had changed considerably, Jiao Jiao Wasn’t Spoiled herself had not.","She was loyal and generous with her money. She didn’t care about wealth or fame, but she valued her friends. She had nipped a possible future conflict in the bud.","Since Jiao Jiao treated her as a friend, Chu Fu naturally wouldn’t let her down.","“Don’t worry, Jiao Jiao. As long as I have food to eat, you’ll have food to eat too. I won’t betray your trust. I won’t argue with you over this position—the guild leader is mine now!”","Chu Fu then used her authority to adjust Jiao Jiao Wasn’t Spoiled’s position.","After stepping down as guild leader, Jiao Jiao Wasn’t Spoiled became an ordinary guild member.","Chu Fu promoted her from ordinary member to elite member, then to guild officer at captain level, guild elder, and finally vice leader.","The two of them exchanged positions.","Once everything was settled, Chu Fu finally turned her attention to the system notification.","[System Notice: The player thwarted the Goblin God’s conspiracy in God’s Servant (Origin), and the Primordial Gate has acquired the Goblin God’s Authority.","The divine power acquired can be converted into a dungeon: [Counter-Invasion: Goblin City].","The dungeon’s difficulty levels are: [Nightmare] [Hell] [Abyss].","Recommended level: 10–20.","Entry conditions: Open for a limited time from 1:00 to 6:00. Players enter through matchmaking. Minimum 1,000 players; maximum 20,000 players.","Loot: Large quantities of Gold-tier equipment, small quantities of Dark Gold-tier equipment, and large quantities of materials.","The Thorn Guild made a major contribution during this great event and ranked first. Ownership of the dungeon belongs to the Thorn Guild.","Thorn Guild leader, please make a decision and choose the dungeon’s location.]","Chu Fu saw a map appear.","Naturally, any location within fifty kilometers of Fengdu Town could be selected.","Then she noticed Thorn Town as well.","After all, Thorn Town had originally been Wangxi Village, and it was only about forty kilometers from Fengdu Town.","What was there to hesitate about?","Chu Fu immediately placed the dungeon to the west of Thorn Town, not far from the guild’s western exit.","Although there were no level 11–20 monsters outside Thorn Town, the town now had a dungeon.","Thorn Town could rival Fengdu Town, retaining players and allowing them to progress from level 1 all the way to level 20. This would enable it to support a much larger population.","It was easy to imagine how prosperous the appearance of this dungeon would make Thorn Town.","“This location is great. At first, I wanted to place it beside our guild headquarters in Fengdu Town so it would be convenient for our own players. But that didn’t feel quite right. Besides, all the guild members who participated in the town defense battle in Fengdu Town are around level 25 now. There’s no point in having them run this dungeon.”","Jiao Jiao Wasn’t Spoiled’s eyes lit up.","But leaving it in Thorn Town was another matter entirely.","She could already imagine a crowd of level-20 players waving their money around as they came to run the dungeon.","“Everyone conquered this dungeon together, so five percent of the profits will go directly to the guild. I suggest setting the dungeon entry fee at five hundred silver coins. It’s not cheap, but players should be able to earn that back as long as they complete the dungeon. We also need to train teams of lower-level players and have them run the dungeon to obtain resources.”","It was time to recruit another wave of newcomers.","The veterans would all be heading to Riverside City.","“Don’t worry, Boss. Leave it to me!” Feng Huimin said.","“Can we make money while lying down again? What a comfortable life!” Xie Lin exclaimed.","Shen Chi glanced at him, then coughed before sending Chu Fu a private message.","“I have something to tell you too.”","Chu Fu looked at the private message, then glanced at Shen Chi.","“What is it, Wheelchair Brother?”","Chu Fu and Shen Chi instinctively moved a little closer. They activated voice chat through a private channel, ensuring that no one else could hear them.","Shen Chi told her about encountering the Star Alliance in the dungeon.","“They probably wiped. I pretended not to see them because I didn’t want to revive them. I also picked up the equipment and gold they dropped.","“That bunch is pretty rich. They actually managed to gather thirty thousand gold coins.","“The source of the money can’t be explained, so I didn’t put it into the guild or team treasury. The three of us can split it evenly—ten thousand each. Consider it a revenge fund. The Star Alliance members might cause trouble later. Just say we had no idea they entered, and I’ll say I didn’t see them.”","In truth, Shen Chi could have kept quiet. No one knew that he had taken the Star Alliance’s money.","But he still told Chu Fu and Xie Lin.","That was because Shen Chi believed the three of them were the true inner circle—their own people.","He didn’t trust anyone else, including Feng Huimin.","After all, Feng Huimin had once been one of Wan Huanyu’s lackeys!","Chu Fu hadn’t expected something like this to happen either.","“Wheelchair Brother, what Star Alliance? We have no idea what you’re talking about. This was simply a gift from nature. And you don’t need to give me a share—keep it for yourself and use it to repair your mecha!”","Xie Lin hovered nearby for a moment. When he saw the two of them still whispering, he couldn’t resist coming over and wedging himself between them. “What’s with all the meaningful glances? I’ve got a feeling you two are hiding something from me!”"]},{"number":181,"title":"Chapter 181: Wanting to Share with Chu Fu, Shen Chi Releases a Clarification Video","paragraphs":["Shen Chi raised a hand to support his forehead. In the end, he could only explain things to Xie Lin through private messages.","“I don’t want it. I’m the dignified Sword God—do I really need such an external aid?”","He was poor, and he wore that poverty proudly.","Shen Chi could only explain it to Chu Fu again. This time, he didn’t say it aloud and sent the words directly, otherwise Xie Lin would start making a fuss again.","“If you don’t take the money, and Xie Lin doesn’t take it either, then Xie Lin won’t have any extra income to earn. His growth rate will be limited. His class is clearly one that becomes powerful later, and it’s already beginning to take shape, but he’s short on money!”","Every time a major event took place, Xie Lin would spend money buying contribution points, so naturally, every bit of money he earned was spent.","Shen Chi, on the other hand, spent a lot, but he also earned a lot. He was practically an entire manufacturing industry by himself. Whether it was producing and selling flight wings or transporting players as a mecha pilot, every business brought him a fortune.","Xie Lin, by contrast, was simply too poor. Sure enough, sword cultivators were all poor.","Ten thousand gold coins—changed from the thirty thousand mentioned earlier—wasn’t a huge sum, but it was enough for Xie Lin to buy more than a thousand golden swords. That would definitely be a major boost.","Of course, Shen Chi wasn’t only thinking about Xie Lin. He mainly wanted to share the spoils with Chu Fu, but since she refused, he decided to include Xie Lin as well.","Chu Fu was finally persuaded.","“Fine, then! This is the revenge fund. We’ll split it! Thanks, Wheelchair Brother!” Chu Fu said sweetly.","If someone was giving you money, shouldn’t you sweet-talk them a little? Chu Fu understood the ways of the world perfectly. Just because she didn’t lack this money didn’t mean she could take it for granted.","“You should take it too! Plant Girl already accepted hers. If you refuse, won’t Plant Girl be losing out on ten thousand gold?”","Shen Chi resorted to provoking him.","Only then did Xie Lin accept the money. He threw an arm around Shen Chi’s neck and said, “Then your brother won’t stand on ceremony. Once my swordsmanship reaches the pinnacle, I’ll storm the enemy’s stronghold. I’ll give you one-third of the treasures, and of course, another third will go to Plant Girl!”","Xie Lin winked.","Chu Fu smiled. “I regret killing the enemy so early. I should’ve kept them alive, like... like shearing sheep. Let them grow a little, then shear them, and raise them again before shearing them again!”","Chu Fu nearly let slip that she should have done it like her brother did—raise Wan Huanyu up, kill him, raise him again, and kill him again. In the original plot, the story had been dragged out for three million words, and Wan Huanyu still hadn’t died.","But now, Wan Huanyu had already received his ticket out.","His name had been placed on the wanted list, and his entire family had been uprooted. It was impossible to say whether he would still cause trouble, but that was something they would only know if they crossed paths again in the future.","The most miserable one was actually Wang Rongxun. He had never even fought Chu Fu face-to-face. Chu Fu had merely used a few minor economic tactics to drive him into bankruptcy.","He was still alive, but his money was gone. He was saddled with a debt of 140 billion.","Before the game’s nighttime period—from 2:00 to 6:00 p.m., when it was daytime for the players—arrived, some players had already gone beneath the Shunmuyuan Building to unfurl banners demanding money.","The scene was incredibly lively.","Chu Fu could only sigh at the power of numbers. The three of them—her, Shen Chi, and Xie Lin—were like three mediocre strategists who together could rival her brother, Zhuge Liang.","At present, the only organization that couldn’t be targeted was the Longhan Group. They had no public leader. As for the Sun family, they had gone underground three years ago to prevent the scandal from affecting the company’s stock price.","Sun Jingya had been sentenced to life imprisonment and had yet to enter the game.","But it wouldn’t be long. A few months later, once game monsters invaded the real world and chaos broke out everywhere, Sun Jingya would naturally be released.","When that happened, Chu Fu would kill her with her own hands and make her pay the price she should have paid three years ago!","Letting her live three extra years—even allowing her to continue believing that she could have her sentence reduced and be released after more than ten years—was the greatest insult to the dead parents of Chu Feng and Chu Fu.","Blood debts should be repaid in blood.","The more Chu Fu thought about it, the angrier she became. Just then, someone suddenly pressed down on her shoulder.","“What are you three researching? Have you got some little secret going on?” Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao wrapped a sturdy arm around Chu Fu.","“Haha, our Avengers are up to something bad. We can’t let anyone hear!” Chu Fu joked, smoothly changing the subject.","Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao was still puzzled about what bad thing Chu Fu and the others had done.","She found out soon enough.","The people from the Starstar Alliance had started making a scene.","They began condemning the Thorn Guild across the entire internet.","“My brother entered the dungeon with Plantman and the others. If Plantman and the others had known the dungeon was so dangerous, they should have issued a warning. Then my brother wouldn’t have gone in. They’re responsible!”","“That’s right! Rocket on a Wheelchair clearly came to the area, but he only focused on collecting crystals and completely ignored us. If he’d spared us even one glance and sent someone to rescue us, things wouldn’t have turned out this way!”","“The Thorn Guild has to take responsibility! Hurry up and go back to rescue our brothers!”","What the Starstar Alliance hadn’t expected was that the Thorn Guild was now at the height of its power. It had ten thousand guild members, along with another ten thousand independent players who had followed along and benefited. They had genuinely gained advantages from the dungeon.","At that moment, driven by a sense of justice and gratitude, they picked up their keyboards and fought back.","“Your brother overestimated himself. Why blame other people?”","“Were you entitled to our help? Why should we have rescued you just because you died? We were busy clearing the dungeon!”","“The dungeon is already over. Rescue what? Do you have no common sense when playing games? No wonder your Starstar Alliance never manages to develop.”","“The guild leader is an idiot, and so are all of you.”","“Sisters, I’m honestly worried about you. Do you even know what the price of gold coins has become? You’re still bleeding yourselves dry to support him? Why not earn money to improve your own families, or stockpile more supplies? What time do you think this is?”","“Ah! The Mechanical Boss has posted a clarification video.”","...","On the forum, Shen Chi uploaded a video.","“I didn’t see anything. I didn’t know. Where were you?”","The video then showed a first-person view from inside his flying mecha.","The mecha was simply too fast. It shot past in an instant, leaving only blurred scenery all around.","Even netizens armed with magnifying glasses couldn’t see anything.","After Shen Chi landed and dismantled the crystal generator, the players finally spotted something more than a hundred meters away that looked like a skull.","“The flesh had already been gnawed clean. You’re saying that was your body? I thought it was goblin kitchen scraps!”","“There were pieces of the body scattered everywhere.”","“Anyone who didn’t know better would think it was just part of the game’s background scenery.”","“Stop trying to extort people. To put it bluntly, you made the wrong decision and are now looking for a scapegoat, abusing an innocent bystander.”","“Am I the only one focused on the fact that this is the mecha’s point of view? My god, that speed, those controls—the Mechanical Boss is unbelievably cool! Mechanics are so awesome!”","“This is a 3D video. Zoom in and the Mechanical Boss looks so handsome. His whole bearing is amazing—gentle as jade, with such clear and refined features. He looks like he must have a wonderful personality. I’m in love! I’m a Mechanical Boss fan from now on!”","“??? Wasn’t the person above a Jiang Yixing fan? What kind of filthy creature is this? I hereby sternly reject you on behalf of the Mechanical Boss.”","In the end, the crisis turned into a farce.","After Shen Chi uploaded the video, he stopped paying attention. Naturally, he hadn’t included the part where he used a suction machine to vacuum up the other players’ equipment. By now, the Starstar Alliance players were dead and unable to provide evidence.","Besides, he didn’t have time to bicker with them.","He was busy repairing his mecha!"]},{"number":182,"title":"Chapter 182: Being Chased to Contribute, I Became a Plant Summoner","paragraphs":["Having just finished one town-defense battle and a super dungeon, both Shen Chi and Chu Fu were extremely busy.","This was the first time she had run into a shortage of Contribution Points.","What she absolutely had to redeem were two Talent Enhancement Stones and ten Skill Enhancement Stones—four attributes in total, costing exactly forty million Contribution Points.","She also needed to redeem the Town Upgrade Blueprint. Once used, it would increase the town’s side length by 100 meters.","It looked like a loss, but in reality, upgrading a 2,000×2,000-meter town to a 2,100×2,100-meter town would add another 410,000 square meters of land.","Buy it!","There was no need to redeem the Second Talent Awakening, since she already had one.","The Growth-Type Divine Artifact Embryo was necessary too.","That left her two hundred million Contribution Points short.","However, because Chu Fu had entered the Origin Dungeon, the monsters in the tenth wave had not appeared. As a result, the entire Novice Village was missing ten billion Contribution Points this time.","After accounting for everyone’s spending, they might not even have enough to redeem everything.","What Chu Fu hadn’t expected was that the moment she sent out a message through the public announcement channel, she was immediately surrounded by countless players.","“Plant Boss, I’ve got a little over a thousand Contribution Points left. I’ll give them all to you—no charge.”","“Plant Boss, thank you for taking us into the dungeon. Take all my Contribution Points.”","“I’m giving them to you directly. Don’t pay me, or I’ll get mad!”","“No need for a private trade. I’ve put them on the ground directly. Don’t forget to pick them up.”","“They’re yours, Boss.”","Chu Fu tried to pay them, but none of them would accept her money.","She could only turn into a broken record.","“Thank you, thank you! Thank you so much!”","“What are you thanking us for, Boss? To put it plainly, the only reason you didn’t get any Contribution Points this time was because you took us into the dungeon.”","“Exactly. If not for this dungeon run, improving my talent would have cost ten million Contribution Points. There’s no way I could have afforded that.”","“Ah, Boss, why didn’t you say so earlier? I already spent mine. I feel like I owe you a hundred million now.”","Chu Fu was both amused and embarrassed.","Lively Not Delicate shouted, “What’s going on? Why didn’t any of you give me anything when I was collecting them? You wouldn’t even let me round down a single point!”","“Everyone knows you’re loaded. Our Plant Girl used to be bedridden!”","“Lively, you heartless capitalist! We have to make you pay through the nose!”","Lively Not Delicate felt as if she had been wrongfully accused like a victim of an ancient injustice. Plant Girl was now so wealthy that even she could only look up to her; she was simply too low-key.","But Lively Not Delicate naturally couldn’t say that and ruin Chu Fu’s image. In fact, she hoped Chu Fu would accept this gift, because it was what she deserved.","Helpless, Chu Fu didn’t want to owe so many people favors. She simply said that she wouldn’t accept any more donations, then transferred some gold coins to Lively Not Delicate and asked her to help purchase the Contribution Points.","Even so, some people still chased after Chu Fu to give her their Contribution Points.","Those who had three thousand or five thousand points left and nowhere to spend them all sent them over to Chu Fu.","In the end, she somehow gathered one hundred million without spending a single copper.","At least ten thousand players seemed to have come over to give her their points.","“Thank you, everyone, but you really don’t have to do this. If you have spare Contribution Points, sell them to Lively Not Delicate instead!”","After saying that, Chu Fu chose to return to Thorn Town.","In the end, Lively Not Delicate also purchased one hundred million Contribution Points, spending ten thousand gold coins, and then transferred them to Chu Fu.","Chu Fu bought the Growth-Type Divine Artifact Embryo.","This time, she hesitated.","At present, earrings and forehead ornaments were extremely scarce in the game.","However, the poison bottle had played a major role this time, making Chu Fu realize just how rare and unique this piece of equipment was.","Most importantly, within the game, the poison bottle could currently only collect effects such as the plagues and toxins released by Chu Fu.","But once it was withdrawn into reality...","Chu Fu didn’t even dare imagine how powerful this thing would be.","It was obviously an item that was mediocre in the game but terrifyingly useful in the real world.","Chu Fu no longer hesitated and upgraded the poison bottle.","[Poison Bottle (Gold Grade—Growth-Type):","Additional Trait: Growth-Type. Requirements for the next growth stage: Collect 10 types of Gold-grade toxins, 10 types of anti-toxin or detoxifying substances, and 50 Space Stones.]","The requirements weren’t too high.","After that, Chu Fu used the Talent Enhancement Stones on her S-rank talent, Poisonous Being.","Yet after using all six Talent Enhancement Stones, Poisonous Being still hadn’t advanced to SS-rank.","“The experience requirement for a second class is double. Could it be that enhancing a second talent also requires twice as many stones?”","Chu Fu helplessly pursed her lips, but there was nothing she could do.","The stones had already been used. If the talent didn’t advance now, it would eventually improve later anyway. Once she adjusted her mindset, Chu Fu stopped paying attention to it.","Next came the Skill Enhancement Stones. Including her rewards and purchases, she had twenty of them.","Her new class had given her three additional abilities, and she could learn a new one upon reaching Level 30.","But then again, her new class, Spirit of the Forest and Sea, was only Level 1!","[Class: Spirit of the Forest and Sea (Hidden Class)]","[Class Trait: Increases the attack power of all wood-element skills by 20%.]","[Basic Skill 1: Nature Spirit Contract: Form a contract with a plant, granting it sentience and allowing it to share 30% of your attributes. One plant can be contracted for every 10 points of Spirit.]","[Basic Skill 2: Verdant Rejuvenation: Wield wood-element healing magic. It can heal contracted classes, as well as yourself or any friendly target. Adds 20% of your own Spell Attack to the healing amount.]","Chu Fu’s eyes instantly lit up.","The Spirit of the Forest and Sea seemed to be a class similar to a plant summoner, and it complemented her Plant Girl abilities perfectly. The effects could even stack together.","She hadn’t expected her Second Talent to correspond with her First Class, while her First Talent corresponded with her Second Class.","Without giving it much thought, Chu Fu used Enhancement Stones to raise the Spirit of the Forest and Sea’s first basic skill to Level 10.","[Nature Spirit Contract: Form a contract with a plant, granting it sentience and allowing it to share 80% of your attributes. One plant can be contracted for every 5 points of Spirit.]","The amount of her attributes shared had increased by 50%, while the contract requirement had been reduced by half.","Chu Fu glanced at her own Spirit attribute.","The Origin Dungeon had given her +100, the town-defense battle +4, purchasing from the Town Defense Contribution Shop +10, and leveling up had given her +16 free attribute points.","Spirit: 647 (+857) = 1,504.","She could contract 300 plants.","That was nowhere near the thousand-strong army of skeletons commanded by Laoji Fuli, but Chu Fu’s contracted plants would possess 80% of her attributes. They definitely wouldn’t be cannon fodder—they would be an elite force.","She could hardly wait to raise the Spirit of the Forest and Sea’s level.","Just as Chu Fu was planning how to improve herself later, Laoji Fuli sent her a private message.","“Classmate Chu, are you planning to run a dungeon first later, or are you going straight to change classes and withdraw your in-game abilities into reality?","“If you’re running a dungeon, you have to bring me!","“If you’re withdrawing your abilities, Linjiang City recently issued a new regulation.","“Any player who withdraws their abilities into reality has to sign a declaration and watch a video about the confidentiality agreement.","“It will all take place at Origin University. Don’t forget to go.”"]},{"number":183,"title":"Chapter 183: Job Change Quest, Time to Ride My Brother's Coattails Again","paragraphs":["After reaching Level 30, players could not immediately bring their strength into the real world. They first had to go to the Job Advancement Hall and complete a class advancement.","From an NPC’s perspective, a player’s level represented the strength of their awakening.","Levels 0–10 were Beginner Awakeners.","Levels 10–20 were Intermediate Awakeners.","Levels 20–30 were Advanced Awakeners.","Levels 30–40 were Master Awakeners, and becoming a Master Awakener required passing an assessment to prove one’s strength.","The difficulty of the assessment had nothing to do with talent or class. There was no such thing as a god-tier class being assigned an absurdly difficult task.","As the NPCs put it, “The Master Awakener assessment is meant to determine whether an awakener possesses Master-level combat power and whether they are willing to contribute to humanity.”","That was why the assessment was usually a monster-hunting mission—and the required number of kills was quite high.","Chu Fu naturally had to complete the mission first.","She replied to Laoji Fuli, “We’re going to advance our classes. I estimate it’ll take us a day.”","“You’re welcome to visit the academy anytime. I’ll personally receive you when you come.”","“You’re too kind, Elder Ji.”","After chatting with him for a few moments, Chu Fu looked toward the team to see whether everyone wanted to advance their classes together.","Then, at the thought of completing the mission, a sudden realization struck her.","Didn’t that mean Shen Chi would be able to stand again?","And Xie Lin would be able to see again?","What were they waiting for?","Chu Fu saw that the team had not yet disbanded. All fourteen members were still present.","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: “What’s everyone up to?”","[Commander Feng Huimin]: “Boss, I’m dealing with the Star Alliance’s issues online. The guild is also recruiting new players. After the Origin Dungeon, the number of players with A-rank talents increased, so there are quite a few people we can take in. I’m reviewing their applications.”","[The Proud but Not Spoiled]: “My throat is hoarse from shouting, and I’m still collecting contribution points!”","[Suture Saint]: “I’m reviving Little Silly Pig. Seriously, how could he die when the tenth wave of monsters hasn’t even appeared yet?”","[Little Sister Wu]: “+1.”","[Holy Healing Angel]: “Waaah, is it because I’m from another town and not famous? Why is no one asking me for a resurrection?”","[Rocket on a Wheelchair]: “The materials we brought back this time are pretty good—all high-grade materials. I also dismantled the extra dark-gold equipment and did some more research on that Replication Crystal and the Spatial Stone. I think if we combine them properly, we can make a diamond-grade mecha. It’ll be completely overpowered.”","[Zhimengzhe]: “I—I’m making equipment too. Give me another two hours and I’ll have it modified!”","[Who Are You Calling Blind]: “Practicing swordsmanship!”","[Shafu Liangu]: “Eating goblin corpses!”","[Shafu Liangu]: “I mean my parasites.”","[Wu Yingchun]: “I learned the cooking secondary profession and I’m making food.”","[Bitter Melon King]: “Looking over my equipment. I want to change into a new set.”","[Dream King]: “You’re all still in Fengdu Town? I left ages ago. I’m in the city learning new skills!”","[Lu An]: “+1.”","Chu Fu took a look. Everyone seemed to be busy!","Even so, she still said:","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: “Why hasn’t anyone mentioned the class advancement mission? Once we advance our classes, we’ll be able to bring our strength into the real world. @Rocket on a Wheelchair @Who Are You Calling Blind! Let’s go. Use your Return Scroll.”","Their return location was bound to Linjiang City, so a single Return Scroll would take them back.","[Who Are You Calling Blind]: “Sword practice suspended. Returning to the city immediately!”","[Rocket on a Wheelchair]: “Manufacturing suspended. Returning to the city immediately!”","[Zhimengzhe]: “Sewing suspended. Returning to the city right away!”","After spending more time with everyone, Zhimengzhe had also become much more outgoing.","[Suture Saint]: “Give me another ten minutes. I’ll come after I finish this resurrection.”","[The Proud but Not Spoiled]: “I’m still ten million short. What if I can’t collect enough? Give me ten minutes too.”","[Who Are You Calling a Vegetable]: “OK!”","Ten minutes later, Chu Fu crushed a Return Scroll and arrived at the teleportation array in Linjiang City.","White light flashed around her as the others arrived one after another.","Together, they headed for Linjiang City’s Job Advancement Hall.","The hall was extremely lively.","Fortunately, there was not just one NPC responsible for class advancement. A whole row of beautiful NPCs were handling applications, and they were all very polite and welcoming.","Master Awakeners were no longer minor figures in the Origin Gate.","“Esteemed awakeners, are you all part of the same team? The Master Awakener advancement mission can also be completed as a team. I can try to issue you all a batch of missions, though the number and difficulty will be greater. Would you like that?”","Chu Fu hurriedly nodded. “Of course!”","How considerate. In the story, from Chu Feng’s perspective, none of this had happened.","The beautiful NPC quickly continued, “After reaching the Master Awakener rank, you’ll face even greater challenges.","“Within the Origin Human organizations, the gods of space and time foresaw the future and created a mirrored dimension, tricking the monsters invading Earth into entering it.","“However, maintaining the stability of that dimension requires reducing the number of monsters that have invaded Earth.","“You must now travel to the future region of Linjiang City—the Level 30–40 map—and kill 500 Titans.","“Alternatively, you may kill five million undead!","“Or, if you believe your strength is sufficient, you can venture into the Level 40–50 mirrored future map and hunt ten bosses.”","They could choose from three missions.","Everyone could see the available choices, and they had to select the same mission before they could accept it.","“Wow, should we go to the higher-level map?” The Proud but Not Spoiled suggested. “We’re pretty fast at killing bosses. We can go to the Level 40–50 map and hunt bosses. Level 50 bosses might be a little difficult, but we can definitely crush Level 40 bosses. We only need to kill ten!”","Chu Fu shook her head. “You haven’t been to the future map, so you don’t know what it’s like. I heard from my brother that the cities on the Level 40 map have already fallen and been reduced to various shelters. Survival there is incredibly difficult.","“Even so, shelters are frequently attacked by bosses. When that happens, the shelter issues a rescue notice and broadcasts its coordinates to everyone.","“The only way for people to reach the shelters is through teleportation.","“Teleporting between cities costs 100 gold coins. There are fourteen people in our team, so that’s 1,400 gold coins. It would be the biggest waste of money imaginable!”","Besides, once they got there, monsters would not be their only problem.","Unexpectedly, Shen Chi’s gentle voice suddenly rang out, filled with confidence in his profession.","“Technology changes lives. I’ve researched the Spatial Stone. If we integrate it into the mecha, it can lock onto coordinates and perform spatial jumps! Distance will no longer be an issue.”","“Are you for real, or are you just making this up?” Xie Lin asked.","“Eighty percent for real!”","Chu Fu fell into thought.","If Shen Chi’s mecha could really do that, then they could indeed go to the Level 40 map.","Chu Fu knew that Chu Feng was currently active on the Level 40 map.","Wouldn’t that mean she could mooch off her brother again?"]},{"number":184,"title":"Chapter 184: The Dreamweaver's Gift, Diamond-Class Bridal Set","paragraphs":["If Chu Fu chose either of the first two options, it would take at least ten days to defeat five million monsters. The five hundred Titans would be easier, but naturally, they would not offer rewards as great as those from a high-level boss.","Either way, they needed something to look forward to.","“Then let’s not change classes yet. We’ll wait two hours until you finish the mecha before deciding!”","“Sure! I’ll go back and continue repairing the mecha!” Shen Chi said.","“I’m going back to practice my swordsmanship!” Xie Lin said without looking back.","“Everyone, do you want to rest, or would you like to run a dungeon and make some money? I still have a few rich clients who are willing to pay for dungeon runs!” Feng Huimin pushed up her glasses.","The cash-strapped group immediately nodded enthusiastically.","“Let’s run it! Let’s run it!”","Zhimengzhe refused. “My equipment is almost finished too. I’m going back to the guild workshop to craft it.”","Chu Fu also spoke up. “I just remembered that I haven’t planted anything yet. I’ll plant crops all around Fengdu Town!”","Because Fengdu Town had been attacked by a goblin army, Chu Fu had harvested her spirit rice ahead of schedule.","Her spirit rice shop was now making a fortune every day.","She could use this time to familiarize herself with the Spirit of the Forest’s skills and form contracts with the plants.","......","Two hours later.","Shen Chi had finally finished building the mecha, and the group appeared once more inside the Class Advancement Temple.","When Zhimengzhe saw Chu Fu, her eyes lit up with anticipation.","“Plant Girl, I have something for you. I modified this equipment myself!”","She initiated a trade with Chu Fu, then placed one sparkling diamond-grade piece of equipment after another into the trade window.","“For this Origin Instance, everyone else switched to dark-gold equipment, but you didn’t get anything at all.","“Everyone agreed that this set of equipment should belong to you.","“So I dismantled that piece of equipment and turned it all into diamond-grade material thread. I cleaned it, then had a Holy Healing Angel dispel it and a water-element mage purify it.","“Besides that, the sheets from inside the goblin tent were made from the same divine material.","“I combined everything to create this set of materials. I even dismantled the goblin’s oversized necklace! We also collected a lot of energy crystals from its residence, so I only made a forehead pendant, earrings, bracelets, and a ring.","“I hope you won’t mind the materials. Their attributes are really good!”","Chu Fu stared at the equipment that had been traded to her, her eyes wide.","“Zhimengzhe, you’re amazing! You can already make diamond-grade equipment! How could I possibly mind? Oh my gosh! It’s so beautiful!”","Chu Fu had never expected Zhimengzhe to be so capable.","Whenever she talked about her craft, Zhimengzhe spoke with confidence and authority. She seemed a little insecure, worried that Chu Fu might dislike the materials, but she was clearly very confident in her skills.","Of course, Chu Fu wasn’t going to complain. This was diamond-grade equipment, after all.","Gamers didn’t care how many owners a piece of equipment had. Who would care if it had already passed through eighteen hands? The Goblin Divine Emissary had practically been giving them equipment for free.","Chu Fu had been somewhat disappointed that the dropped equipment couldn’t be used, but she never expected Zhimengzhe to save the day.","She would be wearing diamond-grade equipment at Level 30. She didn’t even dare imagine whether she would be wearing a full set of epic equipment by Level 40!","“Thank you, Zhimengzhe!”","“N-No need to thank me. We all obtained the materials together, and you contributed the most. You deserve them!”","“Without you, I wouldn’t be able to wear this set, so I still have to thank you!”","“Then I have to thank you too. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have been able to awaken my second talent!”","“Oh, come on, you two, stop thanking each other! Standing here, I keep thinking you’re calling me! Hurry up and put it on, Plant Girl!” Xie Lin teased.","Chu Fu confirmed the trade, and the entire set of equipment landed in her inventory.","[Sacred Bridal Diamond Crown (Diamond Grade)","Sacred Bridal Starfall Diamond Wedding Dress (Diamond Grade)","Sacred Bridal Diamond-Studded Wedding Gloves (Diamond Grade)","Sacred Bridal Diamond-Studded Lace Bracers (Diamond Grade)","Sacred Bridal Diamond-Studded Lace Waist Cincher (Diamond Grade)","Sacred Bridal Diamond-Studded Openwork Lace Stockings (Diamond Grade)","Sacred Bridal Diamond Crystal Shoes (Diamond Grade)","Sacred Bridal Diamond-Studded Tassel Shawl (Diamond Grade)","Sacred Bridal Eight-Piece Set 8/8","Sacred Bridal Teardrop Forehead Pendant (Diamond Grade)","Sacred Bridal Teardrop Earrings (Diamond Grade)","Sacred Bridal Egg-Sized Diamond Necklace (Diamond Grade)","Sacred Bridal Diamond Bracelet—Left (Diamond Grade)","Sacred Bridal Diamond Bracelet—Right (Diamond Grade)","Sacred Bridal Starlight Proposal Diamond Ring (Diamond Grade)]","She immediately changed into the full set.","In an instant, Chu Fu went from a suit of black venom-dragon leather armor to a white diamond wedding-dress set.","A diamond crown and veil rested atop her head. A teardrop-shaped forehead pendant adorned her brow, while matching teardrop earrings hung from her ears.","Around her neck was an enormous, dazzling diamond necklace.","The centerpiece was as large as a goose egg, radiating mesmerizing flashes of light. The chain consisted of two densely arranged rows of diamonds, with a full six hundred accent stones.","Next came the wedding dress, covered in diamonds.","Since it was designed for combat, the dress did not have a wide skirt. It fell just past her knees, with a pair of integrated shorts underneath to prevent any embarrassing mishaps. Five layers of ruffles followed, giving the skirt a billowing shape. The edges glittered like a starry sky, an effect created by the unique properties of the divine fabric.","The outermost layer was covered in light gauze that fell all the way to her ankles, revealing the smooth, slender curves of her calves.","The two-tiered design was breathtaking.","The matching crystal shoes, gloves, bracelets, and oversized ring were all exquisitely crafted and luxurious.","The shawl served as a cloak. Its only flaw was that it could not be used for flight, but its attributes were excellent.","A single diamond-grade piece of equipment could provide as many as 160 attribute points. With fourteen pieces in total, the set increased Chu Fu’s attributes by more than 2,200 points.","It completely surpassed the Venom Dragon set.","What was more, all the equipment came with direct increases to magic attack power.","This meant that both of Chu Fu’s classes—the Seed of Calamity and the Spirit of the Forest—would benefit from the bonuses.","Moreover, once Chu Fu obtained a new set, this equipment could be placed in the guild for someone else who suited it to use.","As the saying went, gamers didn’t care how many times equipment had been worn. They only cared whether its attributes were practical.","Just look at the rest of the team. Everyone except Chu Fu was wearing the Goblin Savage set.","“Wow! It’s so beautiful!”","“Plant Girl is gorgeous!”","The group’s eyes sparkled with amazement.","Even Chu Fu was embarrassed by all the praise, so she quickly said, “Come on, let’s go accept the quest!”","This time, they truly decided to accept the quest.","They headed for the future mirror map of Linjiang City, the Level 40–50 area.","[System Notification: You have accepted the Master-rank Class Advancement Quest. Travel to Linjiang City—the Future Mirror Map, Level 40–50 Area—and hunt ten Shelter-Attacking Bosses.","Please note: A large number of game storms have emerged in this area. Purchase the necessary supplies before proceeding.]"]},{"number":185,"title":"Chapter 185: Future Map, Snow White and Her 13 Little Savages","paragraphs":["“What do we need to prepare for this?” Jiaojiao Isn’t Spoiled asked.","Chu Fu had already prepared everything.","“Underwater breathing potions, anti-cold potions, anti-inflammation potions, and windproof masks.”","Very little information had been leaked about the level 40–50 maps, and no one knew what could be found there.","But Chu Fu knew them like the back of her hand.","Expansion: Elemental Storm.","The fire spirits scorched the earth, the ice spirits froze it, and the water spirits flooded the shelters.","Not to mention the hurricanes and earthquakes.","In short, every attack from an elemental creature caused a natural disaster. Players could barely withstand them.","Every elemental spirit was a master-level mage with terrifying combat ability.","That was why Chu Fu had prepared all these potions.","As for earthquakes, they could simply fly into the air.","If they encountered special elites, such as light-element or dark-element spirits, the worst they would face would be endless daylight and burned skin, or endless night and the loss of their five senses.","Wood-element spirits would cause plants and trees to grow wildly and become poisonous. Every plant would attack people.","Lightning-element spirits would strike players with pinpoint accuracy, causing them to be blasted by lightning. As long as they hid underground, they would be safe.","In short, these elemental spirits were not only powerful, but could also alter the environment.","In the game, this did not seem like much of a problem, because every player capable of coming here had already reached level 40.","But when this expansion invaded reality, it brought about apocalyptic extreme weather. Low-level players died in droves, and the elderly and children fared even worse. Less than one percent of the population survived.","Chu Fu distributed the potions, then led everyone into the teleportation array.","After a wave of dizziness, they appeared inside a gloomy grand hall.","The hall must have been well built in its prime, but it was now filled with the marks of time. No one had cleaned it in years, and its dilapidated state was obvious.","The air felt heavy and stifling.","There were no players standing guard nearby.","A system notification soon appeared.","[System Notification: You have entered Linjiang City (Mirror Future Map, Level 40–50).","This map is a mirror world. Everything will be adjusted according to the conditions of the original map.","You may leave this map at any time without returning to the teleportation array. Simply use the exit button.","From 12:00 to 18:00 in real-world time, this map will be undergoing updates and will not be accessible. It will periodically synchronize with the real world.]","So that was why Big Brother never logged into the game in the afternoon!","The group quickly realized that the entire shelter had probably been built underground. Its area was not very large—smaller even than the Novice Village.","There were very few players, which was only natural. This was a level 40 map, while the current number-one player, Chu Feng, had only just reached level 38.","Moreover, the game had level suppression. Players gained no experience from killing monsters more than five levels below them, while monsters more than five levels above them could very well kill them instantly.","Therefore, most of the people who came here were probably level 35 players.","That reduced the number of eligible players even further.","At present, there were only about three hundred people in the entire Linjiang City.","Chu Fu opened a private chat.","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: “Big Brother, Big Brother! Guess where I am?”","[My Little Sister Is Universally Super Cute]: “You reached level 30? Did you come to the level 40 map to level up?”","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: “Haha, you guessed right! Actually, I’m here to do my class advancement quest. I need to kill ten bosses. Big Brother, come help me kill them!”","[My Little Sister Is Universally Super Cute]: “The level 40 map is dangerous. Don’t leave yet. Wait for me to come back. I’ll come as Lu Xing!”","Chu Feng hurriedly replied.","[Who Wants to Be a Vegetable]: “Okay, okay!”","Nailed it!","“Don’t leave yet. Wait for my brother’s friend. You know who I mean!”","“Your brother’s friend?”","“Could it be the great Lu Xing?” Jiaojiao Isn’t Spoiled asked.","Chu Fu nodded.","Besides, they were here to fight bosses, not hunt ordinary monsters. All they had to do was wait for the system announcement.","That was what they thought, at least. The others, however, began looking in their direction.","A middle-aged woman with the ID No Talking in Class turned her gaze toward them.","When she saw their equipment, a trace of surprise appeared in her eyes. But when she looked at Chu Fu, her expression changed to outright astonishment.","What kind of combination was this?","“Are you new here? Do you need a team? Our group still has a few openings. I’m an Anti-Magic Berserker who can prevent monsters from casting spells. You’ll be safe with us. Just follow my orders.”","No Talking in Class stepped forward. Her equipment was impressive—a full set of dark gold gear—but her face looked haggard and aged. Most striking of all were the deep lines around her mouth and the pronounced vertical crease between her brows.","If she had been wearing ordinary clothes and glasses, she would have looked exactly like a high school dean.","This was actually a character who had appeared in the storyline.","The Anti-Magic Teacher: No Talking in Class!","She really was a female teacher—a high school senior-year teacher. Her talent allowed her to seal elemental magic, making her practically invincible in the level 40 map.","She loved taking newcomers along and helping them, but she was extremely strict and had an unpleasant personality, so she was not well liked.","She was the kind of person who did good deeds but received no thanks for them.","In the original storyline, after Elemental Storm invaded reality, she shone brilliantly and made enormous contributions.","Yet during the next storyline, Mechanical Invasion, the people she had rescued betrayed her, and she ultimately died in the real world.","It was the classic story of a saintly good person being betrayed—the kind person dying young.","Chu Feng admired her from the bottom of his heart, but he did not approve of her actions. In fact, he even thought she was rather foolish.","Thinking of this, Chu Fu quickly smiled and said, “No need, ma’am. We’re here to complete a quest that requires us to fight bosses. Someone will be coming to take us there soon.”","No Talking in Class’s stern, downturned lips twitched. She seemed to want to smile, but was unaccustomed to doing so.","“My eldest son is already fifteen. Just call me Auntie. Add me as a friend, and if you want to level up later, come find me!”","Chu Fu nodded.","She added the woman as a friend. After all, her own friend list was permanently hidden. What was more, because she was so famous, everyone had begun using Disguise Masks to conceal their IDs.","The others could not see Chu Fu’s group’s in-game IDs.","After adding her as a friend, No Talking in Class froze for a moment.","“Who Wants to Be a Vegetable? Are you the one who just cleared the Origin Dungeon?”","“Yes, Auntie!”","“Then I was meddling where I wasn’t needed. Go on, have fun! Stay safe!”","No Talking in Class said nothing more and walked away.","“What did that auntie come here for?” Even Xie Lin, who had encountered all kinds of people online, was somewhat baffled.","Chu Fu smiled and said, “She was just being kind and wanted to take us through the dungeon!”","“I don’t know why, but the way she looked at me felt strange. It was like she was looking at a beggar,” Suture Saint said.","Holy Healing Angel pouted. “Don’t we look like beggars right now? Weaver Sis, can I reserve another wedding dress set? Gold-grade is fine. I don’t want to wear this goblin set anymore!”","At that, everyone looked at one another and burst out laughing.","“One Snow White and thirteen little savages!”","“That teacher probably thought we were wearing level 20 goblin bronze equipment, didn’t she?”","Everyone was left torn between laughter and tears.","As they chatted, the teleportation array flashed.","Chu Feng arrived, dressed in a black cloak."]},{"number":186,"title":"Chapter 186: The Hostility Between Shen Chi and Xie Lin, and Chu Feng's Disdain","paragraphs":["The moment Chu Feng stepped out of the teleportation array, he spotted a group of people in the distance.","One of them, dressed in a white bridal outfit, instantly caught his eye.","Beautiful!","It would look even better on his little sister. But when had new players started showing up on the level 40 map?","Then the girl in the white dress and bridal veil turned around in surprise, revealing a delicate, beautiful face.","Damn, it was his little sister!","When had she changed her equipment? And how had she gotten a diamond-grade item? It was even a cute little bridal dress.","His little sister really was the most beautiful girl in the entire universe.","Chu Feng hurriedly summoned his camera and snapped photo after photo, recording the moment.","“Boss Lu Xing!” Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao shouted energetically.","Chu Fu’s eyes curved into crescents as she raised the corners of her lips and secretly waved at him, her expression sly and playful.","Chu Feng walked over and cleared his throat.","“Nice dress.”","If her previous Poison Dragon Leather Skirt had been Gothic, cute, and devilish, then this dress was more ornate and beautiful.","It even made Chu Feng imagine his little sister getting married.","The thought made him feel strangely upset.","His little sister had really grown up. She was already eighteen this year.","Just then, he noticed two hostile gazes fixed on him.","They belonged to the guy in the wheelchair and the blind guy.","Both of them were watching him warily.","Shen Chi felt uncomfortable too. Lu Xing was Chu Feng’s friend and was usually rather aloof, so why had he suddenly praised Chu Fu’s dress?","Did he like Chu Fu?","Xie Lin was irritated as well. The way Chu Fu looked at Lu Xing—with those sparkling eyes—gave him a bad feeling.","Back when he had been a top-tier expert, plenty of girls had admired him. What those girls worshiped most was someone who was aloof and cool.","And Lu Xing was currently number one on the rankings—the number one player in the world.","That was devastatingly attractive to a young girl.","“Boss Lu Xing, long time no see. Do you know where the bosses around the shelter are? We need to complete our class-change quests!” Xie Lin walked forward a few steps, casually blocking Chu Fu’s view.","Shen Chi did the same.","“Boss Lu Xing, my mech is diamond-grade now. It should be much faster to operate than last time.”","The two of them were desperately making conversation.","Chu Feng immediately sensed that their gazes had cut off his view. His eyes landed on the two men, filled with scrutiny.","Shen Chi and Xie Lin both felt a faint sense of disdain.","“Did you two go to Africa or something? How did you end up dressed like savages?”","He looked at Shen Chi.","He was quite tall, with very fair skin. His savage outfit exposed his abdomen and thighs, and his waist looked even slimmer than a woman’s. With a standard inverted-triangle build and long legs, he had the air of a male model.","This pretty boy wasn’t good enough. He was too thin and frail.","He looked like a bandit chieftain’s husband!","Chu Feng shifted his gaze and looked at Xie Lin.","Xie Lin was wearing the same savage-style outfit, but he complemented it perfectly. His skin was a healthy wheat color, and his muscles were solid. The lines of his forearms were well defined, and he had a distinct eight-pack. His thighs were sturdy and powerful.","Was this what people online called a dark-skinned athlete?","No, this guy looked like a real wild one. His temper probably wasn’t very good.","“Boss Lu Xing, this equipment of ours is dark-gold grade! We got it from a Primal-level dungeon. If you want information about the Primal-level dungeon, you can join our party and help us kill the boss in exchange!”","Chu Fu spoke up.","This was the excuse Chu Fu and Chu Feng had come up with.","They wanted outsiders to believe that Lu Xing had merely happened to pass by and had teamed up with them because he wanted to trade for information.","“Sure!”","Chu Fu happily added Chu Feng to the party.","“We don’t know when the boss will spawn, so let’s kill monsters while we talk. I’ll help you level up too. Your brother told me that you awakened a second class.”","Chu Fu nodded. “Okay, okay!”","Shen Chi: Plant Girl is being way too nice to Lu Xing!","Xie Lin: Girls really do love top players!","Still, with Lu Xing joining them, they would indeed be able to hunt the boss faster.","They had no way to refuse him, so they could only stay on either side of Chu Fu.","That made Chu Feng even more displeased with them!","However, he was soon distracted by the Primal-level dungeon Chu Fu mentioned. The others chimed in, adding details of their own.","The more he listened, the more shocked he became.","“So that’s how it is. But now it all makes sense!” Chu Feng also revealed some information he knew—or rather, information that everyone would learn in the future.","“According to some of the rules of the Gate of Origins, all kinds of monsters and races invade Blue Star, seemingly without end.","“Players can also be killed and then create new accounts. We have cities, and they have cities too. Invasions are carried out by using Spatial Stones to open rifts in space. So why shouldn’t we be able to launch counterinvasions?”","The moment Chu Feng remembered that he had missed two anti-invasion events, he realized just how little he truly understood about the game.","But then he thought about it. In his previous life, he had never heard anything about Primal-level dungeons. Clearly, even the top players back then had failed to discover them.","Instead, his little sister had found one.","He had always said that his little sister was a gaming genius.","As they talked, the group headed outside the shelter. The shelter had been built underground, so they still needed to take an elevator.","As the elevator rose, everyone felt a wave of heat wash over them.","When they reached the surface, the intense heat surrounding them made even breathing feel scorching.","The temperature outside had actually reached 55 degrees Celsius.","Anyone could be roasted to medium-rare in this heat.","“Sizzle!”","Their shoes made a sizzling sound as they stepped onto the ground, as though they were being burned.","It was unbearably hot.","This was no place for humans to live.","Chu Feng moved.","His figure flashed, carrying him fifty meters away in an instant. He swung his blade at a towering giant three meters tall, its entire body composed of molten lava.","An Infernal Demon!","A level 40 fire-type creature.","Chu Feng continued flashing from place to place, clearing out all the monsters in the area.","The surrounding temperature gradually fell.","A flash of white light enveloped Chu Fu.","The Plant Girl class leveled up.","Just as Chu Feng was enjoying himself slaughtering monsters, a system announcement appeared.","[System Announcement: The level 45 boss, Son of the Frozen Tundra, has appeared near the Morgan Mountains. It intends to destroy the shelter. All players, please proceed to coordinates XXX, XXX and intercept it. Ensure the survival of Morgan Shelter.]","“The boss is here!”","Chu Feng stopped.","They had come all this way for nothing and would still have to return to the base to use the teleportation array.","At that moment, Shen Chi suddenly pulled out his mech.","The mech had completely changed!","If the previous mech had been huge and heavy, the new one was silver-white. Though it stood twenty-five meters tall, it looked slender and highly technological.","“Everyone, this is the new mech’s first spatial jump. Let me know what you think!”","Shen Chi opened the cockpit and climbed in first.","The others skillfully climbed onto the mech’s arm before leaping into the mech cabin.","Chu Feng, however, froze.","“You’re going to make a spatial jump? Do you mean the kind I’m thinking of?”"]},{"number":187,"title":"Chapter 187: This Mech Is Pretty Handy, and Everyone Has Their Own Choice","paragraphs":["“That’s right, Brother Star-Slayer, come on!” Chu Fu called out.","Chu Feng had no choice but to board the mecha first.","The fifteen people took their seats and fastened their safety belts.","Shen Chi operated the control panel, entered the coordinates, and activated the mecha.","The next moment, the mecha extended its fingers.","The thick metal fingers gleamed silver. Clearly, spatial stones had been added inside them.","Its hands tore through the air as if ripping open a canvas. A spatial rift appeared in front of them.","Shen Chi leaped inside and accelerated forward. Everything around them transformed into particles as they traveled through spacetime.","Before long, white light flashed ahead.","An icy blue landscape appeared before their eyes.","They landed in another location. The mecha rotated, and soon spotted a colossal figure in the distance.","The Son of the Frozen Snowfield!","It still had the general shape of a human, but its entire body was covered in fur, making it resemble a standing polar bear. Its hair stuck up wildly like a Chow Chow’s, and it gripped a staff condensed from ice crystals in both hands.","Chilling winds swirled around it, covering a full ten kilometers. Everywhere it passed, ice and snow spread across the ground.","Any water it touched instantly froze.","The surrounding temperature rapidly dropped below zero and continued falling. Everyone felt the cold.","Even the mecha’s hatch began to bloom with frost.","“Take the cold-resistance potions!” Chu Fu said quickly.","The Flame Demon had only been a minor monster, but the Son of the Frozen Snowfield was a boss. The temperature around it would clearly fall to an even more terrifying level.","Everyone took a cold-resistance potion. When the hatch opened, a wave of frigid air swept in.","In an instant, everyone was afflicted with Freeze.","Chu Fu discovered that her body had been covered by an entire centimeter of ice crystals.","Unbelievable!","The attack was far too powerful.","“Holy Light: Dispel!”","The Holy Healing Angel cast Holy Light, instantly dispelling the ice crystals covering them and allowing everyone to move again.","The only person who had not been affected was Chu Feng. The moment he had opened the hatch, he had already drawn his dagger and attacked the Son of the Frozen Snowfield.","In an instant, countless streams of dark shadow power erupted, and massive damage numbers appeared above the boss’s head.","It was only a level-45 boss. He would need just a few minutes to finish it off.","The boss reacted and twisted around to attack Chu Feng.","Chu Feng immediately entered stealth and vanished from the spot. He circled around behind the creature, preparing to continue his assault.","At that moment, an impassioned horn call rang out.","[War Horn] All attributes +20%.","Chu Feng’s attack power surged dramatically.","[Holy Light Shield]","[Prison of Sorrow]","[Prayer]","A series of shields descended upon Chu Feng.","He was being pampered!","This boost... Was this the power of teamwork?","Why bother staying in stealth? Just attack directly!","He immediately began dealing damage.","“Big lump of ice, let me smash you into shaved ice!”","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao also joined the fight. Her forced taunt made the boss attack her, giving Chu Feng an opportunity to deal damage.","Chu Fu and the others arrived as well.","From a distance, Chu Fu instantly summoned 300 Corn Gatling Sprites.","Each Corn Gatling Sprite was half a meter tall.","Originally, Plant Sprites were only palm-sized. Chu Fu possessed the Harvest Badge, which had made her Plant Sprites larger, but they still had not reached half a meter in height.","That was because Chu Fu had used the Spiritwood Contract to form contracts with the Corn Gatling Sprites.","Plant Sprites were plants too.","After forming the contracts, the Plant Sprites gained 80% of Chu Fu’s base attributes.","The originally semitransparent sprites became much more solid. Not only that, but they also grew to more than half a meter tall.","They had brown hair on their heads, while their clothes were green. The material looked like a combination of cornstalk leaves and the leaves surrounding the corn itself. Light yellow, pale green, and dark green blended together to form beautiful little skirts.","The Gatling guns in their hands were enormous, measuring thirty centimeters in diameter and fifty centimeters in length. They looked as though they had been made by binding five golden ears of corn together.","They were incredibly exaggerated.","It was like watching someone carry a double-door refrigerator into battle.","Plant Sprites had always been clever. The Mushroom Sprites she had charmed earlier were still guarding the spirit rice.","After forming the Spiritwood Contracts, the Corn Gatling Sprites became even smarter—like raising three hundred adult border collies.","As soon as Chu Fu summoned them, the little sprites lined up in perfect formation, creating a semicircular encirclement thirty meters wide and three meters deep. They aimed at the Son of the Frozen Snowfield.","The Gatling guns in the hands of the Corn Gatling Sprites immediately erupted with a sound even more terrifying and dense than firecrackers.","“Rat-a-tat-tat-tat-tat-tat-tat-tat!”","Before this, the Corn Gatling would pour out all its golden corn bullets, leaving behind only a bare cornstalk. At that point, it was essentially useless in combat.","Now, the Corn Gatling Sprites had mana and could use it to grow corn, reload their weapons, and maintain continuous fire.","That transformed them into weapons with infinite ammunition.","-10, -12, -9, -15 (Critical Hit!)","The Gatling guns in the hands of the Corn Gatling Sprites fired 500 bullets per second.","With 300 Corn Gatling Sprites, they unleashed 150,000 bullets every second.","Their damage per second reached 1.5 million.","A level-45 boss already had more than a hundred million HP, but this barrage dealt roughly one percent of its health every second. Killing the boss would take only 100 seconds.","With Chu Feng’s attacks and those of the others included, it took less than thirty seconds.","The boss crashed to the ground.","[System Announcement: The level-45 boss, Son of the Frozen Snowfield, has been defeated by the “Who Wants to Be a Plant Person?” team. Morgan Shelter has survived and is temporarily safe.]","Outside Linjiang Shelter, No Talking in Class was leading a team of players in fighting monsters when she blinked.","As a mathematics teacher, she was particularly sensitive to numbers.","But no matter how sharp her instincts were, she still compared the time shown in the system announcement again and again.","What was going on?","From the announcement that the boss had appeared to the announcement that Who Wants to Be a Plant Person had killed it...","How had only fifty-eight seconds passed?","They had taken less than a minute to kill it.","Even the strongest, Lu Xing, needed at least half an hour to kill a boss.","Of course, that half hour included Lu Xing’s travel time. Sometimes, when the journey was too far, Lu Xing would not even bother going to kill the boss, resulting in many shelters being overrun.","He did not care.","This map was a future map, and it updated every day. Some shelters appeared, while others vanished.","In fact, she had secretly built models and suspected that the appearance of shelters was related to whether players had protected the Novice Village.","However, in reality, she was merely a high school teacher, and she was not especially outstanding in the game either. In the end, she told no one about her suspicions.","Better to avoid trouble whenever possible.","These were troubled times, and she did not want to expose too much about herself.","Someone like Who Wants to Be a Plant Person looked only a few years older than her son, yet he was already being discussed on the dark web. Players from overseas factions had even added her as a friend to ask for specific information about Who Wants to Be a Plant Person.","There were probably plenty of spies and assassins who wanted her dead by now.","It was far too dangerous.","She still had a husband, a son, and a daughter.","She did not want to draw attention to herself.","All she could do was help the other players as much as possible in the game."]},{"number":188,"title":"Chapter 188: Ice Crystal Snow Lotus, Giving Chu Feng a Comfortable Ride","paragraphs":["Elsewhere.","The battle was over in just one minute, which came as quite a surprise to Chu Feng. He reassessed his little sister’s team once again.","They were strong.","Even without him, their team could deal with a minor boss quickly.","That was right—a boss like this was only a minor boss. It was not particularly powerful on a Level 40 map.","Bosses were divided into different tiers.","This could also be seen from the loot. The Son of the Frozen Snowfield had dropped three Dark Gold–grade pieces of equipment, twenty Gold-grade pieces, and a large number of materials, but not a single Diamond-grade item.","On a Level 40 map, only bosses of the Divine Blood Descendant variety could drop Diamond-grade equipment.","However, they were still not as difficult as the Origin-grade Goblin.","“Hey! Plant Girl, there’s a seed here! A Frost Crystal Snow Lotus seed!”","Someone alerted Chu Fu.","As the leader of the team, the stronger Chu Fu was, the stronger everyone’s combat power became.","Moreover, Chu Fu hardly consumed any of the team’s resources, and she rarely needed equipment. Everyone felt somewhat guilty about that, so whenever something that could improve Chu Fu’s strength dropped, they were even happier than she was.","“Let me see! Let me see!”","Chu Fu’s gaze fell on the Frost Crystal Snow Lotus.","[Frost Crystal Snow Lotus (Dark Gold–grade Seed): Can be planted to grow a Frost Crystal Snow Lotus, which can be used as an alchemy material.","Can mutate:","Mutated Frost Crystal Snow Lotus—Trait 1: Sprays out a freezing mist that inflicts severe frostbite on enemies.","Trait 2: Condenses an ice sphere to attack enemies, dealing frost damage as well as physical impact damage.]","“This is great. I’m taking this Dark Gold–grade material!”","Chu Fu immediately paid 100 gold coins. Naturally, no one bid against her, and the Frost Crystal Snow Lotus fell into her hands.","“Manager Feng, please handle the equipment auction. I’m going to speed up the seed’s growth.”","Feng Huimin took over the auction and began selling off the dropped equipment.","Without a doubt, Level 45 Dark Gold–grade equipment had much better stats than Level 20 Dark Gold–grade equipment.","Level 20 Dark Gold equipment had around 130 attack or defense, with approximately 80 points of attribute enhancement.","Level 45 Dark Gold equipment, on the other hand, had around 280 attack or defense, with approximately 130 points of attribute enhancement.","Moreover, even Level 45 Gold-grade equipment had around 240 attack or defense, with roughly 100 points of attribute enhancement.","As a result, the three Dark Gold and twenty Gold pieces of equipment that had dropped were extremely popular.","[Frost Barrier (Dark Gold–grade): Physical Defense 200, Magic Defense 300, Constitution +80, Strength +20, Spirit +30, Ice-Element Resistance +200.","Trait: Freeze—When used, has a certain chance to freeze an enemy for 0.5 seconds.]","What a great item!","At the same time, Feng Huimin began the auction.","“Shield-type weapon. Its current market value is around 800 gold coins. Considering its higher level, we’ll raise the price slightly. The starting bid is 1,000 gold coins. Shield Warriors and players with higher contribution ratings will have purchase priority. The second-highest bidder must offer 20% more than the first bid.”","Feng Huimin had adopted the rules established by Chu Fu. Of course, as equipment prices continued to rise, the second bidder no longer had to offer double the first bid, but only 20% more.","Jiaojiao Bu Jiao immediately shouted, “2,000 gold coins!”","If Lu An wanted to win the bid, he would have to offer 2,400 gold coins.","“Pass!”","Lu An did not dare compete at all.","How could he possibly fight the Queen Jiaojiao for it?","Apart from the equipment guaranteed to drop from the Origin-grade dungeon this time, which had allowed him to obtain a Goblin-made Beast Bone Shield for free, all his previous equipment had been replaced gear that Jiaojiao Bu Jiao had discarded.","And Jiaojiao Bu Jiao’s equipment was all top-quality. Yet when she sold it to him, she charged only half price—and sometimes simply gave it to him.","Back when he was in the Universal Guild, he had been cultivated as the main MT and was allowed to use Gold equipment for free.","But that equipment technically did not belong to him.","Unless he had an especially pressing need for it, Wan Huanyu would reward it to his lackeys instead.","Things were different in the Thorn Guild. Not only was the pressure of serving as the secondary tank much lower, but his teammates had also gone from a group of amateurs to a team of super experts.","He could just coast along and still receive a share of the profits.","He could even earn attribute points.","He could improve his talents, too!","Sometimes, he could even lead teams and earn gold coins.","As expected, life really was different depending on who you spent it with.","While Lu An was sighing inwardly, Feng Huimin had already begun auctioning the next item.","[Frost Mage Robe (Dark Gold–grade): Physical Defense 100, Magic Defense 200, Constitution +20, Agility +20, Spirit +80, Ice Attack +200.","Trait: Freezing Aura—When a melee enemy attacks the wearer, the Freezing Aura is instantly activated, freezing the enemy in place.]","“What a great piece of equipment. It’s essential for an Ice Mage, and it even provides a special attack bonus. The trait is extremely useful. Although our team doesn’t have an Ice Mage, someone can bid for it and wear it until a replacement becomes available!","“The starting bid is 500 gold coins. Among the magic classes, who has the highest contribution rating? Who Wants to Be a Vegetable, would you like to bid?”","“No bid,” Chu Fu said.","“Then everyone else may bid!”","Holy Healing Angel was the first to shout, “I Don’t Want to Be a Caveman! I want to wear a pretty dress too. 500 gold coins!”","“That makes perfect sense. 600 gold coins!” Suture Saint also joined the bidding.","Zhimengzhe and Shafu Liangu followed suit.","In the end, however, Holy Healing Angel was the most determined and won the equipment for 1,200 gold coins. It was actually a worthwhile purchase, considering that this was Level 45 Dark Gold equipment.","Finally, a pair of Frost Crystal Shoes was also sold at a high price of 800 gold coins.","Holy Healing Angel was nearly bankrupt.","But they really were beautiful.","What was more, the stats of the Gold equipment were also better than those of the Level 20 Dark Gold equipment they currently possessed. Everyone eagerly placed bids and replaced their gear. Not a single item was left unsold.","After everything had been auctioned off, they had earned more than 4,352 gold coins.","Because Chu Feng had accounted for 73% of the damage dealt, he received 3,176 gold coins and 960 silver coins.","And that was not all. Once the equipment auction had ended, the next boss spawned.","Normally, by the time Chu Feng reached the first location, killed the boss, and hurried to the next one, players from other shelters would have already rushed out to protect their shelter.","That created one problem.","Competition over the boss.","Chu Feng did not care whether the other side had started fighting the boss first. If he could steal the kill, he would. Having the stronger strength was all that mattered.","He might show some consideration to players from his own country.","But he would not let the overseas players off.","Now, however, there was no need to worry about that.","Everyone climbed into their mechs, tore open the void, and headed for the next boss’s location.","No one could arrive faster than them.","Even the strongest monsters were dealt with in three to five minutes.","The weaker ones took only a minute.","One after another, all ten bosses were defeated.","Chu Feng had an incredibly satisfying time fighting them!","The only problem was that the name appearing in the system announcements was always “Who Wants to Be a Vegetable!”","Although Chu Fu was quite famous in Linjiang City, she was practically unknown among top-tier players. At the very least, her name could not be found anywhere on the Level Rankings.","The only thing that had left a deep impression was the fact that she had completed an Origin-grade dungeon and even triggered a worldwide announcement.","“Who is this Plantman? She even managed to beat Lu Xing? At last, someone has come to put him in his place,” someone thought gleefully."]},{"number":189,"title":"Chapter 189: Job Transfer Mission Complete, Disability Alliance in Recovery","paragraphs":["Little did he know that Lu Xing was among the members of Who Wants to Be a Vegetable?'s party.","Even Chu Feng felt that this was highly efficient, and he was reluctant to end things so soon.","He felt as though he was gradually changing from a lone wolf into a member of a team.","However, Chu Fu and the others had completed their mission.","Extracting their strength into the real world was still more important.","“Brother Star-Slayer, let’s play together again sometime.”","Chu Fu waved goodbye.","Chu Feng said, “...Call me if anything comes up.”","Then he left and continued his endless journey of fighting bosses.","Since the future-map instance could now be exited directly, the others chose to leave the instance where they stood.","The surrounding light shifted, and before long, they found themselves back in Linjiang City, beside the teleportation array.","They randomly found an NPC and submitted their Master-level quest.","【Important System Notice!】","【Your level has exceeded Level 30, and you have completed your class-change quest. You have become a Master-level Awakened.】","【The system’s built-in withdrawal function has been unlocked! You may withdraw all of your abilities. Click here to view the withdrawal requirements.】","Chu Fu immediately checked.","【SSS-Rank Talent—Vegetative Being: Requires 10,000 gold coins and 300 days’ worth of nutrient solution. Deep-sleep duration: 60 hours.】","【SS-Rank Talent—Poisonous Being: Requires 7,000 gold coins and 200 days’ worth of nutrient solution. Deep-sleep duration: 40 hours.】","【Hidden Class—Seed of Calamity and its skills: Requires 15,000 gold coins and 350 days’ worth of nutrient solution. Deep-sleep duration: 70 hours.】","【Hidden Class—Spirit of the Forest-Sea and its skills: Requires 5,000 gold coins and 120 days’ worth of nutrient solution. Deep-sleep duration: 15 hours.】","【1 free attribute point: 10 gold coins, 1 day’s worth of nutrient solution, and 10 minutes of deep sleep.】","Aside from the items listed above, different pieces of equipment required gold coins and Space Stones.","The item 【A Little Toxic—Silver Grade】 required 100 gold coins and 100 Space Stones.","The 【Poison Bottle—Gold Grade】 required 1,000 gold coins and 200 Space Stones.","The 【Spirit Plant Satchel—Dark Gold Grade】 required 10,000 gold coins and 500 Space Stones.","As for Diamond-grade equipment, there was no need to elaborate—it cost 100,000 gold coins.","Chu Fu could not afford that at present.","She currently had a full 70,000 gold coins in her inventory.","After giving it some thought, Chu Fu first withdrew all three pieces of equipment.","Then she clicked on the SSS-rank talent Vegetative Being and the Spirit of the Forest-Sea. The Spirit of the Forest-Sea was only Level 15 and had few skills, so the requirements were not very demanding.","The total sleep time came to 85 hours.","She temporarily withdrew 10 points in every attribute, which would take approximately six hours and forty minutes.","Altogether, it came to 81 hours.","She had originally planned to withdraw a little each day.","But when the day finally arrived, almost everyone wanted to withdraw all of their abilities in one go.","Unless they did not have enough money.","Chu Fu naturally had enough.","Therefore, she planned to complete the withdrawal while things were relatively quiet.","She was not the only one thinking this way. Everyone in the team had the same idea.","However, Feng Huimin still stopped the others.","The guild still needed someone to hold down the fort.","Thus, the first group chosen to undergo withdrawal consisted of seven people: Chu Fu, Shen Chi, Xie Lin, Holy Healing Angel, Little Sister Wu, Lu An, and Dream King.","Jiaojiao Is Not Spoiled and Suture Saint would remain behind to guard the Thorn Guild.","Once the first group had finished withdrawing their abilities three and a half days later, those two would undergo the process as well.","Afterward, she asked her brother to help prepare the nutrient solution, then immediately went to sleep.","It was a deep sleep.","Before she knew it, three days had passed.","...","At Wangxi Manor.","Shen Chi woke from his sleep.","It was already the agreed-upon time.","Shen Chi opened the game pod and removed the nutrient solution.","Lying in the pod, he mentally prepared himself before slowly sitting up and swinging his legs out.","The discomfort he had imagined never came.","On the contrary, it felt as though he had always been in control of these legs—as though... as though he were still in the game.","He had extracted thirty points of all attributes. In reality, he could no longer feel weak or helpless.","At last, he had regained sensation below his waist.","He was standing!!!","In that instant, Shen Chi’s eyes reddened with tears, and he wept with joy.","...","At another manor.","It sounded as though a monkey were screeching.","Xie Lin opened his game pod and touched his eyes with both hands.","They no longer felt sunken. There were round, solid things inside them, and he could even open his eyes and look out at the world.","Though even without opening his eyes, Xie Lin could now sense everything.","Because he had activated [Mind’s Eye].","Still, he slowly opened his eyes.","This was the first time he had ever seen his own manor!","It was beautiful, comfortable, and incredibly luxurious.","“Hahahaha! I can see! I can see!”","Xie Lin burst out laughing.","He had recovered.","Not only had he recovered—he had also brought back a god-tier class and a god-tier talent!","Who could possibly stand against him?","“Mr. Xie, are you awake? Someone has been calling you repeatedly. They said that once you woke up, you should check your messages.”","The housekeeper spoke.","Xie Lin nodded, wondering who had called him. Could it be Plant Girl?","The thought made him eagerly take out his phone and open his messages.","But the moment he saw them, his lips curled in displeasure.","It was actually Li Weizheng?","...","Inside the grandest manor in Wangxi Manor.","Chu Fu had also received a message from Li Weizheng.","He wanted them to report to the Primordial Arena University as soon as possible after cashing out, so they could complete the necessary formalities.","Chu Fu checked the time. They had logged out at exactly one in the afternoon, and night had also fallen in the game. Although they could still run dungeons in the game, there was no need to rush.","After giving it some thought, she decided to go sign the agreement.","Since Li Weizheng had personally invited them, Chu Fu felt she should bring him a gift.","In fact, she had prepared this gift long ago.","[Goblin Common Language Book (White)]: Found inside the tent after the Goblin Divine Envoy’s death.","A white-grade item only cost one silver coin to exchange, while the spatial stones had only cost thirty.","Giving Li Weizheng a favor would also make it easier for her to negotiate terms with him.","“Fufu, you’re awake? How are you feeling?” Chu Feng had noticed that Chu Fu was awake as well.","Chu Fu hurriedly replied, “I’m fine, I’m fine. No need to increase my training—I can’t keep up with everything. I’m already way too busy.”","Chu Feng was amused.","“Alright, then.”","“Brother, I’m going to Primordial Arena University to sign a confidentiality agreement.”","“Mm. Li Weizheng has urged us several times already. I’ll take you there.”","“Okay, but we need to wait for my companions!”","Chu Fu hurriedly called the others.","Everyone had awakened from their deep sleep as well. Hearing Chu Fu’s summons, they naturally came to the villa to find her.","“Ah! Wheelchair Brother, you’re standing up! That’s wonderful! You’re exactly as tall as you were in the game!”","“Sword Saint Brother, your eye is healed too? That’s amazing!”","Everyone celebrated enthusiastically.","Just then, Chu Feng walked over and said, “The car is waiting at the entrance. Let’s talk outside.”","He also glanced at Shen Chi and Xie Lin, his expression distinctly sour.","Why were these two like ghosts that just wouldn’t go away?","Yet after receiving that look from Chu Feng, Shen Chi’s heart stirred.","For some reason, Shen Chi felt that Brother Chu Feng looked familiar. The way he looked so annoyed with him reminded Shen Chi of a top-tier gaming expert..."]},{"number":190,"title":"Chapter 190: To the Primordial Academy, Intelligence from the Future","paragraphs":["Chu Fu and the others rode in the official van to the Primordial Academy.","They had not notified Li Weizheng, but he had already logged off and was waiting enthusiastically at the entrance of a high-rise building to welcome them.","The Primordial Academy was no longer the quiet place it had once been, with only a handful of people around. It was now bustling with activity, crowded with people coming and going. Quite a few players who had cashed out their in-game strength were even training there.","Most of them carried one or two pieces of equipment from the game, which looked completely out of place in the real world.","“Welcome, welcome!” Li Weizheng greeted them personally.","“You two arrived at just the right time. This afternoon, we have some information to present to Master-level players. Why don’t you join us?”","In reality, the information was shown to players every day, and the presentation should have begun ten minutes earlier.","But because Chu Fu was coming, Li Weizheng would rather make the other players wait than risk keeping her waiting.","Fortunately, they had arrived just in time.","He then led everyone to the screening hall.","Apart from Chu Fu and the others, more than a dozen people were already inside. They were clearly players who had only recently reached Level 30, and the aura of power around each of them was still rather weak.","By contrast, after Chu Fu and the others entered, the players looked them up and down. Their expressions soon changed.","“They look like the Plantman group from the Thorny Rose Guild.”","“Aren’t they from District 030? They got here so quickly?”","“They were already incredibly strong to begin with!”","Chu Fu and the others took their seats.","A female host soon stepped onto the stage. She had short hair cut to her ears and was not as frail and fair-skinned as ordinary presenters. Clearly defined muscles showed on her arms.","She was probably a military art troupe performer.","Although she had given this presentation many times, the host was deeply shaken every time she delivered it.","“Thank you all for coming, Master-level players. I’ll now explain the recent changes that have taken place in Linjiang City.”","The screen soon displayed a large amount of data.","The red-eyed rabbits had mutated, and huge rabbits had appeared across the country.","Fortunately, although the red-eyed rabbits were irritable and kicked people, they could still be dealt with by human strength.","Next came the mutated rats.","These were far more troublesome. The Flower Kingdom had spent a great deal of money encouraging everyone to hunt and exterminate rats, and the situation had been temporarily brought under control.","However, as time passed, the mutated rats gradually grew stronger. In some of the videos, rat hordes had appeared in various regions.","Dozens of mutated rats, each the size of a large yellow dog, attacked humans. The people in the video screamed in agony before ultimately being bitten to death.","Such a scene was perfectly ordinary in the game. Level 2 mutated rats in the rice paddies liked to ambush players and were among the least popular monsters. If players had not later discovered locations where they respawned instantly, they would not have wanted to go there at all.","Next came the wild boars.","The skin of domestic pigs had begun turning black, and they had grown tusks overnight. Because of their weight, they were extremely ferocious, and incidents of people being injured had become frequent.","The host explained, “At present, wild boars are mutating extremely quickly. Their meat is still edible after slaughter and is even more nutritious than before, but they are much harder to control, and attacks on people are occurring frequently. The authorities have already dispatched as many personnel as possible to handle the situation.”","“But this isn’t the most frightening development. This is.”","The host played another video.","A huge hole had appeared in a rice paddy.","The opening was roughly forty or fifty centimeters high and pitch-black inside. Most importantly, it was blocked by a layer of black membrane.","Everyone immediately understood what this meant.","A Level 3 dungeon: the Mutated Rat Nest!","“This Level 3 dungeon appeared three days ago, and one mutated rat respawns every ten seconds.","“There are three difficulty modes. That means 25,920 mutated rats can spawn each day.","“Most frightening of all, after searching the entire city, we discovered a total of fifty-three Mutated Rat dungeon entrances.","“The game has currently unlocked up to District 53. That means 1,373,760 mutated rats will spawn every day, surrounding the entire city.”","Chu Fu’s thoughts stirred.","She was not particularly concerned about the number of mutated rats spawning each day.","What mattered was that the locations of the Mutated Rat Nests could be used to determine the locations of the Novice Villages.","The Novice Villages that had survived would, at the very least, become safe zones for humanity.","Buying property there in advance would be an absolute bargain.","However, purchasing Wangxi Manor had been part of Chu Fu’s advance planning. She had obtained the surrounding land with strategies and guides.","The Flower Kingdom now possessed a great deal of information and had plans of its own. It was too late to acquire more property.","Besides, managing it all would be difficult.","Chu Fu felt that she could not afford to be too greedy.","Sure enough, the young host continued, “The monsters in the game are constantly entering the real world. So, does that mean other things will enter as well? Our research has found that some mutated rats have invaded areas far beyond their expected range. Those locations happen to correspond to Novice Villages that survived.","“District 001, District 009, District 017... At present, we are doing everything in our power to renovate the Novice Villages corresponding to these districts and establish safe zones there.”","“At the same time, we have sent personnel to guard the dungeon entrances and clear out the monsters.","“The only problem is that this dungeon requires Shrinking Potions to enter, and it also imposes a level restriction. The authorities exchanged for a batch of potions and sent a squad of soldiers inside. Using firearms and explosives, they managed to clear the dungeon.","“After a dungeon is cleared each day, it will no longer spawn monsters.","“But the problem is that we are unable to clear Nightmare difficulty.”","The female host’s eyes reddened.","All the soldiers could only be considered Level 1 humans. Even elite soldiers with twice the physical attributes of ordinary humans were merely Level 2.","Without any supernatural abilities and relying solely on guns and explosives, entering the dungeon was practically a suicide mission. Yet the Nightmare-level dungeon still had not been cleared.","Mutated rat monsters continued to spawn at the dungeon entrance. In the game, these creatures were Level 5 elite monsters.","Each one was the size of a large dog. In just three days, Linjiang City had probably fired more bullets than it had in the previous ten years combined.","At this rate, they would not be able to hold out.","That was why they urgently needed players who had cashed out their strength to guard the dungeon.","“The game is constantly invading the real world. If we calculate according to the current rate of one monster level syncing every eighteen days, once all the monsters in the Novice Villages have synchronized, it could trigger a major disaster!","“A beast tide.","“The beast tide will come to exterminate humanity.","“Only by relying on safe zones will we be able to withstand it.","“There is another extremely serious problem: the maps in the game are a hundred times larger than their real-world counterparts.","“Two villages that are originally only three kilometers apart are a full three hundred kilometers apart in the game.","“Furthermore, the Novice Villages, the towns that survive, and Linjiang City are all extremely small in area.","“We have reasonable grounds to suspect that when the time comes, Blue Star itself will expand. Only the safe zones may remain intact. Perhaps there will first be a massive earthquake, followed by a terrifying beast tide.","“Regardless of what happens, the crisis is already upon us.”","The host’s speech came to an end.","At that moment, Li Weizheng stepped onto the stage.","“Everyone, I’m delighted that you still trust the authorities and are willing to work with us toward a common goal. Here, I announce that all Master-level players who are willing to stand on the same front as the authorities will be rewarded with a house inside a safe zone.","“You may choose whichever Novice Village you want, and we will make the necessary arrangements. The only condition is that you may need to guard the dungeon and protect your new home.","Of course. With more and more top-tier players from the official side joining us, everyone’s shifts are staggered. Each person only needs to stand guard for about three hours, and not every day—just once every few days.","The official side is also offering rewards. Besides in-game currency, they’ll provide all kinds of support in the real world to help everyone improve their strength.”","As soon as Li Weizheng finished speaking, a player seated in the back suddenly asked, “Can we choose any novice village? Then I want to choose the one near Wangxi Manor.”"]},{"number":191,"title":"Chapter 191: Follow the official for security, follow the thorns for strength.","paragraphs":["Chu Fu and the others all turned to look at one another. Before Li Weizheng could say anything, the player standing beside that man spoke first.","“Keep dreaming!”","The blunt response clearly came from the player’s friend.","Most players teamed up to level, so when they reached Level 30, they usually weren’t alone—they had friends with them.","With that sharp retort, the people present burst into laughter.","Li Weizheng said helplessly, “You’re not the first player to make this request, but I still have to explain. First of all, Wangxi Manor is private property. Secondly, all the land around the nearby beginner villages belongs solely to Ms. Who Wants to Be a Vegetative Patient.","“At present, Wangxi Manor is essentially an autonomous region. If you want to live there, you’ll also have to become a member of the Thorny Guild!","“Ms. Who Wants to Be a Vegetative Patient is here in person today. Do you have any plans to open Thorny Town to outsiders? What are the requirements for moving in?”","Li Weizheng turned to Chu Fu.","Chu Fu didn’t refuse. After thinking for a moment, she said, “At present, Thorny Town’s buildings can accommodate roughly two hundred thousand people. The Thorny Guild already has ten thousand members. Each guild member may bring their immediate family within three generations to live there. The housing consists of two bedrooms and one living room, with a total area of eighty square meters and no shared-area fees.","“If you’re single, you may bring up to three relatives or friends to live with you.”","Although these were the stated rules, Thorny Town had not yet been completed.","The members of the Thorny Guild had not reached Level 30 either, so they did not yet know about this information and naturally had no reason to rush into moving.","There was still plenty of time.","Chu Fu, however, knew that a Level 10 guild could have up to three hundred thousand members. If each member brought their family, the total could easily exceed one million people.","Thorny Town would have to be pushed beyond its intended capacity to house that many people.","But for a guild to develop into a Level 10 guild, it needed an enormous amount of resources and prestige.","In Chu Feng’s first life, the official guild Longxiang Jiuzhou was established in the capital and reached Level 10 in the fifth year of the apocalypse.","In Chu Feng’s second life, although he did not cooperate with the official guild, there was a player named Tang Xiaonuan who worked with him to sell designated equipment. She could be considered an important supporting character.","In this life, Longxiang Jiuzhou would become a Level 10 guild in three and a half years.","Chu Fu believed that Thorny Town would certainly expand again within those three and a half years.","There was no need to reserve too much space in advance.","Besides, these properties were all hens that laid golden eggs. Chu Fu would never sell them.","“Other than the residences reserved for guild members, the rent for the remaining housing is tentatively set at thirty silver coins per month.","“However, the town has limited capacity, so that is the rent per person, not the rent for an entire house.”","After all, if she rented out a twenty-square-meter dormitory for thirty silver coins, the tenants might cram twenty people into it by using bunk beds.","Chu Fu had no intention of letting Thorny Town become one of those overcrowded shared-housing arrangements.","The thirty-silver-coin rent was meant to screen for players who shared her vision of building the strongest town possible.","As for those who still had not started playing the game and refused to believe that the game would invade reality—those who still had not reached Level 10 four months later—Chu Fu could only say that even the kindest advice could not save someone determined to die.","Chu Fu added, “Of course, Thorny Town hasn’t been completed yet. It won’t open to outsiders until three months from now.”","The players in the back exchanged glances.","Thirty silver coins a month?","Was that expensive?","By now, the price of one copper coin had fallen to ten flower coins. In other words, thirty silver coins was equivalent to three hundred thousand.","With that kind of rent, one could buy a house in a small county.","But for Level 30 players, thirty silver coins a month really wasn’t much.","Several of them were already tempted.","Li Weizheng thought grimly, This is bad.","The appeal of the Thorny Guild was simply too great for these players.","Li Weizheng said, “Residences provided by the official authorities are free. The living quarters are at least 150 square meters, and they come with free cafeterias, clothing, and daily necessities.","“You have to understand that once the apocalypse truly arrives, the value of these things will skyrocket.”","That made the players hesitate.","Put simply, joining the official authorities meant security—a guaranteed job and a stable livelihood.","But going to Thorny Town could mean a high cost of living.","And what if the official authorities managed to defend the town against the beast tide as well?","In that case, why join the Thorny Guild?","Some people, however, were thinking further ahead.","They had well-connected sources. Besides, the news from three days ago—that Ms. Who Wants to Be a Vegetative Patient had led twenty thousand players into a Primordial-level dungeon—had spread throughout the world.","A Primordial dungeon could upgrade everyone’s talents and classes.","Its appeal was simply overwhelming.","Moreover, a full twenty thousand people had taken part in the dungeon. Even if the Thorny Guild’s players kept quiet, the other participants could not resist the temptation. Some had even posted paid dungeon guides on the forums, so players all over the world now knew about it.","Knowing about it was one thing. Being able to clear it was another.","There was a saying: Follow Ms. Who Wants to Be a Vegetative Patient, and you’ll always get a share of the loot.","Could following the official authorities improve their talents?","None of these people possessed an A-rank talent. Otherwise, they would have joined the Thorny Guild long ago.","But which mattered more—a stronger power or greater security?","For a moment, everyone fell into hesitation.","Li Weizheng did not force anyone to join the official authorities.","His primary target was Chu Fu and the others.","If Chu Fu could join the official authorities, or form some kind of deep alliance with them, that would be the greatest victory of all.","“Everyone, rest assured. I’m only extending an invitation. Whether you join the official authorities is entirely up to you.”","“Even if you don’t join, you can still accept official missions, earn official contribution points, and exchange them for supplies.","“However, the reason I invited everyone here today is to have you sign a peace agreement.","“You all possess extraordinary power now, and you must not use it to commit evil or slaughter innocent people.","“Only by maintaining order and living in an orderly world can we sleep with our doors unlocked and walk the streets without fear of theft.","“If the official authorities discover anyone slaughtering innocent people, we will issue a wanted notice and bring them to justice. At the very least, Laoji Fuli, our commander in Linjiang City, will personally take action.”","Li Weizheng’s expression was solemn.","The others nodded in agreement.","Chu Fu, however, raised an eyebrow. Chu Feng wore a perfectly measured, gentle smile, making him look like the friendly big brother next door.","Sorry, they had already done exactly that. They simply hadn’t been discovered by the official authorities.","So, in truth, her brother and the official authorities were fundamentally incompatible in their ideals.","But had Chu Feng done anything wrong?","No.","He had merely reclaimed the justice that was owed to him.","Afterward, everyone signed the peace agreement.","Li Weizheng then explained some of the official missions currently available, as well as the benefits of joining the authorities.","“If you join the official authorities, you can choose to join the Garrison Corps, clear out mutated beasts, and protect other people.","“You can join the Divine Constabulary, maintain law and order, hunt down followers of evil gods and hostile forces, and pursue criminals wanted for slaughtering innocent people.","“You can join the medical teams, treating injured people and even resurrecting fallen soldiers!”","When the Sacred Wolf Club attacked last time, Laoji Fuli had originally intended to have Suture Saint intervene and help resurrect the dead. In the end, Mountain-Sea City had a priest who could perform resurrections, saving them a resurrection scroll.","Even so, healing-class players capable of resurrection remained incredibly important.","Li Weizheng looked at the Holy Healing Angel and Little Sister Wu, his eyes shining.","However, their organization had nothing official to offer the two of them.","In truth, there was only one way: win over Chu Fu. If they could bring her onboard, the Thorn Guild would enter into a deep partnership with them.","Li Weizheng had been prepared for this all along.","“All right, the meeting is adjourned. Classmates Chu, Shen, and Xie, we’ve prepared a few things for the three of you. We hope they’ll be of some help.”"]},{"number":192,"title":"Chapter 192: The Power of the Flower-Growing Family: Official Sincerity from Representative Li Weizheng","paragraphs":["Chu Fu exchanged a glance with Shen Chi and Xie Lin.","Looks like Li Weizheng had prepared quite the tempting offer!","“Then let’s go take a look!”","Chu Fu naturally wanted to show Li Weizheng some respect.","Li Weizheng was delighted and led everyone toward the experimental building.","As soon as they got close, Chu Fu saw a vast expanse of greenery.","All kinds of plants had been gathered together, forming an entire botanical garden.","“This is the plant cultivation area,” Li Weizheng explained. “It contains special plants collected from all over the country. There’s also a seed room inside the experimental building ahead.”","Chu Fu’s eyes widened in amazement, her gaze sparkling with wonder. Along the way, she had already seen more than ten plants capable of transforming into combat forms.","Once they entered the experimental building, everyone was even more stunned.","Row upon row of seeds sat in containers, each labeled with its classification, family, genus, and whether it was poisonous.","Li Weizheng spoke with undisguised pride.","“There are currently four hundred thousand documented plant species worldwide, not counting marine life. This laboratory has cataloged every plant species found domestically—nearly forty thousand in total.","“Another sixty thousand were transported here by air from overseas, after clearing all the necessary security inspections.","“There are six thousand poisonous species among them, covering every known poisonous plant found within China.”","“There are also 162 species of highly toxic plants collected from all over the world. Some were purchased from abroad at enormous cost, while others had already been preserved by research institutes.”","“This entire floor will be your laboratory from now on. You can come whenever you like, and there will be staff maintaining it around the clock.”","This was the power of the nation.","It was also proof of how seriously the government took her.","How long had it been since she decided to register with Origin Academy?","And yet Li Weizheng had already prepared all this.","His sincerity was impossible to doubt.","Chu Fu could not help saying, “Even if I don’t officially join the government, I can still use all this freely?”","Li Weizheng smiled.","“Classmate Chu, as long as your heart is in Linjiang and you remain here, that alone is the greatest contribution you can make to the government.","“Besides, you’re one of Origin Academy’s first students. As a university student, the school supports your early participation in experimental projects.","“Every bit you increase your strength is one more bit of safety for the people.","“We don’t ask for anything in return for any of this!”","Li Weizheng truly had an impressive sense of perspective.","Chu Fu had to admit that she was somewhat moved.","“Thank you, Major Li.” Chu Fu nodded, already considering what she could offer Li Weizheng in exchange for all these resources.","Sigh. Given the current size of the Thorn Guild, there was indeed no way for it to join the government officially. Otherwise, wouldn’t they just be waiting for someone to take the fruits of their labor?","But cooperation was still possible.","She could trade resources from the game for the resources Li Weizheng was offering now.","In fact, Li Weizheng was far more anxious than she was. These resources could still be collected now, but four months later, anyone would be able to take them for free.","Not only that, by then the resources would be impossible to consolidate, and they would no longer be worth anything in exchange.","“There’s also a training room on the second floor, prepared specifically for Student Xie.”","Everyone moved upstairs.","Although it was called a training room, the second floor looked more like a library. Bookshelves covered the walls, and every volume was an ancient text.","Rows of display cases equipped with humidity control and constant-temperature systems held yellowed bamboo slips, silk manuscripts, and thread-bound books.","Li Weizheng explained, “We collected every ancient text related to swordsmanship that could be found from museums and private collectors across the country.","“There are 372 volumes in total.”","The more kinds of swordsmanship Xie Lin learned, the stronger he became through his Myriad Swords Return to the Source ability.","Li Weizheng had clearly seized upon that point.","“Translating these ancient texts will be extremely difficult,” he continued, “but we can mobilize the resources of Linjiang—or even the entire country—to help translate the sword techniques recorded in them. We can assign specialists to study them and then teach you directly. That will certainly be faster than learning on your own.","“It could save you a great deal of time.”","Xie Lin smiled.","Then he suddenly said, “Major Li, do you know that I possess the Heart’s Eye ability? I can even see through any object. I took one look at the books here just now and already knew what they were. I also never forget anything I’ve seen. You might be giving these away like meat buns tossed to a dog—gone forever, with no return.”","Li Weizheng laughed heartily.","“Student Xie, you’re joking. I already said that all of this was prepared for everyone free of charge.”","Xie Lin shook his head. “There’s no such thing as a free lunch. I don’t accept anything I haven’t earned. By nature, I don’t like being tied down. Actually, Lu Xing and I are quite alike.","“But if Linjiang ever encounters danger—like what happened the last time we faced the people from the Saint Wolf Club—I’ll absolutely do my duty and help.”","Chu Feng, who had been following the group the entire time, glanced at Xie Lin.","This was completely backwards!","Who was actually like whom?","That kid was really asking for a beating!","Hearing Xie Lin’s words, Li Weizheng not only wasn’t offended—he even seemed relieved.","Of the three, Chu Fu, Shen Chi, and Xie Lin, he had actually found Xie Lin the most difficult to handle.","Because Xie Lin was an invincible man.","Despite having a poor relationship with his parents, he had managed to claw his way up from the bottom even after becoming blind. He had no one to worry about except himself.","Even these ancient texts and sword techniques held little appeal for him.","Psychologists had already been studying the profiles of Chu Fu, Shen Chi, and Xie Lin in depth.","Fortunately, just as the psychologists had predicted, Xie Lin possessed a passionate sense of justice.","Xie Lin did not want to be bound down. He simply did not want to be exploited for free.","Cooperation was still possible.","“We’re already very glad that Student Xie can think this way,” Li Weizheng said. “I, Li Weizheng, can guarantee that all of this is being provided free of charge. We absolutely have no intention of asking you to exchange other benefits for it.","“As I said before, the current situation is truly dire. Every bit you strengthen yourselves is another layer of protection for humanity.","“So, as long as you have a request, we will do everything in our power to fulfill it.","“The same goes for everyone else. We simply don’t know you well enough yet to understand what you need, and some professions don’t seem to rely much on real-world resources.","“We’ve also prepared a collection of ancient medical texts for Classmate Li Zhenzhen.","“Various insects and reptiles for the classmate who refines Gu through killing husbands.","“China’s finest fabrics and textile materials for Dreamweaver.","“But for Student He, all we can provide are a few gravity chambers for you to use.”","Dream King’s telekinesis required no external resources, so his needs were minimal.","There was little the government could offer him.","But that absolutely did not mean they took him any less seriously.","The degree to which each profession could draw out its power in the real world varied greatly.","“Next, we have the place prepared for Shen Chi,” Li Weizheng continued. “A collection of rare metals. Shen Chi, you haven’t redeemed your mecha yet, have you? But you should have no trouble with the technology. These metals represent practically every type that can be collected domestically.","“Some of them are radioactive, so they’ve been isolated in another building.","“However, these metals are extremely expensive, and we’ve invested a great deal of manpower and resources into acquiring them, so...”","Shen Chi: Oh no. This one’s aimed at me."]},{"number":193,"title":"Chapter 193: Chu Fu Has Too Many Trump Cards, A Win-Win Exchange","paragraphs":["“So, could we get a share of some of the props Classmate Shen has made? For example, those flying wings.”","Shen Chi immediately relaxed.","They only wanted a few minor items?","That was no problem at all.","“We can go take a look.” Shen Chi did not commit himself too firmly.","Li Weizheng nodded with a smile and led everyone to another building.","“This building was originally a prefab structure made of steel panels—a simple warehouse. We didn’t have time to construct anything proper back then. But as players gradually became able to cash out their earnings, things started to change!”","“It was built by Earth- and Metal-element players. They worked incredibly fast; it was completed in less than seven days!”","The building looked as though it had formed naturally, without a single visible seam. It had been cast from ordinary concrete, reinforced with steel bars. Beneath the reinforced concrete, it was essentially a fortress.","It could withstand bombardment.","The moment they entered, a chill filled with the scent of metal swept over them.","Metal was everywhere, piled into blocks or irregular shapes, each stack marked with a label.","The most common materials were iron, copper, silver, and even gold.","There were also large quantities of commonly used metals: titanium, tungsten, chromium, molybdenum, niobium, and more...","Li Weizheng pointed toward several stacks bearing special markings.","“Uranium-alloy scrap, titanium alloy, nickel-based superalloy, tungsten carbide...” He pointed to each one in turn. “This batch came from the aerospace base—the materials used for rocket hulls. Those over there are special steels recovered from decommissioned nuclear submarines.”","There was no doubt about it.","All these metals were meant for Shen Chi.","Shen Chi’s gaze lingered over them, unable to pull away.","As a mechanic who also possessed the secondary talent of metal manipulation, he needed metal materials more than anyone.","The mechas in the game were enormous.","They required far too many spatial stones.","He had already allocated some of the spatial stones obtained from the Goblin Divine Emissary, giving the mecha the ability to tear open the void and perform fixed-point teleportation. But that function served the team.","Cashing the mecha out into reality would be far too wasteful.","Everyone needed spatial stones to exchange for their own vital equipment. Shen Chi could not possibly allocate another batch to redeem the mecha.","This shipment of metal had truly arrived at the perfect time.","There was no denying that Li Weizheng had gone to great lengths, and his efforts had genuinely moved both Chu Fu and Shen Chi.","Chu Fu felt that it was time to return the favor.","“Actually, I brought a few small gifts for Major Li this time as well.”","“Oh? What are they?”","Li Weizheng became curious.","Chu Fu opened the small backpack she was carrying, revealing the beast hide inside.","“This is the white-grade item [Common Goblin Language Book], along with some notes belonging to the Goblin Divine Emissary. They may contain records about the gods.","“We can already tell from Werewolf Tuge that the true enemies opposing us—the masterminds behind everything—are these evil gods!","“If we can uncover the secrets of the gods, we’ll be able to target them more effectively and reduce the number of people who die.","“Moreover, if we can completely translate the Goblin language, we may be able to learn Goblin spells in reality, such as the emissary’s healing spell.","“If we can translate them into forms usable in the real world and teach them to everyone, it will save an enormous amount of resources and greatly increase humanity’s survival rate.”","Li Weizheng’s expression changed from initial interest to solemnity, and finally to shock.","Spells that everyone could learn?","Was that really possible?","“Classmate Chu, these materials are simply too precious!”","At present, most players worldwide were only around Level 20, and the version they were facing was still the Goblin invasion.","What was more, Chu Fu’s proposal was astonishing.","If everyone could learn Goblin skills and a skill could be fully quantified and converted into a universal technique, it would indeed bring about a momentous change for the entire world.","As expected, befriending a top-tier player like Plantman was the most important thing.","Even a tiny fraction of the resources the other party casually produced could keep every research institute in the Flower Kingdom working around the clock.","Chu Fu smiled and continued to raise the stakes.","“Our Thorn Guild is willing to cooperate with the authorities. As for the missions issued by the government that you mentioned, I’ll also send our guild’s players to complete them.","“We can exchange the supplies you provide for resources of our own.”","Li Weizheng was just about to refuse.","Chu Fu smiled and said, “Major Li, don’t rush to turn me down. You should hear what I’m offering in exchange first.”","Li Weizheng could only nod. “I’m all ears.”","Chu Fu spoke casually:","“Long-term supplies of spirit rice!","“Assistance with mutated plants.","“Speed-clearing attribute points from the [Lich King’s Scream] and [Destroy the Undead Cataclysm] dungeons.","“Core-member slots in Origin-level dungeons.","“Placement rights for large-scale Origin-level dungeons.”","At first, Li Weizheng did not pay much attention.","But as Chu Fu continued, his astonishment grew.","He could not help sighing inwardly. Chu Fu had far too many cards in her hand.","The last two were the most important.","Origin-level dungeons!","They had also developed the village corresponding to Huai Shui Town into a proper town, renaming it Soul of the Army Town.","After Chu Fu secured an Origin-level dungeon, she established the large-scale dungeon [Goblin City Counterinvasion] in Thorn Town.","This allowed Thorn Town to retain all the players below Level 20.","Otherwise, they would have faced the awkward situation of having a town in name only, with its strongest players barely reaching Level 10.","“Classmate Chu, let’s discuss this dungeon in detail.”","Chu Fu proceeded to explain the rewards granted upon clearing the Origin-level dungeon.","Of course, even if the dungeon were placed in Soul of the Army Town, Chu Fu would still charge an entrance fee. Those were two separate matters.","After finishing his discussion with Chu Fu, Li Weizheng was grinning from ear to ear, looking extremely pleased.","This was definitely a win-win deal.","In the coming months, with the apocalypse fast approaching, the supplies stockpiled by the nation would only have value right now. Once the game’s invasion began, they might very well be looted by anyone and everyone for free.","No matter what they exchanged them for, the authorities would not lose out.","Afterward, both sides assigned personnel to calculate the values involved.","Although prices had collapsed, the value of copper coins was also declining and even fluctuating. In the end, both sides simply set the exchange rate at ten Flower Kingdom currency units to one copper coin before pricing and exchanging the supplies.","The value of a placement slot for an Origin-level dungeon was difficult to determine, so they agreed to conduct the transaction as a lease. The monthly rental fee would be calculated based on supplies worth 10,000 gold coins.","The supplies worth those 10,000 gold coins would not go to Chu Fu personally, but to the Thorn Guild.","After all, the Origin-level dungeon had been conquered by the entire guild.","With this arrangement, everyone in the Thorn Guild could apply for supplies, especially since 15% of the circulating shares had been reserved as employee benefits. Anyone who needed resources could apply for them.","Furthermore, under the shareholding system, Chu Fu could control 30% of those supplies worth 10,000 gold coins.","Shen Chi could control 16%.","If that was still not enough, they could purchase shares from the others.","In this way, everyone could at least get a meal.","Once the deal was finalized, Chu Fu immediately made a request.","She did not want those plants.","What she wanted was... poisonous creatures!"]},{"number":194,"title":"Chapter 194: The Might of National Power, Ruthlessly Leveraging Resources for Enhancement","paragraphs":["Obtaining poisons in the game was simply too difficult.","But in reality, there were far too many substances that were poisonous to humans—or to living organisms in general.","Some of them were very easy for the state to acquire.","For example: pesticides!","That’s right, pesticides!","Dichlorvos, paraquat, aluminum phosphide!","There were also plenty of industrial toxins.","Cyanides, heavy-metal salts, sodium nitrite, methanol!","Many chemical substances were controlled items that ordinary people could hardly obtain. Moreover, just a few grams of some of them could be fatal. They were all highly toxic.","Chu Fu wanted these substances.","Li Weizheng immediately agreed.","China had plenty of such materials, and after the apocalypse, they would become completely useless.","With the entire country mobilized to collect them, gathering them was quite easy.","For a time, national transportation networks roared into action. Pesticides, poisons, and chemical substances from all over the country were frantically shipped to Linjiang City.","...","Over the next few days, Chu Fu extracted another forty hours of deep sleep and exchanged them for the SS-rank Poisonous Person talent. She also withdrew the Giant-Mouthed Man-Eating Flower from the game.","Without exchanging for the Poisonous Person talent, Chu Fu was afraid she might poison herself to death.","At the Primordial Academy, Li Weizheng opened another highly toxic laboratory for Chu Fu and strictly prohibited any player below Level 30 from approaching it.","He was afraid they might be poisoned to death.","After obtaining the Poisonous Person talent, however, Chu Fu naturally no longer feared poison.","Inside the laboratory at the Primordial Academy, Chu Fu accelerated the growth of the Giant-Mouthed Man-Eating Flower. Using Plant Person Trait 5, she transformed into a plant person whose skirt was covered in countless giant mouths.","Chu Fu approached the toxins and opened her mouth, swallowing a cubic meter of pesticide in a single gulp.","She went on a wild eating spree!","[Your poison attack has increased by 1.]","[Your poison resistance has increased by 1.]","The giant mouth devoured one hundred bottles of dichlorvos. There was plenty to go around.","Not only was Chu Fu unharmed, she even felt herself becoming greener.","The same was even more true for the A Little Too Poisonous Staff.","Until now, the staff had remained at Silver rank. But after absorbing a massive amount of toxins, it rapidly formed new traits.","[A Little Too Poisonous Staff (Diamond Rank):","Poison Attack +500.","Spirit +200.","Trait 1: Growth Potential (Growth Requirement: Absorb 100 quadrillion points of poison to advance to Epic rank.)","Trait 2: Charm: When used on a target, forcibly charms them for 3 seconds, causing them to continuously move toward you without attacking you.","Trait 3: Shock: When used on a target, causes convulsions, suffocation, shock, nerve paralysis, and other effects. Can forcibly interrupt the target’s spellcasting. (Extracted from dichlorvos-based toxins.)","Trait 4: Degeneration: When used on a target, causes irreversible cellular damage, bleeding, decay, and organ failure, with an additional healing prohibition effect. (Extracted from paraquat-based toxins.)","Trait 5: Corrode Sight: When used on a target, forcibly blinds them, damages the nerves in the brain, and reduces their perception. (Extracted from methanol-based toxins.)]","Chu Fu had no idea how much dichlorvos she had used.","The laboratory was filled with deadly poison. It was said that a cafeteria employee had once passed by, inhaled a single breath, and collapsed from poisoning.","Yet these toxins were resources from reality—genuine resources that helped Chu Fu grow stronger.","Furthermore, as a growth-type weapon, A Little Too Poisonous had far higher spell attack power and attribute bonuses than an ordinary Diamond-rank weapon.","The Poison Bottle had also evolved to Dark Gold rank.","The real-world toxins were rated as Dark Gold rank in the game as well.","However, the antidote potion was a different story. Its rating could not meet the requirements for advancing to the next level, Diamond rank. Chu Fu would have to return to the game to find what she needed.","[Poison Bottle (Dark Gold Rank):","Off-Hand Weapon","Physical Attack: 10","Spell Attack: 200","Spirit +50","Agility +50","Mana +1,700","Additional Trait: Growth Potential. Requirement for next advancement: Collect 20 types of Dark Gold-rank poisons, 20 types of anti-poison and antidotal substances, and 100 Space Stones.","Trait 1: Toxin Fusion: Absorbs surrounding toxins and stores them inside the Poison Bottle. The toxins can be extracted as materials or used as attacks.","Trait 2: Toxin Mutation: The more toxins that are fused together, the greater the resulting mutation. There is a chance of producing toxin materials of a higher rank.]","Chu Fu had mixed together a massive amount of toxins. The Poison Bottle could mutate the toxins inside it on its own, and it had already produced three types of Dark Gold-rank toxins.","As for upgrading the Spirit Plant Pouch, there had been no progress at all. Although Li Weizheng had collected a vast number of plants, even after being mutated by Chu Fu, real-world plants ultimately could not reach Dark Gold rank.","At present, Chu Fu possessed only two Dark Gold-rank plants. One was the Enchanted Mushroom, whose quality had been raised by 3% through the Spirit Plant Pouch, and the other was the Ice Crystal Snow Lotus she had just obtained.","She would still need to return to the game and hunt high-level creatures to find more.","...","Inside the Primordial Gate.","Available Game District: 057.","This represented the fact that Valley Pass Town on Server 0178888 had entered the Town Defense Battle, and the town defense quest was now open.","Holy Healing Angel, Dream King, and Lu An had all received the quest.","Ever since reaching Level 20, they had been active in Linjiang City. After acquiring properties in Thorny Town, they could not help feeling that Valley Pass Town looked incredibly bleak by comparison.","The entire town had fewer than ten thousand players defending it.","The Universal Workshop had once consisted of a full five thousand people. Three thousand players had even carried the Universal name. Later, those two words became a notorious cyber-era embarrassment that everyone loved to hate.","Those people simply committed suicide and left the game.","The remaining two thousand also fell apart. The stronger players went to Linjiang City, while the weaker ones were relentlessly hunted down by unaffiliated players.","In the end, fewer than ten thousand people remained in the entire Valley Pass Town.","Moreover, although the Universal Workshop no longer held absolute control over Valley Pass Town and the loss of Feng Huimin had caused its promotional efforts to plummet, players soon identified the town as a dead server.","Who would go to a dead server?","When playing a game, of course you went to whichever server had the most people.","For example, Server 0308888 had become the most popular server in District 8888. Even players from other servers who died by accident would come here to squeeze in.","After all, the server had three resurrection healers.","Once they landed in Thorny Town, unless they died inside a dungeon, they were practically guaranteed a resurrection. The three healers would periodically patrol the area, ensuring that anyone who died could be revived.","Who wouldn’t love that?","As a result, the number of players entering the other servers continued to decline. The beginner villages connected to Valley Pass Town were almost devoid of newcomers.","With so few players, the Town Defense Battle was practically impossible to win.","Players above Level 20 were afraid of dying and simply refused to return to Valley Pass Town.","The Level 10-to-20 players who remained in Valley Pass Town promptly logged off to keep their accounts from being killed.","The result was an empty town.","[System Announcement: Valley Pass Town is about to face a goblin invasion. All players, please take note.]","[System Announcement: The goblin invasion has begun. The Contribution Ranking is now open. Participants: 927. Preparatory missions will also count toward the contribution rankings.]"]},{"number":195,"title":"Chapter 195: Learning Skills — Can You Level Up Even While Lying Down Now","paragraphs":["......","One hour earlier.","Chu Fu logged in.","[System Notification: Syncing the player’s real-world data.]","[System Notification: Synchronization complete.]","Data withdrawn from the game to the real world required gold coins.","However, syncing data from the real world into the game was free.","Over the past few days, Chu Fu had accumulated an additional 10,000 points of poison damage and defense, along with 100 points each in Spirit and Constitution.","It was a tremendous improvement.","The defense of Server 017’s Guguan Town was about to begin. Chu Fu had logged in early to make some preparations.","First, if Guguan Town fell, they could charge in while the goblins were still being sent through the spatial rift and complete a counterattack.","Chu Fu had also prepared a backup plan.","In the mayor’s name, she drafted a quest.","[Quest: Reinforce Guguan Town!","Issuer: Mayor of Thornbriar Town: WhoWantsToBeAVegetable","Quest Details: Guguan Town is facing a goblin invasion, but there are too few Awakened defending the town. Other Awakened are needed to provide support. After accepting the quest, proceed to Guguan Town and resist the goblin invasion.","Quest Reward: A certain amount of experience.]","Chu Fu tried to publish the quest.","[System Notification: This quest is in accordance with the current situation, but the reward is insufficient. The system will provide a quest subsidy.","A large amount of experience!","Due to the emergency, a temporary teleportation array will be opened. Its spatial stability will be enhanced, allowing teleportation from Thornbriar Town to break through the Goblin God’s blockade and reach Guguan Town directly.","Teleportation is free.","Upon completing the quest, you will receive the system reward “Reinforcement Medal” (Silver Grade).","Publish the quest now?]","“No!”","It wasn’t time yet.","Chu Fu sent the information to her own people, as well as Laoji Fuli and the others, and explained her plan.","Then she issued a guild announcement.","[Guild Announcement] [Guild Master] [WhoWantsToBeAVegetable] has announced: “All members must be online two hours from now and return to the Thornbriar Town guild territory. Attendance is mandatory; players who cannot participate will bear the consequences themselves.","“Today, we will be holding a joint event with the players of the Warspirit Guild. Everyone is to gather at the central plaza and await orders.”","This was the first time Chu Fu had announced a major operation in advance. Many players had no idea what was going on, but Feng Huimin issued a strict order that everyone had to attend. Thus, they could only wait there.","Chu Fu also found time to return to Linjiang City.","Her Calamity Seed class had reached Level 30. After hunting ten bosses, her Spirit of the Forest class had rapidly risen from Level 1 to Level 20 as well.","Because of withdrawing funds and devouring poisons in the real world, she had not been logging into the game.","Even when devouring poisons in reality, Chu Fu wore her gaming helmet so she could log in at any time.","As a result, under Feng Huimin’s management, the entire guild had continued developing normally. A large number of players had even reached Level 30 and begun their class advancement quests.","Now that they were about to enter another Origin-level dungeon, Chu Fu naturally had to maximize her strength.","Chu Fu opened the guild territory interface.","There were three guild territories: Thornbriar Town, Fengdu Town, and Linjiang City.","She selected the Linjiang City territory and returned there.","The next moment, Chu Fu arrived at the territory near Linjiang City.","She took out the Poison Dragon Cloak, switched it to its demonic wings form, and flew into Linjiang City, entering the Grand Hall of Skill Instructors.","It was packed with people!","Chu Fu even had to retract her demonic wings, worried that she might poke someone.","However, her equipment was simply too eye-catching. Her pure-white bridal skin looked like a beacon in the darkness to the players around her, who were dressed in all kinds of mismatched outfits because they could not assemble complete sets.","The crowd immediately began to stir.","“It’s WhoWantsToBeAVegetable!”","“The boss is here to learn skills too? Boss, come to my line! I’ll go back and queue again!”","“Boss, I’m farther ahead!”","“Guild Master, Guild Master, we’re almost there!”","Countless players gave way to her.","This was genuine celebrity treatment.","For a moment, Chu Fu even felt like a socially anxious person!","Darn it. If she had known this would happen, she would have changed clothes and used a Disguise Mask.","But the advantage of celebrity treatment was that countless people quickly invited Chu Fu to the front. She had no choice but to go. If she refused, everyone would keep urging her, and she simply couldn’t queue properly.","Otherwise, the entire line would fall into chaos.","A crowd gathered around her to take screenshots and group photos.","Chu Fu could only squeeze through the crowd and reach the front.","The class advancement instructor looked at Chu Fu, his eyes shining, and said, “250 gold.”","Chu Fu froze. “Shouldn’t it be 50 gold?”","Something was wrong. She wasn’t learning just one skill, but according to the level restrictions, skills at Levels 5 and 10 cost 50 silver, while skills at Levels 10 and 20 cost 500 silver.","No matter how she calculated it, it shouldn’t be 250 gold!","Just because she had plenty of money didn’t mean he could cheat her!","The class advancement instructor smiled like a greedy merchant who had spotted a huge fat sheep.","“You’re learning skills for a second class. How could that cost the same as skills for your first class? The experience required for your second class is doubled as well! I’m already being generous by not charging you double for the skills!”","Chu Fu had no choice but to pay.","Then she placed both hands on the enormous Orb of Wisdom.","She had no idea what skills she would comprehend. The Calamity Seed class was one skill short of Level 30, while her new plant class was four skills short.","She was now far stronger than she had been the first time she entered an Origin-level dungeon. She almost didn’t know what she was lacking anymore.","Just as she was thinking this, a green-robed figure suddenly appeared in her mind. A pair of enormous green wings, seemingly filled with deadly poison, spread behind him.","After that came a scene of countless plants hunting monsters.","What was this...?","[System Notification: You have learned Poison God’s Wings: Manipulate the poison within your body to form enormous wings, allowing you to fly. Wherever you fly, residual poison will form a poisonous disaster.","Note: The poisonous disaster can be actively controlled and prevented from spreading.]","[System Notification: You have learned Forest Spirit: Fell the Enemy (Level 5 Skill): Issue an order to fell enemies. Contracted plants will automatically attack enemies in the surrounding area, ignoring their distance from the contract master, until they die.]","[System Notification: You have learned Forest Spirit Passage (Level 10 Skill): Sense the locations of contracted plants and establish a plant passage that automatically teleports you to a plant’s location.]","[System Notification: You have learned Forest Spirit Gathering (Level 15 Skill): Issue a gathering order. Contracted plants can automatically collect dropped items, explore the map, and have a chance to open treasure chests. Items will automatically be sent through the Forest Spirit Passage into the contractor’s spatial inventory. If the spatial inventory is full, the items will drop nearby.]","[System Notification: You have learned Forest Spirit Follower (Level 20 Skill): Designate a target for contracted plants to follow. You can issue the Forest Spirit: Fell the Enemy and Forest Spirit Gathering commands at the same time!","Note: Contracted plants may lose track of a target moving too quickly. Once lost, they will become directionless.]","Chu Fu stared at the skills of the Spirit of the Forest. Only one thought remained in her mind.","Could she level up while lying down now?","They were far too powerful.","With these skills, Chu Fu felt even more confident about the defense of Guguan Town at dawn!"]},{"number":196,"title":"Chapter 196: The Despair of the Player in Guguan Town, and the Actions of the Thorn Guild","paragraphs":["After Chu Fu finished learning, she moved away from the Wisdom Ball and reminded the players who were still studying.","“Remember to return to Thorn Town before midnight. There’s a very important event!”","“Don’t worry, Guild Leader. We know.”","Though they had no idea what the event was.","Still, following the Plant Boss could never be wrong.","Missing out would be an unbearable loss!","After greeting the guild members, Chu Fu returned to Thorn Town and began planting and cultivating new plant spirits inside the Spirit Plant Pouch before using the Forest Spirit Contracts.","If she couldn’t cultivate enough in time, she would go to Fengdu Town and contract a batch of the little spirits in the plantation area, gathering enough Forest Spirit Contracts to reach six hundred first.","Time passed little by little.","Midnight arrived.","By then, a large number of players had gathered inside Thorn Town.","Everyone knew there was going to be an event. Whether they belonged to the Thorn Guild or the War Soul Guild, they were all waiting in the central square.","The players from the War Soul Guild stood ramrod straight in orderly formations, their eyes resolute and their bearing awe-inspiring.","The players from the Thorn Guild grew serious as well. They straightened their backs almost unconsciously, no longer standing crookedly. Some even puffed out their chests and raised their heads, unwilling to lose in sheer presence.","Just as the two sides were engaged in this invisible contest, a system announcement rang out.","[The Mayor of Thorn Town has issued a quest!]","[Support Valley Pass Town! Do you accept?]","At that moment, all the Thorn Guild players were stunned. Then, they erupted in delight.","They could actually go defend Valley Pass Town?","Didn’t that mean they could challenge another Origin-level dungeon and improve their talents?","Sure enough, there were benefits to following the Plant Boss.","Not a single person declined the quest.","Everyone clicked “Accept.”","“Everyone, enter the teleportation array immediately and teleport to Valley Pass Town!”","...","Inside Valley Pass Town.","Looking at the utterly desolate town, the remaining four hundred or so players let out despairing sighs.","All four hundred of them were story-focused players.","They had developed long-standing friendships with the NPCs of Valley Pass Town. They couldn’t bear to watch those NPCs die, so at the final moment, they had been trying to persuade them to leave with them.","They wanted to fight their way out together.","As for why there were only four hundred players instead of 927...","Naturally, it was because the remaining five hundred were players from the evil faction!","After all, Valley Pass Town had once been the headquarters of the Universal Studio.","Although the studio had been destroyed and its members scattered, some people had still remained behind.","Now, looking at the number of participants, all of them felt a concealed excitement.","Because of the Mask of the Deceiver, they were temporarily recognized as defenders of the town.","But once the siege began, after the monsters stormed into the town and killed all the guards defending it, they could take advantage of the chaos to slaughter the civilians.","They had never expected such an opportunity to fall into their laps. Whoever had wanted to become the Plant Boss and destroy the Universal Studio had ended up benefiting them instead.","They would probably become the first evil-faction players to slaughter an entire town. Who knew how many attribute points they would gain, or what kind of rewards they would receive?","As for those four hundred players?","They would deal with them once they were no longer a threat.","Just as they were thinking this, three people walked out of the inn.","The inns in small towns provided players with a place to rest. One night cost around two hundred copper coins.","Players could log off while their characters rested inside, gaining one experience point per hour.","It was a way head-mounted players couldn’t afford to miss—a method of exchanging copper coins for experience.","But there was no reason for these three to stay at an inn in Valley Pass Town, was there?","Everyone recognized them—or rather, they recognized one of the three.","The Holy Healing Angel!","“Why is she here? Could she be planning to defend the town with just the three of them?”","These people actually resented the Holy Healing Angel somewhat. After all, she was a traitor.","In truth, they were simply jealous.","Jealous that the Thorn Guild had not recruited them.","But who could blame the guild? The Holy Healing Angel possessed a top-tier SS-rank talent that came with resurrection. Now, she had even reached the formidable SSS-rank.","Before they could wonder any further, a server-wide announcement rang out.","[0178888 Server—Valley Pass Town] [Twelve-Winged Holy Healing Angel]: “All evil-faction players, take note. To ensure that Valley Pass Town achieves a perfect defense result, evil-faction players are required to gather at the east gate and remove your Masks of the Deceiver. Those who refuse to cooperate will bear the consequences.”","The evil-faction players were instantly furious.","“Why should we? Just because you’ve been hanging around in the Thorn Guild for a few days?”","“Since when do you get to dictate how I play the game?”","“What if we just don’t go?”","“Are you going to send the Thorn Guild after us?”","The moment those words fell, the teleportation array in Valley Pass Town suddenly lit up.","Normally, once Valley Pass Town entered a defense battle, players could spend gold to teleport there from Linjiang City.","However, only players who had accepted the Valley Pass Town quest and left the town could use this method to return. And it cost one gold coin—equivalent to a third of the price of a piece of golden equipment.","No one was willing to do something so costly and unrewarding.","But now, countless silver rays representing spatial energy erupted from the entire teleportation array.","One player after another was teleported into the square.","The number of participants began to soar.","Starting from 927, it increased at a terrifying rate of ten thousand players per second.","It took only sixteen seconds.","The number of participants had already become an astronomical figure.","[122,873 players.]","That’s right—more than 120,000 players.","Every single player from Thorn Town had come.","“My god, we’re actually joining another town-defense battle?”","“So this is Valley Pass Town? It’s so run-down. It can’t compare to our Thorn Town at all.”","“I’m only level one! Why did I get sent on a support quest? Any big brother or sister willing to carry me?”","“Level-five player looking for a carry! Obedient and good at dodging monsters!”","“Bring some low-level babies along to soak up experience! The whole team is level twenty-five or higher and doesn’t need the experience. All of it can go to you!”","The players quickly erupted into chaos.","But they reacted swiftly and formed parties at top speed.","Chu Fu quickly issued a server-wide announcement.","[0178888 Server—Valley Pass Town] [Who Wants to Be a Plant Boss?]: “Members of the Thorn Guild will defend the east gate. The War Soul Guild will defend the north gate. The Fun-Loving Guild will defend the west gate. All unaffiliated players will split between the west and south gates. You may advance a short distance forward when necessary. After the ninth wave of monsters, we will officially enter the Origin-level dungeon.”","The Thorn Guild and War Soul Guild had arranged their assignments beforehand.","As for the Fun-Loving Guild, its Guild Leader, Lin Haowan, Really Loves Fun, had organized it as a group for unaffiliated players, similar to the Madblade Guild.","The guild offered few benefits and imposed few restrictions. Most importantly, it did not limit players based on their talents or strength.","However, as a streamer, Lin Haowan’s organizational abilities were clearly superior to those of Madblade.","After the last defense battle at Fengdu Town ended, Lin Haowan’s talent had improved to S-rank. He had then organized a group to challenge a boss and, unbelievably, obtained a Guild Token as a drop.","He resisted the temptation to sell the Guild Token and ultimately established the Fun-Loving Guild.","Anyone who loved playing this game could join. In just six days, the guild had already gathered five thousand members.","It had become a considerable force.","Naturally, Lin Haowan followed Chu Fu’s instructions without question.","Just as all the players began carrying out Chu Fu’s orders, another server-wide announcement appeared.","【0178888 Server, Guguan Town】【Who Wants to Become a Vegetable?】: “All players who wish to break away from the evil faction, proceed to the East Gate. Failure to do so will be treated as hostility; those killed will not be revived. There are quite a few of our informants among you. Anyone who refuses to cooperate will be killed on sight.”"]},{"number":197,"title":"Chapter 197: Killing the Impostor, Master of Lie Detection, Official Judge","paragraphs":["“What do we do? Should we run?” one of the players from the evil faction asked hurriedly.","“Are you insane? Run where? They have over a hundred thousand people, and there are only a few of us! If we run, we can forget about keeping our accounts!”","“Go turn yourselves in!”","“Damn it, I’ve got a Shapeshifter Mask. What am I afraid of? I’ll just disguise myself. And don’t even think about saying you know me!”","“What the hell? Is it really worth this much trouble over a Golden Mask?”","“It’s not about the Golden Mask! Didn’t you see the overseas news? Do you have any idea how terrifying the attributes you get after completing the quest are? Your character will instantly take off!”","“Guys, don’t believe him. He might be a mole!”","The evil faction quickly descended into chaos.","Still, they all obediently headed toward the eastern side of the town.","By then, the first wave of the goblin army had arrived.","There were no traps or trenches outside the town.","But faced with the terrifying green tide, the players defending the town showed no fear whatsoever. All they felt was an overwhelming hunger for contribution points.","“Kill!”","Countless players charged forward, fighting to snatch up the points.","Chu Fu released six hundred Forest Spirit Contract Plants. Like reaping wheat, they cut down the goblins in swathes.","She did not go to the front line at all. Instead, she stood on the eastern side of the town, watching all the players who arrived.","There were 487 of them in total.","According to the list, forty-eight people had yet to show up.","Chu Fu did not care. She raised the Staff of “A Little Too Much Poison,” which radiated green, yellow, and purple special effects.","The staff was no longer shaped like a mushroom. Its tip now resembled a crystal filled with countless toxins, with bubbles rising inside.","It looked poisonous just sitting there.","“Soul-Extinguishing Calamity!”","In an instant, a wave of soul-annihilating power struck the four hundred players.","They had no idea how they had died. One moment, their minds had gone blank; the next, they had collapsed to the ground.","The map immediately exploded with messages.","“Plantman, we came here to turn ourselves in! Why did you kill us too?”","“Exactly! People from the Thorn Guild aren’t going back on their word, are they?”","“Plantman must have a reason for doing this. We’ll be resurrected!”","Some players wanted to curse Chu Fu, but they did not dare. They could only question her timidly. Others even spoke up in her defense.","Chu Fu manipulated Soul-Extinguishing Calamity, directing its powerful soul force over the faces of all the corpses.","Then, with a violent pulling force, she tore the Golden Masks from one player after another.","Chu Fu’s attack power was simply too high now. Even the slightest move from her would kill these players.","There was no way to ensure they survived.","So she simply killed them all and removed their Shapeshifter Masks.","The 487 Shapeshifter Masks instantly swelled into a fleshy sphere shaped like a giant mask-covered face. Its diameter reached three meters, and the masks began to crush against and fuse with one another.","The sight was horrifyingly bizarre.","Chu Fu’s expression did not change. This area was still within the range of the Calamity of Ruin. Blue soul waves continued attacking the enemies, and the moment the enlarged fleshy sphere came into contact with them, it was annihilated. It let out shrill screams before dissolving into nothingness.","Ten pieces of Evil God divine power material dropped onto the ground.","After some time, the first wave of monsters had been wiped out, and Chu Fu had finished clearing up the area as well.","There were 4,820 pieces of Golden-grade Evil God divine power material, but they could only enhance Golden equipment below Level 10.","There were also 500 pieces of Evil God divine power material that were Golden-grade, but these could enhance Level 20 equipment.","Clearly, the former came from masks that had not advanced to Dark Gold grade, while the latter came from masks that had undergone an upgrade.","None of them were as good as the Dark Gold-grade Evil God divine power material dropped by Werewolf Tuge.","After killing them, Chu Fu said, “Once the town-defense battle is over, the Holy Healing Angel will come and resurrect you.”","This time, some of the players were genuinely unhappy.","“We want to participate in the town-defense battle too! We still want to earn contribution points!”","“This isn’t what we agreed on, Plantman. You’re going back on your word!”","“Exactly! Otherwise, why would we have come here?”","Chu Fu let out a cold laugh.","“Why did you come here? You know perfectly well. You thought no one would be defending the town, so you came to destroy it and claim the attribute rewards!","“People like you don’t deserve any contribution points. And there’s no chance you’ll be following the members of our Thorn Guild into a Genesis-level Rift!”","How could she possibly let them tag along to farm attributes and improve their talents?","They could lie there on the ground and dream.","The players’ plans collapsed completely.","They had all turned themselves in for precisely this reason.","If they followed Chu Fu’s demands, wouldn’t they be taken into the Genesis-level dungeon as well, and eventually get their talents improved?","That would be an incredible bargain.","Look at them—people who had done evil expected good people to offer them benefits before they would let the matter rest. They were still trying to profit from their wrongdoing.","Unfortunately for them, Chu Fu had been prepared for this from the beginning.","Meanwhile, every one of the more than four hundred players from Guguan Town who had participated in the game was surrounded by three players from the Army Soul faction.","“This is official business. Please cooperate. Once we confirm that you aren’t a player from the evil faction, you can participate in the town-defense quest. Not only that, you’ll also be able to join the upcoming Genesis-level dungeon.”","“I’ll cooperate! Of course I’ll cooperate!”","“Wow, I can join the Genesis-level dungeon too? Doesn’t that mean I can get 100 points to all attributes? I’m going to take off!”","Everyone cooperated smoothly.","They were simply puzzled. Did the authorities really have a way to detect Shapeshifter Masks? After all, the item could alter one’s appearance and even change one’s character name.","They were soon gathered together. Among them was a player whose name was Lie-Detecting Master. He tested them one by one.","“Are you a follower of the Evil God? Do you have a Shapeshifter Mask?”","Those who did not have one naturally answered no.","This Lie-Detecting Master was an official psychologist.","He had also been one of the later players to join the game, but he had quickly come to fully accept it. Combining his real-world profession and abilities, he had chosen this ID.","Perhaps because he had joined later, his talent had only reached A-rank: Lie Detector.","He had changed class into a special profession: Judge.","He could forcibly determine whether someone was telling the truth, then pass judgment.","However, this ability was normally used on monsters. This was his first time using it against players. If the other party told the truth, no judgment would be carried out.","It was an extremely powerful profession against players and other intelligent beings.","After a series of questions, they quickly found the hidden shapeshifters.","Some people grew nervous and tried to escape, but the Army Soul players killed them on the spot, carried away their bodies, and delivered them to Chu Fu.","There were forty-seven more corpses.","Chu Fu continued her work. More than half of those forty-seven had killed over a thousand people. Of course, that did not necessarily mean they had PKed random players.","Back when the Universal Studio still existed, the Holy Healing Angel had been there as well.","After killing players, they would resurrect them, allowing the Shapeshifter Masks to advance. This was a privilege reserved for the studio’s upper management and high-potential players.","Naturally, these people had been unwilling to give up their Dark Gold equipment.","Chu Fu gained another 270 pieces of Level 10 Evil God divine power material and 2,000 pieces of Level 20 Evil God divine power material.","There was only one person left to deal with.","He was a player whom Dream King knew. The two of them had once joined forces to fight against the Universal Guild.","His ID was Doggo Sneaky."]},{"number":198,"title":"Chapter 198: Are the traitors really this brazen Only one player among 500 evil-aligned players","paragraphs":["Talent: Honor Among Thieves (C): When stealing from hostile targets or targets with excessively high Sin Points, the success rate increases significantly.","Class: Thief.","Dog Sneaky was acting so suspiciously entirely because of his talent—and because he had a grudge against the Universal Studio.","After Dream King killed Wan Huanyu, Dog Sneaky immediately added Dream King as a friend and helped him wipe out the players from Universal Studio.","He hadn’t even planned to log in today.","But then Dream King found him and recruited him as a mole.","Now, all the impostors were dead.","Dog Sneaky was the only one left.","Chu Fu sent three Plant Sprites to accompany him and ordered him to find Werewolf Tuge.","Dog Sneaky went alone and soon located Werewolf Tuge, twenty kilometers away.","Werewolf Tuge frowned.","“Why are you the only one here? I sensed more than five hundred people on your side earlier!”","Of course, he couldn’t sense them now.","“What exactly happened?” Werewolf Tuge pressed.","“I dunno!” Dog Sneaky said. “Why am I the only one who came?”","Werewolf Tuge frowned again.","But in the next moment, a green, flower-arched passage lit up around a Corn Gatling Gun following Dog Sneaky.","It was Chu Fu’s first time using this skill. After activating it, she discovered that a flower arch and passage made from intertwined roots and vines had appeared ahead.","She stepped inside and passed through it. When she emerged, she was already beside the Plant Sprite.","Standing opposite her was Werewolf Tuge.","Chu Fu shook her Spirit Plant Pouch, summoning more than a hundred plants.","In an instant, Chu Fu transformed into a gigantic green plant being.","“Roar!”","Werewolf Tuge charged forward, attempting to kill Chu Fu.","Chu Fu completely ignored his attacks and used the Forest Spirit Passage again.","This time, it was a reverse teleportation.","Chu Fu could teleport to any plant bound by a Forest Spirit Contract, and the plants could naturally choose to return as well.","Chu Fu summoned back more than six hundred contracted plants.","At that moment—","Werewolf Tuge’s pupils trembled in shock!","How... how was this possible?","Rat-tat-tat-tat-tat-tat!","In just three seconds, Werewolf Tuge’s health hit rock bottom.","“No! No! Roar!”","Werewolf Tuge evolved into his second form, absorbing the divine power bestowed by all the impostor players.","There had been more than five hundred impostors in Guguan Town, and Werewolf Tuge’s strength rose steadily. His health increased from ten million to five hundred million.","But Chu Fu’s attacks never stopped.","Let’s try out the new skills.","[Seed of Calamity]","[Seed of Misfortune]","The two skills struck him, seemingly without producing any effect.","But in the next moment, bullets from who-knew-where instantly hit Werewolf Tuge in the eyes and nose.","A spray of blood exploded outward.","Chu Fu also unleashed her Calamity skills.","[Toxic Calamity]","[Swamp Calamity]","[Plague Calamity]","[Black Death Calamity]","[Soul-Annihilating Calamity]","Werewolf Tuge was enveloped by layer upon layer of poisonous fog, making it impossible for him to move.","He gritted his teeth and chased after Chu Fu, only to discover that she had unfurled a pair of enormous wings and flown away. Wherever she passed, she left poisonous fog in her wake.","This made Chu Fu feel as if her Poison Moth Cloak had returned!","Werewolf Tuge couldn’t catch Chu Fu. Instead, she led him around in circles through the calamities, while countless Gatling Corn Sprites rained fire upon him from above.","They kept this up for two minutes.","His five hundred million health was effortlessly depleted.","Chu Fu wasn’t surprised.","This was also why Shen Chi and the others hadn’t come over. Chu Fu could handle the entire fight by herself.","Werewolf Tuge crashed to the ground, once again dropping material infused with Evil God divine power.","This time, the material was Dark-Gold grade.","One thousand pieces of Evil God divine-power material could strengthen a single Diamond-grade piece of equipment.","Chu Fu didn’t need it, but the players in her team and guild were all short on supplies.","She deposited all the Gold-grade Evil God divine-power material into the guild warehouse in exchange for Thorn Guild Contribution Points.","Contribution Points could be used to post quests, purchase items, exchange for items, or even be directly converted into gold coins.","“I got five thousand pieces of Evil God divine-power material. I’ll sell it at the price of Diamond-grade equipment, but I’ll give you an twenty-percent discount. Eight thousand gold—who wants it?”","“Me, me, me!” Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao never missed an opportunity.","“Save one for me too!” Shen Chi shouted.","“My King’s Sword needs an upgrade!” Xie Lin spoke up at the same time.","“Me too. My needles absolutely have to be upgraded,” Suture Saint said.","“If you don’t want the last one, I’ll take it. I want a pretty dress!” Holy Healing Angel called out.","Everyone would hesitate before spending ten thousand gold coins, but Holy Healing Angel could save lives, and she spent money on herself anyway, so she made the purchase as well.","Little Sister Wu was green with envy. She was taking care of two people at once, and in truth, she didn’t pay for anything herself—the one footing the bill was her mother.","Chu Fu reminded her, “The attributes on that robe of yours aren’t really suited to you. Don’t enhance it. Upgrade special items instead—accessories, rings, and things like that.”","“Okay, then. I’ll listen to you!” Holy Healing Angel was very willing to take her advice.","“Why don’t you hold onto it for now? If this Origin-level dungeon has materials too, I can make another batch for you,” Zhimengzhe said timidly.","That made sense. Holy Healing Angel obediently kept the materials for the time being.","After completely dealing with the Evil God’s lackey, Chu Fu returned to the front lines of Guguan Town and joined the army fighting for Contribution Points.","A town-defense battle of this scale had long since become news that every player in Linjiang City had to follow.","Quite a few reporters were flying overhead in spirit form.","They had originally wanted to witness the first town being destroyed, but instead, they saw an army of more than one hundred thousand Thorn players.","The Guguan Town players who had logged off were all dumbfounded.","Naturally, they could no longer log back in.","Meanwhile, the Guguan Town players inside Linjiang City were filled with regret.","The quest would automatically count as abandoned at midnight. Since they hadn’t accepted it, they couldn’t use the teleportation array to travel to Guguan Town. The array simply refused to let them through.","As a result, the players ultimately defending Guguan Town were not its residents, but the players of Thorn Town.","Half of them were even below Level 10.","After grouping up to share experience, these players had reached an average level of around 15 after only eight waves of monsters.","“Begin the advance! All players, push forward!”","“For now, you’ll have to hold on by yourselves. Once you enter the rift, the Thorn Guild will immediately send people to support you!”","“Anyone who wants to become the Plant Boss and provide support to independent players can take two hundred Gatling Corn Sprites.”","“Please come to the west gate! Send twenty thousand people, or the players from our Love to Play Guild are going to lie down and die!”","“Didn’t the Plant Boss already give you three hundred Gatling Corn Sprites?”","At last, the eighth wave of monsters was completely wiped out.","Chu Fu, Laoji Fuli, and Lin Haowan Zhen Aiwan—the leaders representing the guild factions—clicked to enter the Origin-level dungeon one after another.","The other players entered automatically.","In the blink of an eye, Guguan Town truly became an empty city.","However, one hundred Gatling Corn Sprites still patrolled the streets, preventing any accidents.","Rumble!","The army set out!","Everyone leaped through the spatial rift, their faces brimming with fierce excitement and anticipation.","At this moment, the hunters and prey had switched places.","The prey had become the hunters.","Last time, only twenty thousand people had entered the Origin-level dungeon.","This time, one hundred and twenty thousand had entered—a crushing advantage in numbers!","“Die, goblins!”"]},{"number":199,"title":"Chapter 199: Surround the Goblins from All Four Sides, Clear the Origin-Level Dungeon within 1 Hour","paragraphs":["With Feng Huimin’s Commander’s Blessing active, every member of the Thorny Guild moved in perfect unison.","Feng Huimin’s Level 30 awakened skill, “One Heart, One Legion.”","It unified everyone’s movement speed and defense. Whenever one person took damage, the entire team shared it evenly.","It was an extraordinarily powerful team-battle skill, with a range large enough to cover the entire guild.","As a result, everyone felt their speed increase.","This time, it took only ten seconds for everyone to pass through the spatial passage and climb out of the rift.","Outside the rift, the area still looked like a primeval forest.","Two thousand five hundred powerful goblins were being duplicated through the Replication Crystal as they prepared for the ninth wave of attacks.","“I’ll cast a few skills, then go help elsewhere. You all stay here!”","Chu Fu shouted.","“Plague Cataclysm!”","A sheet of green poison enveloped two thousand goblins.","“Mire Cataclysm!”","The ground beneath every goblin turned into a swamp. Their feet sank into the muck, slowing their movements.","“Pestilence Cataclysm!”","Pink poisonous fog spread through the area. The goblins instantly infected one another, their throats swelling and their eyes turning blood-red.","“Black Death Cataclysm!”","A dense black mist covered the battlefield. In the next moment, sizzling sounds erupted from the goblins’ skin as it was continuously corroded. Their green flesh melted into pools of sludge.","“Soul Annihilation Cataclysm!”","A unique blue wave swept across the area. The souls of all the goblins were destroyed, turning them into mindless idiots.","After this series of skills, every powerful goblin collapsed.","The other players barely had time to attack before the goblins died, leaving them no chance to contribute any damage.","“That was some fine work. Do you still need us to attack?”","Xie Lin withdrew the ten thousand weapons he had summoned.","Chu Fu had not expected her killing power to have become so terrifying.","She was simply too poisonous.","“Haha, you were too fast. Clean up the battlefield, then gather inside the city!”","Shen Chi summoned his mech and brought the team along.","“We at least need to make a full circuit and revive the fallen players.”","Chu Fu did not need to travel with the mech.","She waved her staff and activated the Spiritwood Passage. A tunnel woven from roots, vines, and flowers appeared beside her.","Chu Fu stepped inside and quickly ran to the other end.","In an instant, she appeared beside Lin Haowan Loves to Play.","At that moment, his two hundred contracted Gatling Corn Sprites were unleashing a relentless barrage.","Rat-a-tat-tat-tat-tat!","Lin Haowan led five thousand players, along with roughly forty thousand unaffiliated players, in blasting the powerful goblins with everything they had.","Of course, some of those forty thousand players were only Level 15. They were slaughtered by the powerful goblins the moment they engaged.","Although there were casualties, even ants could bite an elephant to death.","Especially when Lin Haowan had bodyguards with him.","Gatling Corn Sprites.","“Fun Bro, we can’t hold out anymore! Take this one down!”","“Fun Bro, come over here! Help us with this one first!”","“Damn, you’re having all the fun! Let me use it too!”","The players were green with envy.","Wherever Lin Haowan and his Gatling Corn Sprites passed, goblins fell dead.","But two minutes later, Chu Fu arrived.","“Cataclysm Descends!”","The remaining powerful goblins, still stubbornly resisting, dropped dead on the spot.","“Gather the bodies of the dead players. Wheelchair Brother will be bringing a healer over shortly to revive you. Everyone else, collect the spoils and head toward the city! Don’t fall behind. Anyone left behind here won’t be able to get out.”","After Chu Fu finished speaking, Lin Haowan immediately began directing the members of his guild.","“Gather all the bodies and carry them. Don’t let a single player get left behind!”","That works too?","Chu Fu was stunned for a moment before nodding.","“Then do it that way. I’ll notify Wheelchair Brother.”","Chu Fu left a message for Shen Chi, activated the passage again, and headed toward the southern part of Goblin City.","This area was occupied entirely by a group of unaffiliated players, numbering a full sixty thousand. Chu Fu had also given them three hundred Gatling Corn Sprites. The sprites were being led by Dogdog Sneaky.","There were plenty of talented players among the unaffiliated ranks. After five minutes of bombardment, half the goblins had already been killed. Although the players had suffered some losses as well, their casualties were relatively minor.","After all, they vastly outnumbered the enemy.","With a thirty-to-one advantage, they completely overwhelmed the goblins.","Once Chu Fu arrived, she helped clean up the remaining enemies before leading the group toward the city.","“We may encounter more goblin squads later. Everyone, stay alert.”","Everyone continued forward, carrying the bodies of the fallen players.","To Chu Fu’s surprise, the Goblin Divine Envoy did not send an army of powerful goblins to counterattack them.","But when she put herself in his place, she realized that, if she were the Goblin Divine Envoy and possessed intelligence, she would not make such a futile attempt either.","There were simply too many humans.","Chu Fu led everyone straight toward Goblin City.","The surging force of one hundred and twenty thousand players completely surrounded the city.","At that moment, the goblins stationed on the walls trembled in fear.","The players looked like monsters invading the goblins’ homeland, intent on crushing them beneath their feet.","“I refuse to believe you can dismantle my mech again!”","Shen Chi soared into the sky and approached the area near the city center.","The others were all riding on the mech.","“If your mech gets destroyed instantly this time, that’ll be thirteen lives lost in one machine!” Jiao Jiao Bu Jiao shouted.","“Holy Light Domain!”","The Holy Light Angel cast her skill.","It was better to rely on oneself than beg others for help. She put a shield on him first.","At once, Shen Chi’s silver-shining diamond-grade mech was covered in a halo of light.","At that very moment, the Goblin Divine Envoy emerged from his tent.","With a sudden leap, he shot fifty meters into the air. The five-meter-long spiked club in his hand swung around and struck Shen Chi’s mech.","Shen Chi immediately controlled the mech, sending its fist crashing into the spiked club.","Boom!","The sound of an explosion rang out across the sky.","Both sides were sent flying backward fifty meters.","“This divine envoy isn’t a mage! He’s a warrior!”","The attack he had used was the basic warrior goblin skill, Leaping Slash.","The Goblin Divine Envoy moved faster, possessed greater strength, and had an extraordinarily sharp battle instinct.","“Quick, I’m getting off!”","Xie Lin shouted.","Shen Chi immediately opened the mech’s chest compartment and let everyone inside out.","When the Goblin Divine Envoy saw this, his expression became even more ferocious.","Unlike the contemptuous gaze of the previous divine envoy, this Goblin Divine Envoy had already realized that he was probably finished.","His enemies were simply too powerful.","What he did not know was that the most dangerous human had already quietly appeared behind him.","“Charm.”","“Shock.”","“Weaken.”","“Blind.”","Chu Fu hurled every skill from her staff at the Goblin Divine Envoy.","His eyes went blind. A stun effect appeared above his head, leaving him dazed. His internal organs began to fail, causing internal bleeding as his health plummeted.","Strike while he was down and finish him off.","The Thorny Guild’s entire team surged forward.","Brilliant spells, cannon fire, and ten thousand flying swords rained down, completely killing the Goblin Divine Envoy.","Compared with their first arduous battle, this time had been far too easy.","But the rewards were still astonishing.","[You have cleared the dungeon: The True Goblin Lair (Primordial Origin).]","[Dungeon completion time: 52 minutes, 36 seconds.]","【All participating players are revived once for free. Everyone’s level increases by 1, and all attributes increase by 10 points. (100 points for the first clear of a Primordial-tier dungeon; 10 points for subsequent clears. The bonuses can stack.)】","【The system will grant rewards based on each player’s performance in this dungeon. Rewards will be settled automatically; no redemption is required.】","【Calculating rewards...】"]},{"number":200,"title":"Chapter 200: The Flower Planter's Statistics: An Astonishing Team of Thorns","paragraphs":["It was unexpected, yet entirely within reason.","This time, Chu Fu did not improve by much.","A system notification appeared, but it only awarded Chu Fu a small portion of the rewards.","Or rather, the divine power plundered from a Level 20 Origin-level dungeon simply could not provide enough benefits for Chu Fu, who was already Level 31.","Not to mention that the divine power had previously been divided among 20,000 people, whereas this time it was split among 120,000. A smaller share was only natural.","【You have completed a glorious battle and made an enormous contribution!","【Your SS-rank talent, Poisonous Being, has absorbed divine power and become the SSS-rank Poisonous Being!】","【SSS-rank talent—Poisonous Being:","Trait 1: Poison Mutation: You can activate any plant and transform it through poison-based mutation, turning it into a deadly poisonous object.","Trait 2: Poison-Devouring Saint Body: Consuming a poisonous substance increases your Poison Attack by 1 point and Poison Defense by 1 point.","For every 100 points of Poison Attack gained, Mentality increases by 1 point.","For every 100 points of Poison Defense gained, Constitution increases by 1 point.","Trait 3: Poison damage increased by 100%.","Trait 4: Wound-Borne Poison: When you suffer bleeding, grievous wounds, or similar injuries, poison will seep from your wounds and splash onto nearby enemies. The stronger your Poison Attack, the greater the poison damage inflicted by the splash.","Trait 5: Poison Corpse Feign Death: After receiving a fatal blow, your body will be controlled by poison, entering a state of feigned death. During this period, you are immune to all damage, ignore pain, and gain a massive increase to movement speed and damage. The effect lasts for one hour.】","Traits 4 and 5 were both defensive abilities.","Although Chu Fu felt that, with her current strength, she had yet to encounter an enemy capable of injuring her, having an ability that could save her life was still extremely important.","Chu Fu accepted it gladly.","【Affected by divine power, all your class skills have received a basic enhancement of +1.】","Chu Fu looked at her row of skills, all marked +11, and immediately felt that she had made a huge profit.","Once a skill was enhanced to Level 10, further enhancements required not one Skill Enhancement Stone, but ten.","This single wave had saved Chu Fu a tremendous number of Skill Enhancement Stones.","As for the rest of the team—","Shen Chi’s Metal Manipulation had reached SS rank. The two newly acquired traits allowed him to elementalize his body and transform into a metal man.","Shen Chi’s first talent, Trait 5: Mechanical Ascension, had finally become useful.","After transforming into a metal man, he could add various technological items to his body. Once he canceled the elementalization, those technological items would remain embedded within his metal form without altering his flesh-and-blood body.","This allowed him to gain a massive increase in attributes without having to worry about becoming a monster.","Furthermore, if he upgraded his SS-rank Metal Manipulation to SSS rank, then during the version involving the Mechanical Invasion, Shen Chi might even be able to counter the Mechanical Race.","Everyone else had also made tremendous progress. The higher they advanced, the smaller each individual improvement became, but their accumulated attributes and skill enhancements had allowed the players in Chu Fu’s team to pull far ahead of the other players.","Next came the battlefield cleanup.","“Take everything that can be taken, even bricks, soil, and stones.”","“Remove every ornament that can be detached. Those bones may have been dropped by high-level magical beasts, and don’t forget the cores.”","“Those aren’t useless decorative items. They’re real beast cores!”","They stripped the place bare, leaving not even a feather behind.","However, there was a time limit on the town-defense assault. According to the system’s rules, the ninth and tenth waves lasted two hours, and they could remain here for no more than that.","Otherwise, the passage formed by the Spatial Stone would no longer have enough energy to stay open.","So they spent an hour looting the area.","Looking out across the landscape, it was as if the Goblin City had vanished from the map entirely. Even two meters of the surrounding earth had been scraped away.","Not a single player was missing when they returned. After all, the city itself had disappeared, making it easy to see that everyone had come back.","When they returned to Guguan Town, they heard the system’s pleasant voice.","Guguan Town—Perfect Town Defense Complete!","......","Flower-Growing Nation Analysis Bureau.","“The report is here!”","“After the Origin-level dungeon in Linjiang City was cleared, twelve A-rank players in the official Soul of the Army Guild reached S rank.","“We don’t know exactly how many senior members of the Thorn Guild improved, but based on the chat logs we collected and the intelligence we gathered, we estimate that around seventy people obtained S-rank talents.","“As for the Fun Guild and the unaffiliated players, only nine players obtained S-rank talents, including that spy, Eighteen Stabs.","“However, all of them rejected the Soul of the Army Guild’s offer and joined the Thorn Guild instead!”","One of the senior officials in the Analysis Bureau frowned.","“The gap is a little too large.”","The analyst hurriedly explained, “That’s actually quite normal. The Thorn Guild’s players were all A rank to begin with.","“There were simply too many participants this time, so the divine power was divided among them. Naturally, those powerful A-rank players advanced to S rank.","“After all, the strongest members of the previous batch had already advanced.","“The Soul of the Army players and the unaffiliated players didn’t have nearly as many A-rank players among them.”","Especially among the 90,000 unaffiliated players. If any of them had been A rank, they would have done everything possible to join the Thorn Guild long ago.","“Yes, I understand. Continue.”","The leader naturally knew these basic facts. He was merely expressing his feelings.","In truth, the most important issue was not how powerful the Thorn Guild was.","It was whether their methods could be replicated.","The analyst continued his report.","“At present, we have completed a thorough assessment of the combat strength of the Origin-level goblins and calculated their values with precision.","“If a group of A-rank players were all equipped with Dark Gold-grade gear, each of them could fight one of these goblins one-on-one.","“If the players were S rank, their killing power would be nearly a thousand times greater.","“B-rank talents could defeat them through sheer numbers.","“Of course, this also depends on whether an individual possesses a special class, hidden class, or other such factors.","“Overall, as long as we can obtain a large number of Dark Gold-grade items and distribute them among the players defending the towns, we can counterattack the Origin-level goblin dungeons. That would allow us to continuously siphon off divine power and snowball our advantage.","“At present, the Analysis Bureau recommends purchasing or mobilizing the Dark Gold-grade equipment held by the Thorn Guild. We can use the teleportation arrays between cities to transport the equipment and distribute it among the players in regions that are about to defend their towns, allowing them to attempt to clear Origin-level dungeons.","“The Soul of the Army Guild obtained 3,000 sets of Dark Gold equipment yesterday.","“But according to our data analysis, that falls far short. A single town needs at least 20,000 sets of Dark Gold equipment to ensure success.","“Moreover, given the nation’s current resources, the purchase price for such a quantity of equipment would be terrifying. And once the equipment was distributed, there would be no guarantee that the citizens would be responsible enough to return it.”","Those were matters the analyst did not need to consider.","His job was to analyze the situation and leave the final decision to his superiors.","The conference room fell silent for a moment. The leader let out a long sigh.","“Send someone to speak with Plantman. Ask whether we can borrow their equipment.”","“Yes!”","“By the way, what about the new-player villages we asked you to investigate earlier? Have you found any teams capable of exploring Origin-level dungeons?”","Since the goblins could open rifts, the beast tide invasions should naturally have Origin-level dungeons as well.","It was just that the players in the newbie villages were far too weak. He wondered whether there might be a team like Plantman’s—one they could send out to explore. At the very least, they could let the others learn more about the dungeon.","Unfortunately, the newbie villages were completely sealed off, so there was no way for them to lend the other side any support.","A hint of excitement crept into the analyst’s voice.","“There is one—and tomorrow, they’ll be able to start the Town Defense Battle.”","“These players are from Zone 0488888. They’ve practically perfectly retraced Plantman’s path, claiming every first kill and racking up exceptionally high attribute points. And their class is like Lu Xing’s—they’re practically the chosen ones.”","“Her ID is: Eighteen Stabs!”"]}]);
